<node id="Paciente">
  <data key="d0">Paciente</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Paciente is the term used for an individual living with diabetes who must actively manage insulin dosing, monitor blood‑glucose levels, and respond to symptoms of both hypoglycemia and hyperglycemia. This person is responsible for carrying carbohydrate sources, observing any adverse reactions, and seeking professional or emergency care when severe glycemic crises occur.

In daily practice the Paciente frequently uses glucose meters or continuous glucose‑monitoring sensors, records the results, and learns to interpret the values. Interaction with a health‑focused chatbot is common; the Paciente often employs everyday slang while asking for guidance on glucose measurement, documentation, and overall diabetes management. The individual also seeks instructions on initiating and correctly performing insulin self‑injection.

The Paciente receives insulin therapy through a variety of products, each requiring specific handling and dosing protocols. Treatments include Tresiba® (insulin degludec), Toujeo®, BASAGLAR® KwikPen, Humalog Mix 50 KwikPen, and HUMULIN R. For pen‑type insulins, the Paciente is instructed to use a single pen per individual to prevent pathogen transmission and must follow the manufacturer’s dosage and injection guidelines, including proper self‑administration techniques and monitoring for potential side effects.

Throughout the course of the disease the Paciente reports episodes of low (hypoglycemic) and high (hyperglycemic) blood‑glucose levels, discusses these events with health professionals or the chatbot, and seeks advice on prevention and treatment strategies. Continuous monitoring, accurate recording, and adherence to insulin regimens are emphasized as essential components of effective diabetes control for the Paciente.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1be43b1b23852278983f60d0f150b0f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dff1c37dd504c2e0f6d3e3541019e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed051c0c90a644e72ac31d765d73a6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ad60377d965f68ffeebc4b21b89a095&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7982460136aa21cc2de3969af556c4d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe370bbb9ac4bc4d475b9ef58ec9fee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c032d0271c85fd24982516368a62b1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11cce86325de9748e794648198242578&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46c9571a4df1570d4a097dc949f512cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db4ee43ed7cc39546184320e1328d06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aca0b919135813e1d5b772face36989d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56fb3d61e8c32af5d6b8be06cc54f904&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-929e31613caadc967412041c8c2155b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb0cd81f0439cbb74e3c0ff54236c45d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dce7a759a9de18a4d1bcc77a071fbe2</data>
