<node id="Frasco de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Frasco de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Frasco de Insulina is the vial that holds insulin and is used together with a syringe.&lt;SEP&gt;Frasco de Insulina is the vial that contains insulin for preparation and injection.&lt;SEP&gt;Frasco de insulina is a vial used to store insulin before drawing it into a syringe or pen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed051c0c90a644e72ac31d765d73a6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d870035815524d8e4f6b0d6b05e5c2a</data>
