<node id="Regular">
  <data key="d0">Regular</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Regular is a transparent type of insulin that does not require shaking.&lt;SEP&gt;Regular denotes the short‑acting insulin formulation type.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa127476a5c98492d7b7e0fcd1212886</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Lista_Insulinas_Bulas (1).pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786304726</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Caneta de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Caneta de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Caneta de Insulina is an insulin pen that can be fitted with a new needle and used for dose delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Caneta de Insulina is an insulin pen recommended for better HbA1c targets and lower hypoglycemia compared with syringes.&lt;SEP&gt;Caneta de insulina is an insulin pen device evaluated for patient adherence, clinical benefits, and quality‑of‑life improvements compared with syringes.&lt;SEP&gt;Caneta de Insulina is an insulin pen used to deliver insulin doses through a needle.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pen used to deliver insulin doses, comprising a button, needle, injector, and protective cap.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b4dfd5f7bda9f876ccb805f6f77f34e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d870035815524d8e4f6b0d6b05e5c2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b64741e11a7d852f462b1269fabfbe43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e490a7e963a20e2221a8097b50073543</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300280</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agulha">
  <data key="d0">Agulha</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Agulha is a thin, short medical needle designed for skin‑penetrating procedures. It is typically manufactured in lengths of 4 mm, 5 mm, 6 mm, 8 mm, and 12–13 mm, with the shorter sizes (4–6 mm) most often employed for capillary blood sampling and the longer sizes (5–13 mm) used for sub‑cutaneous insulin delivery.  

In the context of capillary glucose testing, the agulha serves as the finger‑prick needle that creates a small puncture to obtain a blood drop for glicemia capilar analysis. For insulin therapy, the same type of needle is attached to a syringe (seringa) or, more commonly, to an insulin pen such as the BASAGLAR KwikPen or other KwikPen models. The needle is mounted on the pen, inserted into the skin at the angle prescribed by the health professional, and held for roughly ten seconds to ensure complete delivery of the insulin dose.  

Each agulha is intended for single‑use only. After an injection, the needle is removed, capped with its external and internal protective caps, and discarded in a rigid, puncture‑proof sharps container in accordance with safety regulations. Because the needle can become clogged during use, a new agulha must be attached for every injection.  

Thus, agulha functions both as a finger‑prick needle for glucose monitoring and as a disposable sub‑cutaneous injection needle for insulin pens, characterized by its short length, single‑use design, protective caps, and mandatory disposal in appropriate sharps containers.&lt;SEP&gt;Agulha is the needle that is attached to the injection system for delivering insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Disposable needle used with the FlexPen for insulin injection.&lt;SEP&gt;Agulha is a disposable needle used in diabetes treatment that must be discarded in a proper collector.&lt;SEP&gt;The agulha is a needle used to insert the catheter‑guide assembly into the skin at either 90° or 45° angles.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dff1c37dd504c2e0f6d3e3541019e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed051c0c90a644e72ac31d765d73a6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b4dfd5f7bda9f876ccb805f6f77f34e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-780053d90e5c36ef6ea68e1a598cc53b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8bd4e5ffecd1db91291addfcb4ad781&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93cf8e2cbfe98257306d973162a0688&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df359ca3783191b2159f8d3f6ea6c52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da4ea6b1580793801f801a34c92f1905&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe370bbb9ac4bc4d475b9ef58ec9fee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc9821850f5a0f8be1e4dd3fd0df6fcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95354772f87ab3bc86a4730a1138dee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4916e2524690f1ce85df7c187f6d7a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d156e12ba8d9418249ea309aab0552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aba4eb027a027fb1ad6e0105b97cfa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a557234bf75633a4af048115a6f0c449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46f4c578332d81d4fc1ca84bcbc26bd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9b085ae33d49450f3f8bc342b5eae55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a48e1013c4a32aca64a00d073b2ee797&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e796e8f4bb4721a269775c3d2ef0c06a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Bula Humalog.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Descarte/descarte.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
