<node id="Algodão">
  <data key="d0">Algodão</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Algodão is a cotton pad used to press a small bleed after injection.&lt;SEP&gt;Algodão is the cotton used during insulin preparation for cleaning.&lt;SEP&gt;Cotton material listed as part of the material set for insulin injection preparation.&lt;SEP&gt;Cotton pieces are used to compress the injection site after needle removal.&lt;SEP&gt;Cotton used, soaked in alcohol, to clean the skin before injection.&lt;SEP&gt;Cotton used during the capillary glucose testing procedure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed051c0c90a644e72ac31d765d73a6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-780053d90e5c36ef6ea68e1a598cc53b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59ce0fcadc9ae2a47a525390ae59d81c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aba4eb027a027fb1ad6e0105b97cfa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5570f88766511a4a62cbe9a2dff0bdb</data>
