  <data key="d5">1786337560</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Geladeira">
  <data key="d0">Geladeira</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Geladeira is the refrigerator where unopened insulin vials should be stored.&lt;SEP&gt;Refrigerator, a storage appliance mentioned as prohibited for keeping the insulin pen.&lt;SEP&gt;Refrigerator used to store insulin vials prior to administration.&lt;SEP&gt;Refrigerator where unused pens are stored between 2°C and 8°C.&lt;SEP&gt;Geladeira is a refrigerator used to store Novolin® R Penfill at 2 °C to 8 °C.&lt;SEP&gt;Geladeira is a refrigerator, recommended for storing Novolin® R FlexPen® between 2 °C and 8 °C.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93cf8e2cbfe98257306d973162a0688&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59ce0fcadc9ae2a47a525390ae59d81c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aba4eb027a027fb1ad6e0105b97cfa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4615ca664e7ff898d8c5929cbc79e7d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba6b31518be6fff1db8b68a28e82f200</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas FRASCOS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786318515</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Temperatura Ambiente">
  <data key="d0">Temperatura Ambiente</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Temperatura Ambiente refers to room temperature conditions suitable for storing opened insulin pens or vials for up to 30 days.&lt;SEP&gt;Temperatura Ambiente is the room‑temperature storage condition used in the insulin stability experiment.&lt;SEP&gt;Temperatura Ambiente refers to ambient storage conditions up to 30 °C for insulin pens after opening.&lt;SEP&gt;Ambient temperature range (15°C to 30°C) where a pen in use is kept.&lt;SEP&gt;Temperatura Ambiente denotes ambient temperature conditions recommended for pen usage after the first application.&lt;SEP&gt;Temperatura ambiente refers to storage at room temperature up to 30 °C after the pen has been opened.&lt;SEP&gt;Temperatura Ambiente denotes room temperature (15 °C‑30 °C) where opened Novolin® R FlexPen® can be kept for up to 6 weeks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8375bd3e65b9aa9965acd81fd9a448f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96f91060a07d79071735f666e2b8aee2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aba4eb027a027fb1ad6e0105b97cfa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f2feff6017b7b438ef10a0741399f08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b060d4f68031bd35dfafc19eadf1e9fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba6b31518be6fff1db8b68a28e82f200</data>
