<node id="Médico">
  <data key="d0">Médico</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Médico is a healthcare professional—generally a physician—who serves as the primary authority for diabetes management and insulin therapy. In this capacity the Médico evaluates patients, determines individualized insulin doses, and prescribes specific formulations such as NPH for morning and night administration, rapid‑acting analogues like Tresiba, and premixed products such as Humalog Mix 50 delivered with devices such as the KwikPen. The professional also sets basal and bolus parameters for insulin pumps and adjusts therapy in response to blood‑glucose trends, hypoglycemic or hyperglycemic episodes, suspected adverse reactions, and changes in clinical status.

Beyond prescribing, the Médico provides comprehensive education to ensure safe and effective use of insulin. This includes demonstrating proper injection technique, instructing patients on self‑monitoring of blood glucose, advising on site rotation, and guiding storage, travel, and disposal of insulin pens and related supplies. The physician assesses each patient’s ability to participate in self‑management, offering training until the individual is confident in handling devices, interpreting glucose readings, and making routine dose adjustments.

The Médico also acts as the emergency responder for severe metabolic disturbances. When patients experience acute hypoglycemia, marked hyperglycemia, or diabetic ketoacidosis, the physician delivers immediate medical assistance, stabilizes the patient, and revises the treatment plan to prevent recurrence. Guidance on managing hyperglycemia, including dietary and medication adjustments, is part of routine care.

Special populations receive tailored recommendations from the Médico. During pregnancy and lactation, the physician modifies insulin regimens to protect maternal and fetal health. For patients with renal, hepatic, or other organ impairments, dose adjustments are made to account for altered drug clearance while still achieving glycemic targets.

Finally, the Médico is consulted for ancillary aspects of diabetes care, such as providing disposal instructions for used insulin devices and overseeing the selection and programming of insulin pump settings. By integrating prescription, education, monitoring, emergency response, and individualized adjustments, the Médico ensures comprehensive, safe, and effective diabetes management for each patient.&lt;SEP&gt;Médico is the physician who defines the dosage for the therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Médico is the health professional who interprets glucose data, graphs, and reports for patient care.&lt;SEP&gt;A doctor who should be contacted for guidance on hypoglycemia or hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Médico is the healthcare professional to whom patients report recorded episodes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4cfc50689ef0b918230df31cb99e5e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcba435392a61e072dfaad9195e42ed7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7982460136aa21cc2de3969af556c4d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe370bbb9ac4bc4d475b9ef58ec9fee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a976e1642df27c488174759a35ca23f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c032d0271c85fd24982516368a62b1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11cce86325de9748e794648198242578&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fec70e5369024cec08c0820152befe39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-518838d3c8e8110567b1891b704bfef9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4916e2524690f1ce85df7c187f6d7a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d156e12ba8d9418249ea309aab0552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aca0b919135813e1d5b772face36989d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aba4eb027a027fb1ad6e0105b97cfa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cd336474a2e9457985162b1ddb4b603&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a557234bf75633a4af048115a6f0c449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-929e31613caadc967412041c8c2155b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb0cd81f0439cbb74e3c0ff54236c45d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbe87fd92ad66dcb02b25b669d829f6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9688a6d3c7f751ad34af5a1cde24fa2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1255cfcf42afb2c6045de0d45b11e99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ed0e4c13d1643a77d1d74092a8cda5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97acd5016384ec4abfe4d43c6a9cad08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86f2f88ae14da4b0c5b7b883da36000d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82e0d8e22a06c73855abed11561ce467&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1136d6aac4c2e881387a4db1a0f4a3a3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Bula Humalog.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/TRESIBA _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/monitoramento contínuo de glicose.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx</data>
