<node id="Luz">
  <data key="d0">Luz</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Luz is sunlight, a source of heat that can degrade insulin if exposed.&lt;SEP&gt;Luz refers to ambient light, from which Lantus must be protected to avoid degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Luz is light, from which Novolin® R FlexPen® must be protected.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29a33072a90b4191a8b6c5136c417e4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba6b31518be6fff1db8b68a28e82f200</data>
