<node id="Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes (disease) is a chronic metabolic disorder characterized by impaired regulation of blood‑glucose and insulin, resulting in persistent hyperglycaemia. It can arise at any age, with many cases diagnosed before puberty, and is most commonly driven by insulin resistance; rare genetic conditions such as Síndrome de Barraquer‑Simons and mandibuloacral dysplasia also increase susceptibility. Acute complications include hypoglycaemia and diabetic ketoacidosis, while long‑term exposure to elevated glucose leads to vascular, renal, ocular and neuropathic damage that progresses over decades. Diagnosis relies on standardized criteria such as fasting plasma glucose, a 2‑hour oral glucose tolerance test, or glycated‑hemoglobin (A1C) thresholds, and routine screening is recommended for both type 1 and type 2 diabetes. Management requires lifelong medical care and continuous self‑monitoring (finger‑stick or continuous glucose monitoring). Therapeutic strategies are individualized and may involve rapid‑acting insulins (e.g., Humalog, NovoRapid), long‑acting basal insulins (e.g., Toujeo), delivery devices such as pens, insulin pumps (e.g., MiniMed 640G) or inhaled powders (Technosphere), as well as GLP‑1 receptor agonists, various oral glucose‑lowering agents, and dietary modifications. Treatment choices are tailored to disease severity, patient age, comorbidities, personal preferences, and practical considerations such as travel. Extensive clinical research, evidence‑based guidelines, and public‑health initiatives aim to improve outcomes, reduce complications, and enhance quality of life for the millions living with this condition.

Diabetes (journal) is a peer‑reviewed medical journal that publishes original research, reviews, guidelines and consensus statements on diabetes and its complications. It has served as the venue for landmark studies including the Diabetes Control and Complications Trial hypoglycaemia analysis, early work on reproducibility in normal and diabetic subjects, the Phase 1 abstract on Technosphere insulin inhalation powder, and investigations of screening for type 1 diabetes in the general population. The journal also features articles on intervention‑trial guidelines for newly diagnosed type 1 diabetes, a consensus statement on latent autoimmune diabetes in adults, reports of insulin‑dependent diabetes induced by checkpoint inhibitors, and analyses of racial differences in glycated‑hemoglobin outcomes. By providing a scholarly platform for disseminating findings worldwide, Diabetes (journal) advances understanding, treatment and prevention of the disease.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1be43b1b23852278983f60d0f150b0f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dff1c37dd504c2e0f6d3e3541019e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26c5ab6d7b3b32c5f6aca2b58489782a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4cfc50689ef0b918230df31cb99e5e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-191286ebd759321d40620f77c84ef5a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-457b20f4d8d08ee6b3ed08a225c773de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6828aacfba0c2a6ae59c439a4e4b161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-986fc7ecc813c4b7942964d7fd64d429&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ed0b3e64751c1a28d72e087f711cc20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-565255f3b3e7de3b17f81233ab493d9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3daabbd42055dc30154f5f97c85fb7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67563459bb64c390a40207da52944afd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffb10c00517fa772be2ca9a42f497edf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f079198593c1702b56062aa87e7801a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c032d0271c85fd24982516368a62b1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da44554b006e6bd1b841f4246a054669&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbae57922175913b7c36c594b4673fa2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61cacf80ada6db26d2b975df763c137a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45d489de28e8fda3c3be3bb09ab29eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4319d08c10ed2b48857a6d42eadd9db0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-518838d3c8e8110567b1891b704bfef9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a247846b9ec5d44d0bcbe6c5f15599f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cd336474a2e9457985162b1ddb4b603&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-863286c185f2a62e5b28d7e4577a1088&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea9b3836b3275f451c3acfb189f42a6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4615ca664e7ff898d8c5929cbc79e7d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba6b31518be6fff1db8b68a28e82f200&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e622f0079074cd1916470223d22aa66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c6243c304001345b8f15d1659f91051&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7eabee57ef0af575162ce8d36f3589a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-005de970178a46619506bcc15fe94fa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7715667f5fca178f0988984e932ecfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a717b5a81dbba0bd3cf2aae23dc0e309&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beee0553403f566be565a996251cac46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dc33cf2a90bf53c26226e44bc285c22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c123ae434326de3c