</node>
<node id="Glicemia Capilar">
  <data key="d0">Glicemia Capilar</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glicemia Capilar is the measurement of glucose concentration in capillary blood obtained by a finger‑prick, commonly referred to as the finger‑stick or fingertip method. The technique involves obtaining a small drop of blood from a punctured fingertip and analyzing it with a portable glucometer (glicosímetro) to determine the blood glucose level.

This point‑of‑care test is frequently employed for manual insulin dosing decisions, allowing patients and clinicians to adjust therapy based on immediate glucose values. It is also used to verify or confirm readings from continuous glucose monitoring sensors, providing an independent check of sensor accuracy.

Glicemia Capilar represents the traditional, rapid approach to capillary blood glucose testing. While it offers quick results and can be performed in various settings, its utility is often limited by the infrequency of sampling, as each measurement requires a separate finger puncture. Nonetheless, it remains a widely accepted method for obtaining reliable glucose measurements in clinical practice and self‑monitoring contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;Glicemia capilar is a finger‑prick test that measures the current blood glucose level for rapid decision‑making.&lt;SEP&gt;Capillary glucose measurement is an evaluation parameter for diabetes control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1be43b1b23852278983f60d0f150b0f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dff1c37dd504c2e0f6d3e3541019e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2d6e4597425d2a83c3efcd9ca07f65c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91a09040fc4581d7aad2216dba9fba79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-276b766b8d515b1e7f388b5b7381bfbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97acd5016384ec4abfe4d43c6a9cad08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5570f88766511a4a62cbe9a2dff0bdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fe1b07f3c84733fcbfca023fbfd70e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12999315830b302d973dd1908eab1e12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d35e6caf612b4c4984ade9315ebc7431</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/cgm.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/monitoramento contínuo de glicose.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Glicemia_SBD.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
