<node id="Refrigerator">
  <data key="d0">Refrigerator</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Refrigerator is a cooling appliance specifically recommended for the storage of insulin and various insulin‑delivery devices, providing a controlled environment that preserves medication potency. The device must maintain an internal temperature consistently between 2 °C and 8 °C. This temperature range applies to unopened insulin vials such as Humalog, as well as to pre‑filled pens and cartridges including Tresiba®, BASAGLAR KWIKPEN, Levemir® FlexPen®, and Levemir® Penfill®.  

For optimal temperature stability, insulin products should be placed in the middle compartment of the refrigerator rather than on the door shelves or in the freezer section. Storing them in the central area minimizes exposure to temperature fluctuations that can occur when the door is opened or when the freezer cycles on and off. The insulin should remain sealed or unopened while stored, and the refrigerator serves as the designated appliance to keep these products before use, ensuring a consistent environment that safeguards their effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;A refrigerator is a storage device kept between 2 °C and 8 °C for preserving Novolin® R.&lt;SEP&gt;Refrigerator is the appliance used to store Novolin® R at cool temperatures.&lt;SEP&gt;Refrigerator is the storage equipment recommended for Humulin R at 2°C to 8°C.&lt;SEP&gt;A cold storage location mentioned as unsuitable for battery storage.&lt;SEP&gt;Refrigerator is an appliance used to store insulin at temperatures between 2 °C and 8 °C when the vial is closed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4654b5e9fa02cf051c2d5ebc846c5d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03a1de93a53fbcb513268c123e2c5a16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc6a26a5d2c41087b58a0f7f71ad21cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8336dc27990f6189c99863d64435c6c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e89f1dbae629e925f06732cebf41df16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9ae5f9ffa7eff9bb36cf1a9764df3e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b9c41c968bcc1d46185583661e8f989&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d96761d60c65f05f1530bc19b144cf1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cedd8e88a8d35eade68ce02222b9e276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3237e202569462c758ec3d878c9faeae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df616353e032c899b02bfa4368bc2667&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0851222a21a012cffce7a16710847208&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577779892c0d463cd6bb1966b8a8ce2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-527777f044e20410ca47d2c5b35306ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e94cedc7134adbb256c931b851235c53</data>
