<node id="Sun">
  <data key="d0">Sun</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sun is a source of heat that can cause insulin to lose its effect when exposed.&lt;SEP&gt;Sun is the source of light that open insulin should be kept away from.&lt;SEP&gt;Sun is the star whose exposure should be avoided when storing opened insulin outside refrigeration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e94cedc7134adbb256c931b851235c53</data>
