<node id="Sensor">
  <data key="d0">Sensor</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensor is the continuous glucose monitoring (CGM) component used with insulin‑pump systems such as the MiniMed™ 640G and MiniMed 780G. It is a small, wearable device that is inserted beneath the skin with a tiny needle, leaving a flexible, water‑resistant plastic filament in the interstitial fluid. The filament serves as the attachment site for capillary glucose sensing and must not be struck, pulled, or otherwise disturbed after placement. Once in place, the sensor measures interstitial glucose concentrations and generates sensor‑generated (SG) values that are transmitted in real time to a paired transmitter and then to the insulin pump or a compatible mobile device.

The sensor operates as both a standalone CGM element and an integral part of sensor‑augmented pump therapy. It continuously provides raw glucose readings, calibration schedule information, remaining sensor life, and transmitter‑battery status. Because the values are sensor‑generated, the system requires calibration with blood‑glucose meter readings before any therapy decisions are made, and a short warm‑up period is needed after insertion before reliable data are available. The sensor can be paired or unpaired with the pump, and it supports features such as the Sensor Feature, SmartGuard, and other automated insulin‑delivery algorithms that adjust insulin delivery based on the incoming glucose data.

The device is designed to be replaceable and includes safety alerts for conditions such as loss of signal, temperature warnings, or other status issues. Users are advised not to expose the sensor to intense magnetic fields or MRI equipment, as such exposure may interfere with its operation or safety. Nevertheless, routine exposure to ordinary magnetic environments is generally permissible. The sensor’s transmitter communicates the SG data to the pump, enabling the pump to modulate insulin delivery, issue alerts, and support closed‑loop diabetes‑management functions.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensor is a monitoring device suggested for use by the patient in consultation with the doctor.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dff1c37dd504c2e0f6d3e3541019e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aa63853b30ac5d214c8cd80df90e517&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84bb2bb0df91a594c6936b2fe97e4220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e91ce385a4956221ce891caa7456655a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beee0553403f566be565a996251cac46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fa7ad1de214645f0e643708dc1efab8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2f8a0d67f7320d6157b61dbbf428a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da325dc5071cd02bfe55ffc2f9b79aa5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ed0e4c13d1643a77d1d74092a8cda5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5f31f609ed760b9e36f235d0109b470&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-381370d223aabc9b355b55a05c98e07b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdb2f497ff0665f2860089645ba9450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cf7c487c5bd4a61120add295be9d518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01785f6f03692dc5e35c672e21b345f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-138cbaf5a43762d4c5b77a07ab51cbd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95ba6f1fa7d1791230f690255a8ba2df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a4a75301f61fc3c86ad768de09d0c3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-474703bb16e6e26e009e9d433c3d3647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8e2f5011e0e0fe7dc11273e2f345b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87a1bd89a18cb218431ff9359e299ee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4faffc449b4b8ea09acbae135d21baa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcdc240f555b6c71532ea6d04e0c5798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b48243f8e773d3c94abc58e2314db2c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-177e9aca0bf1c1724474ea529826bece&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd751b869edcd6c88d9e467cfb2cb0fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4d222786e6ed163a90874659266c72a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3895d65c9a22c257a4717f300d4086b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ede0f32eb8f8ea1eaab76cc0bc7648fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b8de1434b9d9f57cd225b5d3e0d7f3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a0307c83d7b514ca00334e4c8ca2357&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b907eb92deb747df3fb3b37fb9974142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd545bc80ceae270c16406af736789b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c5a5c97986d9b31b155b0c8f0cac1c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8741750a7bf86eb5d1fadf82a9c7720e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d8fcf807f0beb090b2f3d68cc7c168&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c030749e7f9a2ae77cb8993d7250cffe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46d04af5292fae98e3aa651d9cec4512&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da4119d4fc266b13dd11e47dd6f506ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f18f20af642d4a480c16e7a6780bb6</data>
