  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Continuous Glucose Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">Continuous Glucose Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Continuous Glucose Monitoring (CGM) is a diabetes‑management technology that continuously measures interstitial glucose concentrations using a subcutaneous sensor adhered to the skin. The sensor records glucose values at frequent intervals—typically every few minutes—producing a 24‑hour data stream that can be displayed as individual readings, trend graphs, and alerts. Because the system remains functional during routine activities such as bathing, swimming, and exercise, it provides an uninterrupted picture of glucose dynamics both day and night.

By capturing rapid glucose excursions, including hypoglycaemic episodes below 70 mg/dL, CGM enables patients and clinicians to confirm low‑glucose events, assess overall glycaemic variability, and make timely therapeutic adjustments. The technology supplies additional metrics such as time‑in‑range and the glucose‑management‑indicator, and it can be used to estimate hemoglobin A1c. CGM data are often integrated with insulin‑delivery devices—including insulin pumps and advisory algorithms—to support automated or semi‑automated insulin dosing decisions and to reduce glucose variability.

Clinical evidence from multiple hospital‑ and clinic‑based studies demonstrates that CGM use lowers the frequency of hypoglycaemia, improves glycaemic variability, and reduces HbA1c levels compared with traditional capillary glucose monitoring, particularly in individuals with type 1 diabetes. Real‑time feedback empowers users to respond promptly to glucose trends, facilitating tighter glucose control and better overall diabetes management. Consequently, CGM is regarded as a core category of diabetes technology and is referenced in international consensus statements and guidelines.

Examples of CGM systems include the FreeStyle Libre, Eversense, and other devices that provide continuous interstitial glucose readings for periods such as 14 days, during which the sensor can remain 100 % active. The method is widely discussed in consensus documents as a standard approach for tracking glucose levels continuously, supporting both clinical decision‑making and patient self‑management.&lt;SEP&gt;A glucose measurement technique that may show higher A1C for a given mean glucose concentration.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous Glucose Monitoring is a method that may be more sensitive than OGTT for detecting risk of CFRD progression.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0ec5707b6df65f1a6822e01b9bb3fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29e9c7394777a2e452b57285541f75f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91f290894e2d3b4216cac1721f22bb67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-653c72495ca2211399f4a6660e1905e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1196548781bdac364853fdfd2074ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7827239a998e7ac7379613d9e5f81ae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dd74224daea51112742135154e46244&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db5749bec4af1c3ea068b257c4376aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-126f927723331d6ce149cf77ed397bbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16a76447c936e157673f084ffb74520d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca8620e735c40bfe850134ccea9a7154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b50a9fb21c77773aec36a9b8e9f5e1d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9416e8076c17175db0dbb12c3393566&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08c7f7bb0209cabd75e27f9c8556c214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91a09040fc4581d7aad2216dba9fba79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbd74c7f87bf62557b2b4c750ec596b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e0c6a8245e883948688f77c2440ca4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ed3ce00d7a52cdffe7b550ffe0dd568&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c5ae163a494feafedb71ed2205c02f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9bc5d11c9f848439320623cad3d3a38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00d07129873894814fe6540ce243ef9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4b76ae88b212b3a0a4d05c250e05e0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76eaa3af026fbb91a96f70d3502e809d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41b7df11ccfb12f819e6f60481970587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0d0e5c511e72e62db88a57fa6ea198e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3a9b76fabae2f788f96d06b7d98c924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93594146e1ebe099cfc47906e940939f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dec009976a44828d0e619e7fa5b1c5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29ea6999715cd3886bd7d4abc2a653b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad23b9b7ef0802d02c046415e54e3fcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2cd796639bdb0e10eeda7ef3d9ebbce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-034c9e1f42f0eec15fed18c25580b0eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9fe6f17fdb504b9177e8ebc48505716&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-664916c2444f157f5d7d9bc41b032d26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b275f50028ef32e322bf8643e0342810&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36ddeaa53bc38bee375d7ac6d71485d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a19f43c10a7a756e1597ff1a7f53296e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-703ccc96df3edd610232f0cca4bf7afa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54ce8d1437c0ec0329819123568df11e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8df31d65b128b9d7