<node id="Measurement Times">
  <data key="d0">Measurement Times</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Measurement Times are recommended moments to check blood sugar: fasting upon waking, before lunch and dinner, and two hours after meals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46</data>
