<node id="Water">
  <data key="d0">Water</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Water is the natural fluid that sensors are resistant to, allowing users to bathe or swim while wearing them.&lt;SEP&gt;Water is the medium in which the MiniMed™ 640G and Guardian™ 2 Link can be submerged under specified conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Water is mentioned as an environment in which patch pumps can be safely used.&lt;SEP&gt;Water is a fluid recommended to be drunk before and after inhalation to lessen coughing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dd9a1bb820381073ad2475541a3a575&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0a2dce3852e38344f91c86f45dda403&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8644d98286c4a296063176435b45d589</data>
