<node id="Metas Glicêmicas">
  <data key="d0">Metas Glicêmicas</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Metas glicêmicas are the target glucose ranges recommended for fasting and post‑prandial measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;Target glucose values (pre‑prandial, post‑prandial, fasting, etc.) used for insulin dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Metas glicêmicas are glycemic goals (pre‑prandial, post‑prandial, bedtime, fasting) with specific mg/dL ranges defined by each guideline.&lt;SEP&gt;Metas glicêmicas are glycemic targets for adults, pregnant women, and children.&lt;SEP&gt;Metas Glicêmicas are individualized glycemic targets recommended for diabetes management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2dff1c37dd504c2e0f6d3e3541019e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7823719c01e7c914b4a58a1bb0d707bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60530d1861f7c2d1efecc069c0913d37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-276b766b8d515b1e7f388b5b7381bfbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f645bd7019e94151caaff47d6cbfcaf</data>
