  <data key="d0">Colher De Sopa De Açúcar</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A tablespoon of sugar dissolved in water is a simple carbohydrate used to raise low blood glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;Colher de sopa de açúcar provides approximately 15 g of rapid carbohydrate for hypoglycemia treatment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2dff1c37dd504c2e0f6d3e3541019e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee7ecd9171c82c15f635a8a9b605621c</data>
