  <data key="d0">Lanche Leve</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Lanche leve is a light snack (e.g., bread or biscuit) advised after raising blood glucose to maintain stability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2dff1c37dd504c2e0f6d3e3541019e15</data>
