  <data key="d0">Bolsa Térmica</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Bolsa térmica is an insulated bag recommended for transporting insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;A thermal bag used to transport insulin vials while maintaining a temperature between 2 °C and 8 °C.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolsa Térmica is an insulated bag recommended for storing sealed insulin vials at controlled temperatures.</data>
