  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A small notebook used by the patient to record date, time, glucose value, food intake, and insulin dose.&lt;SEP&gt;Caderninho is a small notebook used to manually write down glucose readings.&lt;SEP&gt;Caderninho is a notebook used to record glucose measurements.</data>
