  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A mobile application that can automatically log glucose readings when the measuring device is compatible.&lt;SEP&gt;Aplicativo is a mobile application that allows patients to store and review glucose readings and related information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2dff1c37dd504c2e0f6d3e3541019e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2ef71fb1a347df36dbb8ea8f4856bcb</data>
