  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The glucose measuring device that can sync with an application for automatic data recording.&lt;SEP&gt;Aparelho is the device used to detect blood glucose (Glicemia) levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2dff1c37dd504c2e0f6d3e3541019e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6a0699569d4d9d7344609e3680eec66</data>
