<node id="Dose De Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Dose De Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The amount of insulin administered, which should be recorded alongside glucose readings.&lt;SEP&gt;Dose De Insulina denotes any administered amount of insulin, which may be excessive relative to patient needs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2dff1c37dd504c2e0f6d3e3541019e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-786395f3716fb61a79fd183c63e1a9d6</data>
