<node id="Alimentação">
  <data key="d0">Alimentação</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The food consumed, recorded to correlate with glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Alimentação refers to food intake and its effect on blood glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Food intake can affect the insulin dose needed by a patient.&lt;SEP&gt;Dietary category of precipitating factors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2dff1c37dd504c2e0f6d3e3541019e15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4cfc50689ef0b918230df31cb99e5e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-929e31613caadc967412041c8c2155b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbede05ec60d9c79d637d9a0eb0efe48</data>
