<node id="Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes (SBD), also known as the Brazilian Diabetes Society, is Brazil’s national professional association that unites diabetes specialists, researchers and health‑care professionals, with its headquarters in São Paulo.  As the principal authority on diabetes care in the country, SBD develops, publishes and regularly updates a comprehensive portfolio of clinical practice guidelines that cover prevention, diagnosis, treatment and long‑term management of diabetes mellitus.  Its guidelines are widely cited by clinicians, health institutions and policymakers as the definitive source of best practice for Brazilian diabetes care.  

The society’s publications include the “Diagnóstico de Diabetes Mellitus” guideline, detailed recommendations on insulin‑injection technique, standards for capillary‑glucose monitoring, a hypoglycemia orientation document for health professionals, the “Metas no tratamento do diabetes” guideline that defines treatment targets, and specific guidance for the care of older adults.  Since 2014 SBD has incorporated the Automated Monitoring Glucose Control (AMGC) system into its recommendations and it also issues the official diabetes classification guideline, position statements, educational materials and screening recommendations such as those for metabolic steatotic liver disease in individuals with type 2 diabetes.  

Beyond clinical guidance, SBD addresses public‑health and environmental issues.  It has produced a waste‑disposal guide that promotes safe handling of needles, syringes and other diabetes‑related materials to reduce environmental hazards, and it contributes to the scientific evidence base through systematic reviews and meta‑analyses—such as a notable meta‑analysis of rapid‑acting insulin analogues—that inform its recommendations.  The society’s influence also extends to health‑technology contexts; for example, SBD is cited as the source of the figure illustrating the Guardian Real‑Time system.  

Overall, Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes serves as Brazil’s central hub for diabetes expertise, publishing authoritative documents, advancing research, and advocating for safe clinical practice and public‑health policies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fed051c0c90a644e72ac31d765d73a6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e480a6a15b0d8e7069746e3f3f788f80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b4dfd5f7bda9f876ccb805f6f77f34e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d870035815524d8e4f6b0d6b05e5c2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b64741e11a7d852f462b1269fabfbe43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8375bd3e65b9aa9965acd81fd9a448f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26c5ab6d7b3b32c5f6aca2b58489782a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df359ca3783191b2159f8d3f6ea6c52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96f91060a07d79071735f666e2b8aee2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9663846121f12cec0edb5c72b7d71074&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-565255f3b3e7de3b17f81233ab493d9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ce149c8d2ae4fe9b4a454053c8e0a71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a48e1013c4a32aca64a00d073b2ee797&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b50a9fb21c77773aec36a9b8e9f5e1d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95c81e7ab8160456d9a63a9e0868205b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91a09040fc4581d7aad2216dba9fba79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40fdfdc209a5e3bb46f199c55baac15b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5570f88766511a4a62cbe9a2dff0bdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbede05ec60d9c79d637d9a0eb0efe48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e26d518805695de3e4f9d41ae1d3e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d83801272f7a0ae0d797d60572fe578&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f9624abde6cf128707fcc0466a4c9a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29ea6999715cd3886bd7d4abc2a653b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad23b9b7ef0802d02c046415e54e3fcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6db2125b1b94840ea29100039a6fef20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a92f811a7d2d835dc4b730c9bbf08cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7b4535dbb2554b84c7a2e024c4b82c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80893468bbc3744e2e535806ea31e346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc0d4df5f59432ca990767b120f983a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ad6eb7138be249f01b479174a34076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cf24d486949a568d61c1de206cd3e14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a05276c5db43e3a1e9f987056012750f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2faebf8275a86cd8d9995c769b0926a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-078f5907e86c2158587c79b26b0cd683&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddc3658b93eb925d28d625c4e2ce652f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e428438c632682ef93541430ec497ed5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67792416bc5f0609842dd2a9940d8749&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c92d117f7109ea1ce6995f23bc680ce3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea6df8d05eb3fdd356a1eaef16a26dd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c6dca13b685243e6