<node id="Local de Aplicação">
  <data key="d0">Local de Aplicação</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Local de Aplicação is the injection site on the skin or subcutaneous tissue where insulin is administered.&lt;SEP&gt;Specific area of the body selected for insulin injection.</data>
