<node id="Insulin Injection Technique">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Injection Technique</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin injection technique refers to the methods and practices used for delivering insulin subcutaneously, including needle length and site selection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e480a6a15b0d8e7069746e3f3f788f80</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
