<node id="Systematic Review">
  <data key="d0">Systematic Review</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Systematic review is a research method employed to compare pen devices with needle‑and‑vial systems across multiple studies.&lt;SEP&gt;A structured literature review that collects and critically analyzes multiple research studies.&lt;SEP&gt;A comprehensive literature review of pen devices for insulin self‑administration.&lt;SEP&gt;A systematic review is a study design that synthesizes evidence, employed to examine treatment effects in women with gestational diabetes mellitus.</data>
