  <data key="d2">Meta‑analysis is a statistical technique used in conjunction with systematic review to synthesize results on insulin pen devices.&lt;SEP&gt;Meta‑analysis aggregates results from multiple studies to assess insulin pump impact on diabetes outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Statistical synthesis of studies on insulin pen devices versus vial/syringe delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Meta‑analysis is employed to compare effectiveness and safety of insulin delivery and glucose monitoring methods.</data>
