<node id="Journal of Diabetes Science and Technology">
  <data key="d0">Journal of Diabetes Science and Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Journal of Diabetes Science and Technology is a peer‑reviewed scientific journal that focuses on research, engineering, and clinical advances related to diabetes technologies. The journal publishes studies on a wide range of topics, including continuous glucose monitoring (CGM) systems, sensor interference, device assessments, and the development and evaluation of insulin delivery methods.

The publication record of Journal of Diabetes Science and Technology includes several notable investigations. In 2016, it featured a systematic review and meta‑analysis comparing pen devices with traditional needle‑and‑vial administration. The journal also published a 2015 study describing an automated artificial pancreas that employed inhaled Technosphere insulin, as well as a 2017 pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic study of inhaled insulin. Additional articles have examined closed‑loop systems, various insulin delivery technologies, and the performance of continuous glucose monitoring devices.

Beyond device‑focused research, Journal of Diabetes Science and Technology has contributed to broader discussions in diabetes care, such as virtual clinic implementations and consensus guideline development. Its coverage of both technical innovations and clinical applications makes it a central venue for scholars and practitioners interested in the evolving landscape of diabetes technology.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of Diabetes Science and Technology is a journal that published the ADAG study group data linking A1C levels with measured glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of Diabetes Science and Technology published an accuracy study of a point‑of‑care hemoglobin A1c assay.\</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e480a6a15b0d8e7069746e3f3f788f80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bd45744c4c50bb97abce1352018de47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-161a201d846100f42e643139469a1e6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d30bfc1840eec64224c3568470e6c539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91a114d8b89cacee37b56501f349ce85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e0c6a8245e883948688f77c2440ca4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-651d85a13edd23f654d52f95c75d4e32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41b7df11ccfb12f819e6f60481970587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a414fa1274ab6f8e05af931a0c52be4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29ea6999715cd3886bd7d4abc2a653b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a15ed0aa8749d4f76e8d725e8752873</data>
