<node id="Storage Temperature">
  <data key="d0">Storage Temperature</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The ambient temperature at which insulin is stored, affecting its stability and efficacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Storage temperature specifies that the pen should be kept between 2 °C and 8 °C when refrigerated.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e480a6a15b0d8e7069746e3f3f788f80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7638273060df996ad502ec2fadfc9c82</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
