<node id="Type 1 Diabetes Mellitus">
  <data key="d0">Type 1 Diabetes Mellitus</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An autoimmune form of diabetes requiring insulin therapy, often referenced in studies on insulin pharmacokinetics.&lt;SEP&gt;Type 1 diabetes mellitus is the condition for which SmartGuard and Predictive Low Glucose technologies are intended to manage.&lt;SEP&gt;Type 1 diabetes mellitus describes the same autoimmune insulin‑deficient condition as type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e480a6a15b0d8e7069746e3f3f788f80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-caf5071e54a797f595d8cac8e4653918&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9416e8076c17175db0dbb12c3393566</data>
