<node id="Insulina Regular">
  <data key="d0">Insulina Regular</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina Regular is a short‑acting, rapid‑acting insulin formulation that is commonly prescribed for people with diabetes. It is typically used in mixed‑insulin regimens, often combined with intermediate‑acting NPH insulin, and is referenced in mixing sequences for creating customized insulin blends. The product is supplied in 3 mL cartridges designed for use with reusable insulin pens, allowing precise dosing before meals and at bedtime. As a transparent insulin listed for pre‑meal and nighttime administration, Insulina Regular serves as one of the standard insulin options prescribed alongside other types to help manage blood glucose levels in diabetic&lt;SEP&gt;Regular insulin, referenced as a comparator with higher hypoglycemia rates than ultra‑rapid analogues.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0b4dfd5f7bda9f876ccb805f6f77f34e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8375bd3e65b9aa9965acd81fd9a448f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8bd4e5ffecd1db91291addfcb4ad781&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93cf8e2cbfe98257306d973162a0688&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59ce0fcadc9ae2a47a525390ae59d81c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df359ca3783191b2159f8d3f6ea6c52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7982460136aa21cc2de3969af556c4d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51c7617f1e335789b870332231de4058</data>
