  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agulha de 4 mm">
  <data key="d0">Agulha de 4 mm</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Agulha de 4 mm is a short 4‑millimetre needle recommended as the safest length for children when injecting insulina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b64741e11a7d852f462b1269fabfbe43</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786298839</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agulha de 5 mm">
  <data key="d0">Agulha de 5 mm</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Agulha de 5 mm is a 5‑millimetre needle whose use in children doubles the risk of intramuscular injection compared with a 4‑mm needle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b64741e11a7d852f462b1269fabfbe43</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786298839</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agulha de 8 mm">
  <data key="d0">Agulha de 8 mm</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Agulha de 8 mm is an 8‑millimetre needle that can frequently reach muscle in adults with BMI &lt; 25 kg/m² when inserted perpendicularly.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b64741e11a7d852f462b1269fabfbe43</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786298839</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Injeção Subcutânea">
  <data key="d0">Injeção Subcutânea</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Injeção Subcutânea is the method of delivering insulina into the subcutaneous tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;Injeção subcutânea is the subcutaneous injection method used to deliver Humalog.&lt;SEP&gt;Injeção Subcutânea is the technique of delivering medication into the fatty tissue just beneath the skin.&lt;SEP&gt;Subcutaneous injection method for insulin that provides prolonged effect and can delay hypoglycemia recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Subcutaneous injection technique used for administering BASAGLAR KWIKPEN.&lt;SEP&gt;Injeção subcutânea is the act of delivering medication under the skin at specified injection sites.&lt;SEP&gt;Subcutaneous injection is the prescribed route for administering Levemir® FlexPen® in various body sites.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b64741e11a7d852f462b1269fabfbe43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe370bbb9ac4bc4d475b9ef58ec9fee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c032d0271c85fd24982516368a62b1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61cacf80ada6db26d2b975df763c137a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db4ee43ed7cc39546184320e1328d06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b060d4f68031bd35dfafc19eadf1e9fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a49c8461f43dc12d7df9c921efeb0465</data>
