<node id="Classe I Nível B">
  <data key="d0">Classe I Nível B</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Classe I Nível B designates the evidence quality level assigned to the insulin injection recommendations.&lt;SEP&gt;Evidence classification indicating a Class I recommendation with Level B quality.&lt;SEP&gt;Classe I Nível B indicates the evidence quality rating assigned to recommendation R1.&lt;SEP&gt;Classe I Nível B denotes a classification level used in the guideline for neonatal diabetes recommendations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b64741e11a7d852f462b1269fabfbe43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0cc9dbb0b2eb4685ac17cfe445b7ce7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e551f4b7f03919afc1d663b3b2a2efa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e26b32d53b78f97e8d7fa8b815f2cc87</data>
