<node id="IMC">
  <data key="d0">IMC</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">IMC (Índice de Massa Corporal) is the body‑mass index used to categorize patients’ weight status.&lt;SEP&gt;IMC (Body Mass Index) is a measure of body fat; elevated IMC is identified as a risk factor for glucocorticoid‑induced hyperglycemia and type 2 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b64741e11a7d852f462b1269fabfbe43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7b4535dbb2554b84c7a2e024c4b82c4</data>
