<node id="Tecido Subcutâneo">
  <data key="d0">Tecido Subcutâneo</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Tecido Subcutâneo is the layer of tissue beneath the skin where insulin is injected.&lt;SEP&gt;Subcutaneous tissue layer targeted for insulin injection to ensure proper absorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Subcutaneous tissue is the layer of fatty tissue beneath the skin where insulin injections are administered.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b64741e11a7d852f462b1269fabfbe43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aafda750d4900a464b1ac0c9bad5ba05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da4ea6b1580793801f801a34c92f1905</data>
