</node>
<node id="Insulina de Ação Prolongada">
  <data key="d0">Insulina de Ação Prolongada</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina de Ação Prolongada is a long‑acting insulin formulation that should not be injected intramuscularly.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina de Ação Prolongada is a long‑acting insulin whose stability was measured under different storage conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina de Ação Prolongada refers to long‑acting insulin formulations that can be combined with rapid‑acting insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b64741e11a7d852f462b1269fabfbe43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8375bd3e65b9aa9965acd81fd9a448f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0689fd73d2061ee466b9b90e03bda141</data>
