  <data key="d0">Canetas de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Canetas de Insulina are insulin pens used for storage and injection, evaluated under different temperature conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8375bd3e65b9aa9965acd81fd9a448f8</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
