  <data key="d0">Pacientes Diabéticos</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Pacientes Diabéticos are individuals with diabetes who participated in the insulin stability and education studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Pacientes diabéticos are individuals with diabetes who require insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Pacientes diabéticos are diabetic patients (type 1 or 2) included in pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic studies of insulin formulations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8375bd3e65b9aa9965acd81fd9a448f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b65ee62ad12239ddc729c50a1aef854c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e212a20942ed5387efe96e92bdb4ba98</data>
