<node id="Marcello Bertoluci">
  <data key="d0">Marcello Bertoluci</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Marcello Bertoluci is identified as the editor chief of the insulin application guideline.&lt;SEP&gt;Marcello Bertoluci is the editor‑in‑chief of the Insulinoterapia no DM1 article.&lt;SEP&gt;Marcello Bertoluci is the editor‑in‑chief of the diabetes treatment guideline.&lt;SEP&gt;Marcello Bertoluci is listed as an author and the editor‑chefe of the “Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus” guideline.&lt;SEP&gt;Marcello Bertoluci is listed as an author of the guideline “Diagnóstico de Diabetes Mellitus” published by the Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Marcello Bertoluci is the chief editor of the diabetes classification guideline.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-26c5ab6d7b3b32c5f6aca2b58489782a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd6fa98b7767319460b4a421a719c5c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d35e6caf612b4c4984ade9315ebc7431&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc0d4df5f59432ca990767b120f983a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e551f4b7f03919afc1d663b3b2a2efa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72da6fb8b6a9ed059d146b43a3174f90</data>
