</node>
<node id="Reuse of syringes and needles">
  <data key="d0">Reuse of syringes and needles</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Reuse of insulin syringes and disposable needles is a practice discouraged due to increased lipodystrophy risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-26c5ab6d7b3b32c5f6aca2b58489782a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786298845</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sharps Disposal">
  <data key="d0">Sharps Disposal</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sharps disposal involves discarding used insulin supplies in specific containers or rigid puncture‑proof receptacles.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-26c5ab6d7b3b32c5f6aca2b58489782a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786298845</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Specific Sharps Container">
  <data key="d0">Specific Sharps Container</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Specific sharps containers are the recommended receptacles for safe disposal of insulin needles and syringes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-26c5ab6d7b3b32c5f6aca2b58489782a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786298845</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Rigid Puncture‑proof Container">
  <data key="d0">Rigid Puncture‑proof Container</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Rigid puncture‑proof containers are alternatives for sharps disposal when specific containers are unavailable.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-26c5ab6d7b3b32c5f6aca2b58489782a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
