  <data key="d0">Sensor De Glicose</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensor De Glicose is a modern, minimally painful device that continuously monitors glucose levels without frequent finger pricks.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensor De Glicose is a continuous glucose monitoring sensor that can be paired with certain Medtronic pump models.&lt;SEP&gt;Subcutaneous glucose sensor that continuously measures interstitial glucose levels.</data>
