<node id="Atividade Física">
  <data key="d0">Atividade Física</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Atividade Física refers to physical activity or exercise and its effects on glucose metabolism. It is recognized as a means of increasing energy expenditure, which can enhance glucose utilization in the body and is often recommended as part of the management of hyperglycemia. By promoting the uptake of glucose into muscles, Atividade Física can help lower elevated blood‑sugar levels.

In addition to its beneficial role in controlling high glucose, Atividade Física also influences insulin dynamics. Physical activity can accelerate the absorption of administered insulin, thereby increasing its effectiveness. Because of this accelerated absorption, individuals who engage in increased or prolonged exercise may experience a heightened risk of hypoglycemia during or after the activity. Consequently, adjustments to insulin dosing are frequently required to match the greater energy expenditure and to prevent low blood‑sugar episodes.

Overall, Atividade Física encompasses any increase in physical exertion that impacts glucose metabolism, offering therapeutic advantages for hyperglycemia while simultaneously necessitating careful monitoring and possible insulin dose modifications to mitigate the associated hypoglycemia risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d4cfc50689ef0b918230df31cb99e5e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df359ca3783191b2159f8d3f6ea6c52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ce149c8d2ae4fe9b4a454053c8e0a71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46c9571a4df1570d4a097dc949f512cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cd336474a2e9457985162b1ddb4b603&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbe87fd92ad66dcb02b25b669d829f6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6a0699569d4d9d7344609e3680eec66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f645bd7019e94151caaff47d6cbfcaf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte insulinas.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/HIPO_HIPER.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
