<node id="Estresse">
  <data key="d0">Estresse</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Estresse is psychological stress that can affect blood glucose concentrations.&lt;SEP&gt;Estresse is a factor that can increase insulin sensitivity, raising hypoglycemia risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Resposta fisiológica ao estresse que pode aumentar a glicemia.</data>
