<node id="Intradermal Injection">
  <data key="d0">Intradermal Injection</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intradermal injection places insulin into the very superficial layer of skin, resulting in slower absorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Intradermal Injection is a very shallow injection into the skin layer that slows insulin action and is not recommended.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483</data>
