  <data key="d5">1786302749</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Elliott P. Joslin">
  <data key="d0">Elliott P. Joslin</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Elliott P. Joslin was a pioneering physician who promoted diabetes education and nurse training in the early 20th century.&lt;SEP&gt;Elliott P. Joslin was a physician who promoted diabetes education and trained nurses to teach patients how to manage diet, exercise, and insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Elliott P. Joslin was a diabetes educator who in 1918 emphasized patient education and later expanded the role of visiting nurses in diabetes care.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5de4e99a192602fe98c8b7e8e270a49c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301832</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes Education">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Education</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes education encompasses teaching patients and caregivers how to safely use insulin and manage their condition.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal publishing comparative device assessments of insulin delivery methods.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal that publishes educational research related to diabetes, cited for the study on the Diabetes Prevention Program online network.&lt;SEP&gt;Educational programs about diabetes management provided during screening of first-degree relatives of type 1 diabetes patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e0c6a8245e883948688f77c2440ca4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-651d85a13edd23f654d52f95c75d4e32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-343246c2eef6e8430b581340d6cd4762</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372005</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Medical Professionals">
  <data key="d0">Medical Professionals</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Medical professionals (doctors, nurses, diabetes educators) are responsible for providing up‑to‑date insulin usage guidance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786299814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Patients">
  <data key="d0">Patients</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Patients are individuals with diabetes who are the focus of clinical and therapeutic contexts described in the provided sources. They include both adult volunteers enrolled in randomized treatment arms of clinical trials and the broader study population consisting of 546 persons with Type 1 diabetes and 2 474 persons with Type 2 diabetes. Across these groups, patients receive insulin therapy, whether through standard injectable regimens, specific devices such as Kwikpen pens, or specialized formulations like BASAGLAR. 

In the context of insulin use, patients must follow detailed instructions that address dose adjustments, the sharing of devices, and safety precautions. They are advised to manage the risk of hypoglycemia, particularly when engaging in activities such as driving or operating machinery. For those prescribed BASAGLAR, a policy of one refill per person is enforced to ensure appropriate use. Likewise, patients using Humalog Mix 50 Kwikpen receive explicit cautions about hypoglycemia while performing tasks that require full alertness. 

Overall, the term “patients” in these descriptions refers to diabetic individuals—both Type 1 and Type 2—participating in research or receiving routine insulin therapy, all of whom must adhere to specific treatment protocols, safety guidelines, and medication dispensing rules to optimize therapeutic outcomes and minimize adverse events.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients are the individuals with type 2 diabetes who received the study treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients are individuals using Levemir® who must follow specific handling, dosing, and safety instructions.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients are individuals who receive Novolin® R Penfill for diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients are individuals receiving insulin therapy, some previously treated with non‑homologous animal insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients are individuals who may use Humulin R and require dose adjustments based on various health conditions and activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients are individuals receiving care for gestational diabetes mellitus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d0f18c80f8de2dee960a03599d12052&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbae57922175913b7c36c594b4673fa2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3db0edd23b6b502ccbbf62bfd601ce68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a592aedb257bad9532268b4056ec15c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45d489de28e8fda3c3be3bb09ab29eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd94288932ad6675a1de2b46b3fd9128&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78b302b74d715df9c3b9e9db38fa4c64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-891989adf06518cd34c94853444495e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2073bddd90c7dd8e156b67821f0f3247&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cedd8e88a8d35eade68ce02222b9e276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0955cb70a6ce135722726162a9811e78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1245bd9ff75c998b49dab861cc4cebf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577779892c0d463cd6bb1966b8a8ce2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4655f823785fa91e72cba96e00dba34c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ba9c9c7fe9dd4e901eb52088f3d59f8</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377361</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
