<node id="Kidney Problems">
  <data key="d0">Kidney Problems</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Kidney problems are renal complications that arise from prolonged poor blood‑glucose control.&lt;SEP&gt;Kidney problems are a serious complication that can result from chronic high or low blood sugar.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b91b40e47c97be1b62c0f3d271cd4efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22078404beeceb5adc3e688d239c585e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786336921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Neuropathy">
  <data key="d0">Neuropathy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Neuropathy refers to nerve damage, often in the hands and feet, resulting from diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Neuropathy, specifically acute painful peripheral neuropathy, may occur transiently with rapid glycemic improvement from Novolin® R.&lt;SEP&gt;Neuropathy refers to painful nerve disorder that can be associated with rapid improvement of glycemic control.&lt;SEP&gt;Neuropathy is a microvascular complication of diabetes affecting peripheral nerves.&lt;SEP&gt;Neuropathy refers to pain and loss of sensation in hands and feet caused by diabetes complications.&lt;SEP&gt;A microvascular complication of diabetes causing nerve damage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b91b40e47c97be1b62c0f3d271cd4efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c68e2c07786710dd5250c6610f52b14d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73559dc5d86ea52a348d603482e056e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-494fef0b8efc2c44b3b49ebf9d74b7f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22078404beeceb5adc3e688d239c585e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74ef8c063d84e34c44021aa138b9b903</data>
