  <data key="d2">Continuous Glucose Monitoring (SMCG) is a method using sensors adhered to the skin that measure glucose every few minutes.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous glucose monitoring (SMCG) uses skin‑attached sensors that measure glucose every few minutes.</data>
