  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">GMI (Glucose Management Indicator) is a number derived from continuous glucose sensor data that estimates average glucose, similar to HbA1c.&lt;SEP&gt;GMI (Glucose Management Indicator) is a numeric indicator similar to HbA1c, calculated from continuous glucose sensor data to estimate average glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose Management Indicator derived from CGM data, noted as potentially providing timely treatment changes.</data>
