<node id="Test Strip">
  <data key="d0">Test Strip</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A small strip used to collect a drop of blood for glucose measurement; must be within expiration date and have a code matching the glucometer.&lt;SEP&gt;A reactive strip used to detect ketone bodies in urine or blood.&lt;SEP&gt;Test Strip (fita) is a disposable strip onto which a blood drop is placed for glucose measurement by the glucose meter.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0ec5707b6df65f1a6822e01b9bb3fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e91ce385a4956221ce891caa7456655a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-545c19428427ece2c838e352e759e388</data>
