  <data key="d2">A type of continuous glucose sensor (retro‑SMCG) that records glucose data without showing it to the patient; data are later downloaded by a physician.&lt;SEP&gt;Blind Sensor is a professional or “blind” type of continuous glucose monitoring sensor used in clinical settings.</data>
