<node id="Sistema de Monitoramento Contínuo de Glicose (SMCG)">
  <data key="d0">Sistema de Monitoramento Contínuo de Glicose (SMCG)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The method (SMCG) that implements continuous monitoring of glucose using a skin‑attached sensor, transmitter, and receiver.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0ec5707b6df65f1a6822e01b9bb3fb9</data>
