  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Physical manifestations such as dizziness, hunger, headache, etc., reported by the patient during glucose measurement.&lt;SEP&gt;Physical indications reported by the user that may or may not align with sensor glucose values.&lt;SEP&gt;Symptoms are physical signs such as dizziness, hunger, or headache that may be recorded alongside glucose measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;Symptoms are the bodily sensations such as shaking, sweating, and anxiety that occur during hypoglycemia.</data>
