  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Method of measuring ketone bodies in urine, considered slower and less reliable than blood testing.&lt;SEP&gt;A urine ketone test detects ketones in urine, indicating possible cetoacidosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Urine Ketone Test is a diagnostic test recommended when intercurrent illnesses occur in insulin‑treated patients.</data>
