<node id="Continuous Glucose Monitor (CGM)">
  <data key="d0">Continuous Glucose Monitor (CGM)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensor that continuously measures interstitial glucose levels, shown to improve pregnancy outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous glucose monitors are devices that measure glucose levels and are compatible with SmartGuard and Predictive Low Glucose technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous Glucose Monitor (CGM) is a device that provides real‑time tracking of blood glucose levels for patients.&lt;SEP&gt;CGM is a device that provides glucose monitoring and can include automated low‑glucose suspend features.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous glucose monitor (CGM) is a device that continuously tracks blood glucose trends.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous Glucose Monitor (CGM) is a device that continuously tracks blood glucose and can sound alarms for low levels.</data>
