<node id="Healthcare Team">
  <data key="d0">Healthcare Team</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Group of health professionals who adjust insulin therapy or diet based on glucose‑monitoring results.&lt;SEP&gt;Healthcare team denotes the group of health professionals (e.g., doctors, nurses, diabetes educators) that assists patients in planning and adapting insulin injection rotation.&lt;SEP&gt;Healthcare Team is the group of medical staff targeted for continuing education on insulin safety.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cd6b0367ed2176146798e5cf697d0aeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
