</node>
<node id="Vomiting">
  <data key="d0">Vomiting</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Medical symptom of expelling stomach contents, listed as an indication for blood ketone testing.&lt;SEP&gt;Vomiting is a symptom of illness that can affect insulin requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Vomiting is a symptom of hypoglycemia involving expulsion of stomach contents.&lt;SEP&gt;Vomiting is a condition that may require adjustment of insulin dosing to prevent hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Vomiting is included as a symptom that may accompany extreme hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;A clinical condition that can affect glucose absorption and trigger hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Vomiting is listed as a possible symptom accompanying hyperglycemia in diabetic patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cd6b0367ed2176146798e5cf697d0aeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-431b48980656b0322f263c358250b593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3daabbd42055dc30154f5f97c85fb7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffb10c00517fa772be2ca9a42f497edf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2943becc796c8ce3f0aaedf0978c3213&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2cd796639bdb0e10eeda7ef3d9ebbce</data>
