<node id="Abdominal Pain">
  <data key="d0">Abdominal Pain</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Medical symptom of discomfort in the abdomen, listed as an indication for blood ketone testing.&lt;SEP&gt;Abdominal pain is an adverse event reported in ≥5% of patients with type 1 diabetes using Humalog.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cd6b0367ed2176146798e5cf697d0aeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d26ce64e79b8c4a147140be2f9c63dd</data>
