<node id="Diet">
  <data key="d0">Diet</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Nutritional intake plan that may be adjusted by the healthcare team to manage diabetes in pregnancy.&lt;SEP&gt;Dietary changes can affect the required Humalog dose.&lt;SEP&gt;Diet refers to a patient’s nutritional intake, whose changes can affect the required dose of Humalog Mix 25 Kwikpen.&lt;SEP&gt;Diet refers to eating habits and nutrition, influencing insulin dosage needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Food intake, especially carbohydrate amount, that affects insulin dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Diet is a non‑pharmacologic treatment employed in the conventional arm of diabetes studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cd6b0367ed2176146798e5cf697d0aeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3daabbd42055dc30154f5f97c85fb7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7e6ef38db0b62d161b13473af47d738&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e94cedc7134adbb256c931b851235c53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397</data>
