<node id="Refill Cartridge">
  <data key="d0">Refill Cartridge</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A refill cartridge is a 3 mL insulin cartridge used with a refillable pen to provide additional insulin doses.&lt;SEP&gt;Refill Cartridge is a 3 mL insulin cartridge used with refillable pens.</data>
