<node id="Frequent Hypoglycemia">
  <data key="d0">Frequent Hypoglycemia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Frequent hypoglycemia refers to the condition of experiencing low blood glucose episodes repeatedly over time.&lt;SEP&gt;Repeated episodes of low blood glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;Frequent hypoglycemia refers to often occurring low blood sugar episodes that HbA1c does not reveal.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b6828aacfba0c2a6ae59c439a4e4b161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08c7f7bb0209cabd75e27f9c8556c214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22078404beeceb5adc3e688d239c585e</data>
