<node id="Insulin U100">
  <data key="d0">Insulin U100</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin U100 is a common concentration of insulin (100 units/mL) used in Brazil, intended for use with U100 syringes.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin U100 is the most common insulin concentration in Brazil, measured in units (UI).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e4654b5e9fa02cf051c2d5ebc846c5d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-622f3feb1f15564393e91cefc71256ec</data>
