<node id="Elderly Individuals With Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Elderly Individuals With Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Elderly individuals (65 years and older) with diabetes have adapted glycemic targets based on health condition and comorbidities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-986fc7ecc813c4b7942964d7fd64d429</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786299838</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glycemic Variability">
  <data key="d0">Glycemic Variability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glycemic variability refers to the fluctuations in blood‑glucose concentrations that occur over time, ranging from moment‑to‑moment changes during a single day to longer‑term variations among individuals. These oscillations encompass both episodes of hypoglycemia (low glucose) and hyperglycemia (high glucose) and are distinct from the average glucose level captured by glycated hemoglobin (A1C), which does not reflect short‑term swings.

The degree of glycemic variability is commonly quantified using statistical metrics such as the coefficient of variation (often expressed as %CV), standard deviation, and other derived indices. Research has shown that long‑acting insulin analogues tend to produce lower glycemic variability compared to older formulations such as NPH insulin, highlighting the clinical relevance of these measures in evaluating therapeutic strategies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-986fc7ecc813c4b7942964d7fd64d429&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74b3171b97fd80965359afadc0af9312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8e89a2540c525a104b0a1a5513347a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65cd86aee374fd1ea91bb4fd5ebee2a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4b76ae88b212b3a0a4d05c250e05e0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d8f17f3f250a37a1effaaa88cc8b382&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5f7cad1fb0e1a0a02f63b5928b8acd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-066ba9218f6293a2f3dc5459d69239cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a19f43c10a7a756e1597ff1a7f53296e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/glicemias capilares.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372116</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
