  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The part of an insulin pen where the needle is attached and the dose is administered.&lt;SEP&gt;An insulin pen that delivers insulin via a spring‑loaded needle, requiring the injector button to remain pressed after delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64b999805e924800faef3b856e45d8bf</data>
