<node id="Caregiver">
  <data key="d0">Caregiver</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Caregiver is a person who assists a patient or individual with diabetes in the practical aspects of treatment. This includes helping with daily insulin administration, teaching and supervising the injection technique, and supporting the patient in learning how to give insulin safely and effectively.

In addition to injection assistance, a caregiver is responsible for proper needle handling. They are instructed to manage used needles carefully, following safety protocols that prevent cross‑infection and accidental injury, thereby ensuring a safe environment for both the patient and themselves.

The caregiver’s role also extends to broader diabetes management, particularly for children, elderly persons, or anyone with physical, cognitive, or other limitations that make self‑care difficult. This includes guiding the individual in the use of diabetes‑related devices such as continuous glucose monitoring (CGM) systems, ensuring these technologies are operated safely and correctly.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-03a1de93a53fbcb513268c123e2c5a16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d0de4d525c273cda4939a501eaecc6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74b3171b97fd80965359afadc0af9312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5b4c60b3de8c56d9ab869d868345fb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb8954aaa1e1230598596ce6f5df249&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c24a2af0d0291fc4f4730256c420e93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b355007bba178588f3928b6c8620a78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c5ae163a494feafedb71ed2205c02f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00f6c2252dc945e977b3a2b2f495ffe0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c93787ffd2c022283fc0663decb1a184</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335893</data>
