<node id="Original Packaging">
  <data key="d0">Original Packaging</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Original Packaging is the manufacturer’s sealed container that should be kept with insulin, stored inside a container with a lid.&lt;SEP&gt;The original packaging is the factory-provided container in which insulin should be kept.&lt;SEP&gt;Original packaging is the container in which Humalog should be kept and not used after expiration.&lt;SEP&gt;Original Packaging is the manufacturer‑provided container that protects APIDRA from light and temperature changes.&lt;SEP&gt;Original Packaging refers to the sealed container in which Apidra Solostar is supplied and must be retained for storage.</data>
