  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Blood Vessel is a blood‑carrying vessel that may be punctured by the needle, causing sharp pain but no serious damage.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood vessel is a component of the circulatory system that, if punctured during insulin injection, can cause acute pain.&lt;SEP&gt;The circulatory vessel that carries blood containing blood glucose measured by a BG meter.</data>
