  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Degludeca is a brand of ultra‑long insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Degludeca denotes the ultra‑long‑acting insulin formulation used in Tresiba.&lt;SEP&gt;Example of ultra‑long‑acting insulin mentioned in the table.&lt;SEP&gt;Degludeca is an ultra‑long‑acting insulin analogue evaluated for basal insulinization in type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Degludeca is an ultra‑long‑acting basal insulin analog listed in the Brazilian insulin formulation table.&lt;SEP&gt;Degludeca is an ultra‑long‑acting insulin analog with a duration window from less than 4h to 42h.</data>
