<node id="Insulin Pump (SICI)">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Pump (SICI)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin pump (SICI) is a small device worn on the skin that delivers continuous small doses of insulin throughout the day.&lt;SEP&gt;Small device attached to the skin that delivers continuous small insulin doses throughout the day.</data>
