  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Vial">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Vial</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Vial is a glass container holding insulin, with a rubber stopper that is cleaned before use.&lt;SEP&gt;Glass container that holds insulin, from which the dose is drawn into a syringe or pen.&lt;SEP&gt;A container that holds insulin solution, featuring a rubber stopper that must be disinfected before injection.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin vial contains insulin that is transferred into the reservoir before infusion.&lt;SEP&gt;An insulin vial is a container of insulin that should be replaced with a new one if the current insulin is ineffective or compromised.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin vial is a container that holds insulin for filling the reservoir.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Vial is the container that holds insulin and connects to the reservoir via the Transfer Guard.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc6a26a5d2c41087b58a0f7f71ad21cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64b999805e924800faef3b856e45d8bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30dc18e012cfdf2d8f9b961fdd1ba644&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8e89a2540c525a104b0a1a5513347a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6025fa711665988fad0f789b9eb901a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329606</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fast-Acting Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Fast-Acting Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Fast-Acting Insulin is a type of insulin that begins working quickly after injection, often mixed with intermediate-acting insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300285</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intermediate-Acting Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Intermediate-Acting Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Intermediate-Acting Insulin is a type of insulin with a slower onset, commonly mixed with fast-acting insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Intermediate‑acting insulin describes insulin formulations with a slower absorption profile providing prolonged glucose control.&lt;SEP&gt;Intermediate‑acting insulin refers to insulin formulations of moderate duration that may be switched to Levemir® with dose adjustments.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin with slower, irregular absorption used in injection therapy for basal needs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb0fb965e5ddd796999856ca376d4b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56fc1d5df1b34d9120c3cf8a760c40f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5913d17c337be62cd526d46fbdcd9a6e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324120</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Air">
  <data key="d0">Air</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Air is injected into the insulin vial before drawing insulin to facilitate withdrawal.&lt;SEP&gt;Air is injected into the insulin vial to avoid vacuum before drawing insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8310c065da1c624d58d9a0a8e9ff7d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301820</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Dose">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Dose</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Dose is the specific, quantified amount of insulin measured for and administered during a subcutaneous injection. It represents the exact quantity of insulin that a patient receives, whether expressed in units on a syringe, on an insulin pen dose selector, or as a calculated value displayed by an insulin‑delivery device such as the Bolus Wizard.

The prescribed insulin dose influences practical considerations such as syringe capacity, needle dwell time, and the settings of dose selectors on devices like BASAGLAR, where the displayed amount corresponds directly to the insulin delivered per injection. Clinicians may adjust the dose based on individual factors, including the chosen injection site, the patient’s insulin sensitivity, levels of physical activity, and the presence of concurrent illness, to achieve optimal glycemic control.

In addition to its therapeutic role, Insulin Dose is used as a quantitative variable in research contexts, for example when evaluating correlations between the amount of insulin administered and the production of insulin‑specific antibodies. The dose may also be broken down into components such as corrective insulin and carbohydrate‑coverage insulin, as calculated by bolus‑calculation algorithms that present the total dose to be administered.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Dose is the amount of insulin administered, which may change over time due to various factors.&lt;SEP&gt;Amount of insulin personalized based on weight, diet, activity, age, and special situations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8abf9336f83edf5c92071da1032dc483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74b3171b97fd80965359afadc0af9312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64b999805e924800faef3b856e45d8bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffb10c00517fa772be2ca9a42f497edf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22df77f7bf817d736d90608e62a11d84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b9c41c968bcc1d46185583661e8f989&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd396c45bc09fb646d156b4e69d328e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27a9a11fec63f11922c3e40119833245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7e6ef38db0b62d161b13473af47d738&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e94cedc7134adbb256c931b851235c53</data>
