</node>
<node id="Caneta Reutilizável de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Caneta Reutilizável de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The reusable insulin pen is a durable, free device supplied by SUS that holds 3 mL insulin cartridges, features a cap, body, dosage selector, and needle attachment, and can be used for up to three years.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical device designed for multiple uses in insulin delivery, highlighted as an advancement in safety, humanization, and environmental sustainability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ad60377d965f68ffeebc4b21b89a095&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300574</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
