  <data key="d0">SUS</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">SUS is Brazil’s public health system that offers free medical devices and services, including reusable insulin pens.&lt;SEP&gt;SUS is the Brazilian Unified Health System guaranteeing the right to receive proper medication guidance.&lt;SEP&gt;Brazil’s public health system referenced as the context for the official guide on reusable insulin pens.&lt;SEP&gt;SUS is the Brazilian Unified Health System that provides public health services nationwide.</data>
