<node id="Subjetivo">
  <data key="d0">Subjetivo</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">SOAP note field where the subjective information about the patient’s visit is entered, e.g., “Paciente comparece à farmácia e solicita caneta de insulina”.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ad60377d965f68ffeebc4b21b89a095</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300575</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Objetivo">
  <data key="d0">Objetivo</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">SOAP note field for objective details, e.g., “Paciente apresenta receita para dispensação de caneta de insulina”.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ad60377d965f68ffeebc4b21b89a095</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300575</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Avaliação">
  <data key="d0">Avaliação</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">SOAP note field containing evaluation, e.g., “Necessidade de orientação para a troca de tipo de caneta de insulina”.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ad60377d965f68ffeebc4b21b89a095</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300575</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Plano">
  <data key="d0">Plano</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">SOAP note field with the plan, e.g., “Orientação quanto à troca de tipo de caneta de insulina”.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ad60377d965f68ffeebc4b21b89a095</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300575</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Orientações ao cidadão">
  <data key="d0">Orientações ao cidadão</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">SOAP note field where guidance to the patient is recorded, e.g., “Novo tipo de Caneta de Insulina”.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ad60377d965f68ffeebc4b21b89a095</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300575</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="POP">
  <data key="d0">POP</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">POP is the standard operating procedure that guides access to e‑SUS for health units.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard operating procedure referenced for additional data entry requirements in the system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ad60377d965f68ffeebc4b21b89a095&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8bd4e5ffecd1db91291addfcb4ad781</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300575</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tela de atendimento">
  <data key="d0">Tela de atendimento</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Electronic attendance screen that hosts the SOAP tab for recording patient information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ad60377d965f68ffeebc4b21b89a095</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300575</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Plastic Syringe">
  <data key="d0">Plastic Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Plastic syringes are disposable injection devices whose waste is reduced by the adoption of reusable insulin pens.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300576</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Boletim de Ocorrência">
  <data key="d0">Boletim de Ocorrência</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Boletim de Ocorrência is an official incident report required to justify replacement of a lost or broken reusable insulin pen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300576</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tubete de Insulina de 3 mL">
  <data key="d0">Tubete de Insulina de 3 mL</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The 3 mL insulin cartridge is a tubular container that holds insulin and is inserted into the reusable insulin pen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300576</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agulha Compatível">
  <data key="d0">Agulha Compatível</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A compatible disposable needle is attached to the tip of the reusable insulin pen for insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300576</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes.org.br">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes.org.br</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes.org.br is an informational website that hosts the guide on how to use the reusable insulin pen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300576</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Procedimento de Montagem Inicial">
  <data key="d0">Procedimento de Montagem Inicial</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Procedimento de Montagem Inicial is the step‑by‑step method describing how to assemble and prepare the reusable insulin pen for use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300576</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Máxima Assepsia Possível">
  <data key="d0">Máxima Assepsia Possível</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Máxima Assepsia Possível is the principle of maintaining the highest possible aseptic conditions when handling the pen and insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300576</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tampa">
  <data key="d0">Tampa</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Tampa is the cap of the reusable insulin pen that is removed during initial assembly.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300576</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Corpo da Caneta">
  <data key="d0">Corpo da Caneta</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Corpo da Caneta is the main body of the reusable insulin pen that houses the cartridge holder, piston, window, and buttons.&lt;SEP&gt;Main housing of the BASAGLAR KwikPen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc9821850f5a0f8be1e4dd3fd0df6fcf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310011</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Suporte de Tubete">
  <data key="d0">Suporte de Tubete</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Suporte de Tubete is the holder within the pen body that secures the 3 mL insulin cartridge.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300576</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pistão com Rosca">
  <data key="d0">Pistão com Rosca</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Pistão com Rosca is the threaded piston inside the pen body that drives the insulin cartridge forward.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300577</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Janela de Dosagem">
  <data key="d0">Janela de Dosagem</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Janela de Dosagem is the viewing window on the pen that shows the selected insulin dose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300577</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Botão Seletor de Dose">
  <data key="d0">Botão Seletor de Dose</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Botão Seletor de Dose is the rotating knob on the pen that selects the insulin dose and emits a click sound.&lt;SEP&gt;Button used to adjust the insulin dose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc9821850f5a0f8be1e4dd3fd0df6fcf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310011</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Botão de Injeção">
  <data key="d0">Botão de Injeção</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Botão de Injeção is the button pressed to deliver the insulin through the attached needle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300577</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ponto de Rosca para Agulha">
  <data key="d0">Ponto de Rosca para Agulha</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Ponto de Rosca para Agulha is the threaded location on the pen where a compatible disposable needle is attached.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300577</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Teste de Jato">
  <data key="d0">Teste de Jato</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Teste de Jato is the priming procedure that expels air and ensures insulin flow before injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ece9be8cb2fc7164b997159dbfe6b436</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300577</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Caneta De Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Caneta De Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Caneta de Insulina is a reusable insulin pen that holds insulin, must be clearly labeled, and has a validity of three years after first use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8bd4e5ffecd1db91291addfcb4ad781</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300577</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Unidade De Saúde">
  <data key="d0">Unidade De Saúde</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Unidade de Saúde is a health unit where people with diabetes can obtain pen replacements and report adverse events.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8bd4e5ffecd1db91291addfcb4ad781</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300577</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Secretaria Municipal De Saúde">
  <data key="d0">Secretaria Municipal De Saúde</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Secretaria Municipal de Saúde is the municipal health department responsible for providing replacement insulin pens under specific conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8bd4e5ffecd1db91291addfcb4ad781</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300577</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pessoa Com Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Pessoa Com Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Individual diagnosed with diabetes who uses the insulin pen and cartridges.&lt;SEP&gt;Pessoa com diabetes is the individual with diabetes who signs a commitment term, receives insulin pens, and follows disposal and replacement rules.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8bd4e5ffecd1db91291addfcb4ad781&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93cf8e2cbfe98257306d973162a0688</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300577</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Farmacêutico">
  <data key="d0">Farmacêutico</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Farmacêutico is the pharmacist who delivers orientation on correct medication use and records it in e‑SUS.&lt;SEP&gt;Farmacêutico is the pharmacist who can answer questions about Tresiba and its side effects.&lt;SEP&gt;Farmacêutico is a healthcare professional cited for disposal guidance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8bd4e5ffecd1db91291addfcb4ad781&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11cce86325de9748e794648198242578&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a557234bf75633a4af048115a6f0c449</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/TRESIBA _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786316088</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Boletim De Ocorrência">
  <data key="d0">Boletim De Ocorrência</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Boletim de Ocorrência is an official report required when an insulin pen is lost.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8bd4e5ffecd1db91291addfcb4ad781</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300578</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Termo De Compromisso E Responsabilidade">
  <data key="d0">Termo De Compromisso E Responsabilidade</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Termo de Compromisso e Responsabilidade is a document signed by the person with diabetes acknowledging responsibilities regarding insulin pen usage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8bd4e5ffecd1db91291addfcb4ad781</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300578</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Www.Diabetes.Org.Br">
  <data key="d0">Www.Diabetes.Org.Br</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">www.diabetes.org.br is the website cited as source of information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8bd4e5ffecd1db91291addfcb4ad781</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300578</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Unidade Básica De Saúde (UBS)">
  <data key="d0">Unidade Básica De Saúde (UBS)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Unidade Básica de Saúde (UBS) is a primary health care unit where professionals are encouraged to promote diabetes education.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8bd4e5ffecd1db91291addfcb4ad781</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300578</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="E-SUS">
  <data key="d0">E-SUS</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">e‑SUS is the electronic health information system used to register deliveries and orientations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8bd4e5ffecd1db91291addfcb4ad781</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300578</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Caixa Rígida">
  <data key="d0">Caixa Rígida</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Caixa rígida is a sturdy container used for proper disposal of used needles.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8bd4e5ffecd1db91291addfcb4ad781</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300578</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SOAP">
  <data key="d0">SOAP</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">SOAP is the section label in the e‑SUS interface where subjective patient information is entered.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8bd4e5ffecd1db91291addfcb4ad781</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300578</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tubete De 3 Ml">
  <data key="d0">Tubete De 3 Ml</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Tubete de 3 ml is the insulin cartridge that fits inside a reusable insulin pen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8bd4e5ffecd1db91291addfcb4ad781</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786300578</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Leve Agitação">
  <data key="d0">Leve Agitação</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
