<node id="Caneta">
  <data key="d0">Caneta</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Caneta is an insulin‑pen device designed to hold a pre‑filled insulin cartridge and deliver precise subcutaneous doses of insulin. The pen incorporates a piston that advances the cartridge, a dose‑setting button, a dose‑display window, an external protective cap, and a label for identification.

The pen’s operation relies on the user turning the dose button to select the required units, after which the piston pushes the insulin through a compatible needle for injection. The device is intended for use with standard insulin‑pen needles, including 4 mm needles that are recommended for subcutaneous administration during early pregnancy. Specific insulin products such as Toujeo and APIDRA SOLOSTAR are administered with the Caneta, each requiring the appropriate needle attachment and adherence to the manufacturer’s dosing instructions.

Proper handling and storage are emphasized. Caneta should be kept in a dry environment away from heat sources and must not be stored in a refrigerator. The pen’s cap should remain on when not in use to protect the needle and maintain sterility. Regular regulation checks are advised to ensure accurate dosing, and users should monitor the pen for signs of damage or loss, keeping a spare device available as recommended in guidance documents.

In clinical practice, the pen is employed for routine insulin therapy, with particular attention to dosage accuracy, needle compatibility, and safe storage conditions. When used for Toujeo, the cap must stay on and the pen must follow the specific storage parameters outlined for that formulation. For APIDRA SOLOSTAR, the same compatible‑needle requirement applies, and the device functions as the primary delivery mechanism for the medication.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a93cf8e2cbfe98257306d973162a0688&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df359ca3783191b2159f8d3f6ea6c52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7982460136aa21cc2de3969af556c4d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4916e2524690f1ce85df7c187f6d7a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d156e12ba8d9418249ea309aab0552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aba4eb027a027fb1ad6e0105b97cfa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56fb3d61e8c32af5d6b8be06cc54f904&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b060d4f68031bd35dfafc19eadf1e9fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04b345bc26ec7f5d7c9db8c6004a50a4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Guia-Pratico-SBD-Canetas-Reutilizaveis-de-Insulina-no-SUS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf</data>
