  <data key="d5">1786317639</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tresiba">
  <data key="d0">Tresiba</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Tresiba® is an ultra‑long‑acting (Ultralenta) insulin brand.&lt;SEP&gt;Tresiba is a long‑acting (basal) insulin product listed with a bula link.&lt;SEP&gt;Tresiba® is a long‑acting insulin medication described in the drug label for treatment of diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Tresiba is a medication (insulin analog) discussed in the bula for managing blood sugar levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Tresiba (degludec) is a long‑acting insulin used for basal dosing, reaching steady state in 3–4 days.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8768fa32f88d682aa4ddf677297047e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa127476a5c98492d7b7e0fcd1212886&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2943becc796c8ce3f0aaedf0978c3213&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11cce86325de9748e794648198242578&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70c5a1107fcc9b632361d9c52064f45d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Insulinas CANETAS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Lista_Insulinas_Bulas (1).pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/TRESIBA _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/edelman-et-al-2026-dosing-afrezza-it-s-not-that-complicated.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786333268</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Humalog">
  <data key="d0">Humalog</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Humalog is the commercial brand name for insulin lispro, a recombinant rapid‑acting (ultra‑rapid) insulin formulation used to control hyperglycemia in individuals with diabetes mellitus. The product is supplied as a sterile, transparent, colorless solution for subcutaneous injection, containing 100 units of insulin lispro per milliliter. Onset of glucose‑lowering activity occurs approximately 15 minutes after administration, making Humago suitable for mealtime insulin coverage and correction of elevated blood glucose levels.

Humalog is indicated for the treatment of both type 1 and type 2 diabetes in adults and in children aged three years and older. The prescribing information includes specific guidance for special populations: it may be used during pregnancy and lactation when clinically required, but dosage adjustments and careful monitoring are advised for the elderly, and it is not recommended for children younger than three years. The product is marketed throughout the European Union, where the European Medicines Agency issued a Summary of Product Characteristics (SmPC) for the insulin lispro formulation in 2017.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8768fa32f88d682aa4ddf677297047e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe370bbb9ac4bc4d475b9ef58ec9fee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-431b48980656b0322f263c358250b593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e89f1dbae629e925f06732cebf41df16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3daabbd42055dc30154f5f97c85fb7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d26ce64e79b8c4a147140be2f9c63dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa127476a5c98492d7b7e0fcd1212886&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16a76447c936e157673f084ffb74520d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Insulinas CANETAS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Bula Humalog.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Lista_Insulinas_Bulas (1).pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786330182</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
