  <data key="d0">Novorapid</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Novorapid® is an ultra‑rapid (Ultrarrápida) insulin brand.&lt;SEP&gt;Novorapid is an insulin medication whose leaflet describes dosage, side effects, and emergency instructions.&lt;SEP&gt;Novorapid is a brand of insulin medication discussed in the leaflet, with associated adverse reactions and dosing information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8768fa32f88d682aa4ddf677297047e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e5c50e8a808c537075377966ae2ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f079198593c1702b56062aa87e7801a</data>
