</node>
<node id="Apidra">
  <data key="d0">Apidra</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Apidra® is an ultra‑rapid (Ultrarrápida) insulin brand.&lt;SEP&gt;Apidra is a rapid‑acting insulin product listed with a bulário link.&lt;SEP&gt;Apidra is an insulin analog medication used for rapid-acting glucose regulation in diabetes treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Apidra is a rapid‑acting insulin analog (insulin glulisine) used to regulate blood glucose, characterized by a faster onset and shorter duration of action than regular human insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8768fa32f88d682aa4ddf677297047e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa127476a5c98492d7b7e0fcd1212886&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f46c503a378e6c69618036a038672417&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b65ee62ad12239ddc729c50a1aef854c</data>
