<node id="Músculo">
  <data key="d0">Músculo</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Muscle tissue, where insulin should not be deposited because it can cause hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Muscle tissue that may be inadvertently entered with excessively long insulin needles, increasing hypoglycemia risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Músculo is muscular tissue; injection of Tresiba into a muscle is contraindicated.&lt;SEP&gt;Músculo is muscle tissue in which insulin stimulates rapid intracellular transport of glucose and amino acids and promotes anabolism.</data>
