<node id="Abdominal Wall">
  <data key="d0">Abdominal Wall</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Recommended injection site on the lateral abdomen, three finger widths from the navel.&lt;SEP&gt;Abdominal Wall is a common injection site for subcutaneous delivery of Novolin® R FlexPen® offering rapid absorption.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc6a26a5d2c41087b58a0f7f71ad21cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cd48799a027437b9fe2e1a48b61cb3d</data>
