<node id="Insulina Lispro">
  <data key="d0">Insulina Lispro</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina Lispro is a rapid‑acting insulin analogue that serves as the active ingredient of the commercial product Humalog. It is designed to provide fast‑acting glucose‑lowering activity and is commonly prescribed for morning dosing as well as for administration before meals.  

Pharmacologically, Insulina Lispro is a lispro formulation of rapid‑acting insulin that retains its swift onset of action even when included in insulin mixtures. Its rapid activity makes it suitable for use in basal‑bolus regimens, where it is employed to cover post‑prandial glucose excursions.  

Clinically, Insulina Lispro has been evaluated in phase III basal‑bolus studies, demonstrating its effectiveness when used before meals within such treatment protocols. Comparative clinical studies have further examined its performance relative to other rapid‑acting insulins.  

In addition to efficacy assessments, Insulina Lispro has been the subject of safety investigations that include mutagenicity testing, fertility effect studies, excretion profiling, and detailed pharmacokinetic analyses across various patient populations. These studies support its role as a rapid‑acting human insulin analogue for controlling blood glucose levels in individuals with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina Lispro is a rapid‑acting insulin analogue used as prandial insulin in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina lispro is a rapid‑acting insulin used as a comparator in the clinical study of APIDRA®.&lt;SEP&gt;A rapid‑acting insulin analogue recommended for use with SICI.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7982460136aa21cc2de3969af556c4d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe370bbb9ac4bc4d475b9ef58ec9fee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa127476a5c98492d7b7e0fcd1212886&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e62226007200589cb2143f0fb75b302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0ac8ad5968d54922b924fdb16b61d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4319d08c10ed2b48857a6d42eadd9db0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-518838d3c8e8110567b1891b704bfef9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a247846b9ec5d44d0bcbe6c5f15599f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aca0b919135813e1d5b772face36989d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d9c944d51a42525c017d9109f46684c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb620bf44b37187faceacd0405c4a819&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-336a2f2c9b510e23c35be95e2ff7a72a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Bula Humalog.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Lista_Insulinas_Bulas (1).pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786330193</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
