  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301817</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Seringa De Insulina Com Agulha Fixa E Curta">
  <data key="d0">Seringa De Insulina Com Agulha Fixa E Curta</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Seringa De Insulina Com Agulha Fixa E Curta is an insulin syringe with a fixed short needle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7982460136aa21cc2de3969af556c4d2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301817</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Setor Da Geladeira">
  <data key="d0">Setor Da Geladeira</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Setor Da Geladeira is the refrigerator compartment where insulin, heparin and vaccines may be stored together.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7982460136aa21cc2de3969af556c4d2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301817</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulinas E Heparinas">
  <data key="d0">Insulinas E Heparinas</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulinas E Heparinas are injectable medications stored in proximity, raising contamination concerns.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7982460136aa21cc2de3969af556c4d2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301818</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Vacinas">
  <data key="d0">Vacinas</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Vacinas are injectable vaccines mentioned in storage guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7982460136aa21cc2de3969af556c4d2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301818</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Protocolos">
  <data key="d0">Protocolos</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Protocolos are formal procedures intended to guide safe insulin handling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7982460136aa21cc2de3969af556c4d2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301818</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Educação Continuada">
  <data key="d0">Educação Continuada</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Educação Continuada denotes ongoing training for staff and patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7982460136aa21cc2de3969af556c4d2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301818</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Homogeneização De Suspensão De Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Homogeneização De Suspensão De Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Homogeneização De Suspensão De Insulina is the process of mixing insulin suspension before injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7982460136aa21cc2de3969af556c4d2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301818</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reuso De Agulha">
  <data key="d0">Reuso De Agulha</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Reuso De Agulha describes the practice of reusing a needle, which can cause dosing errors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7982460136aa21cc2de3969af556c4d2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301818</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Retirada Imediata Da Agulha">
  <data key="d0">Retirada Imediata Da Agulha</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Retirada Imediata Da Agulha is the recommended step of removing the needle right after injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7982460136aa21cc2de3969af556c4d2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301818</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dose Incorreta">
  <data key="d0">Dose Incorreta</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dose Incorreta refers to an insulin dose that exceeds the prescribed amount due to technique errors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7982460136aa21cc2de3969af556c4d2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301818</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Técnico De Enfermagem">
  <data key="d0">Técnico De Enfermagem</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Técnico De Enfermagem is a nursing technician who administered insulin NPH to the patient.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7982460136aa21cc2de3969af556c4d2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301818</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hands">
  <data key="d0">Hands</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Hands are the body part that must be washed and dried before the injection procedure.&lt;SEP&gt;Hands must be washed and dried before any insulin preparation steps.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8310c065da1c624d58d9a0a8e9ff7d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ed0b3e64751c1a28d72e087f711cc20</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301818</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Syringe With Fixed Needle">
  <data key="d0">Syringe With Fixed Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A syringe equipped with a fixed needle used for mixing and injecting insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Syringe with fixed needle is the preferred syringe type for safe insulin preparation, offering specific unit capacities and no dead‑space.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8310c065da1c624d58d9a0a8e9ff7d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d795dc393eb02c6418957ee1678504f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786302749</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Rubber Stopper Of Insulin Vial">
  <data key="d0">Rubber Stopper Of Insulin Vial</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The rubber seal of the insulin vial that must be disinfected before drawing insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8310c065da1c624d58d9a0a8e9ff7d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301819</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dose Of Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Dose Of Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The prescribed amount of insulin measured by the syringe graduations for administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8310c065da1c624d58d9a0a8e9ff7d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301819</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Vial Of Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Vial Of Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The container that holds insulin, either NPH or Regular, for preparation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8310c065da1c624d58d9a0a8e9ff7d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301820</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Manual Of Instruction">
  <data key="d0">Manual Of Instruction</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The manufacturer’s guide that explains the correct use of the insulin pen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8310c065da1c624d58d9a0a8e9ff7d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301820</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Injector Button">
  <data key="d0">Injector Button</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The button on the insulin pen that is pressed only after the needle is fully inserted.&lt;SEP&gt;The injector button is a part of the pen that must be fully pressed to deliver the selected dose of insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8310c065da1c624d58d9a0a8e9ff7d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c24a2af0d0291fc4f4730256c420e93</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786318421</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Preparation Method">
  <data key="d0">Preparation Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The step‑by‑step procedure for preparing one or two types of insulin in a syringe.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8310c065da1c624d58d9a0a8e9ff7d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301820</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Application Method">
  <data key="d0">Application Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The step‑by‑step procedure for injecting insulin with a syringe into subcutaneous tissue.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d8310c065da1c624d58d9a0a8e9ff7d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301820</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Gibney et al. Study">
  <data key="d0">Gibney et al. Study</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Study by Gibney et al. reporting that adult epidermis and dermis thickness rarely exceeds 3 mm while subcutaneous tissue thickness varies widely.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301821</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hirsch et al. Study">
  <data key="d0">Hirsch et al. Study</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Study by Hirsch et al. in which patients received insulin injections with 4, 5, and 8 mm needles; the 4 mm needle was found safe and well tolerated.&lt;SEP&gt;A larger randomized multicenter trial that compared glucose excursions after TI versus subcutaneous RAA insulin in 122 adults with T1D.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-127dc0e8b8b960bfd1fce3df4f590120</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332846</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Epidermis">
  <data key="d0">Epidermis</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The outer layer of skin whose thickness in adults rarely exceeds 3 mm according to the Gibney et al. study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301821</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dermis">
  <data key="d0">Dermis</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The skin layer beneath the epidermis whose thickness in adults rarely exceeds 3 mm as reported by the Gibney et al. study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301821</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="4 mm Needle">
  <data key="d0">4 mm Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A short insulin needle of 4 mm length recommended for all adults and for individuals with limited subcutaneous tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;4 mm needle is a short insulin needle length used for subcutaneous injections.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74b3171b97fd80965359afadc0af9312</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301821</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="5 mm Needle">
  <data key="d0">5 mm Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An insulin needle of 5 mm length mentioned in clinical studies.&lt;SEP&gt;5 mm needle is a slightly longer insulin needle length used for subcutaneous injections.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74b3171b97fd80965359afadc0af9312</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301821</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="6 mm Needle">
  <data key="d0">6 mm Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An insulin needle of 6 mm length mentioned in clinical studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301821</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="8 mm Needle">
  <data key="d0">8 mm Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An insulin needle of 8 mm length mentioned in clinical studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301821</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="High-Flow Pen Needle">
  <data key="d0">High-Flow Pen Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An extra‑thin‑walled needle for insulin pens that improves injection experience and insulin flow.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301821</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Subcutaneous Injection Technique">
  <data key="d0">Subcutaneous Injection Technique</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The recommended procedure for delivering insulin into subcutaneous tissue, including site selection, fold creation, and angle of insertion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301822</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Injection Angle 90°">
  <data key="d0">Injection Angle 90°</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The standard needle insertion angle of 90 degrees for subcutaneous insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301822</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Injection Angle 45°">
  <data key="d0">Injection Angle 45°</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The adjusted needle insertion angle of 45 degrees recommended during the first and second trimesters of pregnancy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301822</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Arm (Posterior)">
  <data key="d0">Arm (Posterior)</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The posterior aspect of the arm, located three to four finger widths below the axilla and above the elbow, recommended for insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301822</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Buttocks (Upper Lateral Quadrant)">
  <data key="d0">Buttocks (Upper Lateral Quadrant)</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The upper lateral external quadrant of the buttocks recommended as an injection site.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301822</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Thigh (Anterior/Lateral Upper)">
  <data key="d0">Thigh (Anterior/Lateral Upper)</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The anterior and lateral upper portion of the thigh, a recommended insulin injection site.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301822</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Abdomen (Lateral Right/Left)">
  <data key="d0">Abdomen (Lateral Right/Left)</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The right and left lateral regions of the abdomen, a common injection site except during the third trimester of pregnancy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301823</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pregnancy (First and Second Trimester)">
  <data key="d0">Pregnancy (First and Second Trimester)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The physiological condition during the first two trimesters of gestation, during which a 45° angle and 4 mm needle are advised for insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301823</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Table 2">
  <data key="d0">Table 2</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The table that lists recommendations for appropriate needle use in subcutaneous insulin injection.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 2 displays baseline characteristics and outcomes for the six‑month comparison of NovoRapid® and insulin regular in type‑2 diabetes patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 2 presents a summary of primary therapeutic outcomes for patients with Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 in the Edition 4 Study.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 2 presents baseline and outcome data for pediatric patients with Type 1 diabetes receiving NPH or insulin glargina combined with APIDRA‑insulin lispro.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 2 presents data on the effectiveness of Fiasp® in patients with diabetes mellitus type 2.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 2 provides helpful hints and patient education recommendations for Afrezza use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecd2466ef4258dade38fbadd495188e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78b302b74d715df9c3b9e9db38fa4c64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b18f8ab53481bf1b63fda1bb71fe80ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff211ed5ca723fa2074871af58a4eb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e6371d8083fb20b137912cdaeec1b8b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/edelman-et-al-2026-dosing-afrezza-it-s-not-that-complicated.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786333249</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Institutional Settings">
  <data key="d0">Institutional Settings</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Settings such as health services, daycare centers, and elder care homes where insulin injections are administered.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301823</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Third Trimester of Pregnancy">
  <data key="d0">Third Trimester of Pregnancy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The final stage of gestation during which abdominal insulin injection is not recommended.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301823</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Subcutaneous Tissue Scarcity">
  <data key="d0">Subcutaneous Tissue Scarcity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A condition where there is limited subcutaneous tissue at recommended injection sites.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301824</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Inflammation">
  <data key="d0">Inflammation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Localized swelling of tissue that contraindicates insulin injection at the affected site.&lt;SEP&gt;Inflammation is a biological response that can be associated with insulin resistance in cystic fibrosis patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cdf6af658e42c2f4f7dca5e4dbdd3db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377349</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ulceration">
  <data key="d0">Ulceration</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Open sores on the skin that are unsuitable for insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301824</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Wound">
  <data key="d0">Wound</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Injured skin areas that must not be used for insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301824</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Scar">
  <data key="d0">Scar</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Fibrous tissue from previous injury that should be avoided for insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301824</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fistula">
  <data key="d0">Fistula</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Abnormal connection between organs or vessels that makes the area unsuitable for injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301825</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Recommended Injection Sites">
  <data key="d0">Recommended Injection Sites</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Areas such as posterior arm, upper lateral buttocks, anterior/lateral upper thigh, and lateral abdomen deemed appropriate for insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301825</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pen Injector Button">
  <data key="d0">Pen Injector Button</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Pen Injector Button is the button on an insulin pen that may be pressed before needle insertion.&lt;SEP&gt;The push button on an insulin pen used to trigger the injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e150bb4043de862453b3e96cf6cb663e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5b4c60b3de8c56d9ab869d868345fb7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301825</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GLP-1 Agonist">
  <data key="d0">GLP-1 Agonist</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">GLP-1 agonist is a class of medication that targets GLP-1 receptors and can be combined with insulin in disposable pens for diabetes treatment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7ed0b3e64751c1a28d72e087f711cc20</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301825</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Injection Button">
  <data key="d0">Injection Button</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Injection button is the button on the pen that is pressed to initiate insulin injection and held until needle removal.&lt;SEP&gt;The injection button is pressed with the thumb to deliver the selected insulin dose.&lt;SEP&gt;Injection Button is the mechanism on SoloStar that, when pressed, forces insulin to flow through the needle.&lt;SEP&gt;Injection Button is the trigger on the SoloStar pen that releases insulin when pressed.&lt;SEP&gt;Injection Button is the control on the SoloStar that, when pressed, delivers the insulin dose and updates the dose indicator window.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7ed0b3e64751c1a28d72e087f711cc20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7638273060df996ad502ec2fadfc9c82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffe095bda1b787c5b5ae2d61a2f74c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9835d6684db67541402527b3182b6c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79f891b1d7c0c6ca0eab9dbcc76c902d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786315486</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Refill">
  <data key="d0">Refill</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Refill is the insulin cartridge attached to the pen, which must avoid blood aspiration during the injection process.&lt;SEP&gt;Refill is a 3 mL cartridge compatible with insulin pens, used to deliver Lantus.&lt;SEP&gt;The individual cartridge attached to each BASAGLAR KwikPen that holds the insulin solution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7ed0b3e64751c1a28d72e087f711cc20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572e715aada476f4dac69a032e16cc09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc9821850f5a0f8be1e4dd3fd0df6fcf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310010</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Continuous Subcutaneous Insulin Infusion System">
  <data key="d0">Continuous Subcutaneous Insulin Infusion System</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion system (SICI) is an electronic device that delivers basal and bolus insulin doses through a catheter and cannula.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7ed0b3e64751c1a28d72e087f711cc20</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301825</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reservoir">
  <data key="d0">Reservoir</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Reservoir is the removable container inside an insulin pump that stores the insulin solution for continuous subcutaneous infusion.  It fits into a dedicated reservoir compartment of the device and can be inserted, rotated to lock, and tapped to eliminate air bubbles before the pump delivers the programmed doses.  The reservoir holds a measured volume of insulin, which is displayed on the pump’s screen by a reservoir‑level icon, and it is removed when insulin flow is blocked or when a refill is needed.

In Medtronic’s MiniMed systems—including the MiniMed 640G, MiniMed 780G, and related models—the reservoir connects directly to the infusion set and cannula that deliver insulin into the subcutaneous tissue.  The component is designed specifically for insulin (or other approved medications) and is contraindicated for infusion of blood or blood products.  For guaranteed operation, the reservoir must be manufactured or distributed by Medtronic Diabetes and is supplied as a replaceable, single‑use item.  

Overall, the reservoir functions as the core, replaceable storage element of the pump delivery system, securely holding insulin until it is pumped through the tubing and cannula into the patient.&lt;SEP&gt;Reservoir is a component of the insulin pump that holds insulin before delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Reservoir is a component of the Accu‑Chek® Solo insulin pump that holds insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7ed0b3e64751c1a28d72e087f711cc20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc2aa5d85d666eabc9dbaa5d2ecfe874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30dc18e012cfdf2d8f9b961fdd1ba644&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fe81d733c2a429da0726794b55350b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dd9a1bb820381073ad2475541a3a575&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e91ce385a4956221ce891caa7456655a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9b29e7a7839d7ff2b29e72fb4912618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ce776458e256df9d6070a419cab7449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f3c75e751c36c2f270820a403b40ac0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-527777f044e20410ca47d2c5b35306ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e2c8beb0e0581ef5724dc5c631252e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a4a75301f61fc3c86ad768de09d0c3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a9714e3b2aaad60242e3827215230bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83bb94d08bdb958eff25f76c9a6ac18a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-474703bb16e6e26e009e9d433c3d3647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df77f2ea988e5724effb4c71cc79a65a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8e2f5011e0e0fe7dc11273e2f345b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe844728a502927fee80d42268408b1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0267d2986a48c4c31790b6f183277dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28515a0aca492eeee478cd9947226498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6025fa711665988fad0f789b9eb901a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f3d819d6498d4482286628946e37a6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-177e9aca0bf1c1724474ea529826bece&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec9cae555a06ac660e6c16d90116c8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bfe428f5a1381000cf6932b37aa2239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a01dc8dc15b92e2b0b570753b0f57632&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a764dcbdd73fd1c50fa72a7cd60b6e19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71de01baf40871c616eaa39cb8189f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3895d65c9a22c257a4717f300d4086b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c5a5c97986d9b31b155b0c8f0cac1c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db5749bec4af1c3ea068b257c4376aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7387e81b8141435df1372f5d8b27662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fba8ea0c6bdb8427804ba05f9fe49f9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786330139</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Infusion Set">
  <data key="d0">Infusion Set</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Infusion Set is the tubing‑and‑cannula assembly used in continuous sub‑cutaneous insulin infusion (CSII) systems to link an insulin pump’s reservoir to a sub‑cutaneous insertion site for the delivery of insulin.  The complete set typically comprises a flexible tube or tubing, a connector that mates with the pump, a soft cannula or needle (often protected by a needle‑protector), an adhesive patch or securing component that affixes the set to the skin, and, in some definitions, additional elements such as handles, buttons, a small compartment, or even the reservoir itself.  The cannula penetrates the skin and remains in the sub‑cutaneous tissue while the adhesive patch holds the assembly in place.

In operation the infusion set functions as the conduit through which insulin is conveyed from the pump’s reservoir, through the tubing, and into the body’s sub‑cutaneous tissue.  It enables precise, programmable dosing by allowing the pump to deliver insulin continuously or in bolus doses.  The set is considered the tubing and cannula component of the insulin pump system and is essential for devices such as the MiniMed™ 640G and MiniMed™ 780G insulin pumps.  Compatibility is generally specific to the pump model, with Medtronic Diabetes supplying sets that are matched to its pumps.

Clinical observations in adult study groups have reported reliable fluid flow with no occlusions when using standard infusion sets, indicating dependable performance under typical usage conditions.  Manufacturers and clinical guidelines recommend replacing the infusion set every two to three days to maintain optimal insulin delivery, minimize the risk of site irritation or infection, and ensure consistent sub‑cutaneous absorption.  Set‑change reminders are often built into pump software, and the set must be disconnected before handling the reservoir or during software updates.

The infusion set is a trans‑cutaneous delivery component indicated for sub‑cutaneous use only.  While it is designed to be leak‑tight, occasional leakage may occur without immediate user notification, and blockage alarms can prompt removal of the set.  Proper attachment of the adhesive patch, correct insertion technique, and adherence to the recommended wear duration are essential for safe and effective insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Infusion set comprises the tubing and connections (catheter, cannula, reservoir, battery) used with an insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7ed0b3e64751c1a28d72e087f711cc20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77c1608c27e3114f3a14f175efe260a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c32255a7f064c18ff0b079798cfeaf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fe81d733c2a429da0726794b55350b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dd9a1bb820381073ad2475541a3a575&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e91ce385a4956221ce891caa7456655a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5913d17c337be62cd526d46fbdcd9a6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9b29e7a7839d7ff2b29e72fb4912618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ce776458e256df9d6070a419cab7449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f3c75e751c36c2f270820a403b40ac0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdabdf4730f349f4b46e7242c65d440d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e2c8beb0e0581ef5724dc5c631252e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a4a75301f61fc3c86ad768de09d0c3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83bb94d08bdb958eff25f76c9a6ac18a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-474703bb16e6e26e009e9d433c3d3647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df77f2ea988e5724effb4c71cc79a65a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8e2f5011e0e0fe7dc11273e2f345b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe844728a502927fee80d42268408b1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0267d2986a48c4c31790b6f183277dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28515a0aca492eeee478cd9947226498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6025fa711665988fad0f789b9eb901a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-177e9aca0bf1c1724474ea529826bece&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec9cae555a06ac660e6c16d90116c8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92417ae942a11c591feb2ee9b5fadd7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a01dc8dc15b92e2b0b570753b0f57632&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a764dcbdd73fd1c50fa72a7cd60b6e19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71de01baf40871c616eaa39cb8189f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3895d65c9a22c257a4717f300d4086b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a0307c83d7b514ca00334e4c8ca2357&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dd74224daea51112742135154e46244&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36ace822cd4873b8fd2adcfef0a7f9fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcea1ff62aae96936f552880e96faa69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f94cd06ab0d1bcc7a9349bc40ea3eb22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db5749bec4af1c3ea068b257c4376aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-691a5ee6c6fdbea7a2ef1c835f0e66ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fba8ea0c6bdb8427804ba05f9fe49f9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786330168</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cannula">
  <data key="d0">Cannula</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Cannula is a short, thin, flexible tube that is inserted subcutaneously, typically through a guide needle that is removed once the tube is in place. The device forms the subcutaneous conduit of an insulin infusion set, allowing insulin to flow from the filled reservoir of the set into the body. Because the cannula remains embedded in the tissue, it can stay in place for the duration of a wear period and can even remain during imaging procedures without interfering with scans.

The cannula is a key component of commercial infusion sets such as Quick‑Set, Silhouette, and Mio, where it connects the external parts of the set to the patient’s skin. During a set change, the cannula is filled with insulin as part of the preparation process. Although sometimes referred to as a “subcutaneous needle,” the cannula itself is a small, flexible tube rather than a rigid needle, serving as the actual pathway for insulin delivery. It functions as an artifact that links the infusion set to the body, maintaining a continuous, low‑pressure insulin flow while the outer needle is withdrawn.&lt;SEP&gt;Cannula is another pump component that can become obstructed, especially at the start of use or after incorrect replacement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7ed0b3e64751c1a28d72e087f711cc20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc2aa5d85d666eabc9dbaa5d2ecfe874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf3629e41b33d8907b96157ddd2be394&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fe81d733c2a429da0726794b55350b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f3c75e751c36c2f270820a403b40ac0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdabdf4730f349f4b46e7242c65d440d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e2c8beb0e0581ef5724dc5c631252e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83bb94d08bdb958eff25f76c9a6ac18a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df77f2ea988e5724effb4c71cc79a65a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6025fa711665988fad0f789b9eb901a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-177e9aca0bf1c1724474ea529826bece&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c5a5c97986d9b31b155b0c8f0cac1c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fba8ea0c6bdb8427804ba05f9fe49f9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
