<node id="Site Rotation">
  <data key="d0">Site Rotation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Site rotation is the practice of alternating injection sites to avoid tissue damage from repeated injections.&lt;SEP&gt;Site rotation is the practice of alternating injection sites to reduce the risk of local tissue complications.&lt;SEP&gt;Site rotation is the practice of alternating injection locations to prevent localized adverse effects such as lipodystrophy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7ed0b3e64751c1a28d72e087f711cc20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3db0edd23b6b502ccbbf62bfd601ce68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ee5400065df79b02b6c04efc0f4854d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313669</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SICI">
  <data key="d0">SICI</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">SICI, the abbreviation for Continuous Subcutaneous Insulin Infusion (also referred to as Continuous Insulin Infusion) System, denotes an electronic insulin‑delivery device used in the management of diabetes. The system—known in Portuguese as Sistema de Infusão Contínua de Insulina—delivers rapid‑acting insulin through a small, programmable infusion pump that continuously supplies the hormone subcutaneously via a catheter. It functions both as a method and a device, allowing precise, programmable dosing that can be adjusted to the patient’s basal needs and bolus requirements, thereby improving glycemic control compared with multiple daily injections.

SICI is also cited as a reference factor in the context of DTD (Data Type Definition) calculations. In that technical usage, the acronym does not pertain to medical devices but serves as a variable or coefficient employed within the computational framework of DTD analysis. No further details about its definition or application are provided in the source material.&lt;SEP&gt;SICI is the abbreviation for Continuous Subcutaneous Insulin Infusion, a method of delivering insulin continuously via a pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Abbreviation for Sistema De Infusão Subcutânea Contínua De Insulina, the continuous insulin infusion method.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7ed0b3e64751c1a28d72e087f711cc20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7387e81b8141435df1372f5d8b27662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7823719c01e7c914b4a58a1bb0d707bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60530d1861f7c2d1efecc069c0913d37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fba8ea0c6bdb8427804ba05f9fe49f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-126f927723331d6ce149cf77ed397bbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-336a2f2c9b510e23c35be95e2ff7a72a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2d6e4597425d2a83c3efcd9ca07f65c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51c7617f1e335789b870332231de4058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfa23fc15cc4d520a32488843dbd710b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca8620e735c40bfe850134ccea9a7154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-494fef0b8efc2c44b3b49ebf9d74b7f2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786331394</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Pump Therapy">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Pump Therapy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Pump Therapy is a clinical treatment approach that delivers rapid‑acting insulin continuously through a continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion (CSII) system, using either an external wearable pump or an implanted device. The therapy provides basal (background) insulin at a steady rate and allows patient‑controlled bolus doses for meals, thereby mimicking the physiological secretion pattern of a healthy pancreas. By replacing multiple daily injections, it offers a method of insulin delivery that can be combined with continuous glucose monitoring (CGM) sensors to create an integrated diabetes‑management platform.

The therapy is applicable to individuals with both type 1 and type 2 diabetes who require intensive insulin regimens. Clinical guidelines, best‑practice documents from organizations such as the American Association of Diabetes Educators, and academic literature describe its use for improving glycemic control, reducing the frequency of hypoglycemic episodes, and enhancing overall quality of life. Research studies, including those conducted by the SWITCH Study Group, have examined insulin pump therapy alongside CGM to assess its impact on metabolic outcomes.

In pediatric and adolescent populations, insulin pump therapy has been investigated for its effects on metabolic control and is associated with demographic factors such as race, socioeconomic status, and the characteristics of the treatment center. These findings highlight disparities in access and utilization, emphasizing the need for equitable delivery of this technology. Overall, insulin pump therapy represents a widely recognized alternative to multiple daily injections, offering continuous insulin delivery through a pump‑based system that can be tailored to individual dosing needs.&lt;SEP&gt;A device that delivers insulin continuously, used in conjunction with carbohydrate treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin pump therapy delivers rapid‑acting insulin continuously through a wearable pump to manage blood glucose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7ed0b3e64751c1a28d72e087f711cc20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-565255f3b3e7de3b17f81233ab493d9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7715667f5fca178f0988984e932ecfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b9f6a4a440ccb40e47c326ca6dd9346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5913d17c337be62cd526d46fbdcd9a6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dc33cf2a90bf53c26226e44bc285c22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70519ee85d46567e23db476b219f16a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2f8a0d67f7320d6157b61dbbf428a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59137a5f20ce729bcde5c65e1e45aa29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bd45744c4c50bb97abce1352018de47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-780f90d656277126a05ed136a084fd77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-126f927723331d6ce149cf77ed397bbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16a76447c936e157673f084ffb74520d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9416e8076c17175db0dbb12c3393566&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbd74c7f87bf62557b2b4c750ec596b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ed3ce00d7a52cdffe7b550ffe0dd568&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9bc5d11c9f848439320623cad3d3a38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00d07129873894814fe6540ce243ef9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4b76ae88b212b3a0a4d05c250e05e0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fe1eff7b58582dec4c8ae7578e20e66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4af6b5c6f1fd844ec61928d1cce6ef9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-703ccc96df3edd610232f0cca4bf7afa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8df31d65b128b9d70b82bb8af257332</data>
