  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Table 1">
  <data key="d0">Table 1</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Table 1 – Insulin storage guidance: This table lists the recommended storage temperatures, allowable validity periods, and the various presentation formats (e.g., vial, pen, cartridge) for different insulin products. It serves as a reference for pharmacists and clinicians to ensure insulin potency is maintained from manufacture through patient use.

Table 1 – Clinical outcomes for insulin regimens in type 1 and type 2 diabetes: The table displays numerical results for glycated hemoglobin (A1C), fasting plasma glucose, nighttime hypoglycemia, and severe hypoglycemia across multiple insulin treatment strategies. Data are presented separately for type 1 and type 2 diabetes cohorts, allowing comparison of efficacy and safety among the regimens.

Table 1 – Primary therapeutic outcomes in the Edition 4 Study (Diabetes Mellitus type 1): This table summarizes the key efficacy endpoints of the Edition 4 clinical trial, including changes in A1C, fasting glucose, insulin dose requirements, and incidence of hypoglycemic events for participants with type 1 diabetes. The summary highlights the overall therapeutic benefit observed in the study population.

Table 1 – Efficacy and safety results of an adult type 1 diabetes study: The table reports changes in A1C, total daily insulin dose, and safety outcomes such as adverse events and hypoglycemia rates for adult participants with type 1 diabetes. It provides a concise overview of how the investigational insulin regimen performed relative to baseline measures.

Table 1 – Baseline and outcome data for adult patients receiving insulin glargine or APIDRA‑insulin lispro: This table compares the two treatment arms at study entry and after the intervention period, showing baseline characteristics (age, disease duration, baseline A1C) and outcome measures (final A1C, insulin dose adjustments, hypoglycemia incidence). The side‑by‑side format facilitates direct assessment of the relative efficacy of glargine versus APIDRA‑lispro.

Table 1 – Mean A1C values, insulin dose adjustments, and hypoglycemia events in the Apidra SoloStar study (adult type 1 diabetes): The table presents average A1C reductions, changes in total daily insulin dose, and the frequency of documented hypoglycemic episodes for participants treated with the Apidra SoloStar pen. It emphasizes the clinical impact of the device‑based insulin delivery system.

Table 1 – Efficacy results comparing Fiasp® and NovoRapid®: This table outlines the comparative effectiveness of the rapid‑acting insulin analogues Fiasp and NovoRapid, including mean changes in A1C, post‑prandial glucose excursions, and rates of hypoglycemia. The side‑by‑side presentation assists clinicians in selecting between the two products based on outcome differentials.

Table 1 – Dosage titration approaches for Afrezza: The table enumerates various titration algorithms used to adjust Afrezza inhaled insulin dosing, detailing initial dose selections, stepwise increments, and criteria for dose modification based on glucose monitoring. It provides clinicians with a menu of practical strategies for individualized patient management.

Table 1 – Afrezza correction‑dose conversion and titration guidance: This table offers a conversion chart linking blood glucose levels to corresponding Afrezza correction doses, alongside recommended titration steps for rapid correction of hyperglycemia. The guidance is intended to support safe and effective use of Afrezza in day‑to‑day glucose control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1b1b73e9b7285819a4ba5caa6fdfa785&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d87cbe9886e7203b6e7b26c85d60cb9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78b302b74d715df9c3b9e9db38fa4c64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-162882e6afffb0db8ae5e9153e5f1e82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b18f8ab53481bf1b63fda1bb71fe80ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77dc1a2378f763ffabe8fa379881d1cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb9ea85b9ad8cd6940ae41a3ab5d1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e6371d8083fb20b137912cdaeec1b8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70c5a1107fcc9b632361d9c52064f45d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/edelman-et-al-2026-dosing-afrezza-it-s-not-that-complicated.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786333266</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
