<node id="Leonard Thompson">
  <data key="d0">Leonard Thompson</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Leonard Thompson was a 14‑year‑old patient with Type 1 diabetes who became the first individual to benefit from insulin therapy in 1922.&lt;SEP&gt;Leonard Thompson was a diabetic patient who received the first human insulin injections at Toronto General Hospital.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5de4e99a192602fe98c8b7e8e270a49c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad5d126f417014eb5c7a07a85db48d1d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
