  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The New Insulin Delivery Recommendations is a study published in May 2016 that provides guidelines for safe insulin preparation and administration.&lt;SEP&gt;“New insulin delivery recommendations” is a 2016 journal article presenting updated guidance on insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;A publication presenting updated recommendations for insulin delivery.</data>
