<node id="Lipo‑hipertrofia">
  <data key="d0">Lipo‑hipertrofia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Lipo‑hipertrofia (LH) is the most common form of lipodistrofia, characterized by accumulation of hardened fatty nodules under the skin due to repeated insulin injections.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-da4ea6b1580793801f801a34c92f1905</data>
