  <data key="d0">Continuing Education</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Continuing Education is ongoing training for the healthcare team on safe insulin practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuing Education is ongoing training for healthcare professionals to maintain safe insulin practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5b4c60b3de8c56d9ab869d868345fb7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301834</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Patient Guidance Protocol">
  <data key="d0">Patient Guidance Protocol</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Patient Guidance Protocol comprises instructions provided to patients for proper insulin use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301834</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Subcutaneous Route">
  <data key="d0">Subcutaneous Route</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Subcutaneous Route is the usual insulin injection method delivering gradual absorption through the subcutaneous tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;The subcutaneous route is the injection technique in which insulin is delivered into the fatty tissue beneath the skin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb8954aaa1e1230598596ce6f5df249</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786317623</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intramuscular Route">
  <data key="d0">Intramuscular Route</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intramuscular Route is an insulin injection method used in emergencies for rapid action against hyperglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301834</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intravenous Route">
  <data key="d0">Intravenous Route</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intravenous Route is an insulin delivery method employed in intensive care units under continuous monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Intravenous route is the recommended administration pathway for APIDRA and must not be mixed with inappropriate diluents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51761473ea6fe17b9e098a6bf98636b3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786315441</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intradermal Route">
  <data key="d0">Intradermal Route</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intradermal Route is an incorrect insulin injection technique that results in slower absorption and risk of hyperglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301834</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Absorption Speed">
  <data key="d0">Absorption Speed</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Absorption Speed describes the rate at which insulin enters the bloodstream, influenced by injection site and external factors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301834</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Massage">
  <data key="d0">Massage</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Massage refers to massaging the injection site before or after insulin injection, which can accelerate absorption.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301835</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Physical Exercise">
  <data key="d0">Physical Exercise</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Physical Exercise denotes activity that can increase insulin absorption and may precipitate hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301835</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="High Ambient Temperature">
  <data key="d0">High Ambient Temperature</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">High Ambient Temperature is elevated environmental heat that speeds insulin absorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Heat conditions that accelerate insulin absorption, raising the risk of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338251</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Homogenization Method">
  <data key="d0">Homogenization Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Homogenization Method is the recommended 20 gentle rolling motions to mix insulin suspensions uniformly before use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301835</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Vigorous Shaking">
  <data key="d0">Vigorous Shaking</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Vigorous Shaking is a forceful agitation of insulin containers that can create air bubbles.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301835</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dose Error">
  <data key="d0">Dose Error</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dose Error is an incorrect insulin dosage resulting from air bubbles or inadequate homogenization.&lt;SEP&gt;Dose error refers to an incorrect amount of insulin administered due to factors such as air bubbles or improper technique.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d795dc393eb02c6418957ee1678504f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786302748</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Date of Opening">
  <data key="d0">Date of Opening</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Date of Opening is the recorded date when an insulin vial is first accessed, recommended for tracking storage duration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301836</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Start Date of Use">
  <data key="d0">Start Date of Use</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Start Date of Use must be noted to monitor insulin validity and expiry.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301836</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glycemic Dyscontrol">
  <data key="d0">Glycemic Dyscontrol</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glycemic Dyscontrol refers to abnormal blood glucose regulation linked to storage or administration problems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301836</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NPH (Neutral Protamine Hagedorn)">
  <data key="d0">NPH (Neutral Protamine Hagedorn)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">NPH is an intermediate‑acting insulin formulation referenced in the text.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301836</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Analogue">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Analogue</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Analogue denotes rapid‑acting insulin variants used for intramuscular and intravenous applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301836</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Institute for Safe Practices in Medication Use">
  <data key="d0">Institute for Safe Practices in Medication Use</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Institute for Safe Practices in Medication Use is the source of adapted recommendations on insulin safety.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301836</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Latin American Network for Safe Use of Medicines">
  <data key="d0">Latin American Network for Safe Use of Medicines</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Latin American Network for Safe Use of Medicines provided guidelines for the safe use of insulins.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301836</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ICU">
  <data key="d0">ICU</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">ICU (Intensive Care Unit) is a hospital area where intravenous insulin may be administered under monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301836</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Parents">
  <data key="d0">Parents</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Parents are caregivers instructed not to massage injection sites in young children after insulin administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301836</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lipo‑hypertrophy">
  <data key="d0">Lipo‑hypertrophy</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Lipo‑hypertrophy is a localized increase of fatty tissue associated with irregular insulin absorption.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301837</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Refrigerator Sector">
  <data key="d0">Refrigerator Sector</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Refrigerator Sector is the compartment of a fridge where insulin, heparin, and vaccines may be stored.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301837</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Irregular Absorption">
  <data key="d0">Irregular Absorption</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Irregular Absorption refers to inconsistent insulin uptake, linked to injections in areas with lipo‑hypertrophy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301837</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Packaging Similarity">
  <data key="d0">Packaging Similarity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Packaging Similarity denotes the resemblance of insulin, heparin, and vaccine containers that can cause confusion in storage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301837</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Professional Inexperience">
  <data key="d0">Professional Inexperience</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Professional Inexperience refers to lack of experience among healthcare staff leading to errors in insulin handling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301837</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Distraction">
  <data key="d0">Distraction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Distraction indicates loss of focus during insulin preparation or administration, contributing to mistakes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301837</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Labeling Procedure">
  <data key="d0">Labeling Procedure</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Labeling Procedure comprises steps for distinct labeling of insulin, heparin, and vaccines to ensure correct storage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301837</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Buttock">
  <data key="d0">Buttock</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Buttock is a body region where insulin injection gives slower absorption compared to abdomen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301837</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hot Bath">
  <data key="d0">Hot Bath</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Hot Bath involves immersing the body in warm water, which accelerates insulin absorption.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301838</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hot Compress">
  <data key="d0">Hot Compress</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Hot Compress applies heat to the injection site, increasing insulin absorption speed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301838</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Conservation">
  <data key="d0">Conservation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Conservation refers to keeping insulin under recommended conditions to maintain stability and efficacy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301838</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Potency">
  <data key="d0">Potency</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Potency denotes the strength of insulin that must be preserved through proper storage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301838</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Validity">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Validity</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Validity is the expiry information that should be monitored after the start date of use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301838</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Appearance">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Appearance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Appearance is the visual assessment of insulin before administration to ensure quality.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4902fb11e4844af5cf6fd61f18b6e4ce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301838</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lipo-Hipertrofia">
  <data key="d0">Lipo-Hipertrofia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Lipo-hipertrofia is a condition characterized by thickened subcutaneous tissue at insulin injection sites, linked to injection practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-74b3171b97fd80965359afadc0af9312</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786301838</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Healthy Subcutaneous Tissue">
  <data key="d0">Healthy Subcutaneous Tissue</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Healthy subcutaneous tissue is intact fatty tissue suitable for proper insulin absorption.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-74b3171b97fd80965359afadc0af9312</data>
