<node id="Glucose Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose Monitoring is the systematic measurement of blood‑glucose (blood‑sugar) levels that serves as a fundamental component of diabetes management. By regularly checking a patient’s glucose concentration, clinicians and patients obtain up‑to‑date information on glycaemic trends, which informs insulin‑dosing decisions, assesses overall control, and supports safe therapeutic outcomes. The practice is recommended for all individuals with diabetes and is typically directed by a medical professional as part of routine care.

The primary purpose of glucose monitoring is to guide insulin therapy. Frequent measurements are especially important when insulin regimens are altered, such as during initiation or adjustment of long‑acting insulin analogues (e.g., Toujeo) or when using specific products like APIDRA SOLOSTAR. After a change in injection site, glucose readings help determine whether dose modifications are needed. In patients using continuous insulin infusion systems (insulin pumps), monitoring is performed continuously or at set intervals to maintain safety and prevent hypo‑ or hyperglycaemia.

Glucose monitoring can be performed with a variety of devices. Traditional blood‑glucose meters (BGM) provide point‑of‑care readings from finger‑stick samples, while continuous glucose monitoring (CGM) systems measure interstitial glucose levels in real time, offering trend data and alerts. Both methods are employed to track blood glucose levels, allowing patients and clinicians to respond promptly to fluctuations and to optimise diabetes care.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-74b3171b97fd80965359afadc0af9312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3daabbd42055dc30154f5f97c85fb7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d59c9bf7f429a82cbfd7083e36ff8f9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b9c41c968bcc1d46185583661e8f989&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4319d08c10ed2b48857a6d42eadd9db0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93623071acdcd0ba060c8826ab5a2a81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c95471c4c993fa3a499f99443ee7c922&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c68e2c07786710dd5250c6610f52b14d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a6f9e10c0d4af5fff0338eb861f9c86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd396c45bc09fb646d156b4e69d328e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e622f0079074cd1916470223d22aa66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ac99e7359716e2cecc2ec93159218b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-995e322b08a5c6d446f5fd68e5c3fe5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b355007bba178588f3928b6c8620a78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a35381a5aa22d1a1029482c9502cb0ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc39a0c02d5f1bd08d5cb71bacc69a24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a19f43c10a7a756e1597ff1a7f53296e</data>
