<node id="Insulin Lispro">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Lispro</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Lispro is a rapid‑acting insulin analogue produced by recombinant DNA technology and marketed primarily under the brand name Humalog®, often delivered with the KwikPen® device. The molecule differs from human insulin by a reversal of the amino acids at positions 28 and 29 of the B‑chain, a modification that accelerates subcutaneous absorption. After injection, its glucose‑lowering effect begins in approximately 15 minutes, peaks within an hour, and lasts only a few hours, making it well suited for prandial (mealtime) control of blood‑glucose levels in people with diabetes. Because of its brief action, Insulin Lispro is a core component of basal‑bolus insulin regimens, where it is paired with long‑acting basal insulins such as insulin glargine (Lantus®) or insulin glargine‑yf (BASAGLAR®). Commercial formulations include Humalog® Mix 25 KwikPen and Humalog® Mix 50 KwikPen, each supplied at a concentration of 100 units per millilitre.

Clinically, Insulin Lispro has been evaluated extensively in comparative studies. It has served as the rapid‑acting agent in “Study G,” which examined meal‑time insulin dosing alongside basal insulin, and it has been the active comparator in numerous trials of other rapid‑acting insulins, most notably APIDRA (insulin glulisine). Across these investigations—ranging from adult obese‑population studies to pediatric Type 1 diabetes trials—Insulin Lispro has been used to benchmark the efficacy, safety, and pharmacokinetic profile of APIDRA, as well as regular human insulin. These trials consistently highlight its faster onset and shorter duration relative to regular human insulin, underscoring the importance of precise dosing and patient education to avoid hypoglycaemia from misinterpretation of its rapid action.

Overall, Insulin Lispro provides rapid glucose regulation, is widely employed in routine clinical practice and research, and remains a key fast‑acting ingredient in the Humalog product line while serving as a standard reference insulin in a variety of comparative clinical studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Lispro is a rapid‑acting insulin analogue used in pumps.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Lispro is a rapid‑acting insulin analogue used in insulin pumps.&lt;SEP&gt;Rapid‑acting insulin analog identical to the active ingredient in Humalog.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin lispro is a rapid‑acting insulin investigated for preventing nocturnal hypoglycaemia in young children with diabetes mellitus.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin lispro is a rapid‑acting insulin used as a comparator in a glucose clamp study measuring Tmax.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin lispro is a rapid‑acting insulin analog used as a comparator in pharmacokinetic studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b5b4c60b3de8c56d9ab869d868345fb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-431b48980656b0322f263c358250b593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3daabbd42055dc30154f5f97c85fb7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d26ce64e79b8c4a147140be2f9c63dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe094dd3d94334373a8497a7cb841e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29e9c7394777a2e452b57285541f75f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d87cbe9886e7203b6e7b26c85d60cb9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87576da8269707f5f8d929b71470e023&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a592aedb257bad9532268b4056ec15c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91f290894e2d3b4216cac1721f22bb67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf25fca295be60e28b7c7d3103f722fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db832f06717859b8ba6cf7fd70aa22d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb0fb965e5ddd796999856ca376d4b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7084240a735ca2fe3b6d426e3b8c5756&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2416b3e5e8ebc96cdb451a794fc78e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef35bd45e4ba8d20f4e9181011ccfcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-162882e6afffb0db8ae5e9153e5f1e82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0e34bef478ed432c8de7ef68dc9025&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b18f8ab53481bf1b63fda1bb71fe80ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee2684edaea64aa597fd29c3bbda611d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50719bcc88f4515ec825b9d5a7aba107&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77dc1a2378f763ffabe8fa379881d1cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-891989adf06518cd34c94853444495e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16a76447c936e157673f084ffb74520d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08f12a2de420625ccc88f737d06b7e84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-277e136948d5572acf031988fd092dce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9416e8076c17175db0dbb12c3393566&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbb54288f56e407604ea361f58e58233</data>
