  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The insulin manufacturer provides recommendations for proper storage and transport of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Manufacturer identifies the company that produces a specific insulin brand.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Manufacturer is the producing company of an insulin formulation, whose change may necessitate dose modifications.</data>
