  <data key="d2">Diretrizes da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes 2019-2020 are the adapted guidelines providing recommendations on insulin storage and usage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-96f91060a07d79071735f666e2b8aee2</data>
