<node id="Temperatura">
  <data key="d0">Temperatura</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Temperatura denotes the temperature ranges (2 °C to 8 °C or up to 30 °C) specified for insulin storage.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental temperature extremes, both low and high, that can affect the precision of glucose testing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-96f91060a07d79071735f666e2b8aee2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fe1b07f3c84733fcbfca023fbfd70e6</data>
