</node>
<node id="Validade">
  <data key="d0">Validade</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Validade indicates the shelf‑life period of insulin, such as 2‑3 years from manufacturing or 4‑8 weeks after opening.&lt;SEP&gt;Validade specifies the shelf life of the product (36 months from manufacturing) and the usage period after opening (6 weeks).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-96f91060a07d79071735f666e2b8aee2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56fb3d61e8c32af5d6b8be06cc54f904</data>
