<node id="Oliveira MC">
  <data key="d0">Oliveira MC</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Oliveira MC is an author of a publication on correct waste disposal in diabetes treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Oliveira MC authored the manual “Manual prático: preparo e aplicação de insulina sem mistério” and the guide “Descarte correto do lixo gerado no tratamento do diabetes.”</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9663846121f12cec0edb5c72b7d71074&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-565255f3b3e7de3b17f81233ab493d9a</data>
