<node id="São Paulo">
  <data key="d0">São Paulo</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">São Paulo is a major city in Brazil that is frequently cited as the place of publication for a variety of documents. The city serves as the headquarters and primary Brazilian base for Eli Lilly do Brasil Ltda., with its corporate address listed as Avenida Morumbi, 8264. In addition to Eli Lilly, the city is also the location of Sanofi‑Aventis Farmacêutica Ltda., further underscoring its role as a hub for multinational pharmaceutical companies operating in Brazil.

São Paulo is also the name of a Brazilian state, which encompasses numerous municipalities, including the city of Suzano. The state of São Paulo therefore contains Suzano within its territorial jurisdiction.&lt;SEP&gt;São Paulo is a Brazilian city where Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda. is registered.&lt;SEP&gt;São Paulo is the city in Brazil where Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda. is located.&lt;SEP&gt;São Paulo is the Brazilian city where Eli Lilly do Brasil Ltda. is located, as shown in the address.&lt;SEP&gt;São Paulo is a city in Brazil where Roche Diabetes Care Brasil Ltda. is headquartered.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9663846121f12cec0edb5c72b7d71074&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-431b48980656b0322f263c358250b593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da80e99fd3e43cb7d3b260aca23fe56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-072d97721eef045503ec1dce0363b58e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f0c10866496bbb0b388b1e5ed69901c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef35bd45e4ba8d20f4e9181011ccfcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51761473ea6fe17b9e098a6bf98636b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04b345bc26ec7f5d7c9db8c6004a50a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d5bb996e52cb71f15bc8c30d1b1d321&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f2714936869e55e840f5294caefeaee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6419fb3ef4249d6c7e8d8a45d82efe80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fef140d95c1acc260149fd1d20f7853</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Bula Humalog.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/IFU Accu-Chek Guide Solo Diabetes Manager.PDF</data>
  <data key="d5">1786326164</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ministério da Saúde">
  <data key="d0">Ministério da Saúde</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Ministério da Saúde is Brazil’s federal Ministry of Health, tasked with establishing and enforcing national health regulations, overseeing public health policies, and providing official guidance on medical products. In its regulatory role, the ministry serves as the authoritative source for professional drug documentation, including the preparation and publication of medication guides and professional leaflets.

Specifically, Ministério da Saúde authored and issued the professional leaflets and label information for Novo Nordisk’s insulin product Novolin® R, both in its standard presentation and in the FlexPen® delivery system. These professional health leaflets, referenced in the drug’s label documentation, are published by the ministry to ensure clinicians and healthcare providers have accurate, government‑approved information on the medication’s use, safety, and regulatory status.&lt;SEP&gt;Ministério da Saúde is Brazil's Ministry of Health responsible for public health surveillance and epidemiology.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9663846121f12cec0edb5c72b7d71074&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d01ed6a801b11c1b53f4668059c1f9cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9b085ae33d49450f3f8bc342b5eae55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f2714936869e55e840f5294caefeaee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0851222a21a012cffce7a16710847208&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cd48799a027437b9fe2e1a48b61cb3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0689fd73d2061ee466b9b90e03bda141&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2378c57a337d1ce7103c7086ebba76ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7ca732691e1cbcafd65e378b8d80144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba6b31518be6fff1db8b68a28e82f200&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a05276c5db43e3a1e9f987056012750f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786371996</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
