<node id="Insulina Humana NPH">
  <data key="d0">Insulina Humana NPH</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Human NPH (intermediate‑acting) insulin used for diabetes treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina humana NPH is an intermediate‑acting human insulin used as an active control in clinical comparisons with BASAGLAR®.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina humana NPH is a human intermediate‑acting insulin reported in the study as a prior insulin regimen.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina Humana NPH is an intermediate‑acting human insulin used as a comparator in efficacy studies with BASAGLAR KWIKPEN.&lt;SEP&gt;Human NPH insulin used as basal insulin, given twice daily.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina humana NPH is a basal insulin used in the type 2 diabetes study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0d399f9e64e21e86fd4e2a48869d80e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afc9722167670b0bfeef0b43f4b0df79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e62226007200589cb2143f0fb75b302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0ac8ad5968d54922b924fdb16b61d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f0b85829c02f82470489f3f5e487996&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aecb3968c37f57b78a756e4b661ad089</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786315417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulina Humana Regular">
  <data key="d0">Insulina Humana Regular</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina Humana Regular is a short‑acting, regular human insulin formulation that is administered subcutaneously 30–45 minutes before meals. It is used in clinical studies involving both type 1 and type 2 diabetes to achieve glucose control, and it serves as the standard reference insulin in comparative pharmacodynamic and pharmacokinetic investigations. In these trials, Insulina Humana Regular functions as the comparator against newer agents such as APIDRA and APIDRA SOLOSTAR, providing a baseline for potency and efficacy assessments. The consistent description across the referenced studies underscores its role as the conventional short‑acting human insulin employed for pre‑meal dosing and as the benchmark insulin in subcutaneous administration research.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina Humana Regular is a standard short‑acting insulin that can be replaced by Fiasp® in children over 1 year when rapid action is required.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina Humana Regular is short‑acting human insulin used as a comparator in meta‑analyses of rapid‑acting analogues.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0d399f9e64e21e86fd4e2a48869d80e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e62226007200589cb2143f0fb75b302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0ac8ad5968d54922b924fdb16b61d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aca0b919135813e1d5b772face36989d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f46c503a378e6c69618036a038672417&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2479751a6475c09415f0d79759db091d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f0b85829c02f82470489f3f5e487996&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e212a20942ed5387efe96e92bdb4ba98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7621ac447c9044986ade86ce5f9be201&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b060d4f68031bd35dfafc19eadf1e9fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aecb3968c37f57b78a756e4b661ad089&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3418c4ee80182ca29214dd54b0d9647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09d60e0b850d87c77dd67ca2d709912c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95c81e7ab8160456d9a63a9e0868205b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786331405</data>
