<node id="Pediatr Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Pediatr Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Pediatr Diabetes is a peer‑reviewed scientific journal dedicated to publishing research on diabetes in children and adolescents. It serves as a specialized platform for studies that address the clinical, physiological, and therapeutic aspects of pediatric diabetes, and it is frequently cited in the reference lists of related scholarly works.

The journal’s scope encompasses a broad range of topics, including the investigation of skin and subcutaneous tissue thickness at injection sites, the management of hypoglycemia and diabetic ketoacidosis, and the treatment of neonatal diabetes mellitus using continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion (CSII). It also features research on insulin injection techniques for children and adolescents, as well as epidemiological studies such as the analysis of reduced rates of diabetic ketoacidosis at disease onset.&lt;SEP&gt;Pediatr Diabetes is a journal that published the ISPAD Clinical Practice Consensus Guidelines 2018 for monogenic diabetes in children and adolescents.&lt;SEP&gt;Pediatric Diabetes, the journal reporting TEDDY study findings on progression to type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Pediatric Diabetes publishes research on diabetes in children and adolescents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-565255f3b3e7de3b17f81233ab493d9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a23aee717dff7fe908d8a006fd48a5c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-126f927723331d6ce149cf77ed397bbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08f12a2de420625ccc88f737d06b7e84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ed3ce00d7a52cdffe7b550ffe0dd568&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00d07129873894814fe6540ce243ef9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc0d4df5f59432ca990767b120f983a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44aa59c0e5cc620a11b8fb017d1aefcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddc3658b93eb925d28d625c4e2ce652f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c23c0554362bde8c591c91d4a0185a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c122c1c6d7dd36110b6ddba2c074d122&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a22fadf52eaea018160e4dd41d1d39b8</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377359</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
