  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Sulfonilureias are a class of oral antidiabetic drugs that may be used together with Humalog.&lt;SEP&gt;Class of oral antidiabetic agents that stimulate pancreatic insulin secretion.&lt;SEP&gt;First‑generation oral diabetes drugs associated with higher risk of hypoglycemia.</data>
