<node id="Álcool">
  <data key="d0">Álcool</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Álcool is a versatile substance employed in the handling and administration of insulin therapy. It is commonly used to moisten cotton swabs for cleaning the rubber surface of the metal cap of refill cartridges and for wiping the rubber seal of insulin pens, ensuring that the equipment remains free of contaminants. In addition, alcohol is applied to disinfect the skin before an injection, providing an antiseptic barrier that reduces the risk of infection at the injection site.

Beyond its role as a cleaning and disinfecting agent, Álcool is a consumable that can influence the pharmacodynamics of insulin glargine (Lantus). Clinical observations indicate that alcohol may either potentiate or diminish the glucose‑lowering effect of insulin glargine, leading to variability in blood‑glucose control. Moreover, the ingestion of alcohol is associated with an increased risk of hypoglycemia, particularly in individuals using insulin, because it can interfere with hepatic glucose production and alter insulin sensitivity. Consequently, patients receiving insulin therapy are advised to be aware of these potential interactions and to monitor their blood‑glucose levels closely when consuming alcohol.&lt;SEP&gt;Álcool is an alcoholic beverage that can intensify or diminish insulin’s hypoglycemic effect.&lt;SEP&gt;Álcool is alcohol, which can intensify or reduce the hypoglycemic effect of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Álcool is a substance that can intensify or reduce the hypoglycemic effect of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Álcool is alcoholic beverage, noted to intensify or reduce insulin’s hypoglycemic effect.&lt;SEP&gt;Ethanol consumption, recommended to be avoided in lipodystrophy management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fe370bbb9ac4bc4d475b9ef58ec9fee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29a33072a90b4191a8b6c5136c417e4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46c9571a4df1570d4a097dc949f512cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d156e12ba8d9418249ea309aab0552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aba4eb027a027fb1ad6e0105b97cfa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cd336474a2e9457985162b1ddb4b603&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b060d4f68031bd35dfafc19eadf1e9fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4615ca664e7ff898d8c5929cbc79e7d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6101c469482b48e341b4095a54907fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0851222a21a012cffce7a16710847208&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba6b31518be6fff1db8b68a28e82f200&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7eabee57ef0af575162ce8d36f3589a5</data>
