<node id="Abdome">
  <data key="d0">Abdome</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Abdome is a common subcutaneous injection site for Humalog located on the torso.&lt;SEP&gt;Abdome is a body region commonly used for subcutaneous injection of Lantus.&lt;SEP&gt;Abdome is a body region where APIDRA can be injected, showing a biodisponibilidade of about 73 %.&lt;SEP&gt;The abdominal wall, a recommended site for subcutaneous injection of APIDRA.&lt;SEP&gt;Abdome is a recommended subcutaneous injection site for APIDRA SOLOSTAR.</data>
