  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina de ação rápida refers to fast‑acting insulin formulations such as Humalog.&lt;SEP&gt;Rapid‑acting insulin analog that may require dose adjustment when patients transition to BASAGLAR KWIKPEN.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina De Ação Rápida is rapid‑acting insulin whose kinetic profile may require empirical dose adjustments on planned exercise days.</data>
