  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Teste de glicemia is a method for measuring blood glucose levels to monitor diabetes control.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose test described with hand washing, lancet use, reagent strip, and monitoring steps.&lt;SEP&gt;Teste De Glicemia is a blood glucose test performed to confirm hypoglycemia when symptoms occur.</data>
