<node id="Lilly France S.A.S.">
  <data key="d0">Lilly France S.A.S.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Lilly France S.A.S. is the French pharmaceutical subsidiary of Eli Lilly that operates as a manufacturing entity in Fegersheim, France. The company is dedicated to the production of insulin‑based medicines and delivery devices for the French market.  

Among its product portfolio, Lilly France S.A.S. is credited with manufacturing the rapid‑acting insulin Humalog, as well as the combination formulation Humalog Mix 50 KwikPen. It also produces the BASAGLAR KwikPen, a prefilled insulin pen used for basal insulin therapy, and other KwikPen devices that deliver insulin products.  

As a listed manufacturer of these insulin medications, Lilly France S.A.S. plays a key role in ensuring the availability of essential diabetes treatments within France, operating from its dedicated facility in Fegersheim.</data>
