<node id="Metacresol">
  <data key="d0">Metacresol</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Metacresol is a phenolic compound used as a preservative excipient in a wide variety of commercial insulin products. In these formulations it functions primarily to maintain product stability and sterility during storage and use.  

Metacresol is listed as an ingredient in the Humalog solution as well as in the Humalog Mix 25 KwikPen and Humalog Mix 50 KwikPen formulations. It is also present in the Lantus refill cartridges and vials, the Tresiba® formulation, and the BASAGLAR® insulin formulation, including the BASAGLAR KwikPen version. The compound appears in the APIDRA® insulin solution and the APIDRA SoloStar® (Apidra SoloStar) presentation.  

Additional insulin products that contain Metacresol include Fiasp®, Levemir® FlexPen® injectable solution, Novolin® R (both the standard vial and the Novolin R FlexPen®), and Humulin® R (also referenced as HUMULIN® R solution). In each case Metacresol is described simply as an excipient included in the injectable insulin formulation.  

Across all of these brands, Metacresol’s role is consistent: it acts as a preservative to ensure the insulin remains chemically stable, microbiologically safe, and effective throughout its shelf life.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-431b48980656b0322f263c358250b593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572e715aada476f4dac69a032e16cc09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e590341aac73dca916e560c2df9e60e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e62226007200589cb2143f0fb75b302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0ac8ad5968d54922b924fdb16b61d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db832f06717859b8ba6cf7fd70aa22d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7084240a735ca2fe3b6d426e3b8c5756&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-162882e6afffb0db8ae5e9153e5f1e82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb620bf44b37187faceacd0405c4a819&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77dc1a2378f763ffabe8fa379881d1cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8c7e36686d077dcb6239405f60ea031&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b65a4249ac93aec086cb333ed1507ea7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d01ed6a801b11c1b53f4668059c1f9cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4e1124e7acf6619a1a7c60febd5211c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2378c57a337d1ce7103c7086ebba76ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f7f04b0529d6f0ace11829cc4fa3b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10dad476eb9d365159c539ced3aeec4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-438cbb95853cdda42f2c87bcefa714dd</data>
