  <data key="d2">Water for injection is an excipient present in the Humalog solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Water for injection is an excipient listed in the formulation of Humalog® Mix 25 Kwikpen.&lt;SEP&gt;Water for injection is the solvent component of the Humalog Mix 50 KwikPen suspension.&lt;SEP&gt;Water for injection is the sterile solvent component of the Apidra SoloStar insulin solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Water for injection is an excipient listed in the Fiasp® formulation.</data>
