</node>
<node id="Intramuscular Administration">
  <data key="d0">Intramuscular Administration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intramuscular administration is a route for delivering glucagon in severe hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Intramuscular administration is a route used to give glucagon for severe hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Intramuscular administration is a route whereby Novolin® R can be injected under medical guidance.&lt;SEP&gt;Intramuscular Administration is an injection method for Novolin® R FlexPen® into muscle tissue, allowed only under medical supervision.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-431b48980656b0322f263c358250b593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f079198593c1702b56062aa87e7801a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73559dc5d86ea52a348d603482e056e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cd48799a027437b9fe2e1a48b61cb3d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Bula Humalog.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786318525</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intravenous Administration">
  <data key="d0">Intravenous Administration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intravenous Administration is a medical delivery method that involves injecting a substance directly into a vein, allowing rapid systemic distribution. In clinical practice it is employed as a route for delivering concentrated glucose to patients experiencing severe hypoglycemia, particularly when alternative treatments such as glucagon are ineffective. The technique is also used in research settings to compare the pharmacodynamic and pharmacokinetic properties of various insulin formulations; for example, studies have administered Lantus® (insulin glargine) and human insulin side‑by‑side via the intravenous route to evaluate differences in hypoglycemia symptoms, half‑life, and overall distribution. Similar comparative injections have been performed with insulin glulisine and regular human insulin to characterize their kinetic profiles.

In addition to glucose and insulin studies, intravenous administration has been the chosen route for early‑phase safety evaluations of newer agents such as APIDRA (insulin glulisine) in Phase I trials, where direct venous delivery facilitates precise assessment of drug behavior and adverse‑event monitoring. The method is therefore a standard tool for pharmacokinetic investigations that require controlled, rapid exposure of the circulatory system to the investigational product.

Despite its broad utility, intravenous administration is explicitly contraindicated for certain insulin products. Humalog Mix 50 delivered via a Kwikpen device is prohibited from intravenous use under any circumstances, and the high‑concentration formulation Toujeo 300 U/mL is also contraindicated for intravenous injection because it carries a substantial risk of inducing severe hypoglycemia. These restrictions reflect safety guidelines that recognize the potent glucose‑lowering effects of these insulins when introduced directly into the bloodstream.&lt;SEP&gt;IV delivery of Fiasp by healthcare professionals at concentrations of 0.5‑1.0 U/mL using infusion bags.&lt;SEP&gt;Intravenous administration is a route for delivering Novolin® R using infusion systems, restricted to health professionals.&lt;SEP&gt;Intravenous Administration is a delivery method for Novolin® R FlexPen® through a vein, performed by health professionals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-431b48980656b0322f263c358250b593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f079198593c1702b56062aa87e7801a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f14ce019f10c2a88765380143498ba5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-133169995b3ab942fd96f1fdfe7269ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd94288932ad6675a1de2b46b3fd9128&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ee5400065df79b02b6c04efc0f4854d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0e34bef478ed432c8de7ef68dc9025&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7621ac447c9044986ade86ce5f9be201&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50719bcc88f4515ec825b9d5a7aba107&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc2aa5d85d666eabc9dbaa5d2ecfe874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73559dc5d86ea52a348d603482e056e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cd48799a027437b9fe2e1a48b61cb3d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Bula Humalog.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786318525</data>
