<node id="Headache">
  <data key="d0">Headache</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Headache is a common adverse event reported in patients using Humalog.&lt;SEP&gt;Headache is an adverse event reported in ≥5% of patients with type 1 and type 2 diabetes using Humalog.&lt;SEP&gt;Headache is a symptom of hypoglycemia presenting as pain in the head.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-431b48980656b0322f263c358250b593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e89f1dbae629e925f06732cebf41df16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d26ce64e79b8c4a147140be2f9c63dd</data>
