<node id="Neurological Damage">
  <data key="d0">Neurological Damage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Neurological damage is a severe complication that can result from prolonged hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Neurological Damage denotes injury to the nervous system that may follow prolonged severe hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-431b48980656b0322f263c358250b593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d7223c781e745e72311fccfcdd58583</data>
