<node id="Manufacturing Date">
  <data key="d0">Manufacturing Date</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Manufacturing date is the date when a Humalog batch was produced.&lt;SEP&gt;Manufacturing Date is the date printed on the Tresiba® packaging indicating when the medication was produced.&lt;SEP&gt;Manufacturing date is the date on which Humulin R was produced.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e89f1dbae629e925f06732cebf41df16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9ae5f9ffa7eff9bb36cf1a9764df3e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fa819f7e1e42eb688d4894dc3ca7e64</data>
