  <data key="d2">Loss of consciousness is a possible outcome of severe hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Loss of Consciousness is a state of unresponsiveness that may result from severe hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Loss of consciousness is a possible manifestation of severe hypoglycemia.</data>
