<node id="Death">
  <data key="d0">Death</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Death is a possible extreme outcome of severe hypoglycemia or systemic allergic reaction.&lt;SEP&gt;Death denotes a fatal outcome that can occur due to severe hypokalemia complications.</data>
