<node id="Clinical Study">
  <data key="d0">Clinical Study</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Clinical studies of Humalog in patients with diabetes mellitus type 2 are referenced in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;The Clinical Study comprises two randomized, open‑label trials evaluating safety and efficacy of TOUJEO 300 U/mL with fixed or flexible dosing schedules in type 2 diabetes patients.&lt;SEP&gt;The clinical study was a 26‑week randomized trial comparing Toujeo 300/mL with Insulina Glargina 100 U/mL in pediatric patients.&lt;SEP&gt;The clinical study was a 26‑week, randomized, open‑label, active‑controlled trial assessing the efficacy and safety of Apidra SoloStar versus insulin lispro in patients with diabetes mellitus type 1 and type 2.&lt;SEP&gt;The clinical study evaluated Fiasp® efficacy and safety over 18‑26 weeks in adults with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Clinical Study refers to the six confirmatory therapeutic studies in adults evaluating Fiasp®.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e89f1dbae629e925f06732cebf41df16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d9c944d51a42525c017d9109f46684c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3553e80da33ab48fb157ac9ff75436eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-162882e6afffb0db8ae5e9153e5f1e82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8c7e36686d077dcb6239405f60ea031&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fdc648ec086061141581e27adde6fc4</data>
