  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A freezer is a storage device that must not be used for Humalog.&lt;SEP&gt;A freezer is an appliance that reaches temperatures well below 0 °C, which can damage NovoRapid® if the medication is stored inside.&lt;SEP&gt;Freezer is an appliance that should never be used to store insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e89f1dbae629e925f06732cebf41df16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048d8fafb712e12cec45f2d3ec2c1e3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e94cedc7134adbb256c931b851235c53</data>
