  <data key="d5">1786330482</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glucose Tablets">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Tablets</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose tablets are small, chewable oral tablets that serve as a rapid‑acting carbohydrate source for quickly raising blood glucose levels during episodes of low blood glucose or hypoglycemia. They are commonly recommended for patients who need an immediate source of sugar, as well as for travelers and others who may encounter sudden drops in blood glucose and require a convenient, portable remedy.

Each tablet typically provides about 4 to 5 grams of carbohydrate, and a standard serving of three to four tablets supplies roughly 15 grams of glucose, delivering the fast‑acting energy needed to correct hypoglycemia. Because they are solid, pre‑measured, and easy to carry, glucose tablets are widely used as a fast‑acting supplement to treat low blood glucose in both clinical and everyday settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e89f1dbae629e925f06732cebf41df16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b9f6a4a440ccb40e47c326ca6dd9346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0caf812af55afd2de9fea4fdd33fd06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce8c9873da330aac077f7ccaf108ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ce776458e256df9d6070a419cab7449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-138cbaf5a43762d4c5b77a07ab51cbd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0645201ac55eff389c44997aecbb6ce7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Bula Humalog.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/hipoglicemia.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372324</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
