<node id="Tiazolidinediona (TZD)">
  <data key="d0">Tiazolidinediona (TZD)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">TZD is a class of medication that, when combined with insulin, increases the risk of edema and cardiac insufficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Tiazolidinediona (TZD) is a class of oral antidiabetic drugs sometimes combined with insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Tiazolidinediona (TZD) is a class of drug that, when combined with insulin, increases risk of edema and heart failure.&lt;SEP&gt;Classe de fármacos que, quando combinados com insulina, aumentam o risco de edema e insuficiência cardíaca.</data>
