<node id="Temperature">
  <data key="d0">Temperature</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Temperature influences the duration of Humalog’s action.&lt;SEP&gt;Temperature is a physical parameter that influences the enzymatic reaction in glucose monitors, which have an acceptable temperature range.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c3daabbd42055dc30154f5f97c85fb7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00f6c2252dc945e977b3a2b2f495ffe0</data>
