  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Medication interactions refer to other drugs that may interfere with insulin requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Medication interactions are drug‑drug relationships that can intensify or diminish the hypoglycemic effect of insulin.</data>
