  <data key="d2">Nausea is a symptom of illness that can alter insulin needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Nausea is an adverse event reported in ≥5% of patients with type 1 diabetes using Humalog.&lt;SEP&gt;Nausea is listed among the malaise symptoms linked to very high blood sugar.</data>
