<node id="Children Under 3 Years">
  <data key="d0">Children Under 3 Years</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Children younger than three years have not been studied for Humalog use and should not receive the medication without supervision.&lt;SEP&gt;Children under 3 years represent a pediatric population for which Humulin R use is not studied and requires medical supervision.</data>
