</node>
<node id="Oral Contraceptives">
  <data key="d0">Oral Contraceptives</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Oral contraceptives are hormonal birth‑control pills that belong to a broader category of medications used for preventing pregnancy. They function primarily through the administration of synthetic estrogen and/or progestin to suppress ovulation, and they are commonly referenced as an example of drug types in clinical discussions.  

A consistent finding across clinical observations is that oral contraceptives can interfere with glucose metabolism, leading to higher blood‑glucose levels and an increased need for exogenous insulin. This effect has been reported in patients who are treated with rapid‑acting insulin analogues such as Humalog (insulin lispro) as well as long‑acting formulations like Levemir® (insulin glargine). Consequently, healthcare providers often consider adjusting insulin dosages when patients initiate or discontinue oral contraceptive therapy to maintain optimal glycaemic control.  

Overall, while oral contraceptives serve as an effective method of hormonal birth control, they are also recognized as agents that may raise insulin requirements and affect glucose regulation, a factor that should be accounted for in the management of individuals with diabetes or those receiving insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Oral contraceptives are medications that may increase insulin requirements in patients using Humulin R.&lt;SEP&gt;Oral contraceptives are hormonal drugs that can increase insulin requirements in patients using Humulin R.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4d26ce64e79b8c4a147140be2f9c63dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048d8fafb712e12cec45f2d3ec2c1e3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4704ea4d5c15ebc8c043a077f05fd7a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd94288932ad6675a1de2b46b3fd9128&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-465ad8b77c1c2a2a179062da20337ff5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c32255a7f064c18ff0b079798cfeaf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cedd8e88a8d35eade68ce02222b9e276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3237e202569462c758ec3d878c9faeae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fa819f7e1e42eb688d4894dc3ca7e64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577779892c0d463cd6bb1966b8a8ce2d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Bula Humalog.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/TRESIBA _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
