<node id="Corticosteroids">
  <data key="d0">Corticosteroids</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Corticosteroids are anti‑inflammatory steroid drugs that have a hyperglycaemic effect, meaning they can reduce the glucose‑lowering action of insulin and consequently raise a patient’s insulin requirements. By diminishing insulin‑induced reductions in blood glucose, these medications may increase the dose of rapid‑acting insulins such as Humalog, Humulin R, or other insulin formulations needed to achieve glycaemic control.&lt;SEP&gt;Corticosteroids are a class of drugs mentioned as potential precipitants of DKA in individuals with type 2 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4d26ce64e79b8c4a147140be2f9c63dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3db0edd23b6b502ccbbf62bfd601ce68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d96761d60c65f05f1530bc19b144cf1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd94288932ad6675a1de2b46b3fd9128&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d65840dd2cbd5c9984dfc4334378df5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f09811b149a29105854a0b1e84951e5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fa819f7e1e42eb688d4894dc3ca7e64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577779892c0d463cd6bb1966b8a8ce2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a111d4b40ec241cf54126f594a80308</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Bula Humalog.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377424</data>
