<node id="Oral Antidiabetic Agents">
  <data key="d0">Oral Antidiabetic Agents</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Oral antidiabetic agents are drugs that lower blood sugar and may influence insulin dosing with Humalog.&lt;SEP&gt;Oral antidiabetic agents are non‑insulin medications that were co‑administered with both BASAGLAR KWIKPEN and Lantus® in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;Oral antidiabetic agents are medications that lower blood glucose and can decrease insulin requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Oral antidiabetic agents are medications that can decrease the insulin requirements of a patient.&lt;SEP&gt;Oral antidiabetic agents are medications that may decrease insulin requirements in patients using Humulin R.&lt;SEP&gt;Oral antidiabetic agents are medications that can decrease insulin needs for Humulin R patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4d26ce64e79b8c4a147140be2f9c63dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce5998d1ff6a67e2e549405b16f744f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd94288932ad6675a1de2b46b3fd9128&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fa819f7e1e42eb688d4894dc3ca7e64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577779892c0d463cd6bb1966b8a8ce2d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Bula Humalog.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786319722</data>
