</node>
<node id="Salicylates">
  <data key="d0">Salicylates</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Salicylates are a class of drug compounds primarily known for their anti‑inflammatory and analgesic properties; they are commonly used to relieve pain and reduce inflammation.  

In addition to these therapeutic actions, salicylates have a notable impact on glucose metabolism. Clinical observations indicate that they can enhance the glucose‑lowering effect of insulin, thereby intensifying insulin‑induced reductions in blood glucose levels. As a result, patients using salicylates often require lower doses of insulin to achieve the same glycaemic control, and the overall insulin requirement may be decreased. This interaction has been reported specifically with rapid‑acting insulin analogues such as Humalog, where salicylate use can modify the amount of insulin needed to maintain target glucose concentrations.&lt;SEP&gt;Salicylates are compounds that can reduce insulin requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Compounds such as aspirin that can lower insulin requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Salicylates are compounds that can reduce the insulin requirements of Levemir®.&lt;SEP&gt;Salicylates are compounds that may lower insulin requirements in patients using Humulin R.&lt;SEP&gt;Salicylates are a class of drugs that may lower insulin requirements in users of Humulin R.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4d26ce64e79b8c4a147140be2f9c63dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048d8fafb712e12cec45f2d3ec2c1e3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3db0edd23b6b502ccbbf62bfd601ce68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d96761d60c65f05f1530bc19b144cf1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd94288932ad6675a1de2b46b3fd9128&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d65840dd2cbd5c9984dfc4334378df5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f09811b149a29105854a0b1e84951e5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c32255a7f064c18ff0b079798cfeaf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cedd8e88a8d35eade68ce02222b9e276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3237e202569462c758ec3d878c9faeae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fa819f7e1e42eb688d4894dc3ca7e64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577779892c0d463cd6bb1966b8a8ce2d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Bula Humalog.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
