<node id="Sulfa Antibiotics">
  <data key="d0">Sulfa Antibiotics</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sulfa antibiotics are a class of antibiotics that may modify insulin needs in patients taking Humalog.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfa antibiotics are a class of antibiotics that can lower insulin requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfa antibiotics are medications that can decrease the insulin requirements of a patient.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfa antibiotics are antimicrobial agents that may reduce insulin needs in patients using Humulin R.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfa antibiotics are antibacterial agents that can reduce insulin needs for Humulin R patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4d26ce64e79b8c4a147140be2f9c63dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd94288932ad6675a1de2b46b3fd9128&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fa819f7e1e42eb688d4894dc3ca7e64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577779892c0d463cd6bb1966b8a8ce2d</data>
