<node id="Monoamine Oxidase Inhibitor Antidepressants">
  <data key="d0">Monoamine Oxidase Inhibitor Antidepressants</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Monoamine oxidase inhibitor antidepressants are medications for depression that can interact with Humalog dosing.</data>
