<node id="ACE Inhibitors">
  <data key="d0">ACE Inhibitors</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">ACE inhibitors, short for angiotensin‑converting‑enzyme inhibitors, are a class of cardiovascular drugs that block the activity of the angiotensin‑converting enzyme. By inhibiting this enzyme, they reduce the production of angiotensin II, leading to vasodilation and lower blood pressure, and they are commonly prescribed for conditions such as hypertension, heart failure, and post‑myocardial infarction management.

In addition to their primary cardiovascular effects, ACE inhibitors have been observed to influence insulin dynamics and glucose homeostasis. Clinical reports indicate that these agents may lower the amount of insulin required to achieve glycemic control, as they can enhance the glucose‑lowering effect of administered insulin. Consequently, patients on ACE inhibitors may experience an increased risk of insulin‑induced hypoglycemia, and the typical signs of low blood glucose can become less apparent, making hypoglycemia harder to recognize. The overall impact includes a potential decrease in the need for exogenous insulin and a potentiation of insulin’s effect on blood‑glucose reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;Angiotensin‑converting enzyme inhibitors that can lower insulin requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;ACE inhibitors are drugs that can reduce the insulin requirements of Levemir®.&lt;SEP&gt;ACE inhibitors are enzyme inhibitors that may reduce insulin needs in patients using Humulin R.&lt;SEP&gt;ACE inhibitors are blood pressure drugs that can decrease insulin needs in patients treated with Humulin R.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4d26ce64e79b8c4a147140be2f9c63dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048d8fafb712e12cec45f2d3ec2c1e3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4704ea4d5c15ebc8c043a077f05fd7a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3db0edd23b6b502ccbbf62bfd601ce68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d96761d60c65f05f1530bc19b144cf1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d65840dd2cbd5c9984dfc4334378df5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f09811b149a29105854a0b1e84951e5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c32255a7f064c18ff0b079798cfeaf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cedd8e88a8d35eade68ce02222b9e276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3237e202569462c758ec3d878c9faeae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fa819f7e1e42eb688d4894dc3ca7e64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577779892c0d463cd6bb1966b8a8ce2d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Bula Humalog.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/TRESIBA _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
