  <data key="d0">Angiotensin II Receptor Blockers</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Angiotensin II receptor blockers are medications that may influence insulin dosing when used alongside Humalog.&lt;SEP&gt;Angiotensin II receptor blockers are antihypertensive drugs that can lower insulin needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Angiotensin II receptor blockers are medications that can decrease the insulin requirements of a patient.&lt;SEP&gt;Angiotensin II receptor blockers are medications that may lower insulin requirements in patients using Humulin R.&lt;SEP&gt;Angiotensin II receptor blockers are antihypertensive agents that may lower insulin requirements for patients on Humulin R.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4d26ce64e79b8c4a147140be2f9c63dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd94288932ad6675a1de2b46b3fd9128&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fa819f7e1e42eb688d4894dc3ca7e64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577779892c0d463cd6bb1966b8a8ce2d</data>
