<node id="Beta‑Adrenergic Blockers">
  <data key="d0">Beta‑Adrenergic Blockers</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Beta‑adrenergic blockers can mask symptoms of hypoglycemia in patients using Humalog.&lt;SEP&gt;Beta‑adrenergic blockers are a class of medications that can mask hypoglycemia symptoms and lower insulin requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Beta‑adrenergic blockers are a class of medications that may mask the symptoms of hypoglycemia in some patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4d26ce64e79b8c4a147140be2f9c63dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd94288932ad6675a1de2b46b3fd9128</data>
