  <data key="d0">Non‑Laboratory Tests</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Non‑laboratory tests are assessments that may interact with Humalog.&lt;SEP&gt;Non‑laboratory tests are clinical assessments whose interaction with BASAGLAR has not been studied.&lt;SEP&gt;Non‑Laboratory Tests are medical assessments not involving lab analysis, with no studied interaction with BASAGLAR KWIKPEN.&lt;SEP&gt;Non‑laboratory tests are clinical assessments that do not require laboratory analysis.</data>
