<node id="Driving Ability">
  <data key="d0">Driving Ability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Driving ability is reported to have no known impairment when Humalog is used at the correct dose.&lt;SEP&gt;Driving Ability refers to the capacity to operate a vehicle, which may be affected by hypoglycemia or insulin dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Driving ability is the capacity to operate a vehicle safely, which can be compromised by hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Driving ability is the capacity to operate a vehicle, which may be compromised by hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Driving Ability is the capacity to operate a vehicle, which can be impaired by hypoglycemia.</data>
