<node id="Medical Supervision">
  <data key="d0">Medical Supervision</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Medical supervision denotes professional oversight required for certain patient groups when using Humalog.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical Supervision refers to the strict clinical oversight required when transferring a patient to a different type or brand of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical supervision with careful metabolic monitoring is recommended when changing insulin therapy.</data>
