<node id="Betabloqueadores">
  <data key="d0">Betabloqueadores</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Betabloqueadores are a class of drugs that may potentiate or diminish the glucose‑lowering effect of Lantus.&lt;SEP&gt;Betabloqueadores are beta‑blocking drugs that can either potentiate or diminish insulin glargina’s glucose‑lowering effect.&lt;SEP&gt;Betabloqueadores are substances that can both potentiate and weaken the effect of APIDRA SOLOSTAR.&lt;SEP&gt;Betabloqueadores are described as drugs that can both potentiate and weaken insulin’s hypoglycemic effect and affect adrenergic counter‑regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Betabloqueadores are beta‑blocker medications that may mask hypoglycemia symptoms and alter insulin needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Betabloqueadores are non‑selective beta‑blocker drugs that may mask hypoglycemia symptoms and delay recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Betabloqueadores are non‑selective beta‑blockers that can reduce insulin requirements and mask hypoglycemia symptoms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29a33072a90b4191a8b6c5136c417e4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4ba52cc293c5c002b470566321026d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b060d4f68031bd35dfafc19eadf1e9fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4615ca664e7ff898d8c5929cbc79e7d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6101c469482b48e341b4095a54907fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba6b31518be6fff1db8b68a28e82f200</data>
