  <data key="d0">Clonidina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Clonidina is a medication that may potentiate or diminish the glucose‑lowering effect of Lantus.&lt;SEP&gt;Clonidina is an alpha‑2 agonist that can both increase or decrease insulin glargina activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Clonidina is a substance that can both potentiate and weaken the effect of APIDRA SOLOSTAR.&lt;SEP&gt;Clonidina is a medication that can both potentiate and weaken insulin’s hypoglycemic effect and influence adrenergic counter‑regulation.</data>
