<node id="Pentamidina">
  <data key="d0">Pentamidina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Pentamidina is a drug that can cause hypoglycemia followed by hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Pentamidina is a drug that can cause hypoglycemia followed by hyperglycemia, influencing insulin glargina therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Pentamidina is a medication that can cause hypoglycemia, which may be followed by hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Pentamidina may cause hypoglycemia, which can occasionally be followed by hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Pentamidina is a medication that can cause hypoglycemia, which may occasionally be followed by hyperglycemia, affecting APIDRA SOLOSTAR therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Pentamidina is a drug known to cause secondary diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29a33072a90b4191a8b6c5136c417e4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-465ad8b77c1c2a2a179062da20337ff5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b060d4f68031bd35dfafc19eadf1e9fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f09811b149a29105854a0b1e84951e5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72da6fb8b6a9ed059d146b43a3174f90</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786373026</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Guanetidina">
  <data key="d0">Guanetidina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Guanetidina is a sympatholytic medication that may affect the glucose‑lowering effect of Lantus.&lt;SEP&gt;Guanetidina is a sympatholytic agent that can reduce adrenergic counter‑regulation signals during insulin glargina treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Guanetidina is a sympatholytic drug mentioned among beta blockers, clonidine, and reserpina.&lt;SEP&gt;Guanetidina is listed among sympatholytic drugs that may reduce adrenergic counter‑regulation signals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29a33072a90b4191a8b6c5136c417e4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-465ad8b77c1c2a2a179062da20337ff5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b060d4f68031bd35dfafc19eadf1e9fe</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786315477</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reserpina">
  <data key="d0">Reserpina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Reserpina is a sympatholytic medication that may affect the glucose‑lowering effect of Lantus.&lt;SEP&gt;Reserpina is a sympatholytic drug that can diminish adrenergic counter‑regulation during insulin glargina use.&lt;SEP&gt;Reserpina is a sympatholytic drug mentioned among beta blockers, clonidine, and guanetidina.&lt;SEP&gt;Reserpina is listed among sympatholytic drugs that may reduce adrenergic counter‑regulation signals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29a33072a90b4191a8b6c5136c417e4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-465ad8b77c1c2a2a179062da20337ff5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b060d4f68031bd35dfafc19eadf1e9fe</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786315478</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sanofi‑Aventis">
  <data key="d0">Sanofi‑Aventis</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Sanofi‑Aventis is the pharmaceutical company linked to the production and distribution of Lantus.&lt;SEP&gt;Sanofi‑Aventis is the pharmaceutical company that manufactures Lantus and related injection devices.&lt;SEP&gt;Sanofi‑aventis is a pharmaceutical company cited as the source of comparative data on insulin NPH.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29a33072a90b4191a8b6c5136c417e4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67563459bb64c390a40207da52944afd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e62226007200589cb2143f0fb75b302</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786309964</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Serviço de Atendimento ao Consumidor da Sanofi‑Aventis">
  <data key="d0">Serviço de Atendimento ao Consumidor da Sanofi‑Aventis</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The customer‑service division of Sanofi‑Aventis that assists users with Lantus pen and refill usage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29a33072a90b4191a8b6c5136c417e4c</data>
