</node>
<node id="Frasco‑ampola">
  <data key="d0">Frasco‑ampola</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Frasco‑ampola is the sealed vial that holds the Lantus solution and must be inspected for clarity before use.&lt;SEP&gt;A vial‑ampoule container that holds APIDRA solution before first withdrawal.&lt;SEP&gt;Frasco‑ampola is a 10 mL ampoule container for Fiasp® insulin aspart solution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29a33072a90b4191a8b6c5136c417e4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15a498084b9a0c4cfcd9aa9553e12a14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8c7e36686d077dcb6239405f60ea031</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786316135</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Caneta compatível">
  <data key="d0">Caneta compatível</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Caneta compatível is an insulin pen compatible with Lantus refils for subcutaneous injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29a33072a90b4191a8b6c5136c417e4c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf</data>
