</node>
<node id="BulasMed">
  <data key="d0">BulasMed</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">BulasMed is an online platform and website that serves as a centralized source for medication leaflets, also known as “bulas,” and related drug information. The portal makes these documents accessible through web browsers and mobile devices, offering users the ability to view official package inserts, professional sheets, and label information for a range of pharmaceutical products.

Among the medications featured on BulasMed are the insulin analogues Lantus and NovoRapid (also referred to as Novorapid). For Lantus, the site hosts the full medication package insert, providing detailed dosage, administration, and safety data. For NovoRapid®, BulasMed supplies the professional sheet, label (bula), and an information sheet that present prescribing guidelines, pharmacological details, and patient‑focused instructions.

Overall, BulasMed functions as a publicly available, digital repository of up‑to‑date medication leaflets, enabling healthcare professionals, patients, and anyone seeking reliable drug information to retrieve official documents quickly and conveniently.&lt;SEP&gt;BulasMed is an online platform that provides medication leaflets and drug information, hosting the Tresiba® leaflet.&lt;SEP&gt;BulasMed is an online platform that publishes medication leaflets (bulas) for pharmaceuticals.&lt;SEP&gt;BulasMed is an online platform that hosts the medication leaflet for Tresiba®.&lt;SEP&gt;BulasMed is an online platform that publishes medication leaflets and health information, including the Tresiba® bulletin.&lt;SEP&gt;BulasMed is an online portal that hosts the Tresiba medication bula.&lt;SEP&gt;BulasMed is the website that hosts the Tresiba drug label referenced in the text.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d59c9bf7f429a82cbfd7083e36ff8f9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da80e99fd3e43cb7d3b260aca23fe56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f563c4251564fd1ab552464562a1876c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572e715aada476f4dac69a032e16cc09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4f2935f492529f0d551140b53a84fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e42637e4286cbc19cce4502b22634bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048d8fafb712e12cec45f2d3ec2c1e3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e5c50e8a808c537075377966ae2ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f079198593c1702b56062aa87e7801a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe094dd3d94334373a8497a7cb841e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e590341aac73dca916e560c2df9e60e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2943becc796c8ce3f0aaedf0978c3213&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c032d0271c85fd24982516368a62b1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11cce86325de9748e794648198242578&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9ae5f9ffa7eff9bb36cf1a9764df3e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a20360c489112f7848983049bae7125</data>
