  <data key="d5">1786306294</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Blood Glucose Level">
  <data key="d0">Blood Glucose Level</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Blood Glucose Level is the numerical measurement of glucose concentration in the blood, which is monitored in diabetic patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood glucose level is the measured concentration of sugar in the blood, which can be too low (hypoglycemia) or too high (hyperglycemia).&lt;SEP&gt;Blood Glucose Level is the measured concentration of glucose in the bloodstream, recommended to stay above 100 mg/dL before sleeping.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood Glucose Level is the measured concentration of glucose in the blood, expressed in mg/dL.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood Glucose Level is the concentration of glucose in the blood, measured in mg/dL.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood Glucose Level is the numeric measurement of glucose concentration in the blood.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d59c9bf7f429a82cbfd7083e36ff8f9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4704ea4d5c15ebc8c043a077f05fd7a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b9f6a4a440ccb40e47c326ca6dd9346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4655f823785fa91e72cba96e00dba34c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5f7cad1fb0e1a0a02f63b5928b8acd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-208cda7ee40e8d266fadd1eadff49e03</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/TRESIBA _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/edelman-et-al-2026-dosing-afrezza-it-s-not-that-complicated.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/glicemias capilares.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/hipoglicemia.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372326</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Angioedema">
  <data key="d0">Angioedema</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Angioedema is a swelling in subcutaneous tissues or mucous membranes that can occur as an immediate-type allergic reaction to insulin or its excipients.&lt;SEP&gt;Angioedema is swelling of subcutaneous tissues or mucosa, often allergic, listed among generalized cutaneous reactions to insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Angioedema is a potentially life‑threatening allergic reaction listed among severe insulin‑related adverse events.&lt;SEP&gt;Angioedema is a swelling reaction that can be associated with insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Angioedema is a swelling reaction that can occur as part of systemic allergic reactions to insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d59c9bf7f429a82cbfd7083e36ff8f9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da80e99fd3e43cb7d3b260aca23fe56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d194d06ef99b3f8aa6b6542b7e93e762&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8934881ec5ab7cfeb836126b3f0e8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d7223c781e745e72311fccfcdd58583</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313633</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bronchospasm">
  <data key="d0">Bronchospasm</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bronchospasm is the constriction of the bronchi and bronchioles that may arise as an immediate allergic reaction to insulin or its excipients.&lt;SEP&gt;Bronchospasm is a severe respiratory adverse event associated with insulin use.&lt;SEP&gt;Bronchospasm is a constriction of the airways that can be associated with insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Bronchospasm is a narrowing of the airways that may be triggered by systemic allergic reactions to insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d59c9bf7f429a82cbfd7083e36ff8f9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d194d06ef99b3f8aa6b6542b7e93e762&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8934881ec5ab7cfeb836126b3f0e8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d7223c781e745e72311fccfcdd58583</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313633</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hypotension">
  <data key="d0">Hypotension</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hypotension is low blood pressure that can be a manifestation of an immediate allergic reaction to insulin or its excipients.&lt;SEP&gt;Hypotension is low blood pressure that can be induced by insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Hypotension is a severe adverse event that can occur following insulin administration.&lt;SEP&gt;Hypotension is low blood pressure that can be associated with insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Hypotension is a drop in blood pressure that can be a manifestation of systemic allergic reactions to insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d59c9bf7f429a82cbfd7083e36ff8f9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da80e99fd3e43cb7d3b260aca23fe56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d194d06ef99b3f8aa6b6542b7e93e762&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8934881ec5ab7cfeb836126b3f0e8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d7223c781e745e72311fccfcdd58583</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313633</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Shock">
  <data key="d0">Shock</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Shock is a life‑threatening condition that can result from severe immediate allergic reactions to insulin or its excipients.&lt;SEP&gt;Shock is a life‑threatening condition that can arise from severe insulin reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Shock is a life‑threatening condition listed as a possible insulin‑related adverse event.&lt;SEP&gt;Shock is a life‑threatening condition that may result from severe systemic allergic reactions to insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Shock is a life‑threatening condition that can occur as an adverse reaction to insulin therapy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d59c9bf7f429a82cbfd7083e36ff8f9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da80e99fd3e43cb7d3b260aca23fe56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d194d06ef99b3f8aa6b6542b7e93e762&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8934881ec5ab7cfeb836126b3f0e8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d7223c781e745e72311fccfcdd58583</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313633</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Neuroglycopenia">
  <data key="d0">Neuroglycopenia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Neuroglycopenia is a deficiency of glucose in the brain that occurs during severe hypoglycemia and precedes neurological symptoms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d59c9bf7f429a82cbfd7083e36ff8f9a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786304204</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Adrenérgica Counterregulation">
  <data key="d0">Adrenérgica Counterregulation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Adrenérgica Counterregulation is the body's adrenergic response that intensifies as blood glucose declines during hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d59c9bf7f429a82cbfd7083e36ff8f9a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786304204</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Glargina (Lantus)">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Glargina (Lantus)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin glargina, marketed as Lantus, is a long‑acting insulin reported to be mixed accidentally with short‑acting insulins.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4da80e99fd3e43cb7d3b260aca23fe56</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786304204</data>
