<node id="Urticaria">
  <data key="d0">Urticaria</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Urticaria is an allergic skin eruption causing itching, reported as a reaction to insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Urticaria is a hive‑like skin reaction listed among immune system adverse events.&lt;SEP&gt;Urticaria is a skin allergic reaction (hives) reported among insulin‑related skin adverse events.&lt;SEP&gt;Urticaria is an allergic skin reaction noted as uncommon with Levemir®.&lt;SEP&gt;Urticaria is an uncommon immune‑mediated skin reaction listed as an adverse effect of Novolin® R.</data>
