<node id="0800 722 6001">
  <data key="d0">0800 722 6001</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">0800 722 6001 is a dedicated telephone line that provides medical assistance for intoxication emergencies, particularly those involving insulin‑based therapies. The number is intended to be used when a person experiences an insulin overdose, offering immediate professional guidance and support to mitigate the potentially serious effects of excess insulin in the body.

The service also covers intoxication cases related to specific rapid‑acting insulin products. Callers can obtain help for overdoses of NovoRapid, as well as for the newer formulations Apidra and Apidra Solostar. In each of these situations, the hotline connects the caller with trained medical personnel who can advise on appropriate emergency measures, such as glucose administration and when to seek further medical care.

Beyond insulin‑specific incidents, 0800 722 6001 functions as a general intoxication assistance number, allowing anyone who has been exposed to a harmful dose of medication or other toxic substances to receive prompt, expert advice. The line is staffed to respond to a wide range of poisoning scenarios, ensuring that callers receive timely information to protect their health while awaiting further treatment if necessary.&lt;SEP&gt;0800 722 6001 is the phone number to call for intoxicação (poisoning) assistance.&lt;SEP&gt;0800 722 6001 is the emergency telephone number for intoxication cases related to Levemir®.&lt;SEP&gt;0800 722 6001 is the telephone number to call in case of intoxication.&lt;SEP&gt;0800 722 6001 is the telephone number to call in case of intoxication or urgent guidance.&lt;SEP&gt;0800 722 6001 is the telephone number to call in case of intoxication.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4da80e99fd3e43cb7d3b260aca23fe56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f079198593c1702b56062aa87e7801a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2943becc796c8ce3f0aaedf0978c3213&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22df77f7bf817d736d90608e62a11d84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef35bd45e4ba8d20f4e9181011ccfcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51761473ea6fe17b9e098a6bf98636b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04b345bc26ec7f5d7c9db8c6004a50a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e7689ca0fc736d9eae94256f73fed52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-922791f49d1bf928fe4f02ddd336927b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-831f4bbfc884fc8e9679630a819083e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d01ed6a801b11c1b53f4668059c1f9cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f2714936869e55e840f5294caefeaee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6419fb3ef4249d6c7e8d8a45d82efe80</data>
