  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pediatric Population">
  <data key="d0">Pediatric Population</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pediatric population refers to individuals who are 18 years of age or younger, encompassing both children and adolescents. In clinical contexts this group is often delineated by specific age brackets such as 1 year up to, but not including, 18 years; 6 years up to but not including 18 years; 6‑11 years for younger children and 12‑18 years for adolescents. These sub‑ranges are used to define cohorts in various insulin‑related studies and regulatory submissions.

Across multiple insulin products—including Lantus®, BASAGLAR®, TOUJEO 300 U/mL, and Fiasp®—the safety profile observed in the pediatric population is generally reported as comparable to that seen in adult patients. Nevertheless, certain insulin‑related adverse reactions occur more frequently in children and adolescents than in adults, and the pediatric group exhibits a higher predisposition to asymptomatic hypoglycemia.

The pediatric cohort has been the focus of several clinical investigations. For example, subjects aged 6 up to but not including 18 years were evaluated for safety and efficacy of TOUJEO 300 U/mL, while children aged 6‑11 years and adolescents aged 12‑18 years were studied to demonstrate the faster onset and greater early exposure of Fiasp®. Additionally, a study identified as NN 1250‑3561 enrolled participants aged 1 to less than 18 years, and a comparative trial conducted by the Pediatric Study Group of Insulin Glargine specifically targeted children and adolescents with type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4da80e99fd3e43cb7d3b260aca23fe56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d194d06ef99b3f8aa6b6542b7e93e762&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c580ebfc111aa29796af1a6f15941c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45d489de28e8fda3c3be3bb09ab29eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d7223c781e745e72311fccfcdd58583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14772c7de5db762c492a75a1c744dae6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01fb767ae3a103c9d6c4775570df90c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7e6ca9bf63e843b814736c0409c70fb</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786331421</data>
