  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A metabolic monitoring program is a systematic approach to track glucose, insulin doses, and safety parameters during insulin therapy transitions.&lt;SEP&gt;A metabolic monitoring program is a systematic, medically supervised approach to track glucose and other metabolic parameters during insulin therapy transitions.</data>
