<node id="Room Temperature">
  <data key="d0">Room Temperature</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Room temperature is the ambient condition at which the Lantus refill should be kept for 1 to 2 hours before insertion into the insulin pen.&lt;SEP&gt;The condition that insulin must reach before use to prevent air bubbles and inaccurate delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Room temperature is the ambient condition that, if samples remain in, can cause preanalytic variability.</data>
