<node id="Diabetes Gestacional">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Gestacional</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes Gestacional is diabetes occurring during pregnancy that requires metabolic control and may be treated with Lantus if necessary.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Gestacional is glucose intolerance first recognized during pregnancy, evaluated in studies using Insulina Glargina and Insulina NPH.&lt;SEP&gt;Gestational diabetes is diabetes diagnosed during pregnancy that may be managed with insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Gestational diabetes that develops during pregnancy and requires specific glucose monitoring recommendations.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Gestacional is a form of diabetes that occurs during pregnancy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a976e1642df27c488174759a35ca23f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17844a4a12e6c05ba2d7b5f54b0f9bd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b40c2fbad301807d9646f27d94635cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dce7a759a9de18a4d1bcc77a071fbe2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72da6fb8b6a9ed059d146b43a3174f90</data>
