<node id="Subcutâneo">
  <data key="d0">Subcutâneo</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Subcutâneo denotes the subcutaneous route of administration used for injecting Lantus.&lt;SEP&gt;The subcutaneous method by which insulin is injected under the skin.</data>
