  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Cloreto de zinco is an excipient used in Lantus formulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Cloreto de Zinco is a zinc salt listed as an excipient in Novolin® R.&lt;SEP&gt;Cloreto de Zinco is an excipient included in the insulin solution formulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Cloreto de zinco is an excipient used in the formulation of Novolin® R FlexPen® for injectable use.</data>
