  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Água para injetáveis is the sterile water component of Lantus formulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Água para Injetáveis is sterile water listed as an excipient in Novolin® R.&lt;SEP&gt;Água para injetáveis is the sterile water component used as an excipient in Novolin® R FlexPen®.</data>
