<node id="DNA‑Recombinante">
  <data key="d0">DNA‑Recombinante</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DNA‑recombinante technology is the recombinant DNA method employed to produce insulin glargina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-572e715aada476f4dac69a032e16cc09</data>
