<node id="Monitorização da Glicemia">
  <data key="d0">Monitorização da Glicemia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Monitorização da glicemia is the regular measurement of blood glucose levels required for insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood‑glucose monitoring method recommended for insulin therapy to detect hyper‑ or hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Monitorização da glicemia is the recommended blood‑glucose monitoring for all patients with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Monitorização da glicemia is the ongoing measurement of blood glucose levels required during insulin therapy and infusion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-572e715aada476f4dac69a032e16cc09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da44554b006e6bd1b841f4246a054669&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61cacf80ada6db26d2b975df763c137a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0689fd73d2061ee466b9b90e03bda141</data>
