  <data key="d0">São Paulo/SP</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">São Paulo/SP is the Brazilian city where the price of Lantus was listed.&lt;SEP&gt;São Paulo/SP is the city in Brazil where the price of NovoRapid (R$ 66,52) is listed.&lt;SEP&gt;São Paulo is a city in São Paulo state, Brazil listed as an address for Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda.&lt;SEP&gt;São Paulo/SP is the Brazilian city mentioned in the product’s registration information.&lt;SEP&gt;São Paulo/SP is the Brazilian city where Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda. is located.</data>
