<node id="Insulina Glulisina">
  <data key="d0">Insulina Glulisina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina Glulisina is the generic name for the rapid‑acting insulin analogue glulisine, which is marketed commercially under the brand name APIDRA and its formulation APIDRA® SOLOSTAR® that delivers 100 IU per millilitre of insulin equivalent to human insulin.  

Pharmacologically, Insulina Glulisina is designed for prandial (mealtime) use. Its absorption rate is approximately twice that of regular human insulin, producing a higher peak concentration and a faster onset of action, which makes it suitable for tight post‑prandial glucose control. The molecule has been evaluated in detailed pharmacodynamic and pharmacokinetic studies to characterize these rapid‑acting properties.  

Clinically, Insulina Glulisina is employed to manage blood glucose levels in individuals with diabetes, particularly as a rapid‑acting component of insulin regimens. It has also been used as the test drug in teratology and reproductive toxicity studies, providing data on its effects in animal models.  

Safety information indicates that data on the use of Insulina Glulisina in pregnant women are limited, but existing reports have not identified adverse outcomes for the fetus or newborn. Additionally, there is a paucity of data regarding potential interference of the analogue with laboratory examinations, a gap noted in the literature.  

One description in the source material mistakenly refers to Insulina Glulisina as a misspelled version of the long‑acting insulin glargine. This appears to be an error, as glulisine (Insulina Glulisina) is a rapid‑acting analogue, whereas glargine is a distinct long‑acting formulation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aa127476a5c98492d7b7e0fcd1212886&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d9c944d51a42525c017d9109f46684c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4ba52cc293c5c002b470566321026d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f46c503a378e6c69618036a038672417&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0e34bef478ed432c8de7ef68dc9025&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb620bf44b37187faceacd0405c4a819&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e212a20942ed5387efe96e92bdb4ba98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7621ac447c9044986ade86ce5f9be201&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b060d4f68031bd35dfafc19eadf1e9fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aecb3968c37f57b78a756e4b661ad089&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3418c4ee80182ca29214dd54b0d9647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e7689ca0fc736d9eae94256f73fed52</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Lista_Insulinas_Bulas (1).pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf</data>
