  <data key="d0">ANVISA</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">ANVISA is the Brazilian health regulatory agency responsible for publishing bulários.&lt;SEP&gt;ANVISA is the Brazilian health regulatory agency that approved the medication brochure on 17/04/2026.&lt;SEP&gt;ANVISA is Brazil's health regulatory agency that oversees medication safety and provides the portal for reporting.&lt;SEP&gt;ANVISA is the Brazilian health regulatory agency that registered the Accu-Chek Solo-diabetesmanager under number 81414021710.&lt;SEP&gt;Brazilian regulatory agency that has not approved immunomodulatory medications such as teplizumab for DM1.</data>
