  <data key="d2">NovoRapid® FlexPen® is the injectable pen device that contains the NovoRapid solution.&lt;SEP&gt;NovoRapid® FlexPen® is a color‑identified insulin pen that includes a usage leaflet, uses disposable needles, cannot have its cartridge refilled, and must be discarded after empty.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b4f2935f492529f0d551140b53a84fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9725072a361e9b1b97c5daa35e061e58</data>
