<node id="NovoRapid®">
  <data key="d0">NovoRapid®</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">NovoRapid® is a rapid‑acting insulin analogue (the molecular entity insulin aspart) that is administered by subcutaneous injection. It is indicated for the management of diabetes mellitus, most commonly type 1 diabetes, and is approved for use in children as well as in pregnant women. The formulation is clear and colour‑less, must not be used if frozen, and is typically injected shortly before meals as part of a basal‑bolus insulin regimen. Compared with regular human insulin, NovoRapid® provides a faster onset of action, a shorter duration of effect, and has been shown to reduce the risk of nocturnal hypoglycaemia.  

In clinical practice, NovoRapid® is frequently employed as the reference rapid‑acting insulin in comparative studies. It has served as the active comparator in a series of pharmacokinetic, pharmacodynamic and safety trials evaluating newer rapid‑acting formulations such as Fiasp®, including basal‑bolus trials, continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion (CSII) compatibility studies, and six‑week CSII investigations. The product has also been investigated in combination with the long‑acting insulin degludec to assess hypoglycaemia outcomes.  

Overall, NovoRapid® is marketed as a standard rapid‑acting insulin aspart brand for diabetes treatment, valued for its predictable pharmacokinetic profile, ease of use before meals, and its role as a benchmark agent in the development and evaluation of newer insulin therapies.&lt;SEP&gt;NovoRapid® is the brand name of insulin aspart, a fast‑acting insulin analog mentioned in comparative clinical studies.&lt;SEP&gt;NovoRapid® is an insulin aspart rapid‑acting insulin analogue used to improve glycemic control.&lt;SEP&gt;NovoRapid® is the trade name for insulin aspart, a fast‑acting insulin analog used as a comparator in clinical studies with Novolin® R.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6e42637e4286cbc19cce4502b22634bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9725072a361e9b1b97c5daa35e061e58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048d8fafb712e12cec45f2d3ec2c1e3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecd2466ef4258dade38fbadd495188e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b14c2f0985ae4a417c8fc99e339bd9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d0f18c80f8de2dee960a03599d12052&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe094dd3d94334373a8497a7cb841e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f4f01a72f35d6db3ff333e64f8400ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f85d0ab4cfadc905544cb9e30752dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb9ea85b9ad8cd6940ae41a3ab5d1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14772c7de5db762c492a75a1c744dae6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff211ed5ca723fa2074871af58a4eb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77c1608c27e3114f3a14f175efe260a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a70857656e32cc73aaa270a75eb33af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2073bddd90c7dd8e156b67821f0f3247&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88b97cde53943160602b20f634ba5c1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a7ca48868f79f7be782198d67ffefd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8c7e36686d077dcb6239405f60ea031&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fdc648ec086061141581e27adde6fc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2378c57a337d1ce7103c7086ebba76ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd40a6d69921cf300ed8eda043698d1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f7f04b0529d6f0ace11829cc4fa3b4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
