</node>
<node id="Insulin Human Regular (Novolin® R)">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Human Regular (Novolin® R)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin human regular, sold as Novolin® R, is a short‑acting human insulin used as a comparator in several clinical studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6e42637e4286cbc19cce4502b22634bd</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf</data>
