<node id="Insulin Degludec">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Degludec</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin degludec is a long‑acting basal insulin evaluated for safety and efficacy in children with diabetes type 1.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Degludec is a basal insulin used in combination with fast‑acting insulin aspart in clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin degludec is a long‑acting insulin analogue used as a comparator in some studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Degludec is a long-acting insulin used as background therapy in a trial comparing fast-acting insulin aspart with insulin aspart.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin degludec is an ultra‑long‑acting basal insulin compared with insulin glargine in basal‑bolus regimens for type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6e42637e4286cbc19cce4502b22634bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a7ca48868f79f7be782198d67ffefd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68b98187c6ab15468f1c0d8f5e7f9f6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7e6ca9bf63e843b814736c0409c70fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9416e8076c17175db0dbb12c3393566</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786331407</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Detemir">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Detemir</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Detemir is a long‑acting basal insulin analogue that serves as the active ingredient of the commercial preparation Levemir® and is the generic name for that product. It is classified as a basal insulin used in the management of diabetes mellitus, including both type 1 and type 2 disease, and is listed among possible basal insulin options for patients requiring steady, background insulin coverage.

Pharmacologically, Insulin Detemir is an insulin analogue modified with a fatty‑acid side chain. This structural feature promotes self‑association of the molecules and enables reversible binding to albumin at the injection site, which together prolong the duration of action and produce a relatively flat insulin profile suitable for basal therapy. The molecule’s stability can be compromised by certain substances that may be added to the Levemir® formulation, leading to degradation under specific conditions.

Clinically, Insulin Detemir has been evaluated in numerous studies that assess its efficacy and safety in both type 1 and type 2 diabetes. It has been examined alongside other long‑acting insulins such as insulin degludec in pediatric diabetes trials, and it has been incorporated into bolus‑basal therapy regimens where it is combined with rapid‑acting insulin analogues like NovoRapid® in bolus‑basal therapy studies. These investigations support its role as a reliable basal insulin component in diverse therapeutic strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Detemir is a long-acting insulin analog compared with NPH insulin and insulin glargine in randomized studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin detemir is a long‑acting basal insulin analogue used in intensive therapy for type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;A long‑acting insulin analogue compared in a treat‑to‑target trial as add‑on therapy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6e42637e4286cbc19cce4502b22634bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe094dd3d94334373a8497a7cb841e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f85d0ab4cfadc905544cb9e30752dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef15154a94043650617b3b24d8146a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f36263c657ad99a80e578ac49a333d5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cedd8e88a8d35eade68ce02222b9e276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb8954aaa1e1230598596ce6f5df249&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f5165b3185feb3c6ec93a3c0ef8d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ace26fdb0244e3d0f714a007c9bbb51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3237e202569462c758ec3d878c9faeae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4d7abd3e1e5418ee5a931e28a18e8ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56fc1d5df1b34d9120c3cf8a760c40f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7e6ca9bf63e843b814736c0409c70fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9416e8076c17175db0dbb12c3393566&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76eaa3af026fbb91a96f70d3502e809d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335965</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
