  <data key="d0">Study ANA‑1415</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Study ANA‑1415 is a randomised, open, multicentre safety and efficacy trial comparing prandial insulin aspart with prandial human insulin in children aged 2‑6 years with diabetes type 1.</data>
