  <data key="d0">Study ANA‑1474</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Study ANA‑1474 is a randomised, open, cross‑over multicentre trial comparing NovoRapid® with Novolin® R in a multiple‑injection regimen for diabetes type 1.</data>
