</node>
<node id="Nervous System Disorders">
  <data key="d0">Nervous System Disorders</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Nervous system disorders category includes rare adverse events like peripheral neuropathy (acute painful neuropathy).&lt;SEP&gt;Nervous system disorders is the category under which dysgeusia is listed in the adverse event tables.&lt;SEP&gt;Nervous system disorders are mentioned as possible adverse events.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9e5c50e8a808c537075377966ae2ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22df77f7bf817d736d90608e62a11d84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c580ebfc111aa29796af1a6f15941c7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786309966</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Vision Disorders">
  <data key="d0">Vision Disorders</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Vision disorders category comprises uncommon adverse events such as refractive disturbances and diabetic retinopathy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9e5c50e8a808c537075377966ae2ccd</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786305907</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Skin and Subcutaneous Tissue Disorders">
  <data key="d0">Skin and Subcutaneous Tissue Disorders</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Skin and subcutaneous tissue disorders category includes unknown frequency adverse events like cutaneous amyloidosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9e5c50e8a808c537075377966ae2ccd</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf</data>
