</node>
<node id="Sistema VigiMed">
  <data key="d0">Sistema VigiMed</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Sistema VigiMed is an electronic reporting system designed for the notification of adverse events. It is provided and maintained by Brazil’s National Health Surveillance Agency (Anvisa) and can be accessed through the Agency’s online portal, known as the Portal da Anvisa.

The system serves as the official channel for health professionals, patients, and pharmaceutical stakeholders to submit information about harmful or unexpected reactions associated with the use of medicines. By collecting these reports, Sistema VigiMed supports Anvisa’s pharmacovigilance activities, enabling the agency to monitor drug safety, identify risk patterns, and take regulatory actions when necessary.

While the platform accommodates reports on a wide range of medication‑related adverse events, it is also explicitly cited as a tool for reporting insulin‑related reactions. Consequently, any adverse event linked to pharmaceuticals, including but not limited to insulin products, may be entered into Sistema VigiMed for evaluation by Anvisa.&lt;SEP&gt;Sistema VigiMed is the adverse‑event reporting system available through the Anvisa portal.&lt;SEP&gt;Sistema VigiMed is the adverse‑event reporting system available through the Anvisa portal.&lt;SEP&gt;Sistema VigiMed is a national adverse‑event reporting system available through the Anvisa portal.&lt;SEP&gt;Sistema VigiMed is an adverse‑event reporting system available through the Anvisa portal for notifying incidents related to medicines.&lt;SEP&gt;Sistema VigiMed is the adverse‑event reporting system available through the Portal da Anvisa.&lt;SEP&gt;Sistema VigiMed is a reporting system for adverse events, available through the ANVISA portal.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9e5c50e8a808c537075377966ae2ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-072d97721eef045503ec1dce0363b58e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef35bd45e4ba8d20f4e9181011ccfcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aca0b919135813e1d5b772face36989d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51761473ea6fe17b9e098a6bf98636b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04b345bc26ec7f5d7c9db8c6004a50a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e7689ca0fc736d9eae94256f73fed52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d5bb996e52cb71f15bc8c30d1b1d321&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-922791f49d1bf928fe4f02ddd336927b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d01ed6a801b11c1b53f4668059c1f9cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f2714936869e55e840f5294caefeaee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-786395f3716fb61a79fd183c63e1a9d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7ca732691e1cbcafd65e378b8d80144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-779af610d7298ce98490962cd90b4e76</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
