</node>
<node id="Adverse Events">
  <data key="d0">Adverse Events</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Adverse events are undesirable medical occurrences such as hypoglycemia, skin reactions, and anaphylaxis reported for insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Adverse events are undesirable medical occurrences monitored for safety in the clinical study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9e5c50e8a808c537075377966ae2ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d9c944d51a42525c017d9109f46684c</data>
