</node>
<node id="Portal da Anvisa">
  <data key="d0">Portal da Anvisa</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Portal da Anvisa is the official online portal of Brazil’s health regulator, the Agência Nacional de Vigilância Sanitária (ANVISA). The portal serves as the digital gateway through which users can access the Sistema VigiMed (also referred to simply as VigiMed), the national reporting system for health‑related incidents and product surveillance. All descriptions consistently indicate that the portal provides direct, online access to this reporting system, making it the primary platform for submitting and reviewing VigiMed data.&lt;SEP&gt;Portal da Anvisa is the online portal where users can access Sistema VigiMed to report adverse reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Portal da Anvisa is the online portal of Brazil’s National Health Surveillance Agency where the VigiMed System is available.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9e5c50e8a808c537075377966ae2ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22df77f7bf817d736d90608e62a11d84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-072d97721eef045503ec1dce0363b58e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef35bd45e4ba8d20f4e9181011ccfcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d7223c781e745e72311fccfcdd58583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51761473ea6fe17b9e098a6bf98636b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04b345bc26ec7f5d7c9db8c6004a50a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e7689ca0fc736d9eae94256f73fed52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f2714936869e55e840f5294caefeaee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ac99e7359716e2cecc2ec93159218b6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786319740</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
