<node id="Basal Insulin Administration">
  <data key="d0">Basal Insulin Administration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Basal Insulin Administration refers to once‑daily or divided subcutaneous dosing of insulin NPH to maintain baseline glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Long‑acting insulin dose that may overlap with bolus doses, affecting glucose levels.</data>
