  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hepatic dysfunction denotes impaired liver function affecting drug absorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients with hepatic dysfunction using Levemir® need intensified glucose monitoring and individualized insulin dose adjustment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b14c2f0985ae4a417c8fc99e339bd9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ace26fdb0244e3d0f714a007c9bbb51</data>
