<node id="Tiazolidinediones">
  <data key="d0">Tiazolidinediones</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Tiazolidinediones are a class of oral antidiabetic drugs.&lt;SEP&gt;Tiazolidinediones are a class of oral antidiabetic agents mentioned as used in combination with insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Tiazolidinediones are a class of antidiabetic drugs mentioned in combination with insulin and linked to heart failure risk.&lt;SEP&gt;A class of oral antidiabetic drugs that, when combined with insulin, have been linked to congestive heart failure, weight gain, and edema.&lt;SEP&gt;Tiazolidinediones are a class of oral antidiabetic drugs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6d0f18c80f8de2dee960a03599d12052&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a20360c489112f7848983049bae7125&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d10a1f849386df540104c79e33a7b242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a6f9e10c0d4af5fff0338eb861f9c86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd396c45bc09fb646d156b4e69d328e3</data>
