<node id="Insulin Transfer">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Transfer</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Transfer denotes the process of switching a patient from one insulin brand or type to another.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Transfer denotes the process of moving a patient from one insulin product to another, requiring medical supervision.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin transfer denotes the process of switching a patient from one insulin type or brand to another, such as to Novolin® R Penfill.</data>
