<node id="Novo Nordisk A/S">
  <data key="d0">Novo Nordisk A/S</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Novo Nordisk A/S is a Danish multinational pharmaceutical company headquartered in Denmark. It serves as the global parent and trademark holder for a broad portfolio of insulin and diabetes‑related products. The company manufactures and markets the rapid‑acting insulin analogues Novorapid and Tresiba, as well as the long‑acting basal insulin Levemir, which is available with the FlexPen delivery system. Novo Nordisk also owns and licenses the Novolin® brand of insulin products.

In addition to its insulin lines, Novo Nordisk holds the registered trademarks for several delivery‑device and formulation technologies. These include Fiasp®, a fast‑acting insulin‑aspart formulation; FlexTouch®, a pen‑based injection system; Penfill®, a reusable pen reservoir; and NovoFine®, a precision‑dose pen. The Levemir® FlexPen® and the FlexPen® devices are likewise part of its trademark portfolio. All of these brands and technologies are produced and distributed worldwide under the Novo Nordisk corporate umbrella.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4f079198593c1702b56062aa87e7801a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2943becc796c8ce3f0aaedf0978c3213&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d5bb996e52cb71f15bc8c30d1b1d321&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdee4bcd64faa476dd057e21e2525e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-922791f49d1bf928fe4f02ddd336927b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-831f4bbfc884fc8e9679630a819083e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d01ed6a801b11c1b53f4668059c1f9cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f2714936869e55e840f5294caefeaee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-786395f3716fb61a79fd183c63e1a9d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7ca732691e1cbcafd65e378b8d80144</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/TRESIBA _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786318445</data>
