<node id="Bomba de Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Bomba de Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Bomba de Insulina is an insulin‑pump device that provides continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion, delivering both basal and bolus insulin doses without the need for repeated injections. It is frequently mentioned as a related topic for users of rapid‑acting insulin analogues such as Novorapid, and it serves as the primary method for administering insulin in many diabetes management programs.

The pump is programmed to release a steady basal rate of insulin throughout the day and to deliver additional bolus doses at mealtimes or when corrective insulin is required. It includes an Autoapagado alarm that can pause insulin delivery, offering an extra safety feature for users who need to temporarily stop infusion.

Clinical observations indicate that use of Bomba de Insulina can reduce glycemic variability and lipotoxicity, leading to overall improved metabolic control. By providing more precise and consistent insulin delivery, the device helps maintain tighter blood‑glucose targets and may lessen the risk of long‑term diabetes complications.

In pediatric populations, the use of Bomba de Insulina is often accompanied by recommendations for regular ketone monitoring, as children on continuous insulin infusion may be at heightened risk for ketosis if insulin delivery is interrupted. This monitoring practice supports early detection and management of potential metabolic disturbances.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical device that delivers insulin, mentioned as a potential point of failure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4f079198593c1702b56062aa87e7801a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7eabee57ef0af575162ce8d36f3589a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f3505927abeefb80af00bfabdaff7cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc1b97c88d050500f2b90b8837bd34bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfa23fc15cc4d520a32488843dbd710b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95c81e7ab8160456d9a63a9e0868205b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-276b766b8d515b1e7f388b5b7381bfbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a79d0e4d0f656bd87d2d0c4657378db4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dce7a759a9de18a4d1bcc77a071fbe2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/cgm.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx</data>
