  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Tresiba® is a long‑acting insulin degludeca medication indicated for diabetes mellitus, supplied as FlexTouch 100 U/mL pre‑filled injection.&lt;SEP&gt;Tresiba® is a clear, colorless insulin solution used to manage blood sugar levels in diabetes patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Tresiba® is an insulin medication described as containing less than 23 mg of sodium per dose and may cause doping.&lt;SEP&gt;Tresiba® is a long‑acting insulin medication used to treat diabetes and can cause various local and systemic side effects.</data>
