<node id="Beta‑Blockers">
  <data key="d0">Beta‑Blockers</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Beta‑blockers are blood‑pressure medications that may obscure recognition of hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Beta‑blockers are cardiovascular drugs that can both potentiate and diminish insulin’s glucose‑lowering action and may mask hypoglycemia signs.&lt;SEP&gt;Beta‑blockers are cardiovascular drugs that can both potentiate and diminish insulin’s glucose‑lowering effect.</data>
