  <data key="d0">São Paulo, SP</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">São Paulo, SP is the Brazilian city where the listed price of Tresiba® was shown.&lt;SEP&gt;São Paulo, SP is the Brazilian city where Novo Nordisk Farmacêutica do Brasil Ltda. has its headquarters.</data>
