  <data key="d0">Sistema de Aplicação</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The application system (e.g., pen) is the device used to deliver Tresiba subcutaneously and must have the correct label and color.&lt;SEP&gt;Sistema de aplicação is the injection system used to store insulin, attach a needle, and contain a dose counter.&lt;SEP&gt;The application system of the Levemir® FlexPen® device, including the mechanism for delivering the dose.&lt;SEP&gt;The application system comprising caps, seal, needle, dose selector, and injector button for the FlexPen.</data>
