  <data key="d2">The application system (e.g., pen) is the device used to deliver Tresiba subcutaneously and must have the correct label and color.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin application system is the set of devices required to administer Novolin® R Penfill® and must be acquired together with the needles.</data>
