<node id="Dosagem">
  <data key="d0">Dosagem</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dosagem refers to the amount of Tresiba prescribed for a patient, which may be adjusted by a médico.&lt;SEP&gt;Dosagem is the dosage schedule defined by the physician for the insulin therapy.</data>
