<node id="Blood Sugar Level">
  <data key="d0">Blood Sugar Level</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Blood Sugar Level denotes the concentration of glucose in the bloodstream, which Tresiba® can cause to decrease or increase.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood Sugar Level is the patient's glucose measurement that can rise or fall depending on the administered insulin dose.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood sugar level refers to the concentration of glucose in the bloodstream, which can rise or fall sharply if an incorrect insulin dose is administered.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e9ae5f9ffa7eff9bb36cf1a9764df3e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd25c8bd4672601d6ee40e4b7e28a69c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c24a2af0d0291fc4f4730256c420e93</data>
