  <data key="d2">Fast‑acting insulin refers to rapid‑onset insulin formulations used together with basal insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Fast‑Acting Insulin is a type of insulin that begins working quickly after injection, as described for Novolin® R FlexPen®.</data>
