<node id="RDC 60/12">
  <data key="d0">RDC 60/12</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">RDC 60/12 is a Brazilian regulatory resolution that establishes the mandatory content, structure, and format of medication package leaflets—known locally as “bulas”—and other pharmaceutical labeling documentation. The norm prescribes detailed technical and linguistic requirements that manufacturers must follow when preparing and presenting drug information, with the explicit aim of ensuring clarity, patient safety, and compliance with national health standards.

The resolution serves as the legal basis for submitting notifications of label or package‑insert alterations. It is the reference cited in regulatory filings that request the inclusion of product label text and any subsequent amendments, such as the changes documented for BASAGLAR KwikPen, APIDRA, Levemir, and other drug products. By governing the alteration process for product labeling, RDC 60/12 provides the framework through which Brazilian health authorities evaluate and approve updates to medication information, ensuring that revisions remain consistent with the established standards.

In regulatory practice, RDC 60/12 is repeatedly identified as the governing standard for bula alteration notifications, the authoritative document for label‑change notifications, and the regulatory concept that underpins the procedural requirements for modifying pharmaceutical label texts in Brazil. It is also referenced in various bulletin amendment notices, the Bulário (the official compendium of drug labels), and other product publication materials where text changes to package inserts are reported.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8993f40975183bb8e3b3398f179a00d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22df77f7bf817d736d90608e62a11d84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc9821850f5a0f8be1e4dd3fd0df6fcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a89ae12c86f6f30741a3c6330e6c11b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03d88897d0924973d84bfdd68b45230c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef35bd45e4ba8d20f4e9181011ccfcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a86b24480e35d6df7395a60371a5f2fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dd9ca6f42a5fcd7a3736eab248809ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f2feff6017b7b438ef10a0741399f08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2573669c38640b56efd6bd0668d1e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb620bf44b37187faceacd0405c4a819&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca91c7c60e1068f10c786e7ff7f21339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdeef3e06ffaa7cc0442c3d94917f0c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f41a419eaf2f65caf6c7900213887484&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed8264ddac9525305e06a64be3eeb60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3dd8cca31db67f0714ec26072996029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53644541333e5ca7f2785d80235d27e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d5bb996e52cb71f15bc8c30d1b1d321&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd04b9d444bd15536d886b2c72649da7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdee4bcd64faa476dd057e21e2525e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-759c20cc4c3fc0d3529aabc2fe7dbf99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c24a2af0d0291fc4f4730256c420e93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-813e7e990dba10e8d4147252f6547423&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f957e1a9566d1d41252f7637b06da4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6174696e253339408f72a777ad6cd3ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6419fb3ef4249d6c7e8d8a45d82efe80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-438cbb95853cdda42f2c87bcefa714dd</data>
