<node id="Texto de Bula">
  <data key="d0">Texto de Bula</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Texto de Bula is the official package insert text whose versions and legal statements are recorded in the document.&lt;SEP&gt;Texto de Bula refers to the drug's package insert that provides usage instructions and safety information.&lt;SEP&gt;The package insert text for the medication.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8993f40975183bb8e3b3398f179a00d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03d88897d0924973d84bfdd68b45230c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed8264ddac9525305e06a64be3eeb60</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786315499</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Notificação de Alteração de Texto de Bula">
  <data key="d0">Notificação de Alteração de Texto de Bula</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Notificação de Alteração de Texto de Bula is a regulatory event that records changes to a medication’s package leaflet in accordance with RDC 60/12.&lt;SEP&gt;Notificação de Alteração de Texto de Bula refers to the recorded events that modify the Texto de Bula, each identified by a protocol number and date.&lt;SEP&gt;Notificação de Alteração de Texto de Bula is a notification document that records changes to the Texto de Bula according to RDC 60/12.&lt;SEP&gt;A series of notifications documenting changes to the drug label, each linked to an ID, date, and regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Notificação de Alteração de Texto de Bula is a formal notice indicating a change to the product’s label text.&lt;SEP&gt;Notificação de Alteração de Texto de Bula is a recurring event announcing changes to the medication’s package insert, linked to RDC 60/12.&lt;SEP&gt;Notificação de Alteração de Texto de Bula is an official notice of changes to the medication’s package insert.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8993f40975183bb8e3b3398f179a00d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a89ae12c86f6f30741a3c6330e6c11b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03d88897d0924973d84bfdd68b45230c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a86b24480e35d6df7395a60371a5f2fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dd9ca6f42a5fcd7a3736eab248809ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3dd8cca31db67f0714ec26072996029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd04b9d444bd15536d886b2c72649da7</data>
