</node>
<node id="VPS">
  <data key="d0">VPS</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">VPS is an abbreviation that serves as a branding and version label on insulin‑related products and their accompanying documentation. On the product’s packaging, the VPS mark identifies the specific branding label applied to the insulin formulation, and it is also used to denote the version of the “Texto de Bula” (package insert) editions, such as “VPS/VPS,” indicating a particular revision of the informational text.

In the context of the product’s written materials, VPS functions as a section heading or label that groups a set of informational items. It appears in the documentation sections that describe usage instructions, safety information, and other regulatory details, signaling a simplified version of the label content. The abbreviation stands for “Versão de Produto Simplificada,” which translates to “Simplified Product Version,” and it is employed to differentiate this streamlined label format from other, more detailed versions.

The VPS designation is also associated with the disposable applicator pen that delivers the insulin, appearing as a recurring identifier on the pen’s labeling and related user guides. Across all instances—packaging, insert texts, documentation sections, and the applicator device—VPS consistently marks a simplified, standardized version of the product label used for the biologic drug (Produto Biológico).&lt;SEP&gt;VPS appears as a standalone term in the document, referencing a product form of the medication.&lt;SEP&gt;VPS is a label designation appearing in the medication's package insert sections.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8993f40975183bb8e3b3398f179a00d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a89ae12c86f6f30741a3c6330e6c11b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03d88897d0924973d84bfdd68b45230c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95354772f87ab3bc86a4730a1138dee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a86b24480e35d6df7395a60371a5f2fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dd9ca6f42a5fcd7a3736eab248809ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2573669c38640b56efd6bd0668d1e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb620bf44b37187faceacd0405c4a819&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f41a419eaf2f65caf6c7900213887484&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed8264ddac9525305e06a64be3eeb60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3dd8cca31db67f0714ec26072996029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f957e1a9566d1d41252f7637b06da4f</data>
