<node id="Dizeres Legais">
  <data key="d0">Dizeres Legais</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dizeres Legais are the legal statements included in the Texto de Bula.&lt;SEP&gt;Label section containing legal statements and notices.&lt;SEP&gt;Dizeres Legais are the legal statements required on the product’s label.&lt;SEP&gt;Dizeres Legais refers to the legal notice section of the APIDRA SOLOSTAR leaflet stating that the product is sold by prescription only.&lt;SEP&gt;Dizeres legais is a section of the Bula containing legal statements and notices regarding the Fiasp medication.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8993f40975183bb8e3b3398f179a00d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a86b24480e35d6df7395a60371a5f2fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dd9ca6f42a5fcd7a3736eab248809ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04b345bc26ec7f5d7c9db8c6004a50a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53644541333e5ca7f2785d80235d27e9</data>
