  <data key="d5">1786316124</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Glargine">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Glargine</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin glargine is a long‑acting basal insulin analogue produced by recombinant DNA technology that mimics the body’s endogenous basal insulin secretion. Engineered with specific amino‑acid substitutions, it delivers a relatively flat and prolonged glucose‑lowering effect, allowing once‑daily administration (typically in the morning, though some studies use a nighttime dose) to maintain steady insulin levels over 24 hours. The molecule is classified among human‑like insulin analogues and is available in a 100 U/mL formulation that serves as a standard comparator in many clinical trials, as well as in a higher‑concentration 300 U/mL formulation marketed as Toujeo. Commercially, insulin glargine is sold under the brand names Lantus® and BASAGLAR®, the latter also offered in a prefilled KwikPen device.

Its primary therapeutic role is basal insulin therapy for individuals with type 1 or type 2 diabetes, where it is used to reduce and control blood glucose levels. Clinical investigations have examined its efficacy, safety, and potential for antibody cross‑reaction, confirming its status as a widely prescribed basal insulin. In research contexts, insulin glargine frequently appears as a comparator or component of combination therapy protocols, including adult, pediatric, and pharmacodynamic studies. While its pharmacokinetic profile is described in product safety information, dedicated studies specifically addressing patients with renal or hepatic insufficiency have not been conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Glargine is a long-acting basal insulin evaluated in multiple comparative studies against NPH insulin and other analogs.&lt;SEP&gt;A long‑acting insulin analogue compared in a treat‑to‑target trial as add‑on therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin glargine is a long‑acting insulin used in flexible multiple daily insulin regimens for type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c41538e94f00eba70740ff188bcb6a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c078e8c2861146fb455f1dc3d4af2456&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d194d06ef99b3f8aa6b6542b7e93e762&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbae57922175913b7c36c594b4673fa2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c580ebfc111aa29796af1a6f15941c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3db0edd23b6b502ccbbf62bfd601ce68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce5998d1ff6a67e2e549405b16f744f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d96761d60c65f05f1530bc19b144cf1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91f290894e2d3b4216cac1721f22bb67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e50c145614f04be2319a31b74b80411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ca13e396b094f0c2f482892f220f538&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afc28422755c2c44f931bab7b6a2b477&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93623071acdcd0ba060c8826ab5a2a81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78b302b74d715df9c3b9e9db38fa4c64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-162882e6afffb0db8ae5e9153e5f1e82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77dc1a2378f763ffabe8fa379881d1cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-891989adf06518cd34c94853444495e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b18f8ab53481bf1b63fda1bb71fe80ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f5165b3185feb3c6ec93a3c0ef8d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7e6ca9bf63e843b814736c0409c70fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76eaa3af026fbb91a96f70d3502e809d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4af6b5c6f1fd844ec61928d1cce6ef9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335965</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Advertências e Precauções">
  <data key="d0">Advertências e Precauções</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Advertências e Precauções is the dedicated section of a medication’s Texto de Bula or product label that presents all safety‑related information for the drug. This portion of the label enumerates the warnings, risk statements, and precautionary measures that must be observed by patients, caregivers, and health‑care professionals when using the product. Its purpose is to alert users to potential adverse effects, contraindications, special handling instructions, and any circumstances that could compromise safety.

The Advertências e Precauções section appears in the leaflets of many pharmaceuticals, including specific examples such as Humalog Mix 25 KwikPen, Toujeo, and Fiasp. In each case, the text provides drug‑specific guidance on how to mitigate risks, what symptoms or conditions warrant medical attention, and any restrictions on use. By consolidating these warnings and precautions in a clearly labeled part of the bula, regulators ensure that critical safety information is readily accessible to anyone reading the medication’s official documentation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8993f40975183bb8e3b3398f179a00d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef35bd45e4ba8d20f4e9181011ccfcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a86b24480e35d6df7395a60371a5f2fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dd9ca6f42a5fcd7a3736eab248809ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ee5400065df79b02b6c04efc0f4854d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53644541333e5ca7f2785d80235d27e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-813e7e990dba10e8d4147252f6547423&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f957e1a9566d1d41252f7637b06da4f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786318484</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Posologia e Modo de Usar">
  <data key="d0">Posologia e Modo de Usar</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Posologia e Modo de Usar describe dosage and administration instructions in the Texto de Bula.&lt;SEP&gt;Label section detailing dosage and usage directions.&lt;SEP&gt;Posologia e Modo de Usar is an instruction section that advises medical supervision for dose changes when switching insulins.&lt;SEP&gt;Posologia e Modo de Usar outline the dosage regimen and administration instructions.&lt;SEP&gt;Posologia e modo de usar is a section of the Bula that specifies dosage instructions and how to administer the Fiasp medication.&lt;SEP&gt;Section of the label describing dosage and usage instructions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8993f40975183bb8e3b3398f179a00d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a86b24480e35d6df7395a60371a5f2fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3397508bdfddde019cb1dfdcfb352435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dd9ca6f42a5fcd7a3736eab248809ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53644541333e5ca7f2785d80235d27e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f957e1a9566d1d41252f7637b06da4f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786318547</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reações Adversas">
  <data key="d0">Reações Adversas</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
