<node id="BASAGLAR KWIKPEN">
  <data key="d0">BASAGLAR KWIKPEN</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">BASAGLAR KWIKPEN is a disposable, pre‑filled insulin pen that contains a 3 mL glass cartridge of insulin glargine, a recombinant DNA‑derived long‑acting insulin analogue. The device is designed for subcutaneous injection and can deliver doses ranging from 1 unit up to a maximum of 80 units per injection, making it suitable for both adults and children older than two years. Each pen is intended for use by a single patient and must not be mixed with other insulin products.

The pen is engineered for once‑daily administration of insulin glargine, either as monotherapy or in combination with oral antidiabetic agents. Clinical development included phase 3 trials that evaluated its pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic properties, dose‑adjustment strategies, and the consequences of missed doses. The product is listed in adverse‑reaction tables and has been referenced in packaging descriptions that emphasize its disposable nature and dosing capacity.

BASAGLAR KWIKPEN’s delivery mechanism is intended to enhance the glucose‑lowering effect of insulin glargine by providing precise, reproducible dosing. The device’s design, featuring a glass refill and a user‑friendly applicator, supports reliable subcutaneous delivery while maintaining the stability of the insulin formulation throughout its intended shelf life.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c41538e94f00eba70740ff188bcb6a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8993f40975183bb8e3b3398f179a00d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da44554b006e6bd1b841f4246a054669&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d194d06ef99b3f8aa6b6542b7e93e762&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-072d97721eef045503ec1dce0363b58e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a592aedb257bad9532268b4056ec15c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0ac8ad5968d54922b924fdb16b61d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce5998d1ff6a67e2e549405b16f744f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d96761d60c65f05f1530bc19b144cf1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db4ee43ed7cc39546184320e1328d06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-133169995b3ab942fd96f1fdfe7269ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b40c2fbad301807d9646f27d94635cb</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786309962</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
