  <data key="d0">BASAGLAR®</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">BASAGLAR® is a sterile, clear, injectable solution of 100 UI/mL insulin glargina, supplied in 2‑ or 5‑refill packs of 3 mL for subcutaneous use in adults and children over 2 years.</data>
