  <data key="d0">Eli Lilly do Brasil Ltda.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Eli Lilly do Brasil Ltda. is the Brazilian subsidiary of the global pharmaceutical company Eli Lilly. Operating out of São Paulo, the company serves as the local importer, registrant, and sponsor for several of Eli Lilly’s insulin products marketed in Brazil. It is responsible for bringing the BASAGLAR® KwikPen insulin to the Brazilian market, handling its importation, registration with health authorities, and the issuance of its instructions for use. In addition, Eli Lilly do Brasil Ltda. acts as the confidential sponsor and holder of product documentation for the Humalog® Mix 25 KwikPen and Humalog Mix 50 KwikPen, overseeing their importation and registration within Brazil. Through these roles, the subsidiary ensures that the insulin products comply with Brazilian regulatory requirements and are available to patients throughout the country.&lt;SEP&gt;Eli Lilly do Brasil Ltda. is the Brazilian subsidiary that imported and registered the insulin medication.&lt;SEP&gt;Eli Lilly do Brasil Ltda. is the pharmaceutical company responsible for the HUMULIN®R product.&lt;SEP&gt;Eli Lilly do Brasil Ltda. is the Brazilian subsidiary that imported and registered the product, with address in São Paulo.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9e62226007200589cb2143f0fb75b302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22df77f7bf817d736d90608e62a11d84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-072d97721eef045503ec1dce0363b58e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f0c10866496bbb0b388b1e5ed69901c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc9821850f5a0f8be1e4dd3fd0df6fcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a89ae12c86f6f30741a3c6330e6c11b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db832f06717859b8ba6cf7fd70aa22d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7084240a735ca2fe3b6d426e3b8c5756&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4916e2524690f1ce85df7c187f6d7a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef35bd45e4ba8d20f4e9181011ccfcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aca0b919135813e1d5b772face36989d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6419fb3ef4249d6c7e8d8a45d82efe80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-779af610d7298ce98490962cd90b4e76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-438cbb95853cdda42f2c87bcefa714dd</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
