<node id="Ácido Desoxirribonucleico">
  <data key="d0">Ácido Desoxirribonucleico</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ácido desoxirribonucleico (DNA) is the genetic material referenced as the source for recombinant insulin glargina production.&lt;SEP&gt;Ácido Desoxirribonucleico (DNA) is the molecule used to produce recombinant insulin glargine.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9e62226007200589cb2143f0fb75b302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0ac8ad5968d54922b924fdb16b61d9</data>
