  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Água para injetáveis is sterile water used as a solvent in the BASAGLAR® formulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Água para injetáveis is an excipient listed in the composition of APIDRA® SOLOSTAR®.&lt;SEP&gt;Water for injections used as a solvent in the formulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Água Para Injetáveis is the sterile water component of the HUMULIN®R solution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9e62226007200589cb2143f0fb75b302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb620bf44b37187faceacd0405c4a819&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4e1124e7acf6619a1a7c60febd5211c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-438cbb95853cdda42f2c87bcefa714dd</data>
