<node id="Via Subcutânea">
  <data key="d0">Via Subcutânea</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Via subcutânea is the subcutaneous injection method prescribed for BASAGLAR® administration.&lt;SEP&gt;Via Subcutânea is the subcutaneous injection route indicated for BASAGLAR KWIKPEN usage in adults and children.&lt;SEP&gt;Via subcutânea is the subcutaneous route prescribed for administering APIDRA SOLOSTAR.&lt;SEP&gt;Via subcutânea is the recommended route of administration for APIDRA SOLOSTAR, requiring injection into the fatty tissue under the skin.&lt;SEP&gt;Via subcutânea is the subcutaneous route of administration for Levemir® FlexPen®.&lt;SEP&gt;Via Subcutânea is the preferred subcutaneous route for injecting Humulin®R.&lt;SEP&gt;Via Subcutânea is the recommended subcutaneous injection route for HUMULIN®R.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9e62226007200589cb2143f0fb75b302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0ac8ad5968d54922b924fdb16b61d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b060d4f68031bd35dfafc19eadf1e9fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04b345bc26ec7f5d7c9db8c6004a50a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b65a4249ac93aec086cb333ed1507ea7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10dad476eb9d365159c539ced3aeec4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-438cbb95853cdda42f2c87bcefa714dd</data>
