  <data key="d2">Phase III clinical studies enrolled thousands of patients with type 1 or type 2 diabetes to compare BASAGLAR®/Lantus® with insulin NPH and assess glycemic control.&lt;SEP&gt;Phase III Clinical Study refers to the adult trial (n=2,408) that evaluated safety and efficacy of APIDRA across sexes.</data>
