  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Hidróxido de sódio is sodium hydroxide used to adjust the pH of the BASAGLAR® formulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Hidróxido de Sódio is an excipient listed in the composition of APIDRA® SOLOSTAR®.&lt;SEP&gt;A sodium hydroxide excipient included in the injectable formulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Hidróxido De Sódio is a base added to adjust pH in the Humulin®R formulation.</data>
