  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The immune system is referenced as the overall biological system involved in immune responses.&lt;SEP&gt;The immune system is the body's defense system that can mistakenly attack pancreatic insulin‑producing cells in type 1 diabetes.</data>
