  <data key="d2">Dysgeusia is an adverse reaction of altered taste reported for Lantus®.&lt;SEP&gt;Dysgeusia is a taste disturbance listed among adverse events.&lt;SEP&gt;Dysgeusia is an altered taste sensation reported as a nervous system adverse event in insulin studies.</data>
