<node id="Peripheral Edema">
  <data key="d0">Peripheral Edema</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Peripheral edema is a specific type of edema noted.&lt;SEP&gt;Peripheral edema is swelling reported as a side effect of combined insulin and tiazolidinedione therapy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-22df77f7bf817d736d90608e62a11d84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d10a1f849386df540104c79e33a7b242</data>
