  <data key="d5">1786316122</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Localized Cutaneous Amyloidosis">
  <data key="d0">Localized Cutaneous Amyloidosis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Localized cutaneous amyloidosis is a skin disorder characterized by the deposition of amyloid protein within the dermis at sites of repeated subcutaneous injections. The condition most commonly arises where insulin is administered, but it can also occur with other injectable therapies, such as the BASAGLAR KWIKPEN. Repeated injections into the same area, especially without proper site rotation, increase the risk of developing this localized amyloid accumulation, which manifests as a palpable, sometimes indurated, lesion at the injection site.

Clinically, localized cutaneous amyloidosis is considered an adverse skin reaction rather than a systemic amyloid disease. It is regarded as a potential complication to be avoided when planning injection site selection, prompting healthcare providers to emphasize proper rotation techniques and to monitor injection sites for early signs of amyloid deposition.&lt;SEP&gt;Localized cutaneous amyloidosis is a deposition of amyloid protein in the skin at insulin injection sites.&lt;SEP&gt;Localized Cutaneous Amyloidosis is a skin condition observed at injection sites following repeated insulin administrations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-22df77f7bf817d736d90608e62a11d84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3db0edd23b6b502ccbbf62bfd601ce68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d96761d60c65f05f1530bc19b144cf1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ca13e396b094f0c2f482892f220f538&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd94288932ad6675a1de2b46b3fd9128&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8934881ec5ab7cfeb836126b3f0e8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ee5400065df79b02b6c04efc0f4854d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c95471c4c993fa3a499f99443ee7c922&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-779af610d7298ce98490962cd90b4e76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ac99e7359716e2cecc2ec93159218b6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786319704</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
