  <data key="d0">Hemoglobin A1c (HbA1c)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glycated hemoglobin measurement used to assess long‑term glucose control in both study arms.&lt;SEP&gt;HbA1c is a laboratory measure of average blood glucose over several months.&lt;SEP&gt;A measure of average blood glucose over months, reported as a change after the study period.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29e9c7394777a2e452b57285541f75f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-277e136948d5572acf031988fd092dce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-127dc0e8b8b960bfd1fce3df4f590120</data>
