  <data key="d2">BASAGLAR KwikPen is an insulin pen used for subcutaneous insulin administration.&lt;SEP&gt;A disposable pre‑filled insulin pen containing 300 units of insulin glargina, capable of dispensing up to 80 units per injection.&lt;SEP&gt;BASAGLAR KwikPen is a registered insulin pen used for insulin administration, complying with dose precision standards.</data>
