  <data key="d0">Infecções</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Infections are potential risks prevented by using a new needle for each insulin injection.&lt;SEP&gt;Infections mentioned as concurrent conditions that raise insulin needs.</data>
