<node id="Visor De Dose">
  <data key="d0">Visor De Dose</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Visor De Dose is the display on the pen that shows the selected number of insulin units.&lt;SEP&gt;The dose display window on the pen that shows the selected units.&lt;SEP&gt;The dose display that shows the selected dose number, indicating when the full dose has been delivered.&lt;SEP&gt;Visor de Dose is the dose‑display window on the KWIKPEN.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fec70e5369024cec08c0820152befe39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95354772f87ab3bc86a4730a1138dee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d156e12ba8d9418249ea309aab0552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aba4eb027a027fb1ad6e0105b97cfa3</data>
