  <data key="d5">1786310734</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lacre De Borracha">
  <data key="d0">Lacre De Borracha</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Lacre De Borracha is the rubber seal on the pen that is cleaned with cotton soaked in alcohol before use.&lt;SEP&gt;The rubber seal of the pen that is cleaned with alcohol‑moistened cotton.&lt;SEP&gt;Lacre de Borracha is the rubber seal that secures the KWIKPEN.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fec70e5369024cec08c0820152befe39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95354772f87ab3bc86a4730a1138dee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d156e12ba8d9418249ea309aab0552</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310733</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Suporte Do Refil">
  <data key="d0">Suporte Do Refil</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Suporte Do Refil is the pen’s refill holder that is tapped to move air bubbles to the top of the cartridge.&lt;SEP&gt;The support of the insulin cartridge that is tapped to move air bubbles to the top.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fec70e5369024cec08c0820152befe39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d156e12ba8d9418249ea309aab0552</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310752</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Antidiabéticos Orais">
  <data key="d0">Antidiabéticos Orais</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Antidiabéticos orais are oral antidiabetic agents combined with either BASAGLAR or Lantus® in the trial.&lt;SEP&gt;Antidiabéticos Orais are oral diabetes medicines that can increase the glucose‑lowering effect of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Oral antidiabetic drugs can enhance the glucose‑lowering effect of insulin, raising hypoglycemia risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Antidiabéticos Orais are oral glucose‑lowering medications used alongside prandial insulin in the trials.&lt;SEP&gt;Antidiabéticos orais are oral medications that can be combined with Levemir® in the treatment of type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Antidiabéticos Orais are oral diabetes medications known to reduce the amount of insulin a patient needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Antidiabéticos Orais are oral diabetes medications that can reduce a patient’s insulin requirements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c078e8c2861146fb455f1dc3d4af2456&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17844a4a12e6c05ba2d7b5f54b0f9bd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b40c2fbad301807d9646f27d94635cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-228b9514d97e62787d4a60078f932ceb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00cf434060561bb7d46b6ce50f095c91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4615ca664e7ff898d8c5929cbc79e7d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6101c469482b48e341b4095a54907fd</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786318516</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Modelo ANCOVA">
  <data key="d0">Modelo ANCOVA</data>
