<node id="Tabela 3">
  <data key="d0">Tabela 3</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Tabela 3 presents the 24‑week HbA1c results for BASAGLAR + AO versus Lantus® + AO in type 2 diabetes adults.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabela 3 is a table summarizing hypoglycemic episodes in the clinical studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Table presenting baseline and outcome data for adult type‑2 diabetes patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabela 3 presents the numerical outcomes of the type 2 diabetes study, including A1C changes and insulin doses.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabela 3 provides the formulas for calculating fator de sensibilidade and relação insulina/carboidrato.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabela 3 is a table within the guideline that lists the recommended frequency of DM2 screening for different clinical situations.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabela 3 is a table referenced in recommendation R14 that outlines the re‑evaluation schedule for diabetes screening.</data>
