  <data key="d2">Tabela 4 summarizes pediatric type 1 diabetes study data referenced in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabela 4 presents baseline and outcome metrics (A1C, insulin doses, hypoglycemia) for the three treatment regimens in the APIDRA 12‑Week Study.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabela 4 presents the numerical outcomes of the type 1 diabetes study, including A1C changes and insulin doses.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabela 4 presents detailed results such as insulin doses and A1C changes for each treatment arm.</data>
