<node id="Sodium Retention">
  <data key="d0">Sodium Retention</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Sodium retention is fluid accumulation that may occur after intensified insulin therapy and metabolic improvement.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium retention is an adverse effect where insulin therapy can cause fluid accumulation, especially after metabolic control improves.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d194d06ef99b3f8aa6b6542b7e93e762&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e50c145614f04be2319a31b74b80411</data>
