  <data key="d0">Lipohypertrphia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Lipohypertrphia is a localized thickening of subcutaneous tissue reported as an adverse reaction in insulin‑treated patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d194d06ef99b3f8aa6b6542b7e93e762</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf</data>
