  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Phase 3 clinical study compared BASAGLAR and Lantus® in patients with type 1 and type 2 diabetes, reporting frequencies of adverse reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Phase 3 clinical study is a method of evaluating the safety and efficacy of insulin products such as BASAGLAR KWIKPEN and Lantus®.</data>
