<node id="Medication Error">
  <data key="d0">Medication Error</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Medication error refers to the accidental administration of an incorrect insulin formulation, such as giving short‑acting insulin instead of insulin glargine.&lt;SEP&gt;Medication error describes mistakes such as administering the wrong insulin type or wrong dose, highlighted in the prevention guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d194d06ef99b3f8aa6b6542b7e93e762&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3397508bdfddde019cb1dfdcfb352435</data>
