  <data key="d2">Medical Professional is the healthcare provider who demonstrates insulin injection technique and gives guidance.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical professional (doctor or nurse) provides the injection technique guidance for using the pen.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical professional is a qualified healthcare provider who determines insulin pump settings for an individual.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical professional is a healthcare provider who may give specific instructions about insulin management during illness.</data>
