<node id="Ambient Temperature Storage">
  <data key="d0">Ambient Temperature Storage</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Ambient temperature storage refers to keeping BASAGLAR KWIKPEN at 15 °C to 30 °C after the pen has been opened.&lt;SEP&gt;Ambient Temperature Storage refers to keeping the in‑use pen at 15 °C to 30 °C away from heat and light.&lt;SEP&gt;Ambient temperature storage specifies that the pen should be kept at room temperature for at least one hour before first use.&lt;SEP&gt;Ambient Temperature Storage describes the condition that an opened Apidra Solostar pen may be kept at room temperature up to 30 °C for up to 28 days.&lt;SEP&gt;Ambient temperature storage allows Humulin R to be kept at 15°C to 30°C for up to 28 days after opening.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0b9c41c968bcc1d46185583661e8f989&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d96761d60c65f05f1530bc19b144cf1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ee5400065df79b02b6c04efc0f4854d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dc2313c92b2af4132faaa4d41449eef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fa819f7e1e42eb688d4894dc3ca7e64</data>
