<node id="External Cap">
  <data key="d0">External Cap</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">External Cap is the protective piece that covers the needle on the insulin pen after injection.&lt;SEP&gt;External Cap is the outer cap placed on the needle to unscrew it from the SoloStar.&lt;SEP&gt;The external cap is the outer protective cover of the needle that is removed after injection for safe removal.&lt;SEP&gt;The external cap is the protective cover that holds the needle when not in use and facilitates safe disposal.&lt;SEP&gt;The external cap covers the needle when not in use and is removed and replaced during needle changes.</data>
