  <data key="d0">Asparagine</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Asparagine is the amino acid originally present at position A21 of human insulin before being replaced in insulin glargine.&lt;SEP&gt;Asparagine is an amino acid originally present at position A21 in human insulin, which is replaced in Insulina Glargina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-02780a8bc1d372cc47e0ccf2eaab1a99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a279eef99c9c70338c74ffc7b4e260e</data>
