</node>
<node id="Questionário de Satisfação do Tratamento de Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Questionário de Satisfação do Tratamento de Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The questionnaire is a survey instrument used to assess treatment satisfaction in diabetes patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Questionário de Satisfação do Tratamento de Diabetes is the questionnaire that measured diabetes treatment satisfaction.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a72472938feb27131681a1591081e8c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b916f29e047f8579110cf5da3fd73847</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310021</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Witthaus et al. 2001">
  <data key="d0">Witthaus et al. 2001</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Witthaus et al. 2001 is a cited study reporting higher satisfaction with glargine compared with NPH insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a72472938feb27131681a1591081e8c1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310021</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Peso Corpóreo">
  <data key="d0">Peso Corpóreo</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Peso Corpóreo refers to body weight change reported as a 2.2 kg difference between treatment groups.&lt;SEP&gt;Peso Corpóreo is body weight, reported as the average change between treatment groups.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a72472938feb27131681a1591081e8c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b916f29e047f8579110cf5da3fd73847</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310021</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mortalidade por Todas as Causas">
  <data key="d0">Mortalidade por Todas as Causas</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Mortalidade por Todas as Causas is a secondary outcome measuring death from any cause in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;Mortalidade por todas as causas, all‑cause death, a secondary outcome.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a72472938feb27131681a1591081e8c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b30ff3c650cf7cb71a3cf6e99f2c581</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313624</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Desfecho Microvascular Composto">
  <data key="d0">Desfecho Microvascular Composto</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Desfecho Microvascular Composto is a secondary composite outcome involving microvascular events.&lt;SEP&gt;Desfecho microvascular composto, a composite microvascular outcome comprising laser photocoagulation, vitrectomy, diabetic retinopathy blindness, progressive albuminuria, serum creatinine doubling, or need for renal transplant.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a72472938feb27131681a1591081e8c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b30ff3c650cf7cb71a3cf6e99f2c581</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313625</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Desenvolvimento de Diabetes Tipo 2">
  <data key="d0">Desenvolvimento de Diabetes Tipo 2</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Desenvolvimento de Diabetes Tipo 2 is a secondary outcome tracking new cases of type 2 diabetes among participants.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a72472938feb27131681a1591081e8c1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310021</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Evento Cardiovascular Primário">
  <data key="d0">Evento Cardiovascular Primário</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Evento Cardiovascular Primário is a composite primary outcome of cardiovascular death, non‑fatal myocardial infarction, or non‑fatal stroke.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a72472938feb27131681a1591081e8c1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310021</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Revascularização">
  <data key="d0">Revascularização</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Revascularização refers to cardiac, carotid, or peripheral revascularization procedures included in the secondary composite outcome.&lt;SEP&gt;Revascularização, cardiac, carotid or peripheral revascularization procedures included in the primary composite endpoint.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a72472938feb27131681a1591081e8c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b30ff3c650cf7cb71a3cf6e99f2c581</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313624</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hospitalização por Insuficiência Cardíaca">
  <data key="d0">Hospitalização por Insuficiência Cardíaca</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hospitalização por Insuficiência Cardíaca is a component of the secondary composite outcome assessing heart‑failure admissions.&lt;SEP&gt;Hospitalização por Insuficiência Cardíaca is hospitalization for heart failure, evaluated as a secondary outcome.&lt;SEP&gt;Hospitalização por insuficiência cardíaca, admission for heart‑failure included in the primary composite endpoint.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a72472938feb27131681a1591081e8c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b916f29e047f8579110cf5da3fd73847&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b30ff3c650cf7cb71a3cf6e99f2c581</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313623</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Early Treatment Diabetic Retinopathy Study (ETDRS)">
  <data key="d0">Early Treatment Diabetic Retinopathy Study (ETDRS)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Early Treatment Diabetic Retinopathy Study (ETDRS) is the original clinical study that provided the classification protocol used for grading diabetic retinopathy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a72472938feb27131681a1591081e8c1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310021</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="População Pré‑Protocolo">
  <data key="d0">População Pré‑Protocolo</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">População Pré‑Protocolo refers to the primary analysis cohort evaluated for retinopathy progression in the Lantus® versus NPH study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a72472938feb27131681a1591081e8c1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310021</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="População Intenção ao Tratamento (ITT)">
  <data key="d0">População Intenção ao Tratamento (ITT)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">População Intenção ao Tratamento (ITT) denotes the intention‑to‑treat cohort analyzed for efficacy and safety outcomes in the Lantus® versus NPH study.</data>
