<node id="ORIGIN Study">
  <data key="d0">ORIGIN Study</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">ORIGIN Study (Outcome Reduction with Initial Glargine Intervention) is an international multicenter randomized 2×2 factorial clinical trial evaluating insulin glargine.&lt;SEP&gt;ORIGIN Study, a 6‑year randomized clinical trial evaluating Insulina glargina 100 U/mL versus Tratamento padrão.&lt;SEP&gt;A clinical trial with an average follow‑up of ~6.2 years that compared Toujeo (insulin glargine) with standard glucose‑lowering therapy regarding cancer, cardiovascular, and mortality outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b916f29e047f8579110cf5da3fd73847&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-863286c185f2a62e5b28d7e4577a1088&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b30ff3c650cf7cb71a3cf6e99f2c581</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313612</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glicose de Jejum Alterada (GJA)">
  <data key="d0">Glicose de Jejum Alterada (GJA)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glicose de Jejum Alterada (GJA) is impaired fasting glucose, an eligibility criterion for the ORIGIN Study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b916f29e047f8579110cf5da3fd73847</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tolerância à Glicose Alterada (TGA)">
  <data key="d0">Tolerância à Glicose Alterada (TGA)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Tolerância à Glicose Alterada (TGA) is impaired glucose tolerance, an eligibility criterion for the ORIGIN Study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b916f29e047f8579110cf5da3fd73847</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
