  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Tabela 7 presents the hazard results of the ORIGIN Study.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabela 7 presents the clinical study adverse reaction frequencies for Fiasp® according to MedDRA System Organ Class.</data>
