<node id="Metformina">
  <data key="d0">Metformina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Metformina is the Spanish name for metformin, an oral biguanide antidiabetic medication. It is classified as a hypoglycemic drug that lowers blood glucose by decreasing hepatic glucose production and improving peripheral insulin sensitivity.  

In the clinical studies referenced, Metformina is consistently reported as part of combination therapy. It is administered together with various insulin formulations, including basal insulin (Lantus®), rapid‑acting prandial insulin analogues, and ultra‑rapid insulin (Fiasp®). The drug is also combined with other injectable agents such as the long‑acting insulin analog Levemir® and the GLP‑1 receptor agonist liraglutide.  

These descriptions indicate that Metformina is used as an adjunct to insulin‑based regimens to achieve tighter glycemic control in patients with diabetes, reflecting its role as a cornerstone oral agent in multi‑drug treatment strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Oral antidiabetic drug that improves insulin sensitivity, reduces appetite, and may induce ovulation in SOP patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d87cbe9886e7203b6e7b26c85d60cb9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87576da8269707f5f8d929b71470e023&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97208e231aa338c60205244ac12e0492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3553e80da33ab48fb157ac9ff75436eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78f859befb6230d94e8af9144794e0d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-228b9514d97e62787d4a60078f932ceb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff211ed5ca723fa2074871af58a4eb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e7e47ca39ac4f4975da2b4b7e6d3c36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3059be019782459a72891cea5e0434ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7eabee57ef0af575162ce8d36f3589a5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321217</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
