  <data key="d2">Sulfonamide antibiotics are a class of antimicrobial agents that can reduce insulin efficacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfonamide antibiotics are antimicrobial agents that may enhance insulin‑mediated hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfonamide antibiotics are antimicrobial agents that can increase insulin‑induced hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulfonamide antibiotics are drugs that intensify the insulin‑induced reduction of blood glucose.</data>
