<node id="Diuretics">
  <data key="d0">Diuretics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diuretics are a class of medications that may decrease insulin action.&lt;SEP&gt;Diuretics are medications that increase urine output and can reduce insulin efficacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Diuretics are medications that promote fluid loss and can reduce insulin’s hypoglycemic effect.&lt;SEP&gt;Diuretics are drugs that reduce the insulin‑induced reduction of blood glucose.</data>
