  <data key="d2">Epinephrine is a sympathomimetic hormone listed as decreasing insulin effect.&lt;SEP&gt;Epinephrine is a sympathomimetic hormone that can reduce insulin‑mediated hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Epinephrine is a catecholamine that can antagonize insulin‑induced hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Epinephrine is a sympathomimetic drug that reduces the insulin‑induced reduction of blood glucose.</data>
