<node id="Estrogens">
  <data key="d0">Estrogens</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Estrogens are female sex hormones that may reduce insulin efficacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Estrogens are female sex hormones that may reduce the effectiveness of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Estrogens are female sex hormones that can decrease insulin’s hypoglycemic action.&lt;SEP&gt;Estrogens are hormones that reduce the insulin‑induced reduction of blood glucose.</data>
