  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Reserpine is a sympatholytic agent that can diminish the visible signs of hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Reserpine is a sympatholytic medication that can reduce the observable signs of hypoglycemia.</data>
