  <data key="d0">Medicinal Plants</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Medicinal plants are natural products for which no interaction study with BASAGLAR has been conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;Medicinal Plants are botanical substances potentially interacting with BASAGLAR KWIKPEN, though no studies were conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;Medicinal plants are herbal substances whose interaction with Humulin R has not been investigated.&lt;SEP&gt;Medicinal plants are botanical substances whose interaction with Humulin R has not been studied.</data>
