  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Other Insulins are insulin products that must not be mixed or diluted with BASAGLAR.&lt;SEP&gt;Other Insulins refers to various insulin types (regular, NPH, short‑acting, long‑acting, animal or human‑derived) discussed in the context of switching to Toujeo 300 U/mL.&lt;SEP&gt;Other insulins refer to insulin products other than APIDRA that must not be mixed with it.&lt;SEP&gt;Other insulins are insulin products distinct from Fiasp® that patients must differentiate to avoid accidental mixing.&lt;SEP&gt;Other Insulins denotes insulin products other than Novolin® R Penfill that could be mixed accidentally.</data>
