<node id="Glicemia de Jejum">
  <data key="d0">Glicemia de Jejum</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Glicemia de Jejum (fasting glucose) is a biomarker measured to assess glucose control in the trials.&lt;SEP&gt;Glicemia de Jejum is the fasting blood glucose measurement referenced in the study parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;Fasting glucose levels that are improved when using Levemir® compared with NPH insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Glicemia de jejum is the fasting blood glucose level, with target ranges defined in treatment goals.&lt;SEP&gt;Fasting plasma glucose measured after 8‑12 hours of caloric abstention.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-87576da8269707f5f8d929b71470e023&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78f859befb6230d94e8af9144794e0d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a49c8461f43dc12d7df9c921efeb0465&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12999315830b302d973dd1908eab1e12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2faebf8275a86cd8d9995c769b0926a3</data>
