  <data key="d0">Tabela 1</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Tabela 1 is a table summarizing outcomes (glycated hemoglobin, fasting glucose, nighttime and severe hypoglycemia) for adult Diabetes Tipo 1 and Tipo 2 patients under various insulin regimens.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabela 1 presents clinical efficacy data from the APIDRA Diabetes Tipo 1 Study.&lt;SEP&gt;A table listing the specific factors and conditions that may cause false high or low capillary glucose readings.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabela 1 classifies hypoglycemia levels with corresponding glucose ranges and descriptions.&lt;SEP&gt;Tabela 1 summarizes individualized glycemic targets for different patient groups.</data>
