<node id="Regime Basal‑Bolus">
  <data key="d0">Regime Basal‑Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Regime Basal‑Bolus is an insulin therapy approach combining a basal insulin (once or twice daily) with prandial insulin before meals.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin therapy schedule that combines basal and bolus doses to match food intake and activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Regime Basal‑Bolus is a dosing strategy combining long‑acting (basal) insulin like Levemir® with rapid‑acting (bolus) insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-87576da8269707f5f8d929b71470e023&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45ee3dcb366c1301c9fb1d2ce9f323c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a68ba1e8cc1defda76cde0eff9592e6</data>
