  <data key="d5">1786317598</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Clinical Trial">
  <data key="d0">Clinical Trial</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The clinical trial is an open‑label, controlled study of 24 weeks with a 28‑week extension evaluating glycemic reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;Study designed to prevent or delay DM1 Phase 3, involving candidate inclusion based on screening.&lt;SEP&gt;Clinical trials are research studies considered for delaying development of clinical diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Clinical Trial is a study that compared premeal insulin aspart, repaglinide, and oral placebo in cystic fibrosis patients with diabetes or IGT.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7a592aedb257bad9532268b4056ec15c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cf24d486949a568d61c1de206cd3e14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6601fea85bfbb9f20040c70b7e21695d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cdf6af658e42c2f4f7dca5e4dbdd3db</data>
