  <data key="d0">Instruções De Uso</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Written usage instructions that accompany the BASAGLAR KWIKPEN product and must be followed carefully.&lt;SEP&gt;Instruções de Uso are the usage instructions provided for the KWIKPEN.</data>
