  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Bulário RDC 60/12 is the official publication that compiles the regulatory text of RDC 60/12.&lt;SEP&gt;Bulário RDC 60/12 is the regulatory bulletin where notifications of changes to the product’s label (texto de bula) are published.&lt;SEP&gt;Bulário RDC 60/12 is the regulatory bulletin where the Texto de Bula and its alteration notifications are published.&lt;SEP&gt;Bulário RDC 60/12 is a regulatory publication that contains the official labeling and amendment notices for the insulin product.&lt;SEP&gt;Bulário RDC 60/12 is the regulatory bulletin where label alterations are published.</data>
