</node>
<node id="Pharmacokinetics">
  <data key="d0">Pharmacokinetics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pharmacokinetics describes how a drug is absorbed, distributed, metabolized, and eliminated in the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharmacokinetics denotes the study of drug absorption, distribution, metabolism, and excretion, discussed throughout the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharmacokinetics is the study of drug absorption, distribution, metabolism, and excretion, referenced throughout the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharmacokinetics describes the absorption and disposition of insulin analogs, studied for glargine and detemir.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharmacokinetics refers to the study of drug absorption, distribution, metabolism, and excretion, examined in the AFRESA study.&lt;SEP&gt;The study of drug absorption, distribution, metabolism, and excretion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bf25fca295be60e28b7c7d3103f722fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0e34bef478ed432c8de7ef68dc9025&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649c4ac605d59d792f3d5f8952251312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7e6ca9bf63e843b814736c0409c70fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-161a201d846100f42e643139469a1e6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c83accc14a3b482690949ff04716a0aa</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Inhaling medicines_ delivering drugs to the body through the lungs _ Nature Reviews Drug Discovery.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377257</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pharmacodynamics">
  <data key="d0">Pharmacodynamics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pharmacodynamics refers to the biochemical and physiological effects of a drug and its mechanism of action.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharmacodynamics refers to the drug’s effects on the body, evaluated for APIDRA in various populations.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharmacodynamics investigates the physiological effects of inhaled insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharmacodynamics is the study of drug effects on the body, referenced in relation to inhaled glucocorticoids.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharmacodynamics refers to the biological effects of insulin analogs, evaluated in comparative studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bf25fca295be60e28b7c7d3103f722fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d0e34bef478ed432c8de7ef68dc9025&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649c4ac605d59d792f3d5f8952251312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61a59544bbd02c2c82b13c7808f72c73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7e6ca9bf63e843b814736c0409c70fb</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Inhaling medicines_ delivering drugs to the body through the lungs _ Nature Reviews Drug Discovery.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786331410</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glucose Clamp Study">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Clamp Study</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose clamp study is a research method used to assess insulin absorption and activity profiles in volunteers and patients.&lt;SEP&gt;A glucose clamp study is a clinical research procedure used to assess insulin absorption and activity by maintaining constant blood glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose Clamp Study is a research technique that measures insulin absorption and activity in healthy volunteers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bf25fca295be60e28b7c7d3103f722fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb0fb965e5ddd796999856ca376d4b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2416b3e5e8ebc96cdb451a794fc78e3</data>
