<node id="Two‑Phase Absorption">
  <data key="d0">Two‑Phase Absorption</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Two‑Phase Absorption describes the initial rapid absorption followed by a prolonged later absorption observed with biphasic insulin formulations.</data>
