<node id="Humalog Mix 25 KwikPen">
  <data key="d0">Humalog Mix 25 KwikPen</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Humalog Mix 25 KwikPen is a preparation containing insulin lispro and insulin lispro protamine, delivered as a clear liquid for subcutaneous injection.&lt;SEP&gt;Humalog Mix 25 KwikPen is a marketed formulation containing Insulina Lispro and a suspension of Insulina Lispro Protamina, used for diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Humalog Mix 25 KwikPen is a premixed insulin product containing insulin lispro protamine, prescribed for diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Humalog Mix 25 KwikPen is an insulin medication delivered in a disposable KwikPen device for subcutaneous injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fb0fb965e5ddd796999856ca376d4b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-518838d3c8e8110567b1891b704bfef9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef35bd45e4ba8d20f4e9181011ccfcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a247846b9ec5d44d0bcbe6c5f15599f8</data>
