  <data key="d2">Insulin lispro protamine is the protamine‑bound suspension of insulin lispro providing intermediate‑acting glucose reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin lispro protamine is a protamine‑bound form of insulin lispro included in the Humalog Mix 50 KwikPen to prolong its action.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fb0fb965e5ddd796999856ca376d4b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7084240a735ca2fe3b6d426e3b8c5756</data>
