<node id="Pharmacokinetic Properties">
  <data key="d0">Pharmacokinetic Properties</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pharmacokinetic properties describe the absorption rate, peak serum concentrations, distribution volume, and elimination characteristics of insulin formulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharmacokinetic properties describe the absorption, distribution, and exposure timeline of insulin after administration.&lt;SEP&gt;Set of absorption, distribution, metabolism, and elimination characteristics described for Levemir®.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharmacokinetic Properties describe how Levemir® is absorbed, distributed, metabolized, and eliminated.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharmacokinetic properties describe the absorption, distribution, metabolism, and elimination profile of insulin preparations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fb0fb965e5ddd796999856ca376d4b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f4f01a72f35d6db3ff333e64f8400ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef15154a94043650617b3b24d8146a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f36263c657ad99a80e578ac49a333d5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2378c57a337d1ce7103c7086ebba76ac</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786318541</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pharmacodynamic Properties">
  <data key="d0">Pharmacodynamic Properties</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pharmacodynamic properties refer to the onset, peak effect, and duration of glucose‑lowering activity of insulin agents.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharmacodynamic Properties refer to the effects of Levemir® on the body, including glucose regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharmacodynamic properties describe the glucose‑lowering effect of insulin through receptor binding and inhibition of hepatic glucose production.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fb0fb965e5ddd796999856ca376d4b9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef15154a94043650617b3b24d8146a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2378c57a337d1ce7103c7086ebba76ac</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786318541</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin LM">
  <data key="d0">Insulin LM</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin LM is a formulation whose administration results in better post‑prandial glucose control, closer to physiological response than insulin human 70/30 or NPH insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fb0fb965e5ddd796999856ca376d4b9d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310711</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NPL">
  <data key="d0">NPL</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">NPL is the abbreviation used for insulin lispro protamine in the study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fb0fb965e5ddd796999856ca376d4b9d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310711</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Humalog Mix 25 Kwikpen">
  <data key="d0">Humalog Mix 25 Kwikpen</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Humalog Mix 25 Kwikpen is a sterile injectable insulin lispro suspension supplied in a disposable pen for subcutaneous use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310712</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Thyroid Hormone Replacement Therapy">
  <data key="d0">Thyroid Hormone Replacement Therapy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Thyroid hormone replacement therapy provides thyroid hormones and can increase insulin needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Thyroid hormone replacement therapy is a hyperglycemic treatment that can increase the insulin requirements of a patient.&lt;SEP&gt;Thyroid hormone replacement therapy is a treatment that can increase insulin requirements in patients on Humulin R.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd94288932ad6675a1de2b46b3fd9128&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577779892c0d463cd6bb1966b8a8ce2d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786319732</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Angiotensin‑Converting Enzyme Inhibitors">
  <data key="d0">Angiotensin‑Converting Enzyme Inhibitors</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Angiotensin‑converting enzyme inhibitors are blood‑pressure medicines that can reduce insulin requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Angiotensin‑converting enzyme inhibitors are medications that can decrease the insulin requirements of a patient.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd94288932ad6675a1de2b46b3fd9128</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310715</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Refrigerated Storage">
  <data key="d0">Refrigerated Storage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Refrigerated storage (2 °C to 8 °C) is required for sealed Humalog Mix 25 Kwikpen.&lt;SEP&gt;Refrigerated Storage denotes the requirement to keep Apidra Solostar between 2 °C and 8 °C before first use.&lt;SEP&gt;Refrigerated storage requires keeping Humulin R at 2°C to 8°C, protected from light and heat.&lt;SEP&gt;Closed insulin storage condition requiring temperature between 2 °C and 8 °C.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dc2313c92b2af4132faaa4d41449eef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fa819f7e1e42eb688d4894dc3ca7e64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7e6ef38db0b62d161b13473af47d738</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786330480</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Room Temperature Storage">
  <data key="d0">Room Temperature Storage</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Room temperature storage (15 °C to 30 °C) is permitted for opened Humalog Mix 25 Kwikpen for up to 28 days.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310717</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cutaneous Localized Amyloidosis">
  <data key="d0">Cutaneous Localized Amyloidosis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cutaneous localized amyloidosis is a skin disorder that can develop from repeated injections at the same site.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310718</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Disease Transmission">
  <data key="d0">Disease Transmission</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Disease transmission refers to the potential spread of infections, mitigated by using a single pen per patient.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310719</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Humalog Pen Applicator">
  <data key="d0">Humalog Pen Applicator</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Humalog Pen Applicator is a disposable pen device used to deliver Humalog Mix 25 Kwikpen subcutaneously.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310719</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Compatible Needle">
  <data key="d0">Compatible Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Compatible needles are syringe needles designed to fit the Humalog Pen Applicator for subcutaneous insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310720</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Herbal Products">
  <data key="d0">Herbal Products</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Herbal products (fitoterápicos) are plant‑based medicines that may interact with other drugs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786310721</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
