</node>
<node id="Humalog Mix 50 KwikPen">
  <data key="d0">Humalog Mix 50 KwikPen</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Humalog® Mix 50 KwikPen is an injectable insulin suspension containing 50% insulin lispro and 50% insulin lispro protamine, provided in a disposable injector pen with a 3 mL glass cartridge delivering 100 units per mL.&lt;SEP&gt;Humalog Mix 50 KwikPen is a mixed insulin formulation containing insulin lispro with a rapid onset, indicated for diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Humalog Mix 50 KwikPen is a disposable insulin pen formulation referenced throughout the text for subcutaneous administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7084240a735ca2fe3b6d426e3b8c5756&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2416b3e5e8ebc96cdb451a794fc78e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aca0b919135813e1d5b772face36989d</data>
