  <data key="d0">Glass Cartridge 3 mL</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The glass cartridge holds 3 mL of insulin suspension within the disposable injector pen supplied with Humalog Mix 50 KwikPen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7084240a735ca2fe3b6d426e3b8c5756</data>
