  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">HUMALOG® MIX KWIKPEN is a 100 units/mL injectable insulin solution presented in a 3 mL pen, referenced in the product pages.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-95354772f87ab3bc86a4730a1138dee9</data>
