  <data key="d0">KWIKPEN</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">KWIKPEN is a disposable pre‑filled pen containing 300 units of insulin U‑100, delivering 1 unit per dose and allowing injections of 1 to 60 units.&lt;SEP&gt;KWIKPEN is an insulin delivery pen referenced throughout the instructions for use and troubleshooting.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-95354772f87ab3bc86a4730a1138dee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4916e2524690f1ce85df7c187f6d7a7</data>
