  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Notificação de Alteração de Texto de Bula is a notification announcing changes to the product’s label text, appearing on specific dates.&lt;SEP&gt;Notificação De Alteração De Texto De Bula is the formal notification of changes to the product’s label as required by regulatory resolution RDC 60/12.&lt;SEP&gt;Notificação De Alteração De Texto De Bula is an event documenting changes to medication package leaflets.</data>
