<node id="Botão De Dose">
  <data key="d0">Botão De Dose</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The dose button on the pen used to select the number of insulin units.&lt;SEP&gt;The dose button on the pen that is pressed to deliver the selected insulin amount.&lt;SEP&gt;Botão de Dose is the dose‑setting button on the KWIKPEN.&lt;SEP&gt;Botão De Dose is the dose button on the pen that may be difficult to push and can indicate needle clogging.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-95354772f87ab3bc86a4730a1138dee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4916e2524690f1ce85df7c187f6d7a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d156e12ba8d9418249ea309aab0552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aba4eb027a027fb1ad6e0105b97cfa3</data>
