  <data key="d0">Tampa Da Caneta</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The cap of the insulin pen that is removed to access the pen.&lt;SEP&gt;Tampa da Caneta is the cap that covers the KWIKPEN.&lt;SEP&gt;Tampa Da Caneta is the cap of the pen that can be removed and realigned during troubleshooting.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-95354772f87ab3bc86a4730a1138dee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4916e2524690f1ce85df7c187f6d7a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d156e12ba8d9418249ea309aab0552</data>
