  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Registro 1.1260.0179 is the regulatory registration number listed for the insulin product.&lt;SEP&gt;Registro 1.1260.0179 is the registration number listed for the KWIKPEN product.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b4916e2524690f1ce85df7c187f6d7a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef35bd45e4ba8d20f4e9181011ccfcd</data>
