  <data key="d0">Estudos Clínicos</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Estudos Clínicos are the clinical studies comparing insulin lispro with regular human insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Estudos Clínicos denotes the clinical studies described for APIDRA® SOLOSTAR®, including the Diabetes Tipo 1 trial.</data>
