<node id="Insulin Glargine 100 U/mL">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Glargine 100 U/mL</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Glargine 100 U/mL is the comparator formulation containing 100 units of insulin glargine per milliliter.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Glargine 100 U/mL is a formulation of insulin glargine at a concentration of 100 units per milliliter.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin glargine 100 U/mL is a reference insulin glargine formulation compared with Toujeo 300 U/mL for glucose‑lowering profile.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard‑dose formulation of insulin glargine used as the comparator in the ORIGIN trial and pediatric studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Glargine 100 U/mL is a long‑acting insulin formulation used as a comparator for pharmacokinetic evaluations.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Glargine 100 U/mL is a basal insulin product mentioned as non‑bioequivalent to Toujeo 300 U/mL.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-97208e231aa338c60205244ac12e0492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3397508bdfddde019cb1dfdcfb352435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afc28422755c2c44f931bab7b6a2b477&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-863286c185f2a62e5b28d7e4577a1088&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78b302b74d715df9c3b9e9db38fa4c64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6b9a8472aefa6e90793233284c15a3f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
