  <data key="d0">Análogo De Insulina Prandial</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Análogo De Insulina Prandial is a prandial (mealtime) insulin analog referenced in combination therapy regimens.&lt;SEP&gt;Análogo De Insulina Prandial is a prandial insulin analog used in combination therapy in the study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-97208e231aa338c60205244ac12e0492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3553e80da33ab48fb157ac9ff75436eb</data>
