</node>
<node id="Agentes Hipoglicemiantes Orais">
  <data key="d0">Agentes Hipoglicemiantes Orais</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Agentes Hipoglicemiantes Orais are oral hypoglycemic agents used by some patients before study enrollment.&lt;SEP&gt;Agentes Hipoglicemiantes Orais are oral hypoglycemic agents cited as part of the treatment combinations.&lt;SEP&gt;Agentes Hipoglicemiantes Orais are oral hypoglycemic drugs that can intensify the glucose‑lowering effect of insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-97208e231aa338c60205244ac12e0492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78f859befb6230d94e8af9144794e0d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4ba52cc293c5c002b470566321026d6</data>
