  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Agentes hipoglicemiantes não insulínicos are non‑insulin hypoglycemic agents mentioned as part of treatment regimens.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-97208e231aa338c60205244ac12e0492</data>
