</node>
<node id="Técnicas De Injeção">
  <data key="d0">Técnicas De Injeção</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Técnicas de injeção are appropriate injection techniques required for safe administration of insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9cd336474a2e9457985162b1ddb4b603</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313541</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Monitoramento Da Glicose No Sangue">
  <data key="d0">Monitoramento Da Glicose No Sangue</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Monitoramento da glicose no sangue is the recommended practice of checking blood glucose after changing the injection site.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9cd336474a2e9457985162b1ddb4b603</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313542</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Estenoses Das Artérias Coronárias">
  <data key="d0">Estenoses Das Artérias Coronárias</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Estenoses das artérias coronárias are significant coronary artery narrowings that raise the risk of cardiac complications during hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9cd336474a2e9457985162b1ddb4b603</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313543</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Veias Sanguíneas Que Supram O Cérebro">
  <data key="d0">Veias Sanguíneas Que Supram O Cérebro</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Veias sanguíneas que suprem o cérebro are cerebral venous pathways; their stenosis increases brain complication risk in hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9cd336474a2e9457985162b1ddb4b603</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313543</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diarreia">
  <data key="d0">Diarreia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diarreia is an intercurrent illness that can predispose a patient to hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9cd336474a2e9457985162b1ddb4b603</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313544</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Distúrbios Endócrinos">
  <data key="d0">Distúrbios Endócrinos</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Distúrbios endócrinos are uncompensated endocrine disorders that increase susceptibility to hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9cd336474a2e9457985162b1ddb4b603</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313544</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Alteração Da Área De Injeção">
  <data key="d0">Alteração Da Área De Injeção</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Alteração da área de injeção is the change of the insulin injection site, which can affect insulin absorption and trigger hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9cd336474a2e9457985162b1ddb4b603</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313544</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Aumento Na Sensibilidade À Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Aumento Na Sensibilidade À Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Aumento na sensibilidade à insulina describes heightened insulin responsiveness, often after stress removal, that can precipitate hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9cd336474a2e9457985162b1ddb4b603</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313544</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ingestão Inadequada De Alimentos">
  <data key="d0">Ingestão Inadequada De Alimentos</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ingestão inadequada de alimentos is insufficient food intake that can lead to hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9cd336474a2e9457985162b1ddb4b603</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313545</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Rotação Contínua Do Local De Injeção">
  <data key="d0">Rotação Contínua Do Local De Injeção</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Rotação contínua do local da injeção is a recommended practice of rotating injection sites to lower the risk of lipodistrofia and cutaneous amyloid deposits.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9cd336474a2e9457985162b1ddb4b603</data>
