<node id="Fasting Plasma Glucose">
  <data key="d0">Fasting Plasma Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Fasting Plasma Glucose (FPG) is a laboratory measurement of the concentration of glucose in plasma after an overnight or otherwise defined fasting period. The test is performed on a blood sample taken after the individual has abstained from caloric intake, typically for at least 8 hours, and the result is expressed in millimoles per litre (mmol/L) or milligrams per decilitre (mg/dL). Reported values such as 7.20 mmol/L versus 8.13 mmol/L illustrate the quantitative nature of the measurement.

Fasting plasma glucose serves several clinical and research purposes. It is a primary screening tool for diabetes mellitus and is used to diagnose diabetes, identify impaired fasting glucose (prediabetes), and assess the risk of developing diabetes. In obstetric care, a fasting plasma glucose measurement taken at the first prenatal visit is employed to evaluate the possibility of gestational diabetes, as practiced in China. The test also functions as an efficacy endpoint in clinical trials, such as double‑blind studies, and guides insulin therapy adjustments, for example informing Levemir® dose modifications based on specific glucose ranges. Thresholds for impaired fasting glucose and diabetes are discussed in the context of diabetes incidence, providing clinicians with criteria for categorizing patients’ glycemic status.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7d9c944d51a42525c017d9109f46684c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-767d025776f0f59c05788e25616f412c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3059be019782459a72891cea5e0434ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56fc1d5df1b34d9120c3cf8a760c40f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8393954b021d0ad02018d1a449e0cc93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec7e786a85b1b6e6cc75bcfc9189fd27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea6df8d05eb3fdd356a1eaef16a26dd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44888abd4ca8a1953f751ed6c41922e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d01033177672e6c36e0a368db88e586d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f1215318cea8c61dc12042476611f9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a430bf53157529ccb22e67171fb28e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a111d4b40ec241cf54126f594a80308&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a22fadf52eaea018160e4dd41d1d39b8</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377237</data>
