<node id="Anticorpos">
  <data key="d0">Anticorpos</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Anticorpos are antibodies that can develop against the insulin product, reported as sparse in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;Anticorpos are antibodies that may develop in patients using Levemir® FlexPen®, without affecting glycemic control.</data>
