<node id="SoloStar Pen">
  <data key="d0">SoloStar Pen</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">SoloStar Pen is an insulin pen device designed for delivering Toujeo 300 U/mL.&lt;SEP&gt;The SoloStar pen is a disposable insulin injector specifically designed to hold and deliver Toujeo 300 U/mL in unit increments.&lt;SEP&gt;The SoloStar pen is an insulin delivery device that holds a total of 450 units of insulin and includes a dose selector, dosage window, and injection button.&lt;SEP&gt;SoloStar Pen is a prefilled insulin injection device that holds 300 units of insulin and allows dosage adjustment from 1 to 80 units.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3397508bdfddde019cb1dfdcfb352435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7638273060df996ad502ec2fadfc9c82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ee5400065df79b02b6c04efc0f4854d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b79dcaf41f7f07eed90788ce9e50dddd</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786315482</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sterile Needle">
  <data key="d0">Sterile Needle</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sterile Needle is a new disposable needle required to be attached before each Toujeo 300 U/mL injection.&lt;SEP&gt;A sterile needle of 4–6 mm length is required for each Toujeo injection and must be replaced after every use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3397508bdfddde019cb1dfdcfb352435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ee5400065df79b02b6c04efc0f4854d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313554</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
