  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The simultaneous use of other medications is noted as a circumstance that can affect hypoglycemia risk (see Interações Medicamentosas).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3397508bdfddde019cb1dfdcfb352435</data>
