  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Metabolite M2 is a secondary breakdown product of insulin glargine measured in pharmacokinetic assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;Metabolite M2 is an active metabolite of insulin glargine formed after administration.&lt;SEP&gt;Metabolite M2 is a secondary metabolite of Toujeo 300 U/mL that is rarely detectable and shows concentrations independent of dose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-42b9c5d97c54f39fb69bb1169e1de4d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afc28422755c2c44f931bab7b6a2b477&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6b9a8472aefa6e90793233284c15a3f</data>
