  <data key="d0">IGF‑1 Pathway</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">IGF‑1 pathway is the intracellular signaling cascade activated by the IGF‑1 receptor that can promote mitogenic proliferation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-afc28422755c2c44f931bab7b6a2b477</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
