  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Caneta SoloStar is the pen device designed to deliver TOUJEO 300 U/mL.&lt;SEP&gt;The SoloStar pen is a disposable insulin injector that displays a green injection button and is used with Toujeo 300 U/mL.&lt;SEP&gt;Caneta SoloStar is an insulin pen intended for subcutaneous injection, requiring specific handling and storage guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Caneta SoloStar is a prefilled insulin pen used to administer insulin glulisina.</data>
