  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Composite risk of cardiovascular events that was not altered by treatment with insulin glargine.&lt;SEP&gt;Cardiovascular outcomes denote heart‑related events examined in multiple diabetes studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Cardiovascular Outcomes are heart‑related health results evaluated in diabetes studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-863286c185f2a62e5b28d7e4577a1088&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-998bee92df7a33cd9c3ddc60144e14f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ab98b1c07f7bbaa3ad28fb83167f489</data>
