  <data key="d0">Coelhos</data>
  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">Coelhos (rabbits) are a laboratory animal species used in embryotoxicity, local tolerance and immunogenicity studies of insulin glargina.&lt;SEP&gt;Coelhos are laboratory rabbits used in gestational toxicity studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Coelhos are laboratory rabbits used in teratology studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e212a20942ed5387efe96e92bdb4ba98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3418c4ee80182ca29214dd54b0d9647</data>
