  <data key="d0">Fertilidade Pré E Pós-Natal</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Fertilidade Pré E Pós-Natal describes combined pre‑ and post‑natal fertility assessments of insulin glargina in rats.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313638</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tolerância Local">
  <data key="d0">Tolerância Local</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Tolerância Local evaluates local tissue reactions after subcutaneous, intramuscular, intravenous and paravenous administration of insulin glargina in rabbits.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313638</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Imunogenicidade">
  <data key="d0">Imunogenicidade</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Imunogenicidade assesses the immune response to insulin glargina compared with human insulin in pigs, rabbits and guinea pigs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313638</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Anti-Hiperglicêmicos">
  <data key="d0">Anti-Hiperglicêmicos</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Anti‑Hiperglicêmicos are agents that lower blood glucose and can potentiate the effect of insulin glargina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313638</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Inibidores Da ECA">
  <data key="d0">Inibidores Da ECA</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Inibidores Da ECA are ACE‑inhibitor drugs that may increase insulin glargina’s hypoglycemic effect.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313639</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Inibidores Da MAO">
  <data key="d0">Inibidores Da MAO</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Inibidores Da MAO are monoamine oxidase inhibitors that can potentiate insulin glargina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313640</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Antibióticos Sulfonamídicos">
  <data key="d0">Antibióticos Sulfonamídicos</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Antibióticos Sulfonamídicos are sulfonamide antibiotics that may interact with insulin glargina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313640</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Corticosteroides">
  <data key="d0">Corticosteroides</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Corticosteroides are steroid drugs that can diminish insulin glargina’s glucose‑lowering effect.&lt;SEP&gt;Corticosteroides are a class of drugs that can diminish the hypoglycemic effect of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Anti‑inflammatory drugs that reduce paniculite progression and manage autoimmune diseases, with a risk of iatrogenic hypercortisolism.&lt;SEP&gt;A class of medications that can reduce the progression of paniculite, are used to control associated autoimmune diseases, and carry a risk of iatrogenic hypercortisolism.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4ba52cc293c5c002b470566321026d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7eabee57ef0af575162ce8d36f3589a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321218</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diazóxido">
  <data key="d0">Diazóxido</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Diazóxido is a potassium‑channel opener that can lessen insulin glargina’s effect.&lt;SEP&gt;Diazóxido is a substance listed as reducing the hypoglycemic effect of APIDRA SOLOSTAR.&lt;SEP&gt;Diazóxido is a chemical agent associated with secondary diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4ba52cc293c5c002b470566321026d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72da6fb8b6a9ed059d146b43a3174f90</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786373027</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diuréticos">
  <data key="d0">Diuréticos</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Diuréticos are diuretic agents that may decrease insulin glargina activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Diuréticos are a class of substances listed as reducing the hypoglycemic effect of APIDRA SOLOSTAR.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4ba52cc293c5c002b470566321026d6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786315337</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agentes Simpatomiméticos">
  <data key="d0">Agentes Simpatomiméticos</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Agentes Simpatomiméticos are sympathomimetic drugs (e.g., epinefrina, salbutamol, terbutalina) that can reduce insulin glargina effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Agentes simpatomiméticos are a class of drugs exemplified by epinefrina, salbutamol and terbutalina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b060d4f68031bd35dfafc19eadf1e9fe</data>
