<node id="Somatropina">
  <data key="d0">Somatropina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Somatropina is recombinant growth hormone that may affect insulin glargina.&lt;SEP&gt;Somatropina is a growth hormone used as a medication.&lt;SEP&gt;Somatropina is a substance listed as reducing the hypoglycemic effect of APIDRA SOLOSTAR.&lt;SEP&gt;Somatropina is listed among agents such as sympathomimetics and atypical antipsychotics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4ba52cc293c5c002b470566321026d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-465ad8b77c1c2a2a179062da20337ff5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b060d4f68031bd35dfafc19eadf1e9fe</data>
