  <data key="d0">Inibidores Da Protease</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Inibidores Da Protease are protease inhibitor drugs that may diminish insulin glargina’s effect.&lt;SEP&gt;Inibidores da protease are listed among the medication categories.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b060d4f68031bd35dfafc19eadf1e9fe</data>
