<node id="Olanzapina">
  <data key="d0">Olanzapina</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Olanzapina is an atypical antipsychotic that may reduce insulin glargina efficacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Olanzapina is an atypical antipsychotic that can reduce the hypoglycemic effect of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Olanzapina is an atypical antipsychotic medication referenced as an example.&lt;SEP&gt;Olanzapina is a substance listed as reducing the hypoglycemic effect of APIDRA SOLOSTAR.&lt;SEP&gt;Olanzapina is cited as an example of an atypical antipsychotic.&lt;SEP&gt;Olanzapina is a second‑generation antipsychotic linked to higher diabetes risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4ba52cc293c5c002b470566321026d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d65840dd2cbd5c9984dfc4334378df5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-465ad8b77c1c2a2a179062da20337ff5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b060d4f68031bd35dfafc19eadf1e9fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7b4535dbb2554b84c7a2e024c4b82c4</data>
