  <data key="d2">Clozapina is an atypical antipsychotic that may diminish insulin glargina activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Clozapina is an atypical antipsychotic medication referenced as an example.&lt;SEP&gt;Clozapina is a substance listed as reducing the hypoglycemic effect of APIDRA SOLOSTAR.&lt;SEP&gt;Clozapina is cited as an example of an atypical antipsychotic.&lt;SEP&gt;Clozapina is a second‑generation antipsychotic linked to higher diabetes risk.</data>
