  <data key="d0">Sais De Lítio</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sais De Lítio are lithium salts that may modulate insulin glargina effect.&lt;SEP&gt;Sais de lítio are described as agents that can both potentiate and weaken insulin’s hypoglycemic effect.</data>
