</node>
<node id="Proteção Contra Luz">
  <data key="d0">Proteção Contra Luz</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Proteção Contra Luz indicates that the insulin pen must be protected from light throughout storage and use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313644</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Validade Pós‑Abertura 6 Semanas">
  <data key="d0">Validade Pós‑Abertura 6 Semanas</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Validade Pós‑Abertura 6 Semanas states that once opened, the insulin pen remains usable for six weeks (42 days) if kept protected from light and heat.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
