  <data key="d0">VP</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">VP is a section label appearing in the product documentation denoting a set of informational items.&lt;SEP&gt;Abbreviation for a version type of the product label (Versão de Produto).&lt;SEP&gt;VP is a label version abbreviation appearing in the medication instructions.&lt;SEP&gt;VP denotes a version type of the drug label used in the documentation of Produto Biológico.&lt;SEP&gt;VP is an abbreviation appearing as a section heading in the document.&lt;SEP&gt;VP appears as a heading in the document and likely denotes a product form related to the medication.&lt;SEP&gt;VP is a label designation appearing in the medication's package insert sections.</data>
