<node id="TOUJEO 300 U/mL">
  <data key="d0">TOUJEO 300 U/mL</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">TOUJEO 300 U/mL is a medication administered once daily to patients with type 2 diabetes, evaluated in clinical studies with fixed or flexible dosing schedules.&lt;SEP&gt;TOUJEO 300 U/mL is an insulin glargine formulation used as a basal insulin in the clinical study.&lt;SEP&gt;TOUJEO 300 U/mL is a pharmaceutical product containing 300 units per milliliter of insulin glargine, indicated for diabetes treatment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3553e80da33ab48fb157ac9ff75436eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76df79998cbb923bc6c94e375c220eac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d7223c781e745e72311fccfcdd58583</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313651</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GJ">
  <data key="d0">GJ</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">GJ is a glucose‑related outcome reported in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;GJ refers to fasting glucose measurement used in assessing risk of coronary disease and diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;GJ refers to fasting glucose measurement, used as a comparator in studies of TTGO‑1h and TTGO‑2h.&lt;SEP&gt;GJ (glicemia de jejum) is the fasting plasma glucose measurement employed for initial diabetes screening.&lt;SEP&gt;GJ (fasting glucose) is a laboratory measurement referenced alongside HbA1c and TTGO for assessing diabetes risk.&lt;SEP&gt;GJ denotes fasting glucose measurement (glicemia de jejum) employed in diabetes diagnostic criteria.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3553e80da33ab48fb157ac9ff75436eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a92f811a7d2d835dc4b730c9bbf08cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80893468bbc3744e2e535806ea31e346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ad6eb7138be249f01b479174a34076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-078f5907e86c2158587c79b26b0cd683&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c92d117f7109ea1ce6995f23bc680ce3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786371919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SMPG">
  <data key="d0">SMPG</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">SMPG (self‑monitoring of plasma glucose) mean pre‑injection values were measured as an outcome in the study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3553e80da33ab48fb157ac9ff75436eb</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786313651</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
