  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hipoglicemia Confirmada denotes hypoglycemic episodes that were clinically confirmed in the studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Hipoglicemia Confirmada is hypoglycemia confirmed by plasma glucose ≤70 mg/dL (3.9 mmol/L).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3553e80da33ab48fb157ac9ff75436eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78f859befb6230d94e8af9144794e0d9</data>
