</node>
<node id="Instructions for Use">
  <data key="d0">Instructions for Use</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Instructions for Use provide detailed guidance on dosage, injection technique, and safety precautions for Toujeo 300 U/mL.&lt;SEP&gt;The instructions for use provide safety warnings, usage steps, and maintenance information for Accu‑Chek Solo.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1ee5400065df79b02b6c04efc0f4854d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4d5551bd34470fa603c62d5b51b1ea6</data>
