<node id="Trometamol">
  <data key="d0">Trometamol</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Trometamol is a buffering excipient present in APIDRA.&lt;SEP&gt;Trometamol is an excipient listed in the composition of APIDRA® SOLOSTAR®.&lt;SEP&gt;Trometamol is a buffering excipient included in the formulation of Apidra SoloStar.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-162882e6afffb0db8ae5e9153e5f1e82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb620bf44b37187faceacd0405c4a819&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77dc1a2378f763ffabe8fa379881d1cc</data>
