<node id="Sodium Chloride">
  <data key="d0">Sodium Chloride</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sodium chloride (cloreto de sódio) is an excipient present in APIDRA.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium chloride is an isotonic excipient included in the formulation of Apidra SoloStar.&lt;SEP&gt;Sodium chloride is an excipient used in the formulation of Levemir® FlexPen® injectable solution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-162882e6afffb0db8ae5e9153e5f1e82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77dc1a2378f763ffabe8fa379881d1cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b65a4249ac93aec086cb333ed1507ea7</data>
