</node>
<node id="Polysorbate 20">
  <data key="d0">Polysorbate 20</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Polysorbate 20 is an excipient present in APIDRA.&lt;SEP&gt;Polysorbate 20 is a surfactant excipient included in the formulation of Apidra SoloStar.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-162882e6afffb0db8ae5e9153e5f1e82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77dc1a2378f763ffabe8fa379881d1cc</data>
