<node id="Endocrine Practice">
  <data key="d0">Endocrine Practice</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Endocrine Practice is a scientific journal cited in the reference list.&lt;SEP&gt;Endocrine Practice is a clinical journal covering endocrine disorders, including diabetes technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Endocrine Practice is a journal that published a study comparing once‑daily insulin glargine with twice‑daily NPH insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Endocrine Practice is the journal that published the 24‑week trial of technosphere insulin versus insulin aspart in type 2 diabetes in 2021.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal studying the effect of pen versus vial/syringe delivery of glargine insulin on glycemic control and preferences.&lt;SEP&gt;Endocrine Practice is a journal that published the AACE consensus statement on lipodystrophy detection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f46c503a378e6c69618036a038672417&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08f12a2de420625ccc88f737d06b7e84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7e6ca9bf63e843b814736c0409c70fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d30bfc1840eec64224c3568470e6c539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-651d85a13edd23f654d52f95c75d4e32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1ee3f56f3180d8544dbba6a542c9d68</data>
