<node id="Metabolismo de Glicose">
  <data key="d0">Metabolismo de Glicose</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Metabolismo de glicose refers to the biochemical processes that regulate blood glucose levels, which are the primary target of insulin therapy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b65ee62ad12239ddc729c50a1aef854c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf</data>
