  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">APIDRA 12-Week Study is a randomized, open‑label, active‑medication‑controlled trial (n = 860) evaluating safety and efficacy of APIDRA administered pre‑ or post‑meal in adult type 1 diabetes patients.</data>
