  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">APIDRA vs Insulin Aspart ISCI Study is a randomized, open, active‑medication‑controlled 12‑week trial (n = 59) comparing APIDRA with insulin aspart delivered via continuous subcutaneous infusion.</data>
