  <data key="d0">Insulin Glulisina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Glulisina is a rapid‑acting insulin analogue that serves as the active insulin component of the branded product APIDRA and its device‑based formulation APIDRA SOLOSTAR. Each millilitre of the preparation contains insulin glulisina equivalent to 100 International Units of human insulin, and the product is marketed under the name APIDRA.

Pharmacologically, insulin glulisina lowers blood glucose by promoting peripheral glucose uptake into muscle and adipose tissue and by suppressing hepatic glucose production. Its pharmacokinetic profile is faster than that of regular human insulin, providing a rapid onset of action that mimics the physiological post‑prandial insulin response.

The molecule has been evaluated in clinical investigations as an investigational insulin formulation for children and adolescents with type 1 diabetes, assessing both efficacy in glycaemic control and safety. These studies have demonstrated its ability to reduce blood glucose levels in the target population.

Safety information indicates that insulin glulisina can provoke allergic reactions in individuals who are susceptible, a risk that should be considered when prescribing or dispensing the product.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Glulisina (glulisine) is a rapid‑acting insulin analogue not recommended due to limited safety data.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin glulisina is an insulin formulation noted as not recommended due to lack of safety data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b65ee62ad12239ddc729c50a1aef854c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51761473ea6fe17b9e098a6bf98636b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c95471c4c993fa3a499f99443ee7c922&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04b345bc26ec7f5d7c9db8c6004a50a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50719bcc88f4515ec825b9d5a7aba107&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f09811b149a29105854a0b1e84951e5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77dc1a2378f763ffabe8fa379881d1cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-891989adf06518cd34c94853444495e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fba8ea0c6bdb8427804ba05f9fe49f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-277e136948d5572acf031988fd092dce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786330165</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
