  <data key="d0">Damage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Damage refers to the state of being harmed or impaired, which can occur to the SoloStar pen if mishandled.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fdeef3e06ffaa7cc0442c3d94917f0c4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf</data>
