  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Notificação De Alteração De Texto De Bula – RDC 60/12 is a regulatory notification that amends the text of a medication's label (Bula) for a biological product.&lt;SEP&gt;Notificação De Alteração De Texto De Bula – RDC 60/12 refers to multiple regulatory notifications dated between 2019 and 2022 that announce changes to the Fiasp medication’s package insert.&lt;SEP&gt;Official notification announcing changes to the medication’s labeling in accordance with RDC 60/12.</data>
