<node id="Germany">
  <data key="d0">Germany</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Germany is a sovereign European nation that serves as the official address for several notable pharmaceutical and medical‑device entities, including Sanofi‑Aventis Deutschland GmbH, Roche Diabetes Care GmbH, and a local Accu‑Chek Customer Service Center. As a wealthy country with a long‑standing health‑care infrastructure, Germany was cited in historical analyses as having a high prevalence of diabetes as early as 1920. The nation’s federal structure includes the state of Bavaria, which has been specifically mentioned in scientific studies concerning the screening of islet autoantibodies.

In the context of diabetes research, Germany has been a key recruiting site for multiple clinical investigations. Adult patients with type 1 diabetes were enrolled from Germany for a study examining disease characteristics, and the country was one of two locations where a cohort of children and young adults with type 1 diabetes was assembled. Additional pediatric research focused on autoantibody positivity and the associated risk of progressing to type 1 diabetes was conducted with participants drawn from German cohorts, including a screening program carried out in Bavaria. These studies collectively underscore Germany’s role as both a commercial hub for diabetes‑related companies and a significant contributor to epidemiological and immunological research on the disease.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b79dcaf41f7f07eed90788ce9e50dddd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f540d57f26133557d784c93e6ea2dca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f013a672ce03f1b20f7a515bae12be15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ba3c49b467b6d37cd2aab29bf4a3119&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dec009976a44828d0e619e7fa5b1c5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29ea6999715cd3886bd7d4abc2a653b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-343246c2eef6e8430b581340d6cd4762&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c122c1c6d7dd36110b6ddba2c074d122&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a430bf53157529ccb22e67171fb28e5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/IFU Accu-Chek Guide Solo Diabetes Manager.PDF&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/ref.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377423</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
