  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dose Selector">
  <data key="d0">Dose Selector</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Dose Selector is the knob on SoloStar that sets the desired insulin dose, reflected in the dosage window.&lt;SEP&gt;Dose Selector is the rotating dial on the SoloStar pen that allows selection of insulin doses from 1 to 80 units.&lt;SEP&gt;Dose Selector is the rotating knob on the application system that allows selection of insulin units up to 80 per dose.&lt;SEP&gt;The dose selector is a dial on the pen used to choose the number of insulin units to deliver.&lt;SEP&gt;The dose selector is the dial on the pen that sets the desired insulin units and aligns with a zero indicator.&lt;SEP&gt;The dose selector is a control on the pen used to choose the number of insulin units before injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ffe095bda1b787c5b5ae2d61a2f74c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79f891b1d7c0c6ca0eab9dbcc76c902d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0710d91bd443ae1af3fd98049f4ad42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd25c8bd4672601d6ee40e4b7e28a69c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb8954aaa1e1230598596ce6f5df249&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c24a2af0d0291fc4f4730256c420e93</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786318421</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Internal Cap">
  <data key="d0">Internal Cap</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Internal Cap is the inner cap of the needle that should not be reattached to avoid injury.&lt;SEP&gt;The internal cap is the inner cover of the needle that must be discarded after use to prevent injury.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ffe095bda1b787c5b5ae2d61a2f74c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0710d91bd443ae1af3fd98049f4ad42</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786316043</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
