  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Healthcare Provider is the medical professional who gives instructions on proper use and disposal of SoloStar and its needle.&lt;SEP&gt;A healthcare provider is a medical professional who advises patients on insulin therapy settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ffe095bda1b787c5b5ae2d61a2f74c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8741750a7bf86eb5d1fadf82a9c7720e</data>
