</node>
<node id="Insulin Reservoir">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Reservoir</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Reservoir is the internal chamber of the SoloStar pen that holds insulin before it reaches the needle.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Reservoir stores the insulin inside the MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Reservoir holds a measurable number of insulin units and triggers Low Reservoir reminders when low.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ffe095bda1b787c5b5ae2d61a2f74c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92417ae942a11c591feb2ee9b5fadd7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcea1ff62aae96936f552880e96faa69</data>
