  <data key="d0">Insulin Leaflet</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Leaflet is the instruction sheet (bula) providing guidance on storage, handling, and disposal of the SoloStar pen and needle.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Leaflet is the informational document accompanying the insulin product that provides storage and handling guidelines for the SoloStar.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ffe095bda1b787c5b5ae2d61a2f74c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9835d6684db67541402527b3182b6c5</data>
