<node id="Rotação Contínua do Local da Injeção">
  <data key="d0">Rotação Contínua do Local da Injeção</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Rotação Contínua do Local da Injeção is the practice of regularly changing injection sites to minimize adverse skin reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Practice of regularly changing insulin injection sites to lower adverse‑reaction risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Rotação Contínua do Local da Injeção is a recommended method to lower the risk of injection‑site reactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3418c4ee80182ca29214dd54b0d9647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45ee3dcb366c1301c9fb1d2ce9f323c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bcc4202330d45ebfca8f79c3d4998b3</data>
