  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Carboidratos orais are oral carbohydrates recommended for treating mild to moderate hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Carboidratos orais are oral carbohydrates used to treat mild to moderate hypoglycemia.</data>
