  <data key="d2">Concentrated intravenous glucose is used to treat severe hypoglycemia when rapid correction is needed.&lt;SEP&gt;Glicose intravenosa concentrada is a concentrated glucose solution used intravenously for severe hypoglycemia treatment.</data>
