  <data key="d0">Phase III Clinical Trial (Type 1 Pediatric)</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A 26‑week, open‑label, active‑controlled Phase III clinical trial evaluating insulin glulisina versus insulin lispro in pediatric patients with Type 1 diabetes mellitus (n = 572).</data>
