  <data key="d0">Phase III Clinical Trial (Type 2 Adult)</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A 26‑week, randomized, open, active‑controlled trial evaluating APIDRA versus human regular insulin in adult patients with Type 2 diabetes mellitus (n = 876).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-891989adf06518cd34c94853444495e3</data>
