  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Rotação contínua do local de injeção is a method to alternate injection sites to reduce tissue reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Rotação Contínua do Local de Injeção is a recommended practice of continuously changing the injection site to lower skin‑reaction risk.</data>
