<node id="Manual">
  <data key="d0">Manual</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Manual is the instructional pamphlet that provides step‑by‑step guidance for the safe use of the SoloStar insulin pen.&lt;SEP&gt;Manuals are independent study materials used in the training program.&lt;SEP&gt;Manual is the instructional document divided into sections and chapters.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-79f891b1d7c0c6ca0eab9dbcc76c902d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ab69ff55dee7eb424c572ea28a45ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6737e479a665e986547e5e1e29ef26da</data>
