  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Dose Range 1 to 80 Units denotes the adjustable dosage interval that the SoloStar pen’s selector can be set to, in 1‑unit increments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-79f891b1d7c0c6ca0eab9dbcc76c902d</data>
