  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">1ª Etapa: Verificação da Insulina is the first method step that instructs users to verify the insulin label and appearance before use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-79f891b1d7c0c6ca0eab9dbcc76c902d</data>
