<node id="Continuous Subcutaneous Insulin Infusion (CSII)">
  <data key="d0">Continuous Subcutaneous Insulin Infusion (CSII)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Continuous Subcutaneous Insulin Infusion (CSII) is a therapy method that delivers insulin continuously under the skin using a specialized infusion pump. The pump administers rapid‑acting insulin directly into the subcutaneous tissue, allowing for precise basal rates as well as patient‑controlled bolus doses for meals or correction. By providing a steady, programmable flow of insulin, CSII replaces multiple daily injections and can be adjusted to meet the variable needs of individuals with diabetes.  

The system is pump‑based and does not require dilution or mixing of insulin with other agents; it delivers the insulin in its standard formulation through a catheter inserted subcutaneously. CSII has been employed in clinical research, including a six‑week randomized trial, and is widely used for diabetes management because it offers tighter glycemic control, flexibility, and the ability to tailor insulin delivery to daily activities and dietary intake.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous Subcutaneous Insulin Infusion is a pump‑based method delivering insulin continuously under the skin.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous Subcutaneous Insulin Infusion (CSII) is a method of delivering insulin via an infusion pump, forming a technological foundation for Automated Insulin Delivery systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous Subcutaneous Insulin Infusion (CSII) is a pump technology integrated into AID systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f4f01a72f35d6db3ff333e64f8400ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f85d0ab4cfadc905544cb9e30752dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc2aa5d85d666eabc9dbaa5d2ecfe874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14772c7de5db762c492a75a1c744dae6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77c1608c27e3114f3a14f175efe260a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88b97cde53943160602b20f634ba5c1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c32255a7f064c18ff0b079798cfeaf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08f12a2de420625ccc88f737d06b7e84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f272d1c9c38e2a6b6d02b5aa66809e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c9d162accf67a3761df6b1c9113e193&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2767372b4b5395439f542016058306a4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332842</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
