  <data key="d0">AUC Insulin Aspart 0-15 Min</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">AUC Insulin Aspart 0‑15 min is the area under the insulin concentration curve measured from 0 to 15 minutes post‑injection.</data>
