</node>
<node id="Prandial Test">
  <data key="d0">Prandial Test</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Prandial Test is a post‑meal glucose measurement referenced in the study protocol as “Teste prandial”.&lt;SEP&gt;Prandial test is a post‑meal glucose assessment used to evaluate insulin pharmacodynamics in type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f4f01a72f35d6db3ff333e64f8400ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f85d0ab4cfadc905544cb9e30752dab</data>
