<node id="Fiasp FlexTouch">
  <data key="d0">Fiasp FlexTouch</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Prefilled insulin delivery system for Fiasp that accepts disposable NovoFine needles up to 8 mm, delivers 1‑80 units, and is identified by colour coding.&lt;SEP&gt;Fiasp FlexTouch is an insulin pen system designed for subcutaneous injection, compatible with up to 8 mm disposable needles.&lt;SEP&gt;Fiasp FlexTouch is a format of the Fiasp medication supplied as a pen, listed with a quantity of one in the documentation.&lt;SEP&gt;Fiasp FlexTouch is a form of the medication Fiasp mentioned in the notification documents with a quantity of 1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0710d91bd443ae1af3fd98049f4ad42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc2aa5d85d666eabc9dbaa5d2ecfe874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3dd8cca31db67f0714ec26072996029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53644541333e5ca7f2785d80235d27e9</data>
