<node id="Dose Indicator">
  <data key="d0">Dose Indicator</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Dose Indicator is the marker aligned with the dose counter to confirm the selected insulin unit level.&lt;SEP&gt;The dose indicator aligns with the zero mark to show when the dose has been fully delivered.&lt;SEP&gt;Dose Indicator is the visual component on the FlexPen that shows approximately the amount of insulin remaining in the pen.&lt;SEP&gt;The dose indicator displays the current selected insulin units and aligns to zero after a complete injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0710d91bd443ae1af3fd98049f4ad42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd25c8bd4672601d6ee40e4b7e28a69c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb8954aaa1e1230598596ce6f5df249&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c24a2af0d0291fc4f4730256c420e93</data>
