  <data key="d5">1786318421</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Application Button">
  <data key="d0">Application Button</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Application Button is the pressable control on the application system that initiates insulin delivery and generates audible clicks.&lt;SEP&gt;The application button is pressed to initiate insulin delivery through the needle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0710d91bd443ae1af3fd98049f4ad42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd25c8bd4672601d6ee40e4b7e28a69c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786316045</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Scale">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Scale</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The insulin scale marks incremental dose units on the pen for precise selection.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Scale is the graduated instrument that shows an approximate amount of insulin remaining in the application system, which should not be used for precise dosing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0710d91bd443ae1af3fd98049f4ad42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd25c8bd4672601d6ee40e4b7e28a69c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf</data>
