<node id="Frasco Bula do Profissional">
  <data key="d0">Frasco Bula do Profissional</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Frasco Bula do Profissional is a professional labeling document (CCDS v.10_v.3) that includes information about Fiasp® products.&lt;SEP&gt;Frasco Bula do Profissional is the professional label leaflet accompanying Fiasp®.&lt;SEP&gt;Frasco Bula do Profissional is a professional label/package accompanying insulin products such as Fiasp®.&lt;SEP&gt;A professional‑grade vial containing Fiasp® medication.&lt;SEP&gt;Frasco Bula do Profissional is a professional insulin vial package referenced in the documentation.&lt;SEP&gt;Frasco Bula do Profissional is a vial formulation of FIASP® described in the professional labeling (CCDS v.10_v.3).</data>
