  <data key="d0">CCDS v.10_v.3</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">CCDS v.10_v.3 is the version identifier of the professional labeling document for Fiasp®.&lt;SEP&gt;CCDS v.10_v.3 is the version identifier of the professional label document cited in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;CCDS v.10_v.3 is the professional label document that provides prescribing information for Fiasp® and related products.&lt;SEP&gt;CCDS v.10_v.3 is the version of the professional labeling document that includes information on FIASP® devices.&lt;SEP&gt;Version identifier of the professional label document.</data>
