  <data key="d0">Clinical Study (6‑Week Randomized CSII)</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A 6‑week double‑blind, parallel‑group, 2:1 randomized study evaluating Fiasp® and NovoRapid® administered via CSII in adults with type 1 diabetes mellitus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9f85d0ab4cfadc905544cb9e30752dab</data>
