</node>
<node id="Mean Postprandial Glucose">
  <data key="d0">Mean Postprandial Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Mean Postprandial Glucose is the average glucose level after all meals, reported in mmol/L and mg/dL in the 18‑week study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9f85d0ab4cfadc905544cb9e30752dab</data>
