<node id="Fiasp Penfill">
  <data key="d0">Fiasp Penfill</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Cartridge form of Fiasp intended for use with Novo Nordisk insulin delivery systems and disposable NovoFine needles.&lt;SEP&gt;Fiasp Penfill is a format of the Fiasp medication supplied as a prefilled pen, listed with a quantity of five in the documentation.&lt;SEP&gt;Fiasp Penfill is a pen‑injector form of the medication Fiasp listed in the notifications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bc2aa5d85d666eabc9dbaa5d2ecfe874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3dd8cca31db67f0714ec26072996029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53644541333e5ca7f2785d80235d27e9</data>
