<node id="Novo Nordisk">
  <data key="d0">Novo Nordisk</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Novo Nordisk is a global pharmaceutical company that specializes in the development and manufacturing of insulin and related diabetes therapies. The company traces its origins to the pioneering work of Hans Christian Hagedorn and the historic Nordisk insulin enterprises, and it has continued to build on that legacy through extensive research and product innovation.

Novo Nordisk produces a range of insulin delivery systems, including those compatible with its fast‑acting mealtime insulin Fiasp, as well as Penfill devices for Levemir® and Novolin® R. The firm not only manufactures these delivery systems but also developed the application technologies that enable the use of the Novolin® R Penfill® system. In addition to these devices, Novo Nordisk launched the rapid‑acting insulin Fiasp, further expanding its portfolio of diabetes treatments.

Beyond product development, Novo Nordisk has contributed broadly to insulin manufacturing and has engaged in collaborative research efforts, notably partnering with the University of Toronto Insulin Committee to advance insulin science. These activities underscore the company’s ongoing commitment to improving diabetes care worldwide.&lt;SEP&gt;Novo Nordisk is a pharmaceutical company that received consulting or funding relationships with E.C. and R.W.B.&lt;SEP&gt;Novo Nordisk is a pharmaceutical company that provides speaker relationships and research funding to author T.C.B.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bc2aa5d85d666eabc9dbaa5d2ecfe874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00cf434060561bb7d46b6ce50f095c91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cedd8e88a8d35eade68ce02222b9e276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0955cb70a6ce135722726162a9811e78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b4034f7cf7e37425b7c76f5e0f9fd11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08f12a2de420625ccc88f737d06b7e84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ba3c49b467b6d37cd2aab29bf4a3119&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c80fa00c2f059f9425a4ef62c162b1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47acdaf58d4f121a3948976c07c3d03c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2767372b4b5395439f542016058306a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5419de5a030f812ab408ef47f361bebd</data>
