<node id="FlexTouch®">
  <data key="d0">FlexTouch®</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">FlexTouch® is a pen‑type, pre‑filled insulin delivery system designed specifically for the rapid‑acting insulin formulation Fiasp® (insulin aspart). The device is presented in professional labeling and product literature as a pen‑variant that enables users to administer Fiasp® in a convenient, ready‑to‑use format, functioning as a 3 mL injection system that delivers a total of 300 units of insulin per pen.

The FlexTouch® pen is intended for use with disposable NovoFine® needles, providing a standardized attachment for subcutaneous injection. Its pre‑filled design eliminates the need for manual loading of insulin cartridges, allowing patients and healthcare professionals to administer the prescribed dose of Fiasp® quickly and accurately.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f4f01a72f35d6db3ff333e64f8400ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f85d0ab4cfadc905544cb9e30752dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb9ea85b9ad8cd6940ae41a3ab5d1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88b97cde53943160602b20f634ba5c1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d10a1f849386df540104c79e33a7b242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09d60e0b850d87c77dd67ca2d709912c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d5bb996e52cb71f15bc8c30d1b1d321&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8c7e36686d077dcb6239405f60ea031</data>
