</node>
<node id="Pediatric Clinical Study (26‑Week Randomized)">
  <data key="d0">Pediatric Clinical Study (26‑Week Randomized)</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A 26‑week, 1:1:1 randomized, active‑controlled study that evaluated the efficacy and safety of Fiasp® (pre‑ and post‑prandial) and NovoRapid® (pre‑prandial) in children and adolescents with Type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-77c1608c27e3114f3a14f175efe260a4</data>
