  <data key="d2">Designated collection sites where used needles, syringes, and other waste are safely deposited.&lt;SEP&gt;Designated collection points in pharmacies, drugstores, health posts, or hospitals where used needles and medication devices are discarded.&lt;SEP&gt;Postos de Coleta are collection points where used needles and medication containers are safely disposed of.&lt;SEP&gt;Postos de Coleta are collection points located in pharmacies, drugstores, health posts or hospitals for safe disposal of syringes.</data>
