  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Reações no local da aplicação encompass injection‑site and infusion‑site reactions such as rash, erythema, pain, hematoma and itching reported with FIASP®.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3a70857656e32cc73aaa270a75eb33af</data>
