  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Levemir® Penfill® is a pen‑injector formulation of insulin detemir (Levemir®) referenced in the professional prescribing information.&lt;SEP&gt;Levemir® Penfill® is a pen delivery device designed to administer Levemir® insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Levemir® Penfill® is a prefilled insulin pen containing Levemir® for subcutaneous administration.&lt;SEP&gt;Levemir® Penfill® is a professional pen injector device described in the product leaflet for administering Levemir®.&lt;SEP&gt;Levemir® Penfill® is a long‑acting basal insulin analog supplied in a pen device for subcutaneous injection.&lt;SEP&gt;Levemir® Penfill® is an insulin cartridge associated with the Levemir® FlexPen® device.&lt;SEP&gt;Levemir® Penfill® is a cartridge containing Levemir® insulin for use with the FlexPen® device.</data>
