  <data key="d2">Liraglutida is a GLP-1 receptor agonist medication investigated for added benefit in diabetes therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;GLP‑1 receptor agonist drug examined for interaction with Levemir®.&lt;SEP&gt;Liraglutida is a GLP‑1 receptor agonist used alone or combined with Levemir® and Metformina in the trials.&lt;SEP&gt;Liraglutida is a GLP-1 receptor agonist medication mentioned in combination with Levemir®.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ef15154a94043650617b3b24d8146a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e7e47ca39ac4f4975da2b4b7e6d3c36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f36263c657ad99a80e578ac49a333d5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3059be019782459a72891cea5e0434ea</data>
