<node id="Dose Proportionality">
  <data key="d0">Dose Proportionality</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Linear relationship between Levemir® dose and serum concentration, effect duration, and total effect.&lt;SEP&gt;Dose Proportionality indicates that serum concentrations increase proportionally with the administered dose of Levemir®.</data>
