<node id="Levemir® FlexPen®">
  <data key="d0">Levemir® FlexPen®</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Levemir® FlexPen® is a pre‑filled, single‑use injectable insulin pen that contains the long‑acting insulin analogue insulin detemir, marketed for the treatment of diabetes. The device delivers the Levemir® medication in a ready‑to‑inject format, eliminating the need for separate vials and syringes.

The FlexPen® is designed as a pen‑type delivery system that allows the user to select a dose ranging from 1 to 60 units. It accommodates standard 8 mm needles and incorporates safety features such as a dose‑selector mechanism, a protective seal to prevent accidental dosing, and a lock‑out function to reduce the risk of misuse. The pen must be stored according to specific temperature and handling guidelines to maintain insulin stability and efficacy.

Throughout clinical guides, safety notifications, and product documentation, Levemir® FlexPen® is consistently referenced as the specific insulin pen device used to administer Levemir® insulin. It is recognized as a medical insulin pen that combines the medication and delivery apparatus in a single, convenient, and regulated format.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-50a4f77ab697e068f8cf31533065722b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46f4c578332d81d4fc1ca84bcbc26bd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd04b9d444bd15536d886b2c72649da7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-922791f49d1bf928fe4f02ddd336927b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3237e202569462c758ec3d878c9faeae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-759c20cc4c3fc0d3529aabc2fe7dbf99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a49c8461f43dc12d7df9c921efeb0465&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b65a4249ac93aec086cb333ed1507ea7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786317573</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
