</node>
<node id="FlexPen®">
  <data key="d0">FlexPen®</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">FlexPen® is a registered, trademarked insulin pen brand owned by Novo Nordisk A/S. It is a reusable, pen‑type delivery device specifically designed to administer Levemir® (insulin detemir) subcutaneously. The FlexPen® system is referenced in the professional leaflet and label for Levemir®, where it is described as the presentation device on which Levemir® FlexPen® is based. As an injectable pen, FlexPen® provides a convenient means of delivering the insulin dose, but it requires careful handling to ensure proper dosing and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;FlexPen® is an insulin delivery device mentioned alongside Novolin R® in the notices.&lt;SEP&gt;FlexPen® is a disposable insulin pen device mentioned in conjunction with Novolin R® in the notifications.&lt;SEP&gt;FlexPen® is a device or system described as a filled application system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-46f4c578332d81d4fc1ca84bcbc26bd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f36263c657ad99a80e578ac49a333d5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45ee3dcb366c1301c9fb1d2ce9f323c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdee4bcd64faa476dd057e21e2525e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-922791f49d1bf928fe4f02ddd336927b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-831f4bbfc884fc8e9679630a819083e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a68ba1e8cc1defda76cde0eff9592e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56fc1d5df1b34d9120c3cf8a760c40f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-813e7e990dba10e8d4147252f6547423&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fce17a01f9697252910d19a41ca6c900&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f957e1a9566d1d41252f7637b06da4f</data>
