<node id="Antidiabetic Oral Agents">
  <data key="d0">Antidiabetic Oral Agents</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Antidiabetic oral agents are oral diabetes medicines that may be used together with Levemir® in adults with type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Antidiabetic oral agents are medications that can reduce the insulin requirements of Levemir®.&lt;SEP&gt;Antidiabetic oral agents are concomitantly administered drugs that may require dose or timing adjustment when used with Levemir®.&lt;SEP&gt;Antidiabetic oral agents are medication classes whose long‑term glycotoxicity is mentioned as a reason SICI may improve glycemic control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cedd8e88a8d35eade68ce02222b9e276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ace26fdb0244e3d0f714a007c9bbb51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56fc1d5df1b34d9120c3cf8a760c40f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fba8ea0c6bdb8427804ba05f9fe49f9</data>
