  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A class of drugs that can lower insulin requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;GLP‑1 receptor agonists are drugs that can reduce the insulin requirements of Levemir®.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucagon‑like peptide‑1 receptor agonists are a class of glucose‑lowering drugs with established cardiovascular and renal benefits.</data>
