  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Acta Clinica Belgica is a journal that published a 26‑week follow‑up study of insulin detemir in the Belgian PREDICTIVE cohort.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e5f5165b3185feb3c6ec93a3c0ef8d02</data>
