  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin degludec is a long‑acting basal insulin analogue compared with insulin detemir in Study NN 1250‑3561.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e5f5165b3185feb3c6ec93a3c0ef8d02</data>
