  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Plank J is an author of a double‑blind, randomized, dose‑response study on insulin detemir.&lt;SEP&gt;Plank J is an author of the dose‑response study published in Experimental and Clinical Endocrinology &amp; Diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e5f5165b3185feb3c6ec93a3c0ef8d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42ddf181cf4422a3b24643a2252d99b0</data>
