<node id="Pre‑eclampsia">
  <data key="d0">Pre‑eclampsia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pre‑eclampsia is a pregnancy complication whose incidence was reported for both treatment groups.&lt;SEP&gt;A hypertensive disorder of pregnancy whose incidence was measured in the trial.&lt;SEP&gt;Pre‑eclampsia is a pregnancy‑related hypertensive disorder measured as an adverse event in the study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3237e202569462c758ec3d878c9faeae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42ddf181cf4422a3b24643a2252d99b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4d7abd3e1e5418ee5a931e28a18e8ad</data>
