</node>
<node id="Self-Monitoring of Blood Glucose">
  <data key="d0">Self-Monitoring of Blood Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Self‑monitoring of blood glucose is a practice of regularly checking plasma glucose levels to guide Levemir® dosing, especially during therapy transitions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-56fc1d5df1b34d9120c3cf8a760c40f9</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
