  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Ministry of Health is the Brazilian federal agency that published the professional health leaflet for Novolin® R FlexPen®.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ministry of Health authored the professional bulletin containing the Novolin® R FlexPen® instructions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ministry of Health (Ministério da Saúde) issues the professional health leaflet for Novolin® R FlexPen®.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ministry of Health is Brazil’s federal health authority that receives recommendations from CONITEC.</data>
