<node id="Novolin® R Penfill®">
  <data key="d0">Novolin® R Penfill®</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Novolin® R Penfill® is a 3 mL injectable insulin solution presented in a carpule, used for subcutaneous, intravenous, or intramuscular administration.&lt;SEP&gt;Novolin® R Penfill® is an insulin cartridge pen designed for use with Novo Nordisk insulin application systems and disposable NovoFine® needles.&lt;SEP&gt;Novolin® R Penfill® is an insulin product referenced in the professional label and produced by Novo Nordisk subsidiaries in Brazil.</data>
