</node>
<node id="Hipoglicemia Leve">
  <data key="d0">Hipoglicemia Leve</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hipoglicemia Leve refers to mild hypoglycemia episodes treatable with oral glucose or sugary foods.&lt;SEP&gt;Mild form of hypoglycemia with glucose levels between 54 and 70 mg/dL, treated with 15 g of carbohydrate.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d01ed6a801b11c1b53f4668059c1f9cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5341c88e6470a893413f9aaec70dbdae</data>
