</node>
<node id="Novolin® R FlexPen®">
  <data key="d0">Novolin® R FlexPen®</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Novolin® R FlexPen® is a prefilled, disposable insulin pen device that delivers a rapid‑acting, recombinant human insulin solution. The formulation is an aqueous, clear, colorless solution containing 100 International Units per milliliter (100 UI/mL) of fast‑acting human insulin.  

The pen is designed for single‑use, allowing the user to select and administer doses ranging from 1 to 60 units. It is supplied with a detailed usage leaflet that outlines proper handling, dose adjustment, and safety precautions. The device must be handled carefully, as damage to the pen can cause leakage of the insulin solution.  

Novolin® R FlexPen® is indicated for the treatment of diabetes mellitus. While its primary route of administration is subcutaneous injection, the insulin may also be given intravenously or intramuscularly when clinically appropriate. The pen’s design facilitates convenient, accurate dosing for patients and healthcare professionals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5c24a2af0d0291fc4f4730256c420e93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c68e2c07786710dd5250c6610f52b14d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd396c45bc09fb646d156b4e69d328e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9b085ae33d49450f3f8bc342b5eae55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f2714936869e55e840f5294caefeaee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cd48799a027437b9fe2e1a48b61cb3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2378c57a337d1ce7103c7086ebba76ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7ca732691e1cbcafd65e378b8d80144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba6b31518be6fff1db8b68a28e82f200</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786318425</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
