</node>
<node id="Frasco-ampola">
  <data key="d0">Frasco-ampola</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Frasco-ampola is the 10 mL ampoule container used to hold the injectable solution of Novolin® R.&lt;SEP&gt;Frasco-ampola is a bottle‑ampoule container described as holding 5 carpules.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-813e7e990dba10e8d4147252f6547423&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f7f04b0529d6f0ace11829cc4fa3b4</data>
