  <data key="d0">Carpules</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Carpules are small cartridges, noted as containing Penfill®.&lt;SEP&gt;Carpules are small sealed containers referenced together with the Penfill® brand for product delivery.</data>
