  <data key="d0">Insulina Humana rDNA</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulina humana rDNA is the active recombinant human insulin produced via DNA technology in the yeast Saccharomyces cerevisiae.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina Humana rDNA is recombinant human insulin produced by DNA technology in yeast.&lt;SEP&gt;The active substance described as human recombinant DNA insulin produced using Saccharomyces cerevisiae technology.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e4e1124e7acf6619a1a7c60febd5211c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-786395f3716fb61a79fd183c63e1a9d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f7f04b0529d6f0ace11829cc4fa3b4</data>
