<node id="Unidade Internacional (UI)">
  <data key="d0">Unidade Internacional (UI)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Unidade Internacional (UI) is the dosage unit used to quantify insulin activity, where 1 UI equals 0.035 mg of insulin anhydrous.&lt;SEP&gt;An International Unit equals 0.035 mg of anhydrous human insulin, used to quantify insulin dosage.&lt;SEP&gt;Unidade Internacional (UI) is a measurement unit where one UI corresponds to 0.035 mg of insulina humana anidra.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e4e1124e7acf6619a1a7c60febd5211c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-786395f3716fb61a79fd183c63e1a9d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f7f04b0529d6f0ace11829cc4fa3b4</data>
