  <data key="d2">Normoglicemia is the target blood glucose range (4.4–6.1 mmol/L) achieved in the ICU study.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood glucose level ranging from 4.4 to 6.1 mmol/L, considered normal.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e4e1124e7acf6619a1a7c60febd5211c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f7f04b0529d6f0ace11829cc4fa3b4</data>
