  <data key="d2">Edema Angioneurótico is a rare gastrointestinal swelling listed as a possible adverse reaction to insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Edema Angioneurótico is a severe swelling reaction described within anaphylactic events related to Novolin® R Penfill®.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0b4034f7cf7e37425b7c76f5e0f9fd11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7ca732691e1cbcafd65e378b8d80144</data>
