  <data key="d0">Carboidratos</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Carboidratos are nutrients that patients must ingest in a meal or snack within 30 minutes after injecting Novolin® R.&lt;SEP&gt;Carboidratos are dietary carbohydrates, with a recommended minimum intake of 210 g per day during lactation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0689fd73d2061ee466b9b90e03bda141&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e484a5a1df875be2e1525c8c64e2007</data>
