  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The American Diabetes Association Annual Scientific Sessions is a scientific conference where diabetes research is presented.&lt;SEP&gt;The American Diabetes Association Annual Scientific Sessions is a conference where studies on insulin therapies, including insulin aspart, were presented.</data>
