  <data key="d2">Insulin Aspart (IAsp) is a rapid‑acting insulin analogue used to control post‑prandial glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Aspart (IAsp) is a fast‑acting insulin analog used as a comparator in clinical studies with Novolin® R.</data>
