  <data key="d0">Resistência à Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin resistance is a metabolic condition where the body’s cells respond poorly to insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Resistência à Insulina is a metabolic condition linked to higher TTGO-1h values.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-929e31613caadc967412041c8c2155b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ad6eb7138be249f01b479174a34076</data>
