  <data key="d0">Insulin Regimen</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin regimen refers to the schedule and dosage plan for insulin administration.&lt;SEP&gt;An insulin regimen is a therapeutic plan specifying insulin type, dose, and timing.</data>
