<node id="Bone Density">
  <data key="d0">Bone Density</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Measurement of skeletal mineral content that is normal or elevated in lipodystrophy cases.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone density is examined in patients with Berardinelli-Seip congenital lipodystrophy, showing higher values in trabecular sites.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-336c6084eb6cb7c8ada29ed26c0cd20d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-005de970178a46619506bcc15fe94fa9</data>
