<node id="Generalized Lipodystrophy">
  <data key="d0">Generalized Lipodystrophy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Generalized lipodystrophy denotes loss of adipose tissue over the entire body.&lt;SEP&gt;A disorder of near‑absent body fat, often confused with malnutrition, characterized by body fat percentage below 7%.&lt;SEP&gt;Generalized lipodystrophy is a form of the disease affecting the whole body.&lt;SEP&gt;Generalized lipodystrophy is a severe form of lipodystrophy affecting the entire body’s fat stores.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-336c6084eb6cb7c8ada29ed26c0cd20d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-003b19adf9ab32e9587902e8d639d701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb7105c2156cb3f814ebb240d4a8a1fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-005de970178a46619506bcc15fe94fa9</data>
