<node id="PTRF">
  <data key="d0">PTRF</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">PTRF is a gene whose mutations cause secondary deficiency of caveolins.&lt;SEP&gt;PTRF is a gene linked to congenital generalized lipodystrophy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-336c6084eb6cb7c8ada29ed26c0cd20d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fee32f1fb0c848b0799071a86119b142</data>
