<node id="Metreleptin">
  <data key="d0">Metreleptin</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A leptin analog medication that can improve proteinuria in lipodystrophy patients.&lt;SEP&gt;A medication approved in some countries for generalized lipodystrophies, shown to reduce appetite and improve several metabolic complications.&lt;SEP&gt;Metreleptin is a therapeutic agent studied for its effects on proteinuria in lipodystrophy patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Metreleptin is a therapeutic peptide analogue of leptin investigated for treating metabolic complications of lipodystrophy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-336c6084eb6cb7c8ada29ed26c0cd20d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb7105c2156cb3f814ebb240d4a8a1fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-005de970178a46619506bcc15fe94fa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c96221c60c19f02ac6efa6a987b1e15b</data>
