<node id="Dyslipidemia">
  <data key="d0">Dyslipidemia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dyslipidemia is a disorder of lipid metabolism mentioned as a clinical feature of familial partial lipodystrophy.&lt;SEP&gt;Abnormal lipid levels, included among additional risk factors for screening type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Dyslipidemia is an abnormal lipid profile associated with MODY-CEL.&lt;SEP&gt;Abnormal blood lipid levels, noted as a condition that enhances risk for Type 2 Diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;An abnormal lipid profile, including high triglycerides and low HDL cholesterol, associated with prediabetes and obesity.&lt;SEP&gt;Dyslipidemia is an abnormal lipid profile linked to type 2 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-003b19adf9ab32e9587902e8d639d701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-343246c2eef6e8430b581340d6cd4762&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e26b32d53b78f97e8d7fa8b815f2cc87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca8741dfdb9ff0f12f049953db6cb9c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a111d4b40ec241cf54126f594a80308&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9eb02ab1ab7d834858bf60a8b402e6ea</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377331</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
