<node id="Lpf Tipo 1 (Variante Köbberling)">
  <data key="d0">Lpf Tipo 1 (Variante Köbberling)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A rare form of familial lipodystrophy reported in two families and four sporadic cases, characterized by limited adipose loss in the extremities with normal facial fat.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-383b02cc66391d66174344ff49464766</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321236</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lpf Tipo 2 (Variante Dunnigan)">
  <data key="d0">Lpf Tipo 2 (Variante Dunnigan)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The most common and studied form of familial lipodystrophy with about 300 described cases, caused by mutations in the LMNA gene.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-383b02cc66391d66174344ff49464766</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
