</node>
<node id="Displasia Mandibuloacral">
  <data key="d0">Displasia Mandibuloacral</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A rare autosomal recessive syndrome characterized by mandibular and clavicle hypoplasia, distal phalangeal acro‑osteolysis, delayed cranial suture closure, short stature, progeroid facial features, alopecia, nail dysplasia, lipodystrophy, insulin resistance and associated diabetes and dyslipidemia.&lt;SEP&gt;A rare syndrome classified as a laminopathy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-383b02cc66391d66174344ff49464766&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
