<node id="Codon 482 Mutation">
  <data key="d0">Codon 482 Mutation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Mutation at codon 482 of the LMNA gene that substitutes arginine with glutamine, leucine, or tryptophan, accounting for about 75% of LPF Tipo 2 cases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-383b02cc66391d66174344ff49464766</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
