  <data key="d0">Metreleptin‑Mediated Improvements in Insulin Sensitivity Are Independent of Food Intake in Humans with Lipodystrophy</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A paper reporting that metreleptin improves insulin sensitivity regardless of changes in food intake among lipodystrophy patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb7105c2156cb3f814ebb240d4a8a1fb</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
