</node>
<node id="PLoS One">
  <data key="d0">PLoS One</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">PLoS One is a peer‑reviewed scientific journal that published the article on causes of death in Berardinelli‑Seip lipodystrophy.&lt;SEP&gt;PLoS One is an open‑access journal that published a systematic review on diagnostic methods for diabetic retinopathy.&lt;SEP&gt;PLoS One is an open‑access scientific journal that published the systematic review on diagnostic accuracy for type 2 diabetes and prediabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;PLoS One is a multidisciplinary open‑access scientific journal.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal that published the Tanzanian hemoglobinopathy study.&lt;SEP&gt;PLOS ONE is an open‑access journal covering all areas of science and medicine.&lt;SEP&gt;A peer‑reviewed open‑access journal publishing a systematic review on pre‑pregnancy care for women with diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb7105c2156cb3f814ebb240d4a8a1fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8393954b021d0ad02018d1a449e0cc93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44aa59c0e5cc620a11b8fb017d1aefcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea6df8d05eb3fdd356a1eaef16a26dd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f1215318cea8c61dc12042476611f9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a22fadf52eaea018160e4dd41d1d39b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84032013252fd71963ed381e09a3116d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377400</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="J Clin Endocrinol Metab">
  <data key="d0">J Clin Endocrinol Metab</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Journal of Clinical Endocrinology &amp; Metabolism is a medical journal that published the metreleptin proteinuria study.&lt;SEP&gt;J Clin Endocrinol Metab is a clinical journal that featured guidelines on insulin infusion and glucose monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;J Clin Endocrinol Metab is a scientific journal cited in the reference list.&lt;SEP&gt;J Clin Endocrinol Metab is a journal that published baseline characteristics of adolescents and youth with recent‑onset type 2 diabetes from the TODAY cohort.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal that published the glycated hemoglobin utility study.&lt;SEP&gt;The Journal of Clinical Endocrinology &amp; Metabolism that featured a paper on autoimmune polyendocrinopathy.&lt;SEP&gt;Journal of clinical endocrinology and metabolism.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb7105c2156cb3f814ebb240d4a8a1fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00d07129873894814fe6540ce243ef9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddc3658b93eb925d28d625c4e2ce652f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c23c0554362bde8c591c91d4a0185a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-525031caa389d084bc170433212cdca8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c122c1c6d7dd36110b6ddba2c074d122&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84032013252fd71963ed381e09a3116d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377287</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
