<node id="Berardinelli‑Seip Congenital Generalized Lipodystrophy">
  <data key="d0">Berardinelli‑Seip Congenital Generalized Lipodystrophy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Berardinelli‑Seip congenital generalized lipodystrophy is an inherited form of generalized lipodystrophy with early‑onset metabolic complications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb7105c2156cb3f814ebb240d4a8a1fb</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321244</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LMNA">
  <data key="d0">LMNA</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Gene whose mutations in exons 8‑10 cause Displasia Mandibuloacral type A and are also involved in the Dunnigan variant of familial partial lipodystrophy.&lt;SEP&gt;LMNA is a gene associated with partial lipodystrophy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fee32f1fb0c848b0799071a86119b142</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786373087</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ZMPSTE24">
  <data key="d0">ZMPSTE24</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Gene whose mutations cause Displasia Mandibuloacral type B and encodes a zinc metalloproteinase responsible for post‑translational proteolysis of prelamin A.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321244</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LMNB2">
  <data key="d0">LMNB2</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Gene encoding lamin B2; heterozygous alterations have been identified in some patients with Lipodistrofia Parcial Adquirida but not yet confirmed as causal.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321244</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lipodistrofia Parcial Adquirida">
  <data key="d0">Lipodistrofia Parcial Adquirida</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Acquired partial lipodystrophy that develops later in life, is non‑congenital, non‑hereditary, not linked to known lipodystrophy genes and can be triggered by medications, acute diseases or autoimmune mechanisms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321244</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Síndrome de Barraquer‑Simons">
  <data key="d0">Síndrome de Barraquer‑Simons</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The most common non‑HIV form of Lipodistrofia Parcial Adquirida, with onset before age 15, symmetric cephalocaudal loss of subcutaneous fat sparing the abdomen, accumulation of fat in lower body, predominance in women, and occasional metabolic complications such as diabetes, membranoproliferative glomerulonephritis and drusen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321244</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Prelamina A">
  <data key="d0">Prelamina A</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Precursory form of lamin A that accumulates when ZMPSTE24 function is deficient, implicated in the pathogenesis of Displasia Mandibuloacral type B.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321244</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lamin A Mature">
  <data key="d0">Lamin A Mature</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Mature lamin A protein whose deficiency may underlie Displasia Mandibuloacral type B.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321245</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Zinc Metalloproteinase">
  <data key="d0">Zinc Metalloproteinase</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Enzyme encoded by ZMPSTE24 that catalyzes post‑translational proteolysis of prelamin A.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321245</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Complement C3">
  <data key="d0">Complement C3</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Serum complement protein found at reduced levels in many patients with Lipodistrofia Parcial Adquirida.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321245</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Factor Nefrítico C3">
  <data key="d0">Factor Nefrítico C3</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Autoantibody that blocks degradation of the C3 convertase complex in some Lipodistrofia Parcial Adquirida patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321245</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="C3 Convertase">
  <data key="d0">C3 Convertase</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Key enzyme complex of the complement pathway whose activity is inhibited by Factor Nefrítico C3.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321245</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glomerulonefrite Membranoproliferativa">
  <data key="d0">Glomerulonefrite Membranoproliferativa</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Kidney disease observed in some patients with Síndrome de Barraquer‑Simons.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321245</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Drusen">
  <data key="d0">Drusen</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Extracellular yellow‑white ocular deposits reported in a subset of Síndrome de Barraquer‑Simons cases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321245</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Small Lipid Droplet">
  <data key="d0">Small Lipid Droplet</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Small intracellular lipid vesicle that can fuse with other droplets during adipocyte lipid storage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321245</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Large Lipid Droplet">
  <data key="d0">Large Lipid Droplet</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Larger lipid vesicle formed by the fusion of multiple small lipid droplets, a process mediated by a specific protein.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321245</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Protein Involved in Lipid Droplet Fusion">
  <data key="d0">Protein Involved in Lipid Droplet Fusion</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Protein that facilitates the fusion of small lipid droplets into a larger droplet during adipocyte lipid metabolism.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321245</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lipodistrofias">
  <data key="d0">Lipodistrofias</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">General term referring to disorders characterized by abnormal distribution or loss of adipose tissue, encompassing various forms such as Displasia Mandibuloacral and acquired or HIV‑associated lipodystrophies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321246</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lipodistrofia Parcial Adquirida não HIV">
  <data key="d0">Lipodistrofia Parcial Adquirida não HIV</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Non‑HIV form of acquired partial lipodystrophy, distinct from the HIV‑related type, and includes subtypes such as Síndrome de Barraquer‑Simons.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321246</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lipodistrofia Parcial Familiar">
  <data key="d0">Lipodistrofia Parcial Familiar</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Inherited partial lipodystrophy, commonly abbreviated as LPF, with a known variant called Dunnigan.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321246</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LPF variante Dunnigan">
  <data key="d0">LPF variante Dunnigan</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dunnigan variant of Lipodistrofia Parcial Familiar, associated with mutations in the LMNA gene.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3ed9d0b8e96400d871602cdd7862d35</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321246</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Antirretroviral">
  <data key="d0">Antirretroviral</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Antiretroviral drugs used in HIV treatment, which should be switched to less metabolically toxic options in cases of HIV-associated lipodystrophy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321246</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tesamorelina">
  <data key="d0">Tesamorelina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An analogue of growth hormone‑releasing factor (aGHRH) that reduces excess visceral fat and is indicated for treating visceral lipo‑hypertrophy associated with HIV, though unavailable in Brazil.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321246</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="aGHRH">
  <data key="d0">aGHRH</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The growth hormone‑releasing hormone analogue that serves as the basis for tesamorelina.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321246</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lipo‑hipertrofia Visceral">
  <data key="d0">Lipo‑hipertrofia Visceral</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An excess of visceral fat linked to HIV infection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321246</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tratamentos Cosméticos">
  <data key="d0">Tratamentos Cosméticos</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Cosmetic interventions, such as methacrylate injections, autologous adipose tissue transplantation, and reconstructive surgery, used to mitigate the psychological impact of phenotypic changes in lipodystrophy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321247</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Metacrilato">
  <data key="d0">Metacrilato</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A substance injected subcutaneously as a cosmetic method to fill facial defects.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321247</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Transplante Autólogo de Tecido Adiposo">
  <data key="d0">Transplante Autólogo de Tecido Adiposo</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A cosmetic procedure that transplants the patient’s own adipose tissue for facial filling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321247</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cirurgias Reconstrutivas">
  <data key="d0">Cirurgias Reconstrutivas</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Reconstructive surgeries employed in severe cosmetic cases of lipodystrophy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321247</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lipoaspiração">
  <data key="d0">Lipoaspiração</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A surgical technique to excise or remove excess adipose tissue, with a risk of recurrence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321247</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Excesso de Tecido Adiposo">
  <data key="d0">Excesso de Tecido Adiposo</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Abnormal accumulation of adipose tissue in certain body regions observed in some lipodystrophy patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321247</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Acompanhamento Multiprofissional">
  <data key="d0">Acompanhamento Multiprofissional</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A multidisciplinary follow‑up considered essential for individuals with lipodystrophic syndromes due to complex metabolic alterations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321247</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lipodistrofias Generalizadas">
  <data key="d0">Lipodistrofias Generalizadas</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Generalized forms of lipodystrophy presenting a distinctive phenotype, often subdiagnosed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321247</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hipertrofia Muscular">
  <data key="d0">Hipertrofia Muscular</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Increased muscle mass that may appear in generalized lipodystrophy, sometimes non‑pathological in men and more evident in women due to lack of subcutaneous fat.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321247</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Síndrome de Berardinelli‑Seip">
  <data key="d0">Síndrome de Berardinelli‑Seip</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The congenital form of generalized lipodystrophy, described by Berardinelli and Seip, with a characteristic phenotype present from birth.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321247</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Síndrome de Lawrence">
  <data key="d0">Síndrome de Lawrence</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The acquired form of generalized lipodystrophy, where children appear phenotypically normal early and lose fat later, possibly associated with autoimmune diseases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321248</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Berardinelli">
  <data key="d0">Berardinelli</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The physician who first described the congenital generalized lipodystrophy later named after him.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321248</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Seip">
  <data key="d0">Seip</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The researcher who later contributed to the naming of the congenital generalized lipodystrophy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f54dda12a0c5f43832ff3c6f0dc78369</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/LIPODISTROFIAS.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321248</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
