<node id="Diabetes Materials">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Materials</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes materials include syringes, needles, lancets, insulin pens, insulin pump components, and other blood‑contaminated sharps that require proper disposal.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de69fd058597c808e8be5bd334395b84</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Descarte/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321780</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Used Syringes and Needles">
  <data key="d0">Used Syringes and Needles</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Used syringes and needles are sharps generated by diabetes care that must not be thrown in regular trash.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de69fd058597c808e8be5bd334395b84</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Descarte/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321780</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Other Perforating Items Contaminated with Blood">
  <data key="d0">Other Perforating Items Contaminated with Blood</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Other perforating items or items contaminated with blood are additional hazardous waste from diabetes care.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de69fd058597c808e8be5bd334395b84</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Descarte/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321780</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sharps Collector">
  <data key="d0">Sharps Collector</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The sharps collector is a rigid, lidded box with a wide opening designed specifically for collecting sharps waste.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de69fd058597c808e8be5bd334395b84</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Descarte/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321780</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Specialized Stores">
  <data key="d0">Specialized Stores</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Specialized stores are shops that sell medical waste containers such as sharps collectors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de69fd058597c808e8be5bd334395b84</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Descarte/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321781</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Surgical Houses">
  <data key="d0">Surgical Houses</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Surgical houses are establishments that supply medical waste containers like sharps collectors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de69fd058597c808e8be5bd334395b84</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Descarte/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321781</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Common Plastic Bag">
  <data key="d0">Common Plastic Bag</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A common plastic bag is a regular plastic sack used to initially contain the sealed sharps collector.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de69fd058597c808e8be5bd334395b84</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Descarte/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321781</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Resistant Plastic Bag">
  <data key="d0">Resistant Plastic Bag</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A resistant plastic bag is a sturdier sack used as secondary packaging for transporting the collector.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de69fd058597c808e8be5bd334395b84</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Descarte/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321781</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cleaning Professionals">
  <data key="d0">Cleaning Professionals</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Cleaning professionals are sanitation workers whose safety benefits from correct disposal of sharps.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de69fd058597c808e8be5bd334395b84</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Descarte/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321781</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Safe Disposal">
  <data key="d0">Safe Disposal</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Safe disposal is the practice of correctly discarding diabetes sharps to protect people and the environment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de69fd058597c808e8be5bd334395b84</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Descarte/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321781</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Citizenship Act">
  <data key="d0">Citizenship Act</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The act of citizenship refers to the civic responsibility of disposing waste correctly.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de69fd058597c808e8be5bd334395b84</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Descarte/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321781</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Environment">
  <data key="d0">Environment</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The environment is the natural surroundings that can be polluted by improperly discarded sharps.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de69fd058597c808e8be5bd334395b84</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Descarte/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321781</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="City">
  <data key="d0">City</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The city refers to the local municipality where the UBS provides disposal services.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de69fd058597c808e8be5bd334395b84</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Descarte/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786321781</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lipohypertrofia">
  <data key="d0">Lipohypertrofia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Lipohypertrofia is a common side effect of long‑term insulin therapy, characterized by fibrous, poorly vascularized lesions in subcutaneous adipose tissue.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0cec9d1eb70ae81e8c1cb85f0b49621</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/O que você precisa saber sobre Lipohipertrofia - Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322287</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dr. Augusto Pimazoni Netto">
  <data key="d0">Dr. Augusto Pimazoni Netto</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Dr. Augusto Pimazoni Netto is the author of the article discussing lipohypertrofia and its clinical implications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0cec9d1eb70ae81e8c1cb85f0b49621</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/O que você precisa saber sobre Lipohipertrofia - Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322287</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Long‑Term Insulin Therapy">
  <data key="d0">Long‑Term Insulin Therapy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Long‑Term Insulin Therapy refers to the continuous administration of insulin over an extended period, which is associated with the development of lipohypertrofia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0cec9d1eb70ae81e8c1cb85f0b49621</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/O que você precisa saber sobre Lipohipertrofia - Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322287</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intra‑Lesional Insulin Injection">
  <data key="d0">Intra‑Lesional Insulin Injection</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intra‑Lesional Insulin Injection involves administering insulin directly into lipohypertrophic tissue, resulting in reduced insulin absorption and higher post‑prandial glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0cec9d1eb70ae81e8c1cb85f0b49621</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/O que você precisa saber sobre Lipohipertrofia - Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322287</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lipohypertrophy Study">
  <data key="d0">Lipohypertrophy Study</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Lipohypertrophy Study is a research investigation involving 13 patients with Type 1 Diabetes that compared intra‑lesional insulin injection with injections in non‑affected areas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0cec9d1eb70ae81e8c1cb85f0b49621</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/O que você precisa saber sobre Lipohipertrofia - Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322288</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Famulla S">
  <data key="d0">Famulla S</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Famulla S is listed as an author of a referenced article on insulin injection into lipohypertrophic tissue published in Diabetes Care.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0cec9d1eb70ae81e8c1cb85f0b49621</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/O que você precisa saber sobre Lipohipertrofia - Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322288</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Prevalence Data">
  <data key="d0">Prevalence Data</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Prevalence Data reports that lipohypertrofia occurs in 28 % to 64 % of diabetic patients, being more common in Type 1 Diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0cec9d1eb70ae81e8c1cb85f0b49621</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/O que você precisa saber sobre Lipohipertrofia - Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322288</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Post‑Prandial Glucose Level Data">
  <data key="d0">Post‑Prandial Glucose Level Data</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Post‑Prandial Glucose Level Data indicates glucose concentrations of ≥300 mg/dL observed in two patients after intra‑lesional insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0cec9d1eb70ae81e8c1cb85f0b49621</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/O que você precisa saber sobre Lipohipertrofia - Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322288</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sample Size">
  <data key="d0">Sample Size</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Sample Size denotes that the study enrolled 13 patients with Type 1 Diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0cec9d1eb70ae81e8c1cb85f0b49621</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/O que você precisa saber sobre Lipohipertrofia - Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322288</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sample Subgroup">
  <data key="d0">Sample Subgroup</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Sample Subgroup refers to the two patients within the study who received intra‑lesional insulin and exhibited high post‑prandial glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0cec9d1eb70ae81e8c1cb85f0b49621</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/O que você precisa saber sobre Lipohipertrofia - Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322289</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Self‑Administration of Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Self‑Administration of Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Self‑Administration of Insulin denotes the technique patients should follow for proper insulin injection, including site rotation and avoidance of needle reuse.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0cec9d1eb70ae81e8c1cb85f0b49621</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/O que você precisa saber sobre Lipohipertrofia - Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322289</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Repeated Injection in Same Area">
  <data key="d0">Repeated Injection in Same Area</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Repeated Injection in Same Area is the practice of administering insulin repeatedly at the same body site, identified as a predisposing factor for lipohypertrofia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0cec9d1eb70ae81e8c1cb85f0b49621</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/O que você precisa saber sobre Lipohipertrofia - Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322289</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lipohypertrophic Lesion">
  <data key="d0">Lipohypertrophic Lesion</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Lipohypertrophic Lesion refers to the fibrous, poorly vascularized subcutaneous adipose tissue lesions that characterize lipohypertrofia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0cec9d1eb70ae81e8c1cb85f0b49621</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/O que você precisa saber sobre Lipohipertrofia - Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322289</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Post‑Prandial Glycemic Control">
  <data key="d0">Post‑Prandial Glycemic Control</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Post‑Prandial Glycemic Control denotes the regulation of blood glucose after meals, which is markedly impaired in patients with lipohypertrofia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0cec9d1eb70ae81e8c1cb85f0b49621</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/O que você precisa saber sobre Lipohipertrofia - Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322289</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Injection Into Lipohypertrophic Tissue">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Injection Into Lipohypertrophic Tissue</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Injection Into Lipohypertrophic Tissue is a scholarly article discussing blunted and variable insulin absorption and impaired post‑prandial glucose control, published in Diabetes Care.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0cec9d1eb70ae81e8c1cb85f0b49621</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Complicações relacionadas ao uso da insulina/O que você precisa saber sobre Lipohipertrofia - Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322289</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
