  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Basal Temporal is a temporary basal rate pattern that can be programmed into the MiniMed 770G pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal Temporal refers to the active temporary basal index indicated on the home screen of the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal Temporal is a temporary basal rate setting that can be programmed for a defined time period.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8762fcba31adb064a87d5d846c9a8aff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c8229e79576a8ad79f8dc8a3290e5ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdb2f497ff0665f2860089645ba9450</data>
