<node id="Basal Pattern">
  <data key="d0">Basal Pattern</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Basal Pattern is the configurable schedule of basal insulin rates programmed into an insulin pump to provide continuous background insulin over a full 24‑hour period. It consists of one to 48 individual basal rates that together cover the entire day, and the schedule must be manually entered during pump setup. Users can create, copy, revise, and activate one or more basal patterns; common examples include Basal 1, Basal 2, Workday, Day Off, and Sick Day.  

Each basal pattern defines the amount of insulin delivered at specific times, and the total daily dose may vary—for instance, a typical pattern might total 18 U of insulin. Because the pattern determines the baseline insulin flow, it can be adjusted to meet different lifestyle or clinical needs, but an incorrectly set pattern could deliver more insulin than is actually required.  

The basal pattern also serves functional roles within the pump’s safety features; for example, the programmed schedule is required for SmartGuard activation, which uses the pattern to help prevent hypo‑ or hyperglycemia. In summary, a basal pattern is a user‑defined, programmable set of basal insulin rates that governs the continuous insulin delivery of an insulin pump across a 24‑hour cycle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8762fcba31adb064a87d5d846c9a8aff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa6e3b40416ce7934111298208db5346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-995e322b08a5c6d446f5fd68e5c3fe5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9eee903de4b7e25fc53f52e2e739637&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf54a88e051fe74fd94b773f8b5d98da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b03b7fdf0dd9c96dc459929ccccdccff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28515a0aca492eeee478cd9947226498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcdc240f555b6c71532ea6d04e0c5798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9639df6feeacb49b96ddc51763dec77d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2af59ac9cf813cb07dac53f30250d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b8de1434b9d9f57cd225b5d3e0d7f3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b907eb92deb747df3fb3b37fb9974142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c5a5c97986d9b31b155b0c8f0cac1c5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
