<node id="Home Screen">
  <data key="d0">Home Screen</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Home Screen is the primary user‑interface display of the insulin pump (including the MiniMed 780G system) that appears by default when the device is powered on, after a battery change, when the pump exits Sleep mode, or whenever no other screen is active. It serves as the central navigation hub from which users can access all major functions, menus, and settings of the pump.

The Home Screen presents an overview of real‑time pump information. It continuously shows status icons such as basal activity, insulin delivery, sensor‑by‑suspend indicators, shield (alarm) icons, and alerts. When the Sensor Feature is enabled, a continuous CGM graph, sensor‑warm‑up messages, sensor status banners, trend arrows, and sensor‑specific alerts (e.g., “No Paired CGM”) are displayed alongside the current SG (sensor glucose) reading. Basal temporal patterns, active basal rates, bolus amounts in progress, and insulin‑on‑board values are also visible.

In addition to status data, the Home Screen provides shortcuts to key actions and settings. Users can tap options such as Suspend All Delivery, Resume Basal, SmartGuard functions, Alert Settings, Alert Silence, Reminder Settings, Active Insulin Time, and toggles for bolus features. Menu entries give rapid access to Delivery Settings, Max Basal/Max Bolus limits, basal and bolus setup (including preset temporary basal and pattern configuration), History, and other system screens. The layout adapts to the pump’s current mode (e.g., manual vs. sensor‑guided) and to enabled features, ensuring that relevant banners, messages, and required actions are shown after events such as exiting SmartGuard or completing a fill.

Overall, the Home Screen functions as the main graphical interface and overview page of the insulin pump, consolidating glucose and insulin data, system status, alerts, and navigation shortcuts so that users can monitor therapy and quickly reach any configuration or delivery function they need.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8762fcba31adb064a87d5d846c9a8aff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9eee903de4b7e25fc53f52e2e739637&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-527777f044e20410ca47d2c5b35306ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e2c8beb0e0581ef5724dc5c631252e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-653c72495ca2211399f4a6660e1905e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab510c8377992bab31045a97eb95893a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05241912c4f8f5e79ae75071a1c7c604&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83bb94d08bdb958eff25f76c9a6ac18a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d68acc5f59d78c14cf4d2e4d34edf5e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf54a88e051fe74fd94b773f8b5d98da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8e2f5011e0e0fe7dc11273e2f345b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b03b7fdf0dd9c96dc459929ccccdccff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe844728a502927fee80d42268408b1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0267d2986a48c4c31790b6f183277dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4faffc449b4b8ea09acbae135d21baa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b48243f8e773d3c94abc58e2314db2c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae3b43add031516d14e51c6d2a985bd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f3d819d6498d4482286628946e37a6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-177e9aca0bf1c1724474ea529826bece&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ceebe6fbf743053d7b55523365689e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27b3ea1063acf8e0a407a89daea0dc32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1196548781bdac364853fdfd2074ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92417ae942a11c591feb2ee9b5fadd7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9639df6feeacb49b96ddc51763dec77d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a01dc8dc15b92e2b0b570753b0f57632&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-542e3b31a3f3a9496f26d05d1255498a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14031c05fdb4152e391234af47d0cfe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd751b869edcd6c88d9e467cfb2cb0fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97eb00dc26d33c23bf8bf473c0a98472&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a074860e7f25b8dfbcccbabb53c645d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4d222786e6ed163a90874659266c72a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2af59ac9cf813cb07dac53f30250d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e9f02579c179c758cc6393322299d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ede0f32eb8f8ea1eaab76cc0bc7648fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b907eb92deb747df3fb3b37fb9974142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20af4762343b8357c2c72473211f2918&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8e9d04ca4b641b5d8d5ef85044f4566&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcea1ff62aae96936f552880e96faa69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f94cd06ab0d1bcc7a9349bc40ea3eb22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c030749e7f9a2ae77cb8993d7250cffe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da4119d4fc266b13dd11e47dd6f506ca</data>
