<node id="Equipo Médico">
  <data key="d0">Equipo Médico</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Equipo Médico is the term used to refer to the user’s medical team—a group of healthcare professionals who provide comprehensive guidance, advice, and support for diabetes management, particularly when an insulin pump such as the Bolus Wizard is being used.  

The team’s responsibilities include delivering detailed instructions on insulin administration and timing, determining recommended values for basal‑max and bolus‑max settings, and helping the patient establish appropriate insulin‑to‑carbohydrate ratios. They also advise on pump usage, set basal rates, adjust bolus doses, and review therapy data to ensure optimal glycemic control.  

In addition to routine therapy guidance, Equipo Médico assists with emergency planning, including the establishment of alarm limits and response protocols, and addresses practical concerns such as skin‑irritation issues related to pump use. The team serves as the primary point of contact for any therapy‑related questions, offering recommendations on medication, treatment plans, and limit settings.  

Overall, Equipo Médico collaborates closely with the patient to customize treatment plans, fine‑tune pump parameters, and provide ongoing education and support, thereby playing a central role in safe and effective diabetes self‑management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8aa63853b30ac5d214c8cd80df90e517&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5863810bebfd1be64b8af80afcd57e11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5a3c673db465ff57a023abf1cd26053&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f6eb3be969569b166fc1e5f7e7567f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4cf85d0e1e129080fae6f9bea5bd77f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beee0553403f566be565a996251cac46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c123ae434326de3ccfe03d252e5d267&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d6466bdd61e024e50acc3fed9a5f9f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6737e479a665e986547e5e1e29ef26da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb3bd140c8e2ac53cf1b45386cb861ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3d0dd38cbfd29061a0c9916efb7c5d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-505b4450257d1a728c397959b044ee97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ed0e4c13d1643a77d1d74092a8cda5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-817893fc39ccf7551d476cefaf7f32ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eaa74c3ef8165f52ddf18e17a240a9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cbaec668e54aa5cf462a7bd08d7813c</data>
