<node id="Pantalla De Inicio">
  <data key="d0">Pantalla De Inicio</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Pantalla De Inicio is the home screen of the insulin pump, serving as the initial display that appears when the device is powered on. It provides users with an at‑a‑glance overview of the pump’s operational status and key diabetes‑management data.

The screen prominently shows the current time, the glucose sensor (GS) reading, and the amount of active insulin remaining in the reservoir. Status icons indicate battery level, reservoir status, and other system alerts, while additional indicators convey bolus progress and any ongoing basal delivery. The GS value remains visible for a set period—typically up to twelve minutes—after the user enters the screen, ensuring that critical glucose information is readily accessible.

Beyond passive information, Pantalla De Inicio functions as a navigation hub. Users can tap icons or menu items to access functions such as Basal settings, Infusion Settings, “Opciones,” and other pump features. This interactive element allows quick selection of therapy adjustments without leaving the main display.

Overall, Pantalla De Inicio integrates real‑time glucose monitoring, insulin reservoir tracking, battery and system status, and convenient access to therapeutic controls, making it the central interface for daily pump operation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8aa63853b30ac5d214c8cd80df90e517&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1312783ffe5039c618a48f7f29ec51ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf725cb54eea97f946e1f27eae125a0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9688a6d3c7f751ad34af5a1cde24fa2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f6eb3be969569b166fc1e5f7e7567f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0dcb28a160ed0e11da58b075919575&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cf7c487c5bd4a61120add295be9d518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adb365cf52e00c7b4647e65dc0411d56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01785f6f03692dc5e35c672e21b345f7</data>
