  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Estado Básico is a status screen summarizing the last bolus, the last GS value, and the current basal rate.&lt;SEP&gt;Estado Básico is a screen in the MiniMed™ 640G system showing basic status information.&lt;SEP&gt;Basic status screen that shows reservoir level, the most recent bolus amount and time, and the latest GS value.</data>
