<node id="Notificaciones">
  <data key="d0">Notificaciones</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Notificaciones is a menu displaying the names and times of alarms, alerts, messages, and notices received in the last 24 hours.&lt;SEP&gt;Notificaciones are the alerts received by the pump in the last 24 hours shown on the status screen.&lt;SEP&gt;Notificaciones are system messages displayed to the user.&lt;SEP&gt;Menu section that lists names and times of alarms, alerts, and messages received in the last 24 hours.</data>
