<node id="Último Bolus">
  <data key="d0">Último Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Último Bolus is a record displayed in the Estado Básico screen indicating the time and amount of the most recent bolus administered.&lt;SEP&gt;Último Bolus displays information about the most recent bolus delivery on the status screen.&lt;SEP&gt;The most recent insulin bolus amount and administration time displayed in the basic status screen.</data>
