<node id="Medtronic Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Medtronic Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Medtronic Diabetes is a medical‑technology company that designs, manufactures, and distributes insulin‑pump systems, most notably the MiniMed 780G insulin pump, together with its compatible reservoirs, infusion sets, continuous‑glucose‑monitoring sensors, and transmitters. In addition to the core pump hardware, the company offers a range of accessories intended to conceal, protect, and personalize the device, and it provides guidance on selecting compatible components for optimal performance.

Beyond product supply, Medtronic Diabetes maintains a 24‑hour technical assistance line staffed by highly qualified personnel who can address troubleshooting, device setup, and clinical questions for pump users at any time. The company also supports travelers through a dedicated travel‑loan or travel‑assistance program that helps users obtain temporary equipment while abroad. Comprehensive product information, user resources, and support details are made available on the Medtronic Diabetes website.</data>
