<node id="Equipo De Infusión">
  <data key="d0">Equipo De Infusión</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Equipo De Infusión is the infusion‑set component used in insulin‑pump therapy, including the MiniMed 770G system. It comprises the tubing, cannula, connector, and reservoir‑line assembly that link the pump’s insulin reservoir to the insertion site on the body, allowing continuous subcutaneous delivery of insulin.  

The set functions as the physical interface between the pump and the patient: the cannula is inserted into the skin, the tubing carries insulin from the pump’s reservoir, and the connector secures the line to the pump. Proper placement and secure attachment are essential, as disconnection, leaks, or looseness can lead to rapid rises in blood glucose or loss of insulin delivery.  

Because the infusion set is a critical hardware element of the overall insulin‑pump system, users must monitor it for signs of malfunction, replace it according to the manufacturer’s schedule, and ensure correct insertion technique to maintain reliable insulin administration.&lt;SEP&gt;The infusion set that includes a tube, connector, insertion site section, and adhesive, used to deliver insulin from the pump to the user.&lt;SEP&gt;Equipo de infusión is the infusion set equipment used with the MiniMed 670G insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The infusion set includes the tubing and needle that deliver insulin from the reservoir into the body.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1f5ccf80661c0e52c3a3465ab87c6343&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9526502ad449d7dc77120264e206f332&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fa7ad1de214645f0e643708dc1efab8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34da912924aa29d035c8cd1c3f4f6ae3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1255cfcf42afb2c6045de0d45b11e99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4d039b786601ed8a06d8adad50938&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ed0e4c13d1643a77d1d74092a8cda5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9b29e7a7839d7ff2b29e72fb4912618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eaa74c3ef8165f52ddf18e17a240a9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fb90cfe4a3993c8a19c8fd291cc4d67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb7c582936fb68746bd1911895df40c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a967066e623ddb0c9381f89dfe0f3d42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-995e322b08a5c6d446f5fd68e5c3fe5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1577ef83aca01016db533eba7c49d2a1</data>
