<node id="Mango Verde">
  <data key="d0">Mango Verde</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Mango Verde is the green handle component used to release the needle protector.&lt;SEP&gt;The green handle is pulled until a click is heard to release the infusion set.</data>
