<node id="SmartGuard">
  <data key="d0">SmartGuard</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">SmartGuard is the automated insulin‑delivery and safety algorithm embedded in the MiniMed 770G insulin pump. It constitutes a menu option that activates the system’s “automatic mode,” enabling the pump to continuously adjust basal insulin rates, deliver auto‑correction boluses, and, when necessary, suspend insulin delivery based on real‑time sensor glucose (SG) readings and user‑entered carbohydrate information. The algorithm calculates basal adjustments and correction doses without relying on the pump’s preset Max basal setting, instead using an internally determined delivery limit and an Active Insulin Time (AIT) that is typically recommended at 2–3 hours.  

In addition to basal modulation, SmartGuard monitors glucose trends to generate multiple alerts—including warnings for impending hypo‑ or hyperglycemia, notifications of excessive predicted basal delivery, and prompts for temporary target changes. When glucose values fall below a programmed threshold, the feature can automatically suspend insulin (with options for user‑initiated exit or silent continuation) and can enter a “block mode” that prevents further insulin delivery until safe glucose levels are restored. The system also supports automatic correction boluses that are calculated from current BG/SG values and carbohydrate entries, providing a safety layer that aims to keep glucose within target ranges while minimizing the risk of both low and high glucose excursions.  

Overall, SmartGuard integrates basal regulation, active insulin‑time‑based auto‑corrections, trend‑driven alerts, and insulin‑suspend capabilities into a cohesive, menu‑driven therapy mode that enhances diabetes management by delivering responsive, algorithm‑driven insulin therapy while safeguarding against delivery errors.&lt;SEP&gt;A technology used in the Medtronic 670G® insulin pump to provide hybrid closed-loop glucose control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9526502ad449d7dc77120264e206f332&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84bb2bb0df91a594c6936b2fe97e4220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdb2f497ff0665f2860089645ba9450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-653ce0324c2ed605bfadb08f01e649c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05241912c4f8f5e79ae75071a1c7c604&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83bb94d08bdb958eff25f76c9a6ac18a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8e2f5011e0e0fe7dc11273e2f345b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b03b7fdf0dd9c96dc459929ccccdccff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcdc240f555b6c71532ea6d04e0c5798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae3b43add031516d14e51c6d2a985bd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20af4762343b8357c2c72473211f2918&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c5a5c97986d9b31b155b0c8f0cac1c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d8fcf807f0beb090b2f3d68cc7c168&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da4119d4fc266b13dd11e47dd6f506ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2d6e4597425d2a83c3efcd9ca07f65c</data>
