<node id="Karen">
  <data key="d0">Karen</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Karen is a user who administers an insulin bolus for lunch and may interrupt it due to a phone call.&lt;SEP&gt;Karen eats at her desk at work, gets distracted often, and administers the lunch bolus as a square bolus for 45 minutes to ensure insulin does not act before carbohydrates are digested.&lt;SEP&gt;Karen is a user who administers her lunch bolus as a square bolus while working at her desk.&lt;SEP&gt;Karen is a user who initiates a manual bolus for lunch and decides to interrupt it when a long-distance phone call arrives.&lt;SEP&gt;Karen is a person who eats at her desk and administers her lunch insulin as a 45‑minute square bolus to match carbohydrate digestion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5863810bebfd1be64b8af80afcd57e11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dada456819c45230012103650ccc14a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd31a315488bb0669257b83dd88b9809&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35a3bbe287cd55b2fd0a1505c706e7a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-785aac5c827baebbe0c372f8c4550f23</data>
