<node id="Tubo">
  <data key="d0">Tubo</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Tubo is the tubing that connects the reservoir to the infusion site.&lt;SEP&gt;Tube is the infusion tubing that connects the pump to the infusion set.&lt;SEP&gt;Tubo is the infusion set tubing that can develop air bubbles or blood leaks.&lt;SEP&gt;The tube (1) that transports insulin from the pump to the user as part of the infusion set.</data>
