<node id="Ajustes de Infusión">
  <data key="d0">Ajustes de Infusión</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Infusion settings allow configuration of basal and bolus delivery parameters and are accessible from the main menu.&lt;SEP&gt;Ajustes de Infusión is a menu area for configuring bolus and basal insulin settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Menu within the pump where basal and bolus maximum settings are configured.&lt;SEP&gt;Ajustes de Infusión groups settings that control insulin infusion parameters such as basal rates and bolus calculations.&lt;SEP&gt;Ajustes de Infusión is the pump's infusion settings screen accessed when configuring bolus or basal options.&lt;SEP&gt;Ajustes de Infusión is the set of infusion settings where basal and bolus maximum values can be configured.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84bb2bb0df91a594c6936b2fe97e4220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5a3c673db465ff57a023abf1cd26053&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1a77062463b62317e84265a3b2b6d4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdb2f497ff0665f2860089645ba9450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc1b97c88d050500f2b90b8837bd34bd</data>
