  <data key="d0">Marcador Eventos</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Marcador Eventos allows marking events such as glucose readings, injections, meals, exercise, and others.&lt;SEP&gt;Marcador Eventos is an event marker feature.&lt;SEP&gt;Marcador Eventos is a menu section for logging events such as glucose readings, injections, meals, exercise, or other entries.&lt;SEP&gt;Marcador eventos is an option on the meter used to mark events related to insulin therapy.</data>
