  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Menu element that allows adjustment of screen brightness, timeout, and background light.&lt;SEP&gt;Opciones Pantalla lets the user adjust screen settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Opciones pantalla are the screen display options available on the MiniMed 670G pump menu.&lt;SEP&gt;Screen options menu that lets the user adjust screen brightness, background light, and other display settings on the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Opciones Pantalla is a screen option to adjust display settings.</data>
