  <data key="d0">Bolus Predefinido</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bolus Predefinido provides a predefined bolus setting selectable from the menu.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Predefinido is a method for delivering a predefined bolus amount.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Predefinido is a predefined bolus option.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Predefinido is a menu option providing preset bolus amounts for quick administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84bb2bb0df91a594c6936b2fe97e4220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdb2f497ff0665f2860089645ba9450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cf7c487c5bd4a61120add295be9d518</data>
