</node>
<node id="Suspender Infusión">
  <data key="d0">Suspender Infusión</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Suspender Infusión is a method that stops all insulin infusion.&lt;SEP&gt;The suspend infusion function stops all insulin delivery from the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Suspender infusión is the method to pause insulin delivery on the MiniMed 670G pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Suspender Infusión is a menu option that stops all insulin infusion, typically used before swimming or showering.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84bb2bb0df91a594c6936b2fe97e4220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f6eb3be969569b166fc1e5f7e7567f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-995e322b08a5c6d446f5fd68e5c3fe5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cf7c487c5bd4a61120add295be9d518</data>
