<node id="Easy Bolus">
  <data key="d0">Easy Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Easy Bolus is a method that simplifies bolus delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Easy Bolus is a simplified bolus entry mode designed for quick dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Easy Bolus is a bolus type available only in Manual mode.&lt;SEP&gt;Easy bolus is a feature that delivers a normal bolus in preset increments using sound or vibrate confirmation.&lt;SEP&gt;Easy Bolus is a feature that delivers a normal bolus in preset increments using sound or vibrate confirmation.&lt;SEP&gt;Easy Bolus is a method providing a simplified bolus delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84bb2bb0df91a594c6936b2fe97e4220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdb2f497ff0665f2860089645ba9450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6025fa711665988fad0f789b9eb901a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9639df6feeacb49b96ddc51763dec77d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c5a5c97986d9b31b155b0c8f0cac1c5</data>
