  <data key="d5">1786329603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Velocidad de Bolus">
  <data key="d0">Velocidad de Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Velocidad de Bolus sets the speed of bolus delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Velocidad de Bolus controls the delivery speed of a bolus dose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84bb2bb0df91a594c6936b2fe97e4220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdb2f497ff0665f2860089645ba9450</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325517</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Audio">
  <data key="d0">Audio</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The audible beep mode that the pump can emit.&lt;SEP&gt;Audio configures the pump's sound alerts.&lt;SEP&gt;Audio is the pump’s sound notification system that can emit a repeated tone, a vibration of two or three pulses, or both.&lt;SEP&gt;Audio is a sound output option that can be enabled for the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Sound notification option that can be activated on the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Audio refers to the sound and vibration output of the insulin pump used for alarms, alerts, and messages.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84bb2bb0df91a594c6936b2fe97e4220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9688a6d3c7f751ad34af5a1cde24fa2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdb2f497ff0665f2860089645ba9450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e303ffa37ca96974ad7399e052659bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14031c05fdb4152e391234af47d0cfe4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329641</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Vibración">
  <data key="d0">Vibración</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The vibration mode that the pump can emit.&lt;SEP&gt;Vibración configures the pump's vibration alerts.&lt;SEP&gt;Vibración is a haptic feedback option that can be enabled for the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Vibration notification option that can be activated on the pump.</data>
