  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bolus Dual/Cuadrado is a method for delivering a bolus using a dual or square waveform.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Dual/Cuadrado is a combined dual and square bolus mode offered by the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Dual/Cuadrado is a bolus delivery mode that splits the dose into two or more square-wave segments.</data>
