  <data key="d0">Incremento Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Incremento Bolus defines the incremental step size for bolus dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Incremento Bolus is a setting that defines the incremental step size when adjusting bolus amounts.</data>
