  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Basal/Bolus Máx. sets the maximum allowable basal and bolus insulin delivery limits.&lt;SEP&gt;Combined screen in the pump settings that allows configuration of both basal max and bolus max limits.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal/Bolus Máx. sets the maximum allowed basal and bolus delivery rates.</data>
