  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose Target Range defines the desired blood glucose interval (low Ba and high Al) and can be configured with one or multiple time segments.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose Target Range defines the desired blood glucose interval for optimal diabetes control.</data>
