  <data key="d2">Carbohydrate Amount (HC) is the number of grams of carbohydrates the user plans to eat, entered as input for bolus calculation.&lt;SEP&gt;The quantity of grams of carbohydrates entered by the user to calculate a meal bolus.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbohydrate Amount is the quantity of grams of carbohydrates entered by the user for calculating a meal bolus.</data>
