<node id="Patrones Basales">
  <data key="d0">Patrones Basales</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Patrones basales are pre‑programmed insulin delivery schedules configured in the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Option used to review currently configured basal patterns and to select the basal pattern that should be active on the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal patterns that define scheduled insulin delivery, allowing multiple patterns for different days or shifts.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal Patterns are collections of basal patterns stored in the pump for insulin delivery schedules.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal patterns that define insulin delivery rates over a 24‑hour cycle.&lt;SEP&gt;Patrones Basales are saved basal rate schedules that can be applied to the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Patrones Basales are basal insulin delivery patterns that can be reviewed, copied, activated, or modified.</data>
