<node id="Bolus Square">
  <data key="d0">Bolus Square</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A square bolus delivers insulin gradually over a set duration to align insulin action with carbohydrate digestion.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Square is a method that delivers insulin continuously over a set period.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2dada456819c45230012103650ccc14a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd31a315488bb0669257b83dd88b9809</data>
