<node id="Alerta">
  <data key="d0">Alerta</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Alerta is a warning signal from the pump indicating a situation that may require attention, such as low reservoir or battery.&lt;SEP&gt;Alert is a notification indicating conditions such as low reservoir or low battery, accompanied by a red light flashing once, an audio tone or vibration, and a yellow screen icon.&lt;SEP&gt;An alert condition indicated by the flashing notification light.&lt;SEP&gt;A warning notification from the pump indicating a situation that may require user attention.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-644dc086af7b196cc5bc332524608d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb7c582936fb68746bd1911895df40c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-220ba7466dbb8a2a07b8e4b09b215d39</data>
