  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Screen is the pump’s display that shows a notification with an icon and instructions for the user.&lt;SEP&gt;The display screen of the pump used to navigate menus and view glucose graphs.&lt;SEP&gt;The display screen of the pump where options and icons appear.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump’s display screen that shows icons, text instructions, and notifications for alerts and alarms.&lt;SEP&gt;The screen displays menus, warnings, and status information for the pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb7c582936fb68746bd1911895df40c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a967066e623ddb0c9381f89dfe0f3d42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e303ffa37ca96974ad7399e052659bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-220ba7466dbb8a2a07b8e4b09b215d39</data>
