  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Blocked Infusion is an example of an alarm that occurs when insulin cannot be delivered through the tubing or cannula.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific alarm condition indicating that insulin cannot be infused through the tube or cannula.</data>
