<node id="Rebobinar">
  <data key="d0">Rebobinar</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Rewind is a method to change the reservoir and infusion set when a blocked infusion alarm recurs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
