<node id="Patrón Basal">
  <data key="d0">Patrón Basal</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A basal pattern schedule that defines insulin delivery rates throughout a 24‑hour period.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal Pattern is a content set of basal indices that can be edited, reviewed, or added to.&lt;SEP&gt;Patrón Basal is a basal pattern option.&lt;SEP&gt;Patrón Basal is a concept representing the overall schedule of basal insulin delivery throughout a 24‑hour period.&lt;SEP&gt;Patrón basal is a basal insulin delivery pattern that can be selected, copied, edited, or activated.&lt;SEP&gt;The basal rate pattern configuration that determines insulin delivery over time.&lt;SEP&gt;A schedule of basal insulin indices that defines insulin delivery over different time segments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9688a6d3c7f751ad34af5a1cde24fa2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc1b97c88d050500f2b90b8837bd34bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cf7c487c5bd4a61120add295be9d518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adb365cf52e00c7b4647e65dc0411d56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7305e2b34a4a57db2afea4935fe2fc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-220ba7466dbb8a2a07b8e4b09b215d39</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325522</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Configuración De Patrón Basal">
  <data key="d0">Configuración De Patrón Basal</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The process to add, edit, or change basal patterns, including naming the pattern and entering required basal indices.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal Pattern Configuration is a method used to modify a basal pattern through a series of menu selections.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1312783ffe5039c618a48f7f29ec51ed</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322869</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Opciones">
  <data key="d0">Opciones</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Opciones is the submenu that allows selection of actions such as Editar.&lt;SEP&gt;Options is a content element in the pump’s menu used during configuration and selection steps.&lt;SEP&gt;A menu option on the pump interface that allows users to access various settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Opciones is the submenu option that provides actions such as copying a basal pattern.&lt;SEP&gt;Opciones is the menu option used to access settings such as basal max, bolus max, and infusion adjustments.&lt;SEP&gt;The options menu accessed from the pump interface that includes actions such as Editar.&lt;SEP&gt;Opciones is the menu screen in the pump interface that provides access to various functions such as history and settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1312783ffe5039c618a48f7f29ec51ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d41e93e7754b06eedcc2e2a44afcb32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1a77062463b62317e84265a3b2b6d4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc1b97c88d050500f2b90b8837bd34bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adb365cf52e00c7b4647e65dc0411d56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1577ef83aca01016db533eba7c49d2a1</data>
