  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Menu element that allows the user to select audio, vibration, or both for pump alerts.&lt;SEP&gt;Audio Options is the menu content that allows the user to configure the pump’s audio notification settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Opciones de audio are the audio setting options available on the MiniMed 670G pump menu.&lt;SEP&gt;Opciones De Audio are audio settings allowing selection of audio, vibration, or both.</data>
