<node id="CareLink Personal">
  <data key="d0">CareLink Personal</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">CareLink Personal is a software program that allows users to download and review pump data.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink Personal is a secure web‑based program that organizes pump data into easy‑to‑read reports for users and their medical team.&lt;SEP&gt;Software that provides sensor data for therapy adjustments.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink Personal is a software program introduced for managing pump data and settings.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink Personal is a free, internet‑based program from Medtronic that transfers pump and meter data to a secure website for reporting.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink Personal is a software program that receives insulin pump and meter data for remote access by healthcare providers.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink Personal is a software platform that provides the latest configuration report used to program the insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9855ca7ae42a0c01685280c4cc5bb56a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c8229e79576a8ad79f8dc8a3290e5ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fb90cfe4a3993c8a19c8fd291cc4d67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f3c75e751c36c2f270820a403b40ac0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-381370d223aabc9b355b55a05c98e07b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcff234f91816c50c56d0113b934824c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9eee903de4b7e25fc53f52e2e739637</data>
