<node id="Blue Adapter">
  <data key="d0">Blue Adapter</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Blue Adapter is a device used to transfer data from the MiniMed pump to the CareLink program when the mobile app cannot be used.&lt;SEP&gt;An accessory that connects the MiniMed 780G insulin pump to a computer and must be disconnected when not in use.&lt;SEP&gt;The Blue Adapter uploads system data from the MiniMed 780G system to CareLink software via a USB connection.&lt;SEP&gt;Blue Adapter is a hardware accessory used to upload system data from the MiniMed 780G System to CareLink software.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9855ca7ae42a0c01685280c4cc5bb56a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdb000b83632c89167783ad4e6f1fb64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a764dcbdd73fd1c50fa72a7cd60b6e19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dd74224daea51112742135154e46244</data>
