  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Medical Team">
  <data key="d0">Medical Team</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Medical Team refers to the group of healthcare professionals who support patients using insulin pump therapy. They are responsible for advising when to insert the insulin reservoir, providing training on pump setup, and offering guidance on sensor insertion, site irritation, and the use of emergency kits. The team also assists users in determining appropriate insulin‑to‑carbohydrate ratios when therapy is initiated and helps manage pump‑related issues such as transmitter irritation.

In addition to instructional support, the Medical Team continuously monitors glucose data, including CareLink reports, to evaluate basal patterns and make necessary adjustments. They review glucose readings, assess high ketone bodies, nausea, vomiting, or persistently elevated glucose levels, and intervene with therapy modifications. Their oversight extends to individualized adjustments for activity, alcohol consumption, and hypoglycemia management, ensuring that basal rates, bolus calculations, and insulin‑to‑carb ratios are optimized for each patient.

Overall, the Medical Team provides professional, ongoing guidance for insulin therapy, acting as the primary point of contact for therapy adjustments, troubleshooting pump or sensor issues, and coordinating care whenever clinical concerns arise. Their role is to ensure safe, effective, and personalized insulin pump use throughout the patient’s treatment journey.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9855ca7ae42a0c01685280c4cc5bb56a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa6e3b40416ce7934111298208db5346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd31a315488bb0669257b83dd88b9809&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fe81d733c2a429da0726794b55350b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dd9a1bb820381073ad2475541a3a575&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b9f6a4a440ccb40e47c326ca6dd9346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0caf812af55afd2de9fea4fdd33fd06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dc33cf2a90bf53c26226e44bc285c22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70519ee85d46567e23db476b219f16a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59137a5f20ce729bcde5c65e1e45aa29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07b23fc13c50867e0aa61204fb79bc2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab7cedc48ea8fdd199a2c12c99416a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d03a310916c005d1dfa70800a753d1c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ab69ff55dee7eb424c572ea28a45ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce8c9873da330aac077f7ccaf108ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2b8be67edef23560656776b89947c10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9b29e7a7839d7ff2b29e72fb4912618</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
