<node id="User Manual">
  <data key="d0">User Manual</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">User Manual is the detailed documentation included in the meter box that explains how to operate the Accu-Chek Guide Link.&lt;SEP&gt;User Manual is the instruction document that provides usage guidelines, warnings, and maintenance procedures for the Accu-Chek Solo system.&lt;SEP&gt;The user manual for Accu-Chek Solo contains usage instructions, warnings, information, and notes for safe and appropriate operation.&lt;SEP&gt;User Manual is the instruction guide that provides usage, cleaning, and maintenance directions for the Accu-Chek Solo micro‑pump system.&lt;SEP&gt;The user manual provides detailed safety information, including recommendations for meter use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9855ca7ae42a0c01685280c4cc5bb56a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0626e0ac97f4b970eb2c1ce138923abc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3ad4687f0918b43c325eb513c97227b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0eedfa9db50d515c53181256a5959a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db5749bec4af1c3ea068b257c4376aaf</data>
