</node>
<node id="CareLink™ Personal">
  <data key="d0">CareLink™ Personal</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A service that provides the latest configuration report used to set up the Bolus Wizard™ on a new pump.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink™ Personal is software that receives and displays glucose trends and patterns from the MiniMed™ 640G system.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink™ Personal is software that allows systematic review of data from the insulin pump and MCG.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink™ Personal is a data platform that stores sensor glucose values and therapy information used to adjust insulin pump therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink™ Personal is software that allows users to register accounts, download system data, and create reports for the MiniMed™ 640G.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1312783ffe5039c618a48f7f29ec51ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beee0553403f566be565a996251cac46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59137a5f20ce729bcde5c65e1e45aa29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2474d83c9e01bbd20c6e68744a2dad5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edbbe2e207a7e0a28611a2a16fa2845f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324132</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ratio De Hidratos De Carbono">
  <data key="d0">Ratio De Hidratos De Carbono</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The carbohydrate‑to‑insulin ratio used by the Bolus Wizard™ to determine bolus dosing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1312783ffe5039c618a48f7f29ec51ed</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322871</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="G/U">
  <data key="d0">G/U</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The unit representing grams of carbohydrate per unit of insulin in a carbohydrate ratio.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1312783ffe5039c618a48f7f29ec51ed</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322871</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="U/H">
  <data key="d0">U/H</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The unit representing units of insulin delivered per hour for basal rates.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1312783ffe5039c618a48f7f29ec51ed</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322871</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mensaje Basal Temporal">
  <data key="d0">Mensaje Basal Temporal</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The on‑screen message indicating that an Índice Basal Temporal is currently active.&lt;SEP&gt;The on‑screen message indicating that a temporary basal index is currently active.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1312783ffe5039c618a48f7f29ec51ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adb365cf52e00c7b4647e65dc0411d56</data>
