</node>
<node id="Finalizado">
  <data key="d0">Finalizado</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Finalizado is the command that ends the editing session.&lt;SEP&gt;A menu option indicating the completion of a configuration process.&lt;SEP&gt;The action indicating completion of a configuration process.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1312783ffe5039c618a48f7f29ec51ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d41e93e7754b06eedcc2e2a44afcb32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adb365cf52e00c7b4647e65dc0411d56</data>
