</node>
<node id="Guardar">
  <data key="d0">Guardar</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The action to save configuration changes in the pump menu.&lt;SEP&gt;Guardar is the command that stores the configured basal pattern.&lt;SEP&gt;A menu option used to save changes made in the pump settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Save action used to store configuration changes on the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The action to save changes made to basal indices, patterns, or temporary settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1312783ffe5039c618a48f7f29ec51ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d41e93e7754b06eedcc2e2a44afcb32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9688a6d3c7f751ad34af5a1cde24fa2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adb365cf52e00c7b4647e65dc0411d56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e303ffa37ca96974ad7399e052659bb</data>
