  <data key="d0">Cancelar</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A menu option used to abort or exit a configuration without saving.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cancel button used to abort or exit actions in the pump interface.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1312783ffe5039c618a48f7f29ec51ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adb365cf52e00c7b4647e65dc0411d56</data>
