  <data key="d0">Añadir Nuevo</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A menu command for creating a new basal pattern or index.&lt;SEP&gt;Añadir Nuevo is the option within Config. Patrón Basal to create a new basal pattern.&lt;SEP&gt;The action to create a new basal pattern by providing a name and associated basal indices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1312783ffe5039c618a48f7f29ec51ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1a77062463b62317e84265a3b2b6d4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adb365cf52e00c7b4647e65dc0411d56</data>
