  <data key="d0">Siguiente</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A navigation command to proceed to the next step in a configuration wizard.&lt;SEP&gt;The Next button used to proceed to the following step in configuration processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1312783ffe5039c618a48f7f29ec51ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adb365cf52e00c7b4647e65dc0411d56</data>
