  <data key="d0">Índice Basal Programado Normal</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The regular scheduled basal insulin rate that the pump delivers when no temporary adjustments are active.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1312783ffe5039c618a48f7f29ec51ed</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322872</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Índice Basal Activo">
  <data key="d0">Índice Basal Activo</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The currently active basal insulin setting, which may be a regular or temporary index.&lt;SEP&gt;The currently active basal insulin rate being delivered by the pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1312783ffe5039c618a48f7f29ec51ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adb365cf52e00c7b4647e65dc0411d56</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325529</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Índice Basal Temporal Activo">
  <data key="d0">Índice Basal Temporal Activo</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The temporary basal insulin index that is currently in effect, indicated by an on‑screen message.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1312783ffe5039c618a48f7f29ec51ed</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322872</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MiniMed MMT-332A Reservoir">
  <data key="d0">MiniMed MMT-332A Reservoir</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The MiniMed MMT-332A reservoir is a 3.0 mL (300 U) insulin cartridge referenced in the pump’s status icons.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322873</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Icono del Reservorio">
  <data key="d0">Icono del Reservorio</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The reservoir icon visually indicates the remaining insulin volume in the MiniMed MMT-332A reservoir.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322873</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Icono de Audio">
  <data key="d0">Icono de Audio</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The audio icon shows the current alert mode (audio, vibration, or both) being used by the pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322873</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pantalla de Inicio">
  <data key="d0">Pantalla de Inicio</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The home screen is the initial display of the pump from which users can access the main menu.&lt;SEP&gt;Pantalla de inicio is the home screen of the insulin pump that displays messages and status during insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1a77062463b62317e84265a3b2b6d4a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325513</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Luz de Fondo">
  <data key="d0">Luz de Fondo</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The background light illuminates the pump’s screen and can be turned off to save battery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322873</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Modo de Inactivación">
  <data key="d0">Modo de Inactivación</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Inactivity mode is a power‑saving state that locks the pump after the background light turns off.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322873</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Botón Resaltado">
  <data key="d0">Botón Resaltado</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The highlighted button is pressed to unlock the pump and confirm user interaction.&lt;SEP&gt;Botón Resaltado is the highlighted button used to unlock the pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cf7c487c5bd4a61120add295be9d518</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325523</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Margaret">
  <data key="d0">Margaret</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Margaret is a user who observed the screen dimming behavior of the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Margaret is a person who observed the screen behavior when buttons were not pressed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cf7c487c5bd4a61120add295be9d518</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325522</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Barra de Desplazamiento">
  <data key="d0">Barra de Desplazamiento</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The scroll bar appears on the right side of a screen when more than six lines of information are present.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322873</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Opciones de Audio">
  <data key="d0">Opciones de Audio</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Audio options let the user select between audio alerts, vibration, or both, and adjust volume.&lt;SEP&gt;Opciones de Audio is a menu element that allows configuring audio, vibration, and volume for the pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdb2f497ff0665f2860089645ba9450</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325515</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Opciones de Pantalla">
  <data key="d0">Opciones de Pantalla</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Screen options allow the user to modify the background light behavior and other display settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322873</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Icono de la Pila">
  <data key="d0">Icono de la Pila</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The battery icon shows a single red bar when the battery is low and turns fully black with a red outline when the battery must be replaced.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322874</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Desbloqueo de la Bomba">
  <data key="d0">Desbloqueo de la Bomba</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Pump unlock is the procedure of pressing the highlighted button to exit inactivity mode and access the menu.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322874</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Silenciar Alertas">
  <data key="d0">Silenciar Alertas</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Silence alerts is a screen option that mutes audio and vibration notifications.&lt;SEP&gt;Silenciar Alertas is a screen to mute alerts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cf7c487c5bd4a61120add295be9d518</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325524</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Estado del Sensor">
  <data key="d0">Estado del Sensor</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensor status displays the last calibration and the next scheduled calibration on the pump’s status screens.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322874</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Estado de la Bomba">
  <data key="d0">Estado de la Bomba</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Pump status provides information such as battery level, reservoir volume, start time, and device identifiers on the status screens.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322874</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Jessica">
  <data key="d0">Jessica</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Jessica is a person who injected insulin and later uses an insulin pump; her glucose readings were high in the morning.&lt;SEP&gt;Jessica is a person who injects insulin and monitors her blood glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fa6e3b40416ce7934111298208db5346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7305e2b34a4a57db2afea4935fe2fc2</data>
