<node id="Basal Index">
  <data key="d0">Basal Index</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Basal Index refers to a basal rate setting in the insulin pump, such as Basal Index 1.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal Index refers to the basal insulin delivery rate, which should keep glucose within the target range.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal Index refers to the illustrative basal rate values shown in the guide, which differ from the user’s actual basal settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fa6e3b40416ce7934111298208db5346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2b8be67edef23560656776b89947c10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9eee903de4b7e25fc53f52e2e739637</data>
