  <data key="d0">24‑Hour Period</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The 24‑hour period is the daily time span over which the basal pattern delivers insulin continuously.&lt;SEP&gt;A 24‑hour period refers to the full day span over which basal rates, patterns, and other settings may be programmed.</data>
