</node>
<node id="Gastroparesia">
  <data key="d0">Gastroparesia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Gastroparesia is a medical condition causing delayed digestion of food, mentioned as a situation where a square bolus can be useful.&lt;SEP&gt;Gastroparesia is a condition causing delayed gastric emptying, mentioned as a scenario where a square bolus may be useful.&lt;SEP&gt;Gastric motility disorder mentioned among conditions affecting insulin therapy decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;Gastrointestinal condition mentioned as a factor affecting glucose monitoring.</data>
