  <data key="d0">Número De Serie De La Bomba</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The serial number uniquely identifies the insulin pump and may be required when requesting technical assistance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cf725cb54eea97f946e1f27eae125a0b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322877</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Línea De Asistencia Técnica 24 Horas">
  <data key="d0">Línea De Asistencia Técnica 24 Horas</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A 24‑hour technical assistance phone line that connects callers to local support staff for the insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cf725cb54eea97f946e1f27eae125a0b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322877</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Equipo De Asistencia Local">
  <data key="d0">Equipo De Asistencia Local</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The local assistance team that provides technical support for the insulin pump after a call to the 24‑hour line.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cf725cb54eea97f946e1f27eae125a0b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322877</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tapa Del Portapilas">
  <data key="d0">Tapa Del Portapilas</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The battery cover secures the AA battery in the insulin pump and must be tightened correctly to avoid damage or detection issues.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cf725cb54eea97f946e1f27eae125a0b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322878</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Clip De La Bomba">
  <data key="d0">Clip De La Bomba</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The pump’s clip is used to turn the battery cover when securing it on the insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cf725cb54eea97f946e1f27eae125a0b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322878</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Icono De La Pila">
  <data key="d0">Icono De La Pila</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The battery icon on the home screen indicates the charge level of the AA battery with colors and bars.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cf725cb54eea97f946e1f27eae125a0b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322878</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Icono Del Reservorio">
  <data key="d0">Icono Del Reservorio</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The reservoir icon on the home screen represents the MiniMed MMT reservoir component of the insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cf725cb54eea97f946e1f27eae125a0b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322878</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reservorio MiniMed Mmt">
  <data key="d0">Reservorio MiniMed Mmt</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The MiniMed MMT reservoir stores insulin within the insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cf725cb54eea97f946e1f27eae125a0b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322878</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MiniMed">
  <data key="d0">MiniMed</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">MiniMed is the manufacturer of the MMT reservoir used in the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;MiniMed is Medtronic’s insulin‑pump device referenced throughout the user manual.&lt;SEP&gt;The product brand associated with the insulin pump and its technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;MiniMed is the company that develops the MiniMed 780G system and the MiniMed Mobile app.&lt;SEP&gt;MiniMed is the manufacturer of the Paradigm Veo 754 and 640G insulin pumps.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cf725cb54eea97f946e1f27eae125a0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fa7ad1de214645f0e643708dc1efab8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-653ce0324c2ed605bfadb08f01e649c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c030749e7f9a2ae77cb8993d7250cffe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0a2dce3852e38344f91c86f45dda403</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786330177</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Asistente De Configuración">
  <data key="d0">Asistente De Configuración</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The configuration assistant guides the user through language, time format, date, and other settings when the insulin pump is turned on.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cf725cb54eea97f946e1f27eae125a0b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322878</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Luz De Notificación">
  <data key="d0">Luz De Notificación</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The notification light on the insulin pump blinks when an alert or alarm occurs.&lt;SEP&gt;The notification light on the pump that flashes when an alert or alarm is present.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cf725cb54eea97f946e1f27eae125a0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb7c582936fb68746bd1911895df40c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325480</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Modo De Inactivación">
  <data key="d0">Modo De Inactivación</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The inactivation mode is a setting of the insulin pump that can be activated by pressing and holding a button.&lt;SEP&gt;The inactivity mode that can be activated on the pump to pause operation.&lt;SEP&gt;Modo De Inactivación is a low‑power state where the pump is locked.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cf725cb54eea97f946e1f27eae125a0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb7c582936fb68746bd1911895df40c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cf7c487c5bd4a61120add295be9d518</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325480</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Asociación Estadounidense de la Diabetes (ADA)">
  <data key="d0">Asociación Estadounidense de la Diabetes (ADA)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Asociación Estadounidense de la Diabetes (ADA) is a U.S. organization that provides guidance and contact information for travelers with diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322878</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Transportation Security Administration (TSA)">
  <data key="d0">Transportation Security Administration (TSA)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Transportation Security Administration (TSA) is the U.S. agency responsible for security screening and travel regulations, including guidelines for insulin pump travelers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322878</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="X‑ray Machine">
  <data key="d0">X‑ray Machine</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">X‑ray Machine is a security scanning device that can damage insulin pumps if they are passed through it.&lt;SEP&gt;An X‑ray machine is equipment used for security scanning that should not be used on insulin pumps because of radiation risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-138cbaf5a43762d4c5b77a07ab51cbd4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325539</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lithium Batteries">
  <data key="d0">Lithium Batteries</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Lithium Batteries are power sources for medical devices that must be kept in original packaging and carried in hand luggage.&lt;SEP&gt;Lithium batteries power medical devices and must be kept in original packaging and carried in hand luggage according to TSA regulations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-138cbaf5a43762d4c5b77a07ab51cbd4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325539</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Medical Emergency Card">
  <data key="d0">Medical Emergency Card</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Medical Emergency Card is a printed card that travelers should carry to inform authorities of their diabetes and insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The Medical Emergency Card is a card provided with the device that supplies critical information for airport security and airplane pump use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329563</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="24‑Hour Technical Support Line">
  <data key="d0">24‑Hour Technical Support Line</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">24‑Hour Technical Support Line is a service provided by Medtronic Diabetes for troubleshooting insulin pump issues at any time.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322879</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Medtronic Travel Loan Program">
  <data key="d0">Medtronic Travel Loan Program</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Medtronic Travel Loan Program is a loan service that allows travelers to obtain a reserve insulin pump while abroad.&lt;SEP&gt;The Medtronic Travel Loan Program allows travelers to obtain a reserve insulin pump for use while abroad.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-138cbaf5a43762d4c5b77a07ab51cbd4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325539</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="United States (Continental)">
  <data key="d0">United States (Continental)</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">United States (Continental) refers to the mainland U.S. territory where TSA regulations apply.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322879</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="TSA Security Commissioner">
  <data key="d0">TSA Security Commissioner</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">TSA Security Commissioner is the TSA official on the ground who can be asked to visually inspect an insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322879</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ADA Contact Number">
  <data key="d0">ADA Contact Number</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">ADA Contact Number is the phone number 1.703.549.1500 ext. 1768 provided by the Asociación Estadounidense de la Diabetes for assistance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322879</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="TSA Contact Number">
  <data key="d0">TSA Contact Number</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">TSA Contact Number is the phone number 1-866-289-9673 provided by the Transportation Security Administration for traveler inquiries.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322879</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="TSA Travel Tips Webpage">
  <data key="d0">TSA Travel Tips Webpage</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">TSA Travel Tips Webpage is an online page (https://www.tsa.gov/blog/2014/04/01/tsa-travel-tips-travelers-diabetes-or-other-medical-conditions) offering guidance for travelers with diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322880</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Medtronic Diabetes Travel Webpage">
  <data key="d0">Medtronic Diabetes Travel Webpage</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Medtronic Diabetes Travel Webpage is an online resource (https://www.medtronicdiabetes.com/customer-support/traveling-with-an-insulin-pump-or-device) offering information on traveling with an insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322880</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Supplies">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Supplies</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Supplies are extra items such as reservoirs, infusion sets, batteries, and ketone test strips that travelers should carry.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322880</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Nutritious Food Bars">
  <data key="d0">Nutritious Food Bars</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Nutritious Food Bars are easy-to-carry snack bars recommended for travelers in case of flight delays or cancellations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322880</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ketone Test Strip">
  <data key="d0">Ketone Test Strip</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Ketone Test Strip is a diagnostic strip used to analyze ketone bodies in the blood, recommended for travelers with diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322880</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reserve Syringe">
  <data key="d0">Reserve Syringe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Reserve Syringe is a backup syringe for insulin administration in case the pump fails.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322880</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reserve Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d0">Reserve Insulin Pump</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Reserve Insulin Pump is an extra insulin pump provided through a travel loan program for use when the primary pump is unavailable.&lt;SEP&gt;A reserve insulin pump is a backup device that can be carried during travel under the Medtronic loan program.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1700b8f7c792afbd394001e28bf632f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-138cbaf5a43762d4c5b77a07ab51cbd4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325539</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Guía De Inicio I Patrones Basales">
  <data key="d0">Guía De Inicio I Patrones Basales</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Guía De Inicio I Patrones Basales is a user manual that provides step‑by‑step instructions for creating, editing, and deleting basal insulin rate patterns.&lt;SEP&gt;Guía De Inicio I Patrones Basales is a content document that provides step‑by‑step instructions for setting up basal insulin patterns.&lt;SEP&gt;Guía De Inicio I Patrones Basales is a guide document that instructs users on how to manage basal insulin patterns with an insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1d41e93e7754b06eedcc2e2a44afcb32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b56965a1473183cf6e1086bfecabe348&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7305e2b34a4a57db2afea4935fe2fc2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325489</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Función Suspender Infusión">
  <data key="d0">Función Suspender Infusión</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Función Suspender Infusión is a manual feature that temporarily stops all insulin infusion from the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Función Suspender Infusión is the manual method to stop all insulin infusion from the pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1d41e93e7754b06eedcc2e2a44afcb32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b56965a1473183cf6e1086bfecabe348</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325491</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Infusión De Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Infusión De Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Infusión De Insulina is the process by which the pump delivers insulin to the user.&lt;SEP&gt;Infusión De Insulina is the process of delivering insulin through the MiniMed™ 640G pump, which can be automatically suspended or resumed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1d41e93e7754b06eedcc2e2a44afcb32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dd65471e9cdf7a7389998e6124f5b10</data>
