  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Basal 1">
  <data key="d0">Basal 1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Basal 1 is the first basal pattern configuration that contains a series of Índice Basal entries.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific basal index (e.g., 0.750 U/h) selected in the pump’s basal pattern configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal 1 is a data entry representing a specific basal insulin rate, expressed in units per hour.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal 1 is a basal rate profile setting within the insulin pump that can hold multiple basal rate indices.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal 1 is a basal pattern that can be selected and copied for modification.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal 1 is a predefined basal pattern option.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1d41e93e7754b06eedcc2e2a44afcb32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b56965a1473183cf6e1086bfecabe348&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc1b97c88d050500f2b90b8837bd34bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7305e2b34a4a57db2afea4935fe2fc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e303ffa37ca96974ad7399e052659bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9639df6feeacb49b96ddc51763dec77d</data>
