  <data key="d2">U/h is the unit of measurement for basal insulin rates expressed in units per hour.&lt;SEP&gt;U/h is the unit of insulin delivery rate used when configuring the amount of basal insulin per hour.&lt;SEP&gt;U/h is the unit of measurement representing units of insulin per hour.</data>
