  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The background light setting that can affect battery life.&lt;SEP&gt;Luz de fondo refers to the backlight feature of the MiniMed 670G pump display.&lt;SEP&gt;Background light setting adjustable through Opciones Pantalla.&lt;SEP&gt;Luz De Fondo is the background light feature that turns off to save battery.&lt;SEP&gt;The backlight illuminates the screen when activated.</data>
