  <data key="d2">The settings interface used to configure basal patterns and infusion parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;Infusion settings menu where basal patterns and other insulin delivery parameters are configured.&lt;SEP&gt;Ajustes De Infusión are infusion settings accessible from various menu items.&lt;SEP&gt;Ajustes De Infusión is a method screen used to configure infusion parameters on the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Ajustes De Infusión refers to the infusion settings menu in the insulin pump used to configure basal rates.&lt;SEP&gt;The Infusion Settings menu where basal and other insulin parameters are configured.</data>
