</node>
<node id="Cuerpos Cetónicos">
  <data key="d0">Cuerpos Cetónicos</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Cuerpos Cetónicos are ketone bodies measured in urine or blood to assess the risk of diabetic ketoacidosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Cuerpos Cetónicos are ketone bodies whose presence is analyzed in the manual.&lt;SEP&gt;Ketone bodies that may appear in the blood when glucose is very high or during illness.&lt;SEP&gt;Cuerpos Cetónicos are ketone bodies measured in blood or urine indicating ketosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Cuerpos Cetónicos are ketone bodies whose presence indicates metabolic status and is used to assess insulin adequacy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-644dc086af7b196cc5bc332524608d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fa7ad1de214645f0e643708dc1efab8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34da912924aa29d035c8cd1c3f4f6ae3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1255cfcf42afb2c6045de0d45b11e99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ed0e4c13d1643a77d1d74092a8cda5a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324136</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
