  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Equipo de Infusión is the infusion set equipment that connects the pump to the infusion site.&lt;SEP&gt;Equipo de Infusión refers to the infusion set equipment used with the MiniMed™ 640G system for insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;The infusion set-including tubing and cannula-that delivers insulin from the reservoir to the body.</data>
