  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Pila is the battery powering the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The battery powering the pump, whose lifespan can be affected by background light settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Pila is the battery of the pump.</data>
