  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Rango Objetivo is the target glucose range that the user aims to maintain.&lt;SEP&gt;Rango Objetivo is the target blood glucose range that therapy aims to maintain.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-644dc086af7b196cc5bc332524608d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb3bd140c8e2ac53cf1b45386cb861ae</data>
