  <data key="d0">Tube</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The tube transports insulin from the pump to the insertion site.&lt;SEP&gt;The tube connects the infusion set to the insulin reservoir, allowing insulin to flow to the patient.&lt;SEP&gt;Tube is part of the infusion set that transports insulin from the pump to the insertion site.</data>
