<node id="Adhesive">
  <data key="d0">Adhesive</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The adhesive secures the infusion set in position on the user.&lt;SEP&gt;Adhesive or patch is used to secure the Enlite™ sensor to the skin.&lt;SEP&gt;Adhesive is used to secure the glucose sensor and Guardian™ 2 Link transmitter to the skin, but may detach when in water.&lt;SEP&gt;Adhesive secures the infusion set to the skin.&lt;SEP&gt;The adhesive is pressed against the skin to secure the infusion set after insertion.&lt;SEP&gt;Material that holds the infusion set in place on the skin.&lt;SEP&gt;Adhesive is a component of the Accu‑Chek® Solo system used to attach the pump to the skin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fe81d733c2a429da0726794b55350b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dd9a1bb820381073ad2475541a3a575&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d03a310916c005d1dfa70800a753d1c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f3c75e751c36c2f270820a403b40ac0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdabdf4730f349f4b46e7242c65d440d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e2c8beb0e0581ef5724dc5c631252e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7387e81b8141435df1372f5d8b27662</data>
