  <data key="d5">1786330139</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reservoir Compartment">
  <data key="d0">Reservoir Compartment</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The reservoir compartment is part of the pump where the reservoir is placed.&lt;SEP&gt;Reservoir Compartment is the part of the infusion set that houses the insulin reservoir.&lt;SEP&gt;The compartment inside the pump that holds the reservoir.&lt;SEP&gt;The reservoir compartment is the part of the insulin pump that holds insulin and should be kept dry.&lt;SEP&gt;Compartment of the insulin pump that holds the insulin reservoir and must stay dry.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fe81d733c2a429da0726794b55350b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f3c75e751c36c2f270820a403b40ac0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95ba6f1fa7d1791230f690255a8ba2df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e2c8beb0e0581ef5724dc5c631252e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb80f00ba2dab32852874cb384b38de3</data>
