  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Button">
  <data key="d0">Button</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The button allows the user to navigate menus, confirm selections, and reactivate the screen.&lt;SEP&gt;Button is the physical control on the pump that, when pressed, can trigger the Easy Bolus increment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fe81d733c2a429da0726794b55350b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-542e3b31a3f3a9496f26d05d1255498a</data>
