  <data key="d5">1786329640</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Screen">
  <data key="d0">Screen</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The screen displays menus, glucose graphs, and alerts; it can darken after inactivity.&lt;SEP&gt;The visual interface of the pump that displays menus and data.&lt;SEP&gt;Screen is the display component of the pump that shows menus, data, and alerts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fe81d733c2a429da0726794b55350b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f3d819d6498d4482286628946e37a6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329607</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Notification Light">
  <data key="d0">Notification Light</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The notification light flashes when an alert or alarm occurs.&lt;SEP&gt;The notification light on the pump flashes when an alarm or alert is active.&lt;SEP&gt;Notification Light is an indicator that blinks during self‑test.&lt;SEP&gt;Notification Light flashes on the pump when an alarm or alert is active.&lt;SEP&gt;Notification light is an LED indicator on the pump that illuminates to signal alerts or statuses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fe81d733c2a429da0726794b55350b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83bb94d08bdb958eff25f76c9a6ac18a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8e9d04ca4b641b5d8d5ef85044f4566&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcea1ff62aae96936f552880e96faa69</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329543</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Graph">
  <data key="d0">Graph</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The graph shows glucose sensor data on the screen.&lt;SEP&gt;A visual representation of data such as glucose trends.&lt;SEP&gt;Graph is content visualizing data trends.&lt;SEP&gt;Graph is a visual representation of sensor glucose trends referenced in the interface.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fe81d733c2a429da0726794b55350b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8e2f5011e0e0fe7dc11273e2f345b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c</data>
