<node id="Pump Serial Number">
  <data key="d0">Pump Serial Number</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The pump serial number is a unique identifier printed on the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Pump serial number is the unique identifier printed on the back of the MiniMed 780G insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Pump Serial Number is the unique identifier assigned to each MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump.</data>
