</node>
<node id="Suspender Infusión Manualmente">
  <data key="d0">Suspender Infusión Manualmente</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The manual suspend infusion function stops all insulin delivery from the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Suspender Infusión Manualmente is the manual procedure to halt insulin delivery from the insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-63f6eb3be969569b166fc1e5f7e7567f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b56965a1473183cf6e1086bfecabe348</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325492</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reanudar Infusión">
  <data key="d0">Reanudar Infusión</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The resume infusion function restarts insulin delivery, including basal insulin, after a suspension.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-63f6eb3be969569b166fc1e5f7e7567f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322885</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Plan">
  <data key="d0">Plan</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A medical plan includes glucose measurements and possible corrective boluses when disconnecting and reconnecting the pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-63f6eb3be969569b166fc1e5f7e7567f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322886</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Daniela">
  <data key="d0">Daniela</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Daniela prefers not to wear the pump while swimming and manually suspends it to prevent insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-63f6eb3be969569b166fc1e5f7e7567f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322886</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Susi">
  <data key="d0">Susi</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Susi finds it easier to administer a bolus with the pump than with injections.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-63f6eb3be969569b166fc1e5f7e7567f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322886</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Confirmación">
  <data key="d0">Confirmación</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The confirmation screen appears when selecting actions like suspend or resume infusion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-63f6eb3be969569b166fc1e5f7e7567f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786322886</data>
