  <data key="d0">Alarma 10:00A</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Alarma 10:00A is the specific alarm that sounds at 10:00 AM when no button is pressed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-310d06ee583c6aa24af77816642d0ba7</data>
