<node id="Bloodstream">
  <data key="d0">Bloodstream</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The bloodstream is the circulatory medium that carries glucose, insulin, and ketone bodies throughout the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Bloodstream is the circulatory system through which insulin enters and exerts its effects on glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;Bloodstream is the circulatory system that transports insulin and glucose throughout the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The bloodstream transports glucose throughout the body.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b7715667f5fca178f0988984e932ecfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65c6beab51324e055f4a39b388e2eefe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce8c9873da330aac077f7ccaf108ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b867cec4c5eed3b10e431cbd4078dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324097</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="U100 Rapid-Acting Insulin">
  <data key="d0">U100 Rapid-Acting Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">U100 Rapid-Acting Insulin is a fast‑acting insulin formulation (100 units/mL) used by insulin pumps.&lt;SEP&gt;Rapid‑acting insulin with a concentration of 100 units/mL used exclusively in insulin pump therapy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b7715667f5fca178f0988984e932ecfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5913d17c337be62cd526d46fbdcd9a6e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324100</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Guardian™ 2 Link">
  <data key="d0">Guardian™ 2 Link</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Guardian™ 2 Link is a transmitter that connects to the glucose sensor, stores glucose data for up to 10 hours, and can be worn in water when properly attached.&lt;SEP&gt;Guardian™ 2 Link is a transmitter that records glucose values from the Enlite™ sensor for up to 10 hours.</data>
