<node id="Airplane Mode">
  <data key="d0">Airplane Mode</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Airplane Mode is a feature that disables wireless communication of the MiniMed™ 640G pump during flight or when the pump is disconnected.&lt;SEP&gt;Airplane Mode is a setting activated on the MiniMed™ 640G pump to suspend wireless communication during flight.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1dd9a1bb820381073ad2475541a3a575&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d03a310916c005d1dfa70800a753d1c5</data>
