<node id="MiniMed™ 640G">
  <data key="d0">MiniMed™ 640G</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">MiniMed™ 640G is a sensor‑augmented insulin pump system designed for comprehensive diabetes management. The device delivers rapid‑acting insulin via a programmable basal rate and multiple bolus options that can be tailored to meal composition, while also providing a temporal basal index function for adjusting basal delivery in specific situations. Its home screen can display the amount of active insulin, and the Bolus Wizard™ feature assists users in calculating appropriate bolus doses.

The system incorporates a continuous glucose sensor that requires user calibration and presents real‑time glucose values, trend arrows, limits, and a variety of trend graphs. Advanced algorithms emulate the basal insulin delivery of a healthy pancreas and enable the SmartGuard™ feature, which monitors glucose trends to prevent hypoglycemia by automatically suspending insulin infusion and later resuming basal delivery when safe. Users receive alerts for high or low glucose levels and can view detailed glucose information directly on the pump.

MiniMed™ 640G is built for durability and flexibility in everyday life. It is water‑resistant to a depth of 3.6 meters for up to 24 hours when used according to the instructions, and it can be placed in Airplane Mode during flights. The device is referenced throughout the user and therapy guides, emphasizing its role as the central component of the prescribed insulin therapy regimen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1dd9a1bb820381073ad2475541a3a575&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4cf85d0e1e129080fae6f9bea5bd77f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0caf812af55afd2de9fea4fdd33fd06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beee0553403f566be565a996251cac46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70519ee85d46567e23db476b219f16a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59137a5f20ce729bcde5c65e1e45aa29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36de8c99d97d234e12244c240c45f156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d03a310916c005d1dfa70800a753d1c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2474d83c9e01bbd20c6e68744a2dad5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce8c9873da330aac077f7ccaf108ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edbbe2e207a7e0a28611a2a16fa2845f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9b29e7a7839d7ff2b29e72fb4912618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-817893fc39ccf7551d476cefaf7f32ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5f31f609ed760b9e36f235d0109b470&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bec9e867c8de5a0beabd70ea9209c1a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eaa74c3ef8165f52ddf18e17a240a9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dd65471e9cdf7a7389998e6124f5b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cbaec668e54aa5cf462a7bd08d7813c</data>
