<node id="SAP">
  <data key="d0">SAP</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensor‑augmented pump (SAP) is a diabetes‑management therapy that integrates an insulin pump with a continuous glucose monitoring (CGM) system. By coupling the pump’s programmable insulin delivery with real‑time glucose sensor data, SAP enables clinicians and users to base insulin dosing and lifestyle decisions on current glucose levels rather than on intermittent finger‑stick measurements alone. The concept is employed in commercial systems such as the MiniMed™ 640G, where the SAP software displays glucose trends, trend arrows, and calibration guidance, and allows users to set threshold alerts for high‑glucose events.

The CGM component of SAP provides continuous glucose information, including the direction and speed of glucose change. This trend data is presented to the user through visual displays and audible alerts, helping to anticipate and prevent both hyperglycemia (including the risk of Diabetic Ketoacidosis) and hypoglycemia. Users can adjust high‑glucose thresholds and receive warnings when glucose levels rise rapidly, supporting proactive interventions such as insulin boluses or carbohydrate intake.

In clinical practice, SAP is described as a structured, daily‑routine therapy mode. It is used to improve overall glycemic control by delivering insulin in response to sensor‑derived glucose values, while also offering educational value: mastering the system’s features and interpreting trend information typically requires a learning period. The approach is therefore both a technological solution and a learning method that patients integrate into their everyday insulin management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1dd9a1bb820381073ad2475541a3a575&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0caf812af55afd2de9fea4fdd33fd06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beee0553403f566be565a996251cac46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fa7ad1de214645f0e643708dc1efab8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2f8a0d67f7320d6157b61dbbf428a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c123ae434326de3ccfe03d252e5d267&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-646b0d64191b72fd929f7fb514a8cb8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36de8c99d97d234e12244c240c45f156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4d039b786601ed8a06d8adad50938&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d03a310916c005d1dfa70800a753d1c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d6466bdd61e024e50acc3fed9a5f9f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2474d83c9e01bbd20c6e68744a2dad5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ab69ff55dee7eb424c572ea28a45ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce8c9873da330aac077f7ccaf108ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3d901ee668c4fdbd518454aa3ebea3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da325dc5071cd02bfe55ffc2f9b79aa5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-505b4450257d1a728c397959b044ee97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-817893fc39ccf7551d476cefaf7f32ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5f31f609ed760b9e36f235d0109b470&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bec9e867c8de5a0beabd70ea9209c1a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eaa74c3ef8165f52ddf18e17a240a9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dd65471e9cdf7a7389998e6124f5b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff2787d1cec4a771ee14b7d5d97324a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
