</node>
<node id="Cetoacidosis Diabética (CAD)">
  <data key="d0">Cetoacidosis Diabética (CAD)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cetoacidosis Diabética (CAD) is a serious complication of diabetes that can develop from prolonged high glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Cetoacidosis diabética (CAD) is a diabetic complication mentioned at the beginning of the text.&lt;SEP&gt;A serious medical condition caused by insufficient insulin, leading to high blood glucose and accumulation of ketone bodies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e91ce385a4956221ce891caa7456655a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c123ae434326de3ccfe03d252e5d267&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4d039b786601ed8a06d8adad50938</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324116</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ketone Bodies">
  <data key="d0">Ketone Bodies</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Ketone bodies are acidic waste products produced when the body uses fat for energy in the absence of sufficient insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Compounds measured when blood glucose exceeds 250 mg/dL to assess metabolic state.&lt;SEP&gt;Metabolic byproducts produced when the body burns fat for energy due to lack of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Ketone bodies are metabolic by‑products produced when the body uses fat for fuel, indicating metabolic imbalance.&lt;SEP&gt;Ketone Bodies are metabolic compounds whose presence in blood must be checked during illness.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e91ce385a4956221ce891caa7456655a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5913d17c337be62cd526d46fbdcd9a6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dc33cf2a90bf53c26226e44bc285c22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b867cec4c5eed3b10e431cbd4078dee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff2787d1cec4a771ee14b7d5d97324a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324116</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ketone Body Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Ketone Body Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The process of testing for ketone bodies to assess risk of diabetic ketoacidosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e91ce385a4956221ce891caa7456655a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324116</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CAD Warning Signs">
  <data key="d0">CAD Warning Signs</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Indicators such as high blood glucose and presence of ketone bodies that precede diabetic ketoacidosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e91ce385a4956221ce891caa7456655a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324117</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CAD Symptoms">
  <data key="d0">CAD Symptoms</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Clinical manifestations like nausea, vomiting, abdominal pain, confusion, lethargy, breathing difficulty, and decreased consciousness associated with diabetic ketoacidosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e91ce385a4956221ce891caa7456655a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324117</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="High Blood Glucose Level">
  <data key="d0">High Blood Glucose Level</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Elevated blood glucose concentration that serves as a warning sign of diabetic ketoacidosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e91ce385a4956221ce891caa7456655a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324117</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insertion Site">
  <data key="d0">Insertion Site</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The body location where the insulin infusion set is placed for delivering insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;The insertion site on the body is chosen from shaded areas, cleaned, and rotated regularly to avoid overuse.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e91ce385a4956221ce891caa7456655a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe844728a502927fee80d42268408b1a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329590</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Capillary Blood Glucose">
  <data key="d0">Capillary Blood Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose measurement obtained from a fingerstick sample, used for monitoring and entered into the insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e91ce385a4956221ce891caa7456655a</data>
