  <data key="d2">Target Glucose Range is the desired blood glucose interval set by the user for insulin dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Target glucose range defines the desired blood glucose interval for the patient.&lt;SEP&gt;Target glucose range is the desired blood glucose level programmed into the insulin pump.</data>
