  <data key="d0">Blood Glucose Reading</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Blood Glucose Reading is the measured glucose concentration in the bloodstream used for insulin dosing decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;A blood glucose (BG) reading is a measurement obtained with a BG meter used to confirm insulin dosing and sensor glucose values.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood glucose (BG) readings are manual glucose measurements entered by the user.&lt;SEP&gt;Numeric measurement of blood glucose entered via a BG meter, used by SmartGuard for reliability checks.</data>
