<node id="Low Glucose">
  <data key="d0">Low Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Low glucose refers to glucose values that fall below a predefined threshold, indicating risk of hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Low Glucose denotes a glucose level that falls below the predefined low limit threshold.</data>
