<node id="Low Limit">
  <data key="d0">Low Limit</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Low Limit is a configurable numeric threshold that defines the lower bound of sensor‑derived glucose (SG) values considered “low.” It is set within insulin‑pump or continuous glucose monitoring systems and is used to identify a low‑glucose condition for both clinical monitoring and therapy control.   

The threshold can be programmed between 50 mg/dL and 90 mg/dL, allowing users to select a value that matches individual safety preferences or clinical recommendations. When the SG reading approaches or falls below the chosen Low Limit, the system treats the measurement as low glucose.  

At this point the Low Limit triggers several safety mechanisms: it generates low‑glucose alerts and audible alarms, and, on pumps that support it, initiates a low‑glucose suspend (LGS) feature that temporarily halts insulin delivery to help prevent hypoglycemia.  

The same numeric value can also be entered on the SG Review screen to set the lower limit for visualizing glucose data, ensuring that charts and reports clearly mark the region where glucose values are below the defined low threshold.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b0caf812af55afd2de9fea4fdd33fd06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce8c9873da330aac077f7ccaf108ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-653c72495ca2211399f4a6660e1905e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8e2f5011e0e0fe7dc11273e2f345b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b53b69acbef0e172ea7719cc15bf3ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6025fa711665988fad0f789b9eb901a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ceebe6fbf743053d7b55523365689e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd751b869edcd6c88d9e467cfb2cb0fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3b794ead59ea83de139af0358a0e7b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e9f02579c179c758cc6393322299d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd545bc80ceae270c16406af736789b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c5a5c97986d9b31b155b0c8f0cac1c5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329471</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fundamentos De La Terapia Con Bomba De Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Fundamentos De La Terapia Con Bomba De Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Fundamentos De La Terapia Con Bomba De Insulina is the title of a chapter or document section that serves as an instructional guide to the fundamentals of insulin‑pump therapy.  It presents the basic principles underlying the use of an insulin pump, offering a concise overview of how the technology works and why it is employed in diabetes management.

The chapter provides practical guidance on several key aspects of pump therapy.  It explains how to adjust insulin delivery based on carbohydrate intake and discusses the impact of alcohol consumption on glucose control.  Safety features of the pump are described, and the text includes instructions for using sensor data to fine‑tune therapy settings, ensuring that users can respond appropriately to real‑time glucose information.

Overall, Fundamentos De La Terapia Con Bomba De Insulina functions as an educational resource that introduces readers to the core concepts, operational steps, and safety considerations essential for effective and confident use of an insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b4cf85d0e1e129080fae6f9bea5bd77f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59137a5f20ce729bcde5c65e1e45aa29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab7cedc48ea8fdd199a2c12c99416a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4d039b786601ed8a06d8adad50938&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d6466bdd61e024e50acc3fed9a5f9f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6737e479a665e986547e5e1e29ef26da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb3bd140c8e2ac53cf1b45386cb861ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3d0dd38cbfd29061a0c9916efb7c5d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da325dc5071cd02bfe55ffc2f9b79aa5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f369332c7e5ee7ed284fec07f68d394d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-505b4450257d1a728c397959b044ee97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9b29e7a7839d7ff2b29e72fb4912618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bec9e867c8de5a0beabd70ea9209c1a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eaa74c3ef8165f52ddf18e17a240a9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dd65471e9cdf7a7389998e6124f5b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fb90cfe4a3993c8a19c8fd291cc4d67</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
