<node id="Ratio I/R">
  <data key="d0">Ratio I/R</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The insulin-to-carbohydrate ratio indicating how many units of insulin are needed per carbohydrate serving.&lt;SEP&gt;Ratio I/R is the insulin‑to‑carbohydrate ratio used to calculate the appropriate bolus based on carbohydrate intake.&lt;SEP&gt;Ratio I/R is the insulin‑to‑carbohydrate ratio used for calculating bolus doses.&lt;SEP&gt;Ratio I/R is the insulin‑to‑carbohydrate ratio used to calculate meal bolus doses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b0caf812af55afd2de9fea4fdd33fd06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d6466bdd61e024e50acc3fed9a5f9f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3d0dd38cbfd29061a0c9916efb7c5d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-505b4450257d1a728c397959b044ee97</data>
