  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bolus de Corrección is a correction insulin bolus used to lower elevated glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus de Corrección is a corrective insulin dose administered when hyperglycemia does not improve.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-beee0553403f566be565a996251cac46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9b29e7a7839d7ff2b29e72fb4912618</data>
