<node id="MCG">
  <data key="d0">MCG</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">MCG (Monitorización Continua de Glucosa) is continuous glucose monitoring used in insulin pump therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Abbreviation for the continuous glucose monitoring system (Monitorización Continua de Glucosa).&lt;SEP&gt;MCG is the continuous glucose monitoring component of the MiniMed™ 640G system that shows current sensor glucose, trend arrows, and hourly graphs on the device screen.&lt;SEP&gt;MCG refers to the alert system of the MiniMed™ pump that can be muted according to user preferences.&lt;SEP&gt;MCG is mentioned as offering information within the therapy guide.&lt;SEP&gt;Monitoramento Contínuo de Glicose, a continuous glucose sensor providing real-time glucose data.&lt;SEP&gt;MCG is a system that cannot be paired with the Accu-Chek® Solo insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-beee0553403f566be565a996251cac46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-646b0d64191b72fd929f7fb514a8cb8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d03a310916c005d1dfa70800a753d1c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2474d83c9e01bbd20c6e68744a2dad5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da325dc5071cd02bfe55ffc2f9b79aa5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7387e81b8141435df1372f5d8b27662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2d6e4597425d2a83c3efcd9ca07f65c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786330135</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
