  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Fundamentos de la terapia con bomba de insulina is the chapter heading that introduces fundamentals of insulin‑pump therapy and bolus calculations.&lt;SEP&gt;Fundamentos de la terapia con bomba de insulina is a foundational content section outlining insulin pump therapy basics.&lt;SEP&gt;Fundamentos de la terapia con bomba de insulina is a manual that provides educational information about insulin pump therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Spanish-language document that provides fundamental information on insulin‑pump therapy.</data>
