  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The kit provides glucagon for emergency treatment of severe hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Kit De Emergencia De Glucagón is a portable set containing glucagón for emergency treatment of severe hypoglycemia.</data>
