</node>
<node id="Bolus De Corrección">
  <data key="d0">Bolus De Corrección</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bolus De Corrección is the method for calculating correction insulin doses.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus de corrección is a calculated insulin dose administered to lower a high glucose reading.&lt;SEP&gt;Correction bolus: insulin administered to lower blood glucose that is above the target range.&lt;SEP&gt;The correction insulin dose calculated to reduce current glucose toward the target glucose level.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus De Corrección is the insulin dose calculated to correct blood glucose deviations from the target level.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus De Corrección is a correction bolus dose administered when glucose is above target.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus de corrección is a calculated insulin dose intended to lower elevated glucose readings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1fa7ad1de214645f0e643708dc1efab8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4d039b786601ed8a06d8adad50938&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d6466bdd61e024e50acc3fed9a5f9f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3d0dd38cbfd29061a0c9916efb7c5d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f369332c7e5ee7ed284fec07f68d394d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-817893fc39ccf7551d476cefaf7f32ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bec9e867c8de5a0beabd70ea9209c1a4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324136</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bolus Total">
  <data key="d0">Bolus Total</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bolus Total is the method for determining the overall insulin dose for a given situation.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Total is the total insulin bolus delivered, as recorded in the therapy log.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Total is the sum of the food bolus and correction bolus, representing the overall insulin dose for a meal.&lt;SEP&gt;The overall insulin dose calculated, encompassing correction and active insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1fa7ad1de214645f0e643708dc1efab8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb3bd140c8e2ac53cf1b45386cb861ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f369332c7e5ee7ed284fec07f68d394d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bec9e867c8de5a0beabd70ea9209c1a4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324137</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
