  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbohydrate Counting is a method for estimating carbohydrate intake to improve post‑meal glucose control.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbohydrate counting is a dietary management technique that involves tracking carbohydrate intake to regulate blood glucose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2dc33cf2a90bf53c26226e44bc285c22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b50a9fb21c77773aec36a9b8e9f5e1d5</data>
