<node id="Capillary Glucose">
  <data key="d0">Capillary Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Capillary glucose refers to blood glucose measured via a finger‑stick, as part of capillary glucose monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Capillary Glucose is the glucose concentration measured from capillary blood, used as a reference point for lag time.</data>
