<node id="Total Bolus">
  <data key="d0">Total Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Total bolus is the combined insulin dose administered for a meal, including meal and correction doses.&lt;SEP&gt;Total bolus is the sum of the meal bolus and correction bolus suggested by the Bolus Wizard™.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d2f8a0d67f7320d6157b61dbbf428a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8ef457272b70b6404625941c8d26a3d</data>
