  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Journal focusing on technological advances in diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Technology &amp; Therapeutics is the journal in which the article appears.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Technology &amp; Therapeutics is the journal that published the Afrezza dosing article.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Technology &amp; Therapeutics is a journal featuring research on glucose monitoring technologies such as continuous glucose monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Technology &amp; Therapeutics is a peer‑reviewed journal that published the study linking hemoglobin A1c to Time‑in‑Range.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Technology &amp; Therapeutics is a peer‑reviewed journal that published a 2016 article on hypoglycaemia in older adults with type 1 diabetes.</data>
