<node id="Dora">
  <data key="d0">Dora</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Dora is an example individual who consumes carbohydrates and uses the insulin-to-carb ratio to determine her insulin dose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-07b23fc13c50867e0aa61204fb79bc2b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324150</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin-to-Carb Ratio">
  <data key="d0">Insulin-to-Carb Ratio</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The insulin-to-carb ratio defines how many units of insulin are required per one ration of carbohydrates.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin-to-Carb Ratio determines how many units of insulin are needed per gram of carbohydrate.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-07b23fc13c50867e0aa61204fb79bc2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2b8be67edef23560656776b89947c10</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324150</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Breakfast">
  <data key="d0">Breakfast</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Breakfast is a meal time for which a specific insulin-to-carb ratio may be applied.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-07b23fc13c50867e0aa61204fb79bc2b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324150</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lunch">
  <data key="d0">Lunch</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Lunch is a meal time for which a specific insulin-to-carb ratio may be applied.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-07b23fc13c50867e0aa61204fb79bc2b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324150</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dinner">
  <data key="d0">Dinner</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dinner is a meal time for which a specific insulin-to-carb ratio may be applied.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-07b23fc13c50867e0aa61204fb79bc2b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324150</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Snack">
  <data key="d0">Snack</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Snack (merienda) is a meal time for which a specific insulin-to-carb ratio may be applied.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-07b23fc13c50867e0aa61204fb79bc2b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324150</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Temporal Basal Index">
  <data key="d0">Temporal Basal Index</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A temporary basal insulin rate adjustment considered to avoid hypoglycemia, especially around exercise or alcohol intake.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ab7cedc48ea8fdd199a2c12c99416a0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324150</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Muscle Glycogen Repletion">
  <data key="d0">Muscle Glycogen Repletion</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The process of restoring muscle glycogen after physical activity, which influences basal insulin adjustments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ab7cedc48ea8fdd199a2c12c99416a0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324150</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Bolus">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bolus insulin is a larger dose of insulin released by the pancreas in response to high glucose levels after meals.&lt;SEP&gt;A rapid insulin dose administered for meals or corrections, active in the body for several hours.&lt;SEP&gt;A discrete, typically larger, dose of insulin delivered by the pump to cover meals or corrections.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Bolus comprises mealtime and correction insulin doses, representing 30‑70% of the Daily Total Dose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ab7cedc48ea8fdd199a2c12c99416a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f4d152d83c514f926b18413e065c2fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df77f2ea988e5724effb4c71cc79a65a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e3c3741659a85988124e5ddaf69c849</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786330151</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glucose Sensor Value">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Sensor Value</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The numeric glucose reading from the sensor used by SmartGuard to assess low‑glucose risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ab7cedc48ea8fdd199a2c12c99416a0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324150</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MiniMed™ 640G System">
  <data key="d0">MiniMed™ 640G System</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An insulin pump system that incorporates Bolus Wizard™ and SmartGuard™ functionalities.&lt;SEP&gt;MiniMed™ 640G is an insulin pump device that provides continuous glucose monitoring and automated insulin delivery features.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ab7cedc48ea8fdd199a2c12c99416a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2b8be67edef23560656776b89947c10</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324151</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Low Glucose Limit">
  <data key="d0">Low Glucose Limit</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Low Glucose Limit is the predefined glucose threshold below which a low‑glucose alert is generated.&lt;SEP&gt;A predefined glucose threshold (e.g., ≤70 mg/dL) that triggers SmartGuard™ suspension of insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ab7cedc48ea8fdd199a2c12c99416a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36de8c99d97d234e12244c240c45f156</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324151</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dynamic Suspension">
  <data key="d0">Dynamic Suspension</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A suspension strategy that stops insulin infusion when sensor glucose approaches the low limit with a 30‑minute forecast.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ab7cedc48ea8fdd199a2c12c99416a0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324151</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dynamic Resumption">
  <data key="d0">Dynamic Resumption</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A resumption strategy that automatically restarts insulin infusion once glucose rises above the low limit.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ab7cedc48ea8fdd199a2c12c99416a0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324151</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glucose Trend">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Trend</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The direction (ascending or descending) of glucose values, important for deciding insulin and carbohydrate adjustments.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose Trend describes whether glucose levels are rising, falling, or stable over time.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ab7cedc48ea8fdd199a2c12c99416a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-545c19428427ece2c838e352e759e388</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786336918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glucose Value">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Value</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Current blood glucose measurement used to evaluate therapy decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose Value is any numerical measurement of blood sugar used in calculations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ab7cedc48ea8fdd199a2c12c99416a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97eb00dc26d33c23bf8bf473c0a98472</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329648</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Basal Insulin Rate">
  <data key="d0">Basal Insulin Rate</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The continuous background insulin delivery rate provided by an insulin pump, adjustable via the temporal basal index.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ab7cedc48ea8fdd199a2c12c99416a0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324151</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Terapia De Bomba Con Sensor">
  <data key="d0">Terapia De Bomba Con Sensor</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Terapia De Bomba Con Sensor is a therapeutic approach that uses an insulin pump combined with a glucose sensor to manage diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6c123ae434326de3ccfe03d252e5d267</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324151</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Regla De 15/15">
  <data key="d0">Regla De 15/15</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Regla De 15/15 is a protocol that advises consuming 5‑15 g of fast‑acting carbohydrates and rechecking glucose after 15 minutes to treat mild hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6c123ae434326de3ccfe03d252e5d267</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324151</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Carbohidratos De Acción Rápida">
  <data key="d0">Carbohidratos De Acción Rápida</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbohidratos De Acción Rápida are fast‑acting carbohydrate sources used to quickly raise blood glucose during hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6c123ae434326de3ccfe03d252e5d267</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324151</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sensor De Glucosa">
  <data key="d0">Sensor De Glucosa</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensor De Glucosa is a continuous glucose monitoring sensor used together with the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensor De Glucosa is a device that measures glucose levels in interstitial fluid for continuous monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensor De Glucosa is a continuous glucose monitoring sensor that provides real‑time glucose (SG) readings to the MiniMed™ 640G system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6c123ae434326de3ccfe03d252e5d267&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb3bd140c8e2ac53cf1b45386cb861ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dd65471e9cdf7a7389998e6124f5b10</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324152</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Comprimidos De Glucosa">
  <data key="d0">Comprimidos De Glucosa</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Comprimidos De Glucosa are glucose tablets used as rapid‑acting carbohydrate treatment for hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Comprimidos De Glucosa are glucose tablets used as a fast source of carbohydrate to treat mild hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6c123ae434326de3ccfe03d252e5d267&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6737e479a665e986547e5e1e29ef26da</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324152</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Caramelos">
  <data key="d0">Caramelos</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Caramelos are candy sweets that can provide quick carbohydrates for treating mild hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6c123ae434326de3ccfe03d252e5d267</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324152</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Zumo De Frutas">
  <data key="d0">Zumo De Frutas</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Zumo De Frutas is fruit juice that can be consumed to raise blood glucose during mild hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6c123ae434326de3ccfe03d252e5d267</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324152</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cucharada De Azúcar">
  <data key="d0">Cucharada De Azúcar</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Cucharada De Azúcar is a spoonful of sugar used as a rapid carbohydrate source for treating mild hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6c123ae434326de3ccfe03d252e5d267</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324152</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Alertas De Glucosa Alta">
  <data key="d0">Alertas De Glucosa Alta</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Alertas De Glucosa Alta are high‑glucose notifications configured in a monitoring system to warn of hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;High glucose alerts are notifications generated when glucose readings exceed a threshold.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6c123ae434326de3ccfe03d252e5d267&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eaa74c3ef8165f52ddf18e17a240a9d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324152</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bomba MiniMed™">
  <data key="d0">Bomba MiniMed™</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Bomba MiniMed™ is an insulin pump used to deliver bolus doses based on glucose readings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1255cfcf42afb2c6045de0d45b11e99d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324152</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Línea De Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Línea De Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Línea De Insulina is the tubing that connects the reservoir to the infusion site.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1255cfcf42afb2c6045de0d45b11e99d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324153</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Líquidos Sin Hidratos De Carbono">
  <data key="d0">Líquidos Sin Hidratos De Carbono</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Líquidos Sin Hidratos De Carbono are carbohydrate‑free fluids recommended during ketosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1255cfcf42afb2c6045de0d45b11e99d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324153</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Servicio De Urgencias">
  <data key="d0">Servicio De Urgencias</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Servicio De Urgencias is the emergency department where patients with severe symptoms can receive immediate care.&lt;SEP&gt;Servicio De Urgencias is the emergency medical service to contact for severe hyperglycemia or ketoacidosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1255cfcf42afb2c6045de0d45b11e99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ed0e4c13d1643a77d1d74092a8cda5a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786324153</data>
