<node id="Blood">
  <data key="d0">Blood</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Blood carries glucose throughout the organism and is the medium where glucose levels are measured in mg/dL.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood is the circulatory fluid that transports glucose, insulin, and other substances throughout the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood is the bodily fluid in which glucose levels are measured.&lt;SEP&gt;Human blood, mentioned as a substance not to be infused via the reservoir or infusion set.</data>
