  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Illness or infection is a condition that typically raises blood glucose levels and increases the risk of Diabetic Ketoacidosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Illness is a health condition that can alter glucose trends and influence insulin therapy decisions.</data>
