<node id="Calibration">
  <data key="d0">Calibration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Calibration is the process of aligning sensor glucose readings with reference blood‑glucose measurements in order to improve the accuracy of continuous glucose monitoring systems.  

The procedure typically involves using a capillary glucose self‑test or a blood‑glucose meter reading as the reference value; the user enters this blood‑glucose value so that the sensor glucose (SG) can be matched to the corresponding blood‑glucose measurement (GS). In some implementations, capillary autocontrols are employed to facilitate the matching of sensor data with the reference readings.  

By adjusting the sensor output to correspond with these reference values, calibration reduces systematic errors and enhances the reliability of the glucose sensor’s reported values.  

Calibration adjustments are often required within a specific time window after the sensor is reconnected or re‑started—commonly within two hours—to ensure that the sensor’s readings remain properly aligned with the true blood‑glucose levels.  

Overall, calibration is the systematic adjustment of sensor glucose data to match reference blood‑glucose values, thereby ensuring that the continuous monitoring device provides accurate and clinically useful information.&lt;SEP&gt;Calibration is the process of adjusting a glucose sensor using stable glucose measurements to ensure accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Calibration is the process by which some real‑time CGM systems require the user to adjust sensor readings to maintain accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;A process required by some sensor models to ensure accurate glucose readings, often involving a finger prick.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d03a310916c005d1dfa70800a753d1c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3d901ee668c4fdbd518454aa3ebea3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edbbe2e207a7e0a28611a2a16fa2845f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5f31f609ed760b9e36f235d0109b470&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95ba6f1fa7d1791230f690255a8ba2df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1196548781bdac364853fdfd2074ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d8fcf807f0beb090b2f3d68cc7c168&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94150b57cc35a773b7c36f33f237f8a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fe1eff7b58582dec4c8ae7578e20e66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c804699375feba4c866cc3a1bc00211</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/cgm.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786336920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
