  <data key="d0">Actividad Física</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Actividad Física denotes physical activity that can influence glucose values and therapy adjustments.&lt;SEP&gt;Physical activity, including exercise and daily tasks, that influences glucose utilization and can cause low glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Actividad Física refers to physical activity, which influences basal insulin adjustments.&lt;SEP&gt;Physical activity is exercise that can affect glucose levels, potentially causing hypoglycemia or hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Physical activity that can be performed despite a rising glucose trend according to the system.</data>
