  <data key="d0">Carbohidratos</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbohydrate servings consumed in meals that influence blood glucose levels and insulin dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbohidratos are the grams of carbohydrates that must be counted to calculate bolus insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;The grams of carbohydrates a user plans to eat, which influence the calculated bolus amount.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbohidratos are the amount of carbohydrates entered into the Bolus Wizard to calculate insulin dosage.</data>
