  <data key="d2">Grasas are fat molecules in which excess glucose can be stored.&lt;SEP&gt;Grasas are a macronutrient in meals that can affect glucose values.&lt;SEP&gt;Fats present in meals that can independently influence the rise of blood glucose.</data>
