<node id="ISPAD Clinical Practice Consensus Guidelines 2018">
  <data key="d0">ISPAD Clinical Practice Consensus Guidelines 2018</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Guidelines released by ISPAD in 2018 outlining glycemic control targets and glucose monitoring for children, adolescents, and young adults with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;The ISPAD Clinical Practice Consensus Guidelines 2018 provide recommendations for insulin treatment in children and adolescents with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;ISPAD Clinical Practice Consensus Guidelines 2018 is a guideline document outlining glycemic control targets and glucose monitoring for children, adolescents, and young adults with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;ISPAD Clinical Practice Consensus Guidelines 2018 is a guideline on stages of type 1 diabetes in children and adolescents.&lt;SEP&gt;These guidelines provide recommendations for staging type 1 diabetes in children and adolescents.&lt;SEP&gt;ISPAD Clinical Practice Consensus Guidelines 2018 is a guideline document detailing diagnosis and management of monogenic diabetes in children and adolescents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5bd45744c4c50bb97abce1352018de47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08f12a2de420625ccc88f737d06b7e84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29ea6999715cd3886bd7d4abc2a653b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddc3658b93eb925d28d625c4e2ce652f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c23c0554362bde8c591c91d4a0185a0</data>
