<node id="Postprandial Hyperglycemia">
  <data key="d0">Postprandial Hyperglycemia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Elevated blood glucose levels occurring after meals.&lt;SEP&gt;Postprandial Hyperglycemia is elevated blood glucose after meals, which appropriate bolus strategies aim to control.&lt;SEP&gt;Postprandial Hyperglycemia refers to elevated blood glucose levels after meals, a condition that Automated Insulin Delivery systems alone do not fully eliminate.&lt;SEP&gt;Postprandial Hyperglycemia is elevated blood glucose after meals that Afrezza can help manage.&lt;SEP&gt;Postprandial hyperglycemia is the elevated blood glucose after meals that Afrezza helps to control.&lt;SEP&gt;Postprandial hyperglycemia is elevated blood glucose after meals, contributing to higher A1C.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5bd45744c4c50bb97abce1352018de47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e3c3741659a85988124e5ddaf69c849&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c9d162accf67a3761df6b1c9113e193&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e6371d8083fb20b137912cdaeec1b8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5419de5a030f812ab408ef47f361bebd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aff91698679a52cd7b07563b7b2627a3</data>
