<node id="Ratio">
  <data key="d0">Ratio</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ratio is the insulin‑to‑carbohydrate factor (units of insulin per carbohydrate portion) used to compute the meal bolus.&lt;SEP&gt;A numerical factor (0.9) used in the nutrition calculations shown in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Ratio is the insulin-to-carbohydrate ratio used to convert carbohydrate servings into insulin units.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f369332c7e5ee7ed284fec07f68d394d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bec9e867c8de5a0beabd70ea9209c1a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8ef457272b70b6404625941c8d26a3d</data>
