<node id="Raciones">
  <data key="d0">Raciones</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The portion count used together with the ratio to determine insulin dosage.&lt;SEP&gt;Raciones denotes the number of carbohydrate servings considered in a meal.&lt;SEP&gt;Raciones refers to the number of carbohydrate portions consumed, used to compute the meal bolus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f369332c7e5ee7ed284fec07f68d394d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bec9e867c8de5a0beabd70ea9209c1a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8ef457272b70b6404625941c8d26a3d</data>
