  <data key="d0">Sangre</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Sangre is the blood component of the circulatory system where glucose can accumulate when insulin is insufficient.&lt;SEP&gt;Sangre is blood, a bodily fluid used for glucose and ketone measurements.</data>
