<node id="Plan De Emergencia Para CAD">
  <data key="d0">Plan De Emergencia Para CAD</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Emergency plan for CAD is a protocol provided by the medical team for managing illness or emergencies.&lt;SEP&gt;Plan de emergencia para CAD is a documented emergency protocol for managing high ketone results, supplied by the medical team.&lt;SEP&gt;An emergency plan to follow when a high glucose trend suggests diabetic ketoacidosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-817893fc39ccf7551d476cefaf7f32ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eaa74c3ef8165f52ddf18e17a240a9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fb90cfe4a3993c8a19c8fd291cc4d67</data>
