<node id="Glucose Target">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Target</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose Target is the desired blood glucose level in mg/dL set as the goal for correction calculations (e.g., 100 mg/dL, 120 mg/dL).&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose Target is the desired blood glucose level that therapy aims to achieve.&lt;SEP&gt;The glucose target sets desired blood glucose levels (low and high) for the Bolus Wizard to aim for.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bec9e867c8de5a0beabd70ea9209c1a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8ef457272b70b6404625941c8d26a3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9eee903de4b7e25fc53f52e2e739637</data>
