<node id="Sensor Graph">
  <data key="d0">Sensor Graph</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensor Graph is a visual display of glucose readings over time on the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sensor Graph visualizes recent and historical SG readings, limits, carb entries, boluses, suspend events, and BG entries.&lt;SEP&gt;Visual display of historical sensor glucose readings, bolus, carb, and BG entries.&lt;SEP&gt;A visual display on the pump showing glucose or insulin data over time.&lt;SEP&gt;A visual representation of glucose sensor data displayed on a mobile device.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensor Graph is a visual display showing recent bolus deliveries and glucose trends.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensor Graph is content visualizing glucose trends.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bec9e867c8de5a0beabd70ea9209c1a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf54a88e051fe74fd94b773f8b5d98da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb80f00ba2dab32852874cb384b38de3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a01dc8dc15b92e2b0b570753b0f57632&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ede0f32eb8f8ea1eaab76cc0bc7648fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f94cd06ab0d1bcc7a9349bc40ea3eb22</data>
