  <data key="d0">Chapter 3</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Chapter 3 presents the fundamentals of insulin‑pump therapy and explains how to calculate bolus doses.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 3 is a section of the insulin pump therapy manual covering bolus calculation fundamentals.</data>
