<node id="Negative Correction">
  <data key="d0">Negative Correction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Negative Correction is the concept of reducing insulin dose for a meal when pre‑meal glucose is below the target range.&lt;SEP&gt;Negative Correction is an insulin reduction calculated when BG Reading falls below the low target value and subtracted from a food bolus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c8ef457272b70b6404625941c8d26a3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97eb00dc26d33c23bf8bf473c0a98472</data>
