<node id="Diabetes Complications">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Complications</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes complications are health problems whose risk is reduced when hemoglobin A1C levels are lowered.&lt;SEP&gt;Health complications arising from diabetes, such as retinopathy and nephropathy.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes complications are adverse health outcomes monitored annually after CFRD diagnosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f8e89a2540c525a104b0a1a5513347a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9eb02ab1ab7d834858bf60a8b402e6ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0631ff2b95dd459677eaaebe9283a776</data>
