  <data key="d2">High alert is a notification indicating an elevated blood glucose reading that should be confirmed with capillary testing.&lt;SEP&gt;An alert setting that notifies the user when sensor glucose rises above a configured high limit, with options such as before high and on high.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of alert indicating a glucose value above the configured high limit.</data>
