  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Pump therapy is the management approach that uses an insulin pump to deliver insulin and adjust basal rates.&lt;SEP&gt;The clinical practice of delivering insulin via an insulin pump, referenced throughout the safety information.&lt;SEP&gt;Pump therapy refers to the use of insulin pumps for diabetes management, with adoption rates that vary geographically in the United States.</data>
