<node id="Ketones">
  <data key="d0">Ketones</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Ketone measurement (in urine or blood) indicates the presence of metabolic ketones.&lt;SEP&gt;Ketones are metabolic markers checked alongside blood glucose when insulin flow is blocked.&lt;SEP&gt;The measurement of ketone bodies in the blood, indicating metabolic state, especially during insulin deficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Ketones are metabolic markers suggested to be checked during high sensor glucose events.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7ce776458e256df9d6070a419cab7449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df77f2ea988e5724effb4c71cc79a65a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71de01baf40871c616eaa39cb8189f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a0307c83d7b514ca00334e4c8ca2357</data>
