</node>
<node id="6:00P">
  <data key="d0">6:00P</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">6:00P is a time stamp indicating six o’clock in the evening (PM) used as an end time for a basal segment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b56965a1473183cf6e1086bfecabe348</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
