  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sistema Minimed® 670G is an insulin pump system used for delivering insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed 670G is an insulin pump system referenced throughout the instructions for changing the infusion set.</data>
