  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Quick-Set® is an infusion set with a cannula that can remain in place during magnetic resonance imaging procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;Quick-Set® is the rapid‑set procedure described for replacing the infusion equipment on the MiniMed 670G system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a967066e623ddb0c9381f89dfe0f3d42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-381370d223aabc9b355b55a05c98e07b</data>
