<node id="Meter">
  <data key="d0">Meter</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The meter is a device that serves as the communication link between the insulin pump and a computer running CareLink.&lt;SEP&gt;The meter is a handheld device that pairs with the pump, shows serial numbers, and can record glucose measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;A blood glucose meter used to measure glucose concentrations.&lt;SEP&gt;Meter is a term for any blood glucose meter.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-381370d223aabc9b355b55a05c98e07b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdabdf4730f349f4b46e7242c65d440d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcdc240f555b6c71532ea6d04e0c5798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6025fa711665988fad0f789b9eb901a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db5749bec4af1c3ea068b257c4376aaf</data>
