  <data key="d0">Magnetic Resonance Imaging</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Magnetic Resonance Imaging (MRI) is an imaging technique that generates strong magnetic fields, which can interfere with insulin pump systems and related components.</data>
