</node>
<node id="X‑Ray">
  <data key="d0">X‑Ray</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">X‑Ray is an imaging technique that generates radiation which can interfere with insulin pump systems.&lt;SEP&gt;X‑Ray refers to the imaging modality mentioned alongside the pump information.</data>
