  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">CT Scan is a computed tomography imaging technique that can affect insulin pump devices.&lt;SEP&gt;CT Scan is the acronym for Computed Tomography scan, a medical imaging procedure mentioned in the glossary.&lt;SEP&gt;CT Scan is an artifact referencing a computed tomography image.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-381370d223aabc9b355b55a05c98e07b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c5a5c97986d9b31b155b0c8f0cac1c5</data>
