  <data key="d2">Profesional de Salud is a health professional who collaborates with the user to determine optimal use of square and dual bolus strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Profesional de Salud is the health professional who advises the user on insulin dosing adjustments.&lt;SEP&gt;A health professional who provides instructions on glucose and ketone measurement, insulin dosing, and device management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-35a3bbe287cd55b2fd0a1505c706e7a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc1b97c88d050500f2b90b8837bd34bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-220ba7466dbb8a2a07b8e4b09b215d39</data>
