  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mensaje Bolus Dual">
  <data key="d0">Mensaje Bolus Dual</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Mensaje Bolus Dual is a screen notification that appears during the administration of a dual bolus, indicating its progress.&lt;SEP&gt;Mensaje Bolus dual is the on‑screen notification that appears while a dual bolus is being administered.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-35a3bbe287cd55b2fd0a1505c706e7a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1a77062463b62317e84265a3b2b6d4a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325505</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Profesional De Salud">
  <data key="d0">Profesional De Salud</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Health professional who calculates appropriate basal indices and guides pump setup.&lt;SEP&gt;Profesional De Salud is a health professional who assists the patient in interpreting glucose readings and adjusting basal insulin settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Health professional who provides instructions on how to respond to abnormal GS values.&lt;SEP&gt;A health professional can review meter and pump data via CareLink to adjust pump settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Profesional De Salud is the health professional who advises patients on when to contact them, reviews glucose data, and assists with pump setting adjustments.&lt;SEP&gt;Profesional De Salud is a health professional who collaborates with the user to determine optimal use of square and dual bolus strategies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-35a3bbe287cd55b2fd0a1505c706e7a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcff234f91816c50c56d0113b934824c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de8328f990d0902170699f76dac78b01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7305e2b34a4a57db2afea4935fe2fc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e303ffa37ca96974ad7399e052659bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01785f6f03692dc5e35c672e21b345f7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325505</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Duración">
  <data key="d0">Duración</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Duración sets the time interval for which an alert remains active or muted.&lt;SEP&gt;Duración is the selectable time period over which a square bolus is delivered.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-35a3bbe287cd55b2fd0a1505c706e7a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdb2f497ff0665f2860089645ba9450</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325506</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ratio De Carbohidratos">
  <data key="d0">Ratio De Carbohidratos</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A carbohydrate‑to‑insulin ratio shown as a single example value of 15, used for practice or personal settings in the Bolus Wizard configuration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-da0dcb28a160ed0e11da58b075919575</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
