  <data key="d0">Factor De Sensibilidad A La Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An insulin sensitivity factor displayed as a single example value of 50, which can be entered as a practice or personal value for calculating correction insulin.</data>
