<node id="Función Autoapagado">
  <data key="d0">Función Autoapagado</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Autoapagado function is a setting on the insulin pump that, after a configurable number of hours without button press, triggers an alarm and halts insulin infusion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8f3505927abeefb80af00bfabdaff7cd</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
