  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Alarma Autoapagado">
  <data key="d0">Alarma Autoapagado</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Autoapagado alarm sounds at the preset time when no button has been pressed, indicating that the pump will suspend insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8f3505927abeefb80af00bfabdaff7cd</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325510</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glucosa Sanguínea">
  <data key="d0">Glucosa Sanguínea</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucosa Sanguínea is the natural substance glucose in the bloodstream, measured to assess blood sugar levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucosa Sanguínea (GS) is the blood glucose level measured at various times such as upon waking, before meals, after meals, at bedtime, and during the night.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8f3505927abeefb80af00bfabdaff7cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7305e2b34a4a57db2afea4935fe2fc2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325511</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Regla 15-15">
  <data key="d0">Regla 15-15</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The 15-15 rule directs treating hypoglycemia by ingesting 15 grams of rapid‑acting carbohydrates, rechecking glucose after 15 minutes, and repeating if needed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8f3505927abeefb80af00bfabdaff7cd</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325511</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Carbohidratos de Acción Rápida">
  <data key="d0">Carbohidratos de Acción Rápida</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Rapid‑acting carbohydrates are foods that provide approximately 15 grams of sugar used to correct low glucose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8f3505927abeefb80af00bfabdaff7cd</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786325511</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
