<node id="Serial Number">
  <data key="d0">Serial Number</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The serial number is a code displayed on both pump and meter that must match for successful connection.&lt;SEP&gt;Serial number is the unique alphanumeric identifier assigned to each MiniMed 780G unit.&lt;SEP&gt;The serial number printed on the back of the transmitter is used to match the CGM device during pairing.&lt;SEP&gt;Serial Number is an identifier printed on the sensor inserter label used to match the sensor with the pump.</data>
