  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A set of icons on the home screen that provide quick visual status of the pump, including battery, reservoir, and audio.&lt;SEP&gt;Status icons are graphical indicators on the Home screen that provide a quick overview of the pump system status.&lt;SEP&gt;Status Icons are visual symbols indicating current system states (e.g., connection, battery).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-527777f044e20410ca47d2c5b35306ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4faffc449b4b8ea09acbae135d21baa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c</data>
