  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Medtronic webpage offers detailed instructions for traveling with an insulin pump or related device.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-138cbaf5a43762d4c5b77a07ab51cbd4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
