<node id="Accu-Chek Solo">
  <data key="d0">Accu-Chek Solo</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Accu-Chek Solo is a diabetes management device that provides glucose monitoring, bolus recommendations, and controls a micro‑pump, intended for single‑person reuse.&lt;SEP&gt;Accu-Chek Solo is a diabetes management device that configures and controls a micropump, includes a glucose monitoring system, and provides bolus recommendations.&lt;SEP&gt;Accu-Chek Solo is a micro‑pump system used for diabetes management, allowing configuration and control of a small insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Accu-Chek Solo is a diabetes management device that configures and controls a micro pump, provides bolus calculation recommendations, and includes a glucose level monitoring system for self‑monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Accu-Chek Solo is a diabetes management device that includes a micro‑pump system, blood glucose monitoring system, and provides personalized insulin dosing recommendations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5379c0f7436396fcd6b2bb136f76c05c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3ad4687f0918b43c325eb513c97227b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0eedfa9db50d515c53181256a5959a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f540d57f26133557d784c93e6ea2dca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4d5551bd34470fa603c62d5b51b1ea6</data>
