<node id="Glucose Monitoring System">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Monitoring System</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The glucose monitoring system in Accu-Chek Solo enables users to self‑monitor blood glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose monitoring system is the built‑in feature of Accu-Chek Solo that enables self‑monitoring of blood glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;The glucose monitoring system integrated in Accu-Chek Solo measures blood sugar levels for personal self‑monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose Monitoring System is an integrated component of the Accu-Chek Solo device that measures blood glucose levels for self‑monitoring.</data>
