<node id="Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager">
  <data key="d0">Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager is a device used to configure and control the Accu-Chek Solo Micropump and includes features such as bolus advice and a blood glucose monitoring system for self‑testing.&lt;SEP&gt;Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager is a diabetes management device that configures and controls the Accu-Chek Solo micro pump and provides bolus recommendations and blood glucose measurement.&lt;SEP&gt;A diabetes manager device used to set and control Roche micro pump, includes a blood glucose monitoring system and provides bolus advice for correction or meal bolus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0626e0ac97f4b970eb2c1ce138923abc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ef8a2f253226fae5e5f848c7dc0042b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f013a672ce03f1b20f7a515bae12be15</data>
