</node>
<node id="Accu-Chek Solo Micro Pump System">
  <data key="d0">Accu-Chek Solo Micro Pump System</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Accu-Chek Solo Micro Pump System is a micro insulin pump that operates under the control of the Accu-Chek Solo Diabetes Manager.&lt;SEP&gt;Accu-Chek Solo Micro Pump System is a diabetes micro‑pump device intended for use by a single person, reusable, and includes instructions for cleaning, disinfection, and disposal.&lt;SEP&gt;Accu-Chek Solo Micro Pump System is the integrated micro‑pump component of the Accu-Chek Solo device used for insulin delivery and glucose control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0626e0ac97f4b970eb2c1ce138923abc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0eedfa9db50d515c53181256a5959a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02bf2da7f1cdbbbcbe760df43f00b2e0</data>
