<node id="Diabetes Management">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Management</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes management is the intended purpose of the Accu-Chek Solo device, encompassing configuration, control, and monitoring of insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes management refers to the therapeutic strategies, including insulin delivery and glucose monitoring, used to control blood glucose in people with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;The overall process of controlling blood glucose levels in individuals with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes management encompasses the strategies and tools used to achieve glycemic targets in people with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Management is the overall approach to controlling diabetes, encompassing insulin use, carbohydrate intake, and physical activity.&lt;SEP&gt;The set of strategies and interventions used to control diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes management encompasses strategies and treatments to control blood glucose and prevent complications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4f540d57f26133557d784c93e6ea2dca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00f6c2252dc945e977b3a2b2f495ffe0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c93787ffd2c022283fc0663decb1a184&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05cc642337c2a615c9b40de9336aec18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-664916c2444f157f5d7d9bc41b032d26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14456299df06b01b603504def87f381</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/IFU Accu-Chek Guide Solo Diabetes Manager.PDF&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377422</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
