  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Package contents and storage conditions are detailed on the outer packaging and include symbol explanations for the Accu-Chek Solo micropump system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f013a672ce03f1b20f7a515bae12be15</data>
