<node id="CGM Devices">
  <data key="d0">CGM Devices</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Continuous glucose monitoring (CGM) devices are sensors that provide glucose data to the insulin pump system.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous glucose monitoring devices that can be paired with the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;CGM devices are continuous glucose monitoring sensors that can be viewed in a list on the Paired Sensors screen.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous glucose monitoring devices that normally do not require calibration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-95ba6f1fa7d1791230f690255a8ba2df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27b3ea1063acf8e0a407a89daea0dc32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e9f02579c179c758cc6393322299d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36ace822cd4873b8fd2adcfef0a7f9fd</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329366</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Blood Glucose (BG) Meter">
  <data key="d0">Blood Glucose (BG) Meter</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Blood Glucose (BG) meter is an artifact that provides finger‑stick glucose readings for verification of SG values.&lt;SEP&gt;Device that provides blood glucose readings used for calibration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-95ba6f1fa7d1791230f690255a8ba2df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8741750a7bf86eb5d1fadf82a9c7720e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329366</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="BG Meter Reading">
  <data key="d0">BG Meter Reading</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A blood glucose measurement taken with a meter; readings older than 12 minutes may be inaccurate for bolus calculations.&lt;SEP&gt;BG Meter Reading is the glucose value obtained from a blood glucose meter.&lt;SEP&gt;BG Meter Reading is a blood glucose measurement used to verify SG readings when symptoms differ.&lt;SEP&gt;Numeric glucose measurement between 50 mg/dL and 400 mg/dL used for sensor calibration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-95ba6f1fa7d1791230f690255a8ba2df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d68acc5f59d78c14cf4d2e4d34edf5e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3b794ead59ea83de139af0358a0e7b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97eb00dc26d33c23bf8bf473c0a98472</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329366</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Near Field Communication (NFC)">
  <data key="d0">Near Field Communication (NFC)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Wireless technology required by mobile devices to start the Instinct sensor.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-95ba6f1fa7d1791230f690255a8ba2df</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329367</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="24-Hour Technical Support">
  <data key="d0">24-Hour Technical Support</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">24‑Hour Technical Support is a round‑the‑clock service provided for users of the MiniMed 780G insulin pump and its continuous glucose‑monitoring (CGM) components. The service team can be reached at a dedicated phone number that is printed on the bottom of the pump, and it is the primary point of contact for any technical assistance related to the system.

The support team helps resolve a wide range of issues, including pump malfunctions, battery problems, exposure to strong magnetic fields, and recurring or critical pump errors and alarms. It also assists with sensor‑related difficulties such as loss of sensor signal, calibration problems, pairing issues, and other CGM device alerts. Users are advised to call the 24‑Hour Technical Support line whenever the pump cannot locate the sensor signal, when alerts remain unresolved, or when any technical problem interferes with normal pump operation.

In addition to troubleshooting, the service provides guidance on proper disposal of sensor components and related equipment, ensuring users follow safe and compliant practices. Overall, 24‑Hour Technical Support serves as the comprehensive, always‑available resource for pump operation, troubleshooting, alarm management, and device‑related concerns.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-95ba6f1fa7d1791230f690255a8ba2df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab510c8377992bab31045a97eb95893a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdb000b83632c89167783ad4e6f1fb64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a9714e3b2aaad60242e3827215230bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83bb94d08bdb958eff25f76c9a6ac18a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28515a0aca492eeee478cd9947226498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcdc240f555b6c71532ea6d04e0c5798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b53b69acbef0e172ea7719cc15bf3ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bfe428f5a1381000cf6932b37aa2239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a01dc8dc15b92e2b0b570753b0f57632&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14031c05fdb4152e391234af47d0cfe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71de01baf40871c616eaa39cb8189f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a0307c83d7b514ca00334e4c8ca2357&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b907eb92deb747df3fb3b37fb9974142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd545bc80ceae270c16406af736789b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcea1ff62aae96936f552880e96faa69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f94cd06ab0d1bcc7a9349bc40ea3eb22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46d04af5292fae98e3aa651d9cec4512</data>
