  <data key="d5">1786329469</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sensor Screen">
  <data key="d0">Sensor Screen</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensor Screen is a pump interface that shows details of a selected CGM sensor and provides unpair options.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ab510c8377992bab31045a97eb95893a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329470</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Unpair Device? Screen">
  <data key="d0">Unpair Device? Screen</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Unpair Device? Screen is a confirmation dialog on the pump that asks the user to confirm sensor unpairing.&lt;SEP&gt;Unpair Device? Screen appears after selecting Unpair and asks for confirmation to disconnect the transmitter.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ab510c8377992bab31045a97eb95893a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c030749e7f9a2ae77cb8993d7250cffe</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
