<node id="Simplera Sync Sensor">
  <data key="d0">Simplera Sync Sensor</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Simplera Sync Sensor is a continuous glucose monitoring (CGM) device that pairs wirelessly with the MiniMed 780G insulin pump. Identified by the model number MMT‑5120, it functions as an optional accessory that provides real‑time glucose data to the pump for calibration and automated insulin delivery functions.

The sensor is expressly compatible with the MiniMed 780G system’s SmartGuard and Predictive Low Glucose technologies, enabling features such as low‑glucose suspension and predictive alerts. Pairing and unpairing must occur within a limited time window, and the process includes a security‑code verification step to ensure that only authorized users can connect the sensor to the pump.

While Simplera Sync Sensor can be used for continuous glucose monitoring and to support automated insulin delivery, it is not approved for making treatment decisions in Manual mode for individuals younger than 18 years old. The device also carries specific warnings regarding the use of certain medications that may interfere with sensor accuracy, and users are advised to follow the manufacturer’s guidance on calibration and sensor care.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ab510c8377992bab31045a97eb95893a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdb000b83632c89167783ad4e6f1fb64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a4a75301f61fc3c86ad768de09d0c3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cceea4f7036977c7ddcbe81f76f8aa1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a75df3ab63706f501e8d3134e74a64b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-caf5071e54a797f595d8cac8e4653918&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf54a88e051fe74fd94b773f8b5d98da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28515a0aca492eeee478cd9947226498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f3d819d6498d4482286628946e37a6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec9cae555a06ac660e6c16d90116c8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1196548781bdac364853fdfd2074ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a764dcbdd73fd1c50fa72a7cd60b6e19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3895d65c9a22c257a4717f300d4086b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e9f02579c179c758cc6393322299d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f677e56841fc57bffd8bf5b6cc4a7797&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db5749bec4af1c3ea068b257c4376aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da4119d4fc266b13dd11e47dd6f506ca</data>
