<node id="Guardian 4 Sensor">
  <data key="d0">Guardian 4 Sensor</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Guardian 4 Sensor is a Medtronic continuous glucose monitoring (CGM) sensor, identified by the model number MMT‑7040, that is designed to work interoperably with the company’s SmartGuard and Predictive Low Glucose technologies. The sensor measures interstitial glucose levels and transmits the data via a dedicated Guardian 4 transmitter to an insulin‑delivery system, where the information is displayed on the Sensor Status screen, including the transmitter’s battery status.

The Guardian 4 Sensor is specifically approved for use with Medtronic’s MiniMed 780G insulin pump. When the sensor’s transmitter is correctly paired with the pump, a green LED on the transmitter indicates a successful connection. Users can also pair the sensor with the optional MiniMed Mobile App, which provides remote viewing of glucose data. The sensor’s manual details insertion and removal procedures, calibration requirements, and a set of medication‑interaction warnings that must be observed to ensure accurate readings.

In addition to its core functionality, the Guardian 4 Sensor is referenced alongside other CGM accessories such as the Simplera Sync system, where calibration and warning information are presented. While the description list includes a note about “another model of continuous glucose monitor sensor referenced in the warning,” this appears to be a generic reference to alternative sensors rather than a distinct device bearing the same name. Consequently, all provided statements pertain to the same Guardian 4 Sensor model and its role as a CGM component for the MiniMed 780G ecosystem.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ab510c8377992bab31045a97eb95893a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdb000b83632c89167783ad4e6f1fb64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a4a75301f61fc3c86ad768de09d0c3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cceea4f7036977c7ddcbe81f76f8aa1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-caf5071e54a797f595d8cac8e4653918&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28515a0aca492eeee478cd9947226498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec9cae555a06ac660e6c16d90116c8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1196548781bdac364853fdfd2074ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92417ae942a11c591feb2ee9b5fadd7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a764dcbdd73fd1c50fa72a7cd60b6e19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e9f02579c179c758cc6393322299d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dd74224daea51112742135154e46244&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f677e56841fc57bffd8bf5b6cc4a7797&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c030749e7f9a2ae77cb8993d7250cffe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db5749bec4af1c3ea068b257c4376aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da4119d4fc266b13dd11e47dd6f506ca</data>
