<node id="MiniMed 780G System Technical Guide">
  <data key="d0">MiniMed 780G System Technical Guide</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The MiniMed 780G System Technical Guide provides detailed technical specifications and clinical performance data for the insulin pump system.&lt;SEP&gt;The technical guide contains usage instructions, safety warnings, and separation‑distance recommendations for the system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4a4a75301f61fc3c86ad768de09d0c3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36ace822cd4873b8fd2adcfef0a7f9fd</data>
