<node id="Temp Target">
  <data key="d0">Temp Target</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Temp target is a temporary glucose target setting used when less insulin is needed, such as during exercise.&lt;SEP&gt;A temporary glucose target that can be programmed for up to eight hours when acetaminophen or paracetamol is taken.&lt;SEP&gt;Temp Target is a configurable glucose target used temporarily during activities like exercise to adjust insulin needs.&lt;SEP&gt;A temporary glucose target set for SmartGuard.&lt;SEP&gt;A temporary glucose target programmed into SmartGuard when interfering medication is taken.&lt;SEP&gt;Temp Target is a temporary glucose target setting that can be configured by the user.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8cceea4f7036977c7ddcbe81f76f8aa1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83bb94d08bdb958eff25f76c9a6ac18a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf54a88e051fe74fd94b773f8b5d98da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f677e56841fc57bffd8bf5b6cc4a7797&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8741750a7bf86eb5d1fadf82a9c7720e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329511</data>
