  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Max bolus defines the maximum allowable bolus amount and is applicable only in Manual mode.&lt;SEP&gt;Max Bolus is the maximum bolus insulin delivery setting referenced alongside Max Basal settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Max Bolus is the maximum bolus amount that can be programmed by the user in one dose.&lt;SEP&gt;The maximum allowable bolus insulin dose.</data>
