<node id="Preset Bolus">
  <data key="d0">Preset Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Preset bolus is a predefined bolus amount available only in Manual mode.&lt;SEP&gt;Preset Bolus is a predefined bolus option available only in Manual mode.&lt;SEP&gt;Preset Bolus is a saved bolus configuration that can be quickly selected for a meal.&lt;SEP&gt;A predefined bolus amount that can be selected from the pump’s menu and delivered.&lt;SEP&gt;Preset Bolus is a feature to set up and save a bolus for specific meals or snacks that are frequently consumed.</data>
