  <data key="d0">Menu Screen</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Menu screen allows selection of various pump functions and settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Menu Screen allows navigation to various feature screens and options of the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The Menu screen is accessed to navigate pump functions such as loading and filling.&lt;SEP&gt;A screen that is blocked while the pump is in Block Mode.&lt;SEP&gt;Menu Screen is a user interface screen that is blocked while the pump is locked.</data>
