  <data key="d2">The Graph screen displays glucose and insulin delivery data.&lt;SEP&gt;The Graph screen is a UI screen that shows information about SG readings, trends, blood glucose entries, auto‑correction bolus deliveries, bolus entries, and optionally backfilled SG values.</data>
