<node id="Suspend All Delivery">
  <data key="d0">Suspend All Delivery</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Suspend all delivery is a function that stops all insulin delivery from the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Suspend All Delivery is a function that stops both basal and bolus insulin delivery and provides periodic reminders.&lt;SEP&gt;Suspend All Delivery is a status‑screen option that temporarily stops all insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Suspend All Delivery is a selectable option on the Home Screen that halts all insulin delivery after user confirmation.&lt;SEP&gt;A pump feature that stops all insulin delivery when selected from the Home screen.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-83bb94d08bdb958eff25f76c9a6ac18a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92417ae942a11c591feb2ee9b5fadd7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a01dc8dc15b92e2b0b570753b0f57632&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2af59ac9cf813cb07dac53f30250d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b907eb92deb747df3fb3b37fb9974142</data>
