  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Temp Basal Rate">
  <data key="d0">Temp Basal Rate</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Temp basal rate is a temporary adjustment that can increase or decrease basal insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Temp basal rate is a feature that temporarily increases or decreases the current basal insulin delivery rate for a specified duration.&lt;SEP&gt;Temp Basal Rate is a feature that temporarily increases or decreases the current basal rate for a specified duration.&lt;SEP&gt;A temporary adjustment to the basal insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Temp Basal Rate specifies a temporary adjustment to the basal insulin infusion rate.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-83bb94d08bdb958eff25f76c9a6ac18a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6025fa711665988fad0f789b9eb901a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f3d819d6498d4482286628946e37a6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c</data>
