<node id="Basal Delivery">
  <data key="d0">Basal Delivery</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Basal delivery is the continuous background insulin infusion provided by the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The continuous background insulin infusion provided by the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal Delivery is a continuous background insulin infusion that continues when the pump is locked.&lt;SEP&gt;The ongoing administration of basal insulin by the pump, which can be paused and resumed automatically.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal Delivery is the continuous background insulin infusion provided by the pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-83bb94d08bdb958eff25f76c9a6ac18a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b53b69acbef0e172ea7719cc15bf3ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f677e56841fc57bffd8bf5b6cc4a7797&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8e9d04ca4b641b5d8d5ef85044f4566</data>
