  <data key="d0">Suspend on Low Feature</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A pump mode that suspends insulin delivery when low glucose is detected, requiring established pump settings.&lt;SEP&gt;A system mode that suspends insulin delivery when sensor glucose falls below a low limit, which is unavailable when SmartGuard feature is active.</data>
