  <data key="d2">Pre‑programmed insulin delivery rates that maintain baseline glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;The continuous background insulin delivery rate programmed into the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal rates are the programmed insulin delivery rates that must be set correctly on the pump.</data>
