  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Occlusion alarm is a pump alert indicating a blockage or issue in insulin delivery that prompts inspection of the infusion set.&lt;SEP&gt;An alarm triggered by the MiniMed 780G system when insulin flow is blocked or restricted.</data>
