<node id="Manual Bolus Feature">
  <data key="d0">Manual Bolus Feature</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Manual Bolus Feature allows the user to calculate and manually enter the bolus amount.&lt;SEP&gt;Manual Bolus feature is a function in Manual mode that allows users to enter and deliver a bolus dose.&lt;SEP&gt;Manual Bolus Feature allows the user to deliver a bolus directly without wizard assistance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d68acc5f59d78c14cf4d2e4d34edf5e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0267d2986a48c4c31790b6f183277dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-542e3b31a3f3a9496f26d05d1255498a</data>
