  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Max Bolus Setting">
  <data key="d0">Max Bolus Setting</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A configurable limit (0‑25 units) that caps the amount of insulin deliverable in a single manual bolus.&lt;SEP&gt;Max Bolus Setting is a concept defining the maximum allowable bolus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d68acc5f59d78c14cf4d2e4d34edf5e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366</data>
