  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Max Basal/Bolus screen is a user interface displayed after selecting Max Basal/Bolus in Delivery Settings, showing options for basal and bolus configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;The screen displayed after selecting Delivery Settings, showing options for basal and bolus limits.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d68acc5f59d78c14cf4d2e4d34edf5e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b03b7fdf0dd9c96dc459929ccccdccff</data>
