  <data key="d0">BG Target</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The desired blood glucose range used by the Bolus Wizard to calculate correction doses.&lt;SEP&gt;The desired blood glucose range, specified by low and high limits between 60 and 250 mg/dL.&lt;SEP&gt;BG Target is the concept of a target blood glucose level.</data>
