  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">CareLink Connect app is a companion application that shares device data.&lt;SEP&gt;The CareLink Connect app allows care partners to view patient therapy data and receive selected patient alerts; it does not replace the primary display of pump data.&lt;SEP&gt;CareLink Connect App is an application that works with CareLink software and displays information shared from a connected MiniMed Mobile App.</data>
