<node id="Pump Alarms Alerts and Messages">
  <data key="d0">Pump Alarms Alerts and Messages</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Pump alarms, alerts, and messages are notifications generated by the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump's alarms, alerts, and messages are notifications generated by the insulin pump to indicate status or issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Pump alarms, alerts, and messages is a reference table summarizing meanings, consequences, reasons, and resolutions for notifications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4a75df3ab63706f501e8d3134e74a64b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14031c05fdb4152e391234af47d0cfe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e9f02579c179c758cc6393322299d9c</data>
