  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Personal Reminders">
  <data key="d0">Personal Reminders</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Personal reminders are user‑specific prompts generated by the MiniMed Mobile app.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4a75df3ab63706f501e8d3134e74a64b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329557</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bolus BG Check Reminder">
  <data key="d0">Bolus BG Check Reminder</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Bolus BG Check reminder is a reminder to check blood glucose before delivering a bolus.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus BG Check Reminder notifies the user to check blood glucose after a bolus delivery and includes a countdown timer.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus BG Check Reminder is an artifact that reminds users to check glucose before bolus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4a75df3ab63706f501e8d3134e74a64b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcea1ff62aae96936f552880e96faa69</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329558</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Missed Meal Bolus Reminder">
  <data key="d0">Missed Meal Bolus Reminder</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Missed Meal Bolus reminder prompts the user to deliver a bolus after a missed meal.&lt;SEP&gt;Missed Meal Bolus Reminder can be set for typical meal times, allows up to eight reminders, and can be edited or deleted.&lt;SEP&gt;Missed Meal Bolus Reminder is a reminder when a bolus is not delivered during the specified time period, often around meals.&lt;SEP&gt;A reminder for a meal bolus that was not delivered.&lt;SEP&gt;Missed Meal Bolus Reminder is an artifact that prompts a missed meal bolus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4a75df3ab63706f501e8d3134e74a64b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8e2f5011e0e0fe7dc11273e2f345b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6025fa711665988fad0f789b9eb901a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcea1ff62aae96936f552880e96faa69</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329558</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Low Reservoir Reminder">
  <data key="d0">Low Reservoir Reminder</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Low Reservoir reminder alerts the user when insulin reservoir is low.&lt;SEP&gt;Low Reservoir Reminder alerts when the insulin level in the reservoir reaches a low threshold or after half of the units have been used.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4a75df3ab63706f501e8d3134e74a64b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcea1ff62aae96936f552880e96faa69</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329558</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Set Change Reminder">
  <data key="d0">Set Change Reminder</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Set Change reminder notifies the user to replace infusion sets.&lt;SEP&gt;Set Change Reminder tracks the time between infusion set changes and alerts the user to replace the set.&lt;SEP&gt;Set Change Reminder is a reminder to change the infusion set.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4a75df3ab63706f501e8d3134e74a64b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6025fa711665988fad0f789b9eb901a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcea1ff62aae96936f552880e96faa69</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329559</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Predictive">
  <data key="d0">Predictive</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Predictive is a mode that uses algorithmic forecasts to adjust insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4a75df3ab63706f501e8d3134e74a64b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329559</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SmartGuard Technology">
  <data key="d0">SmartGuard Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">SmartGuard technology is a predictive algorithm integrated into the MiniMed 780G system.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard technology automatically adjusts basal insulin delivery and provides correction boluses based on sensor glucose values for Type 1 diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard technology is a glucose management feature compatible with certain Medtronic CGMs and insulin pump configurations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-caf5071e54a797f595d8cac8e4653918&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec9cae555a06ac660e6c16d90116c8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3895d65c9a22c257a4717f300d4086b0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329559</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Predictive Low Glucose Technology">
  <data key="d0">Predictive Low Glucose Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Predictive Low Glucose technology anticipates low glucose events within the MiniMed 780G system.&lt;SEP&gt;Predictive Low Glucose technology automatically suspends insulin delivery when predicted glucose values fall below predefined thresholds for Type 1 diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Predictive Low Glucose technology provides insulin delivery adjustments in Manual mode when SmartGuard is inactive.&lt;SEP&gt;Predictive Low Glucose technology forecasts low glucose events and is compatible with specific Medtronic CGMs and pump configurations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-caf5071e54a797f595d8cac8e4653918&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec9cae555a06ac660e6c16d90116c8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3895d65c9a22c257a4717f300d4086b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36ace822cd4873b8fd2adcfef0a7f9fd</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329559</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CareLink Account">
  <data key="d0">CareLink Account</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A CareLink account is required to log into and use the MiniMed Mobile app for data synchronization.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-caf5071e54a797f595d8cac8e4653918</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329559</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Person Under Age 18">
  <data key="d0">Person Under Age 18</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Individuals younger than 18 years are warned not to rely on the Simplera Sync sensor for treatment decisions in Manual mode.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-caf5071e54a797f595d8cac8e4653918</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329560</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Subcutaneous Delivery">
  <data key="d0">Subcutaneous Delivery</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Subcutaneous delivery is the method by which the insulin pump administers insulin into the tissue.</data>
