  <data key="d0">ACE Pump</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An alternate controller enabled (ACE) pump, exemplified by the MiniMed 780G insulin pump, is compatible with SmartGuard and Predictive Low Glucose technologies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-caf5071e54a797f595d8cac8e4653918</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329561</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Integrated Continuous Glucose Monitor (iCGM)">
  <data key="d0">Integrated Continuous Glucose Monitor (iCGM)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Integrated continuous glucose monitors are compatible devices used with SmartGuard and Predictive Low Glucose technologies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-caf5071e54a797f595d8cac8e4653918</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329561</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Auto Correction On">
  <data key="d0">Auto Correction On</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Auto Correction On is a setting that enables the SmartGuard feature to automatically correct glucose deviations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-caf5071e54a797f595d8cac8e4653918</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329562</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="One-Press Serter">
  <data key="d0">One-Press Serter</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The One-Press serter is a device referenced for specific user guide indications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-caf5071e54a797f595d8cac8e4653918</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329562</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Consumer Electronic Device">
  <data key="d0">Consumer Electronic Device</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A consumer electronic device is a suitable hardware platform that can display information from the MiniMed Mobile app.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-caf5071e54a797f595d8cac8e4653918</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329562</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CareLink™">
  <data key="d0">CareLink™</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">CareLink™ is a cloud‑based platform that stores and synchronizes diabetes therapy data from compatible devices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-caf5071e54a797f595d8cac8e4653918</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329562</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Delivery Settings">
  <data key="d0">Delivery Settings</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Delivery Settings is a menu option on an insulin pump that provides users with access to the screens used to configure all basal and bolus delivery parameters. From the Home Screen, selecting Delivery Settings opens a series of configuration pages where the basal rate, the maximum basal setting, and preset temporary basal setups can be viewed and adjusted. The same menu also leads to the Bolus Wizard Setup, allowing users to define bolus options such as dual‑wave or square‑wave delivery, bolus increment size, and bolus delivery speed.

Within the Delivery Settings menu, users can also specify a full range of insulin dosing factors that influence bolus calculations. These include the carbohydrate‑to‑insulin ratio, the insulin sensitivity factor, the target blood‑glucose range, and the active insulin time (the duration that insulin remains active in the body). By consolidating basal rate controls, bolus wizard parameters, and these additional dosing settings, Delivery Settings serves as the central hub for tailoring insulin delivery to an individual’s therapeutic needs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d68acc5f59d78c14cf4d2e4d34edf5e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b03b7fdf0dd9c96dc459929ccccdccff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcdc240f555b6c71532ea6d04e0c5798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae3b43add031516d14e51c6d2a985bd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27b3ea1063acf8e0a407a89daea0dc32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-542e3b31a3f3a9496f26d05d1255498a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14031c05fdb4152e391234af47d0cfe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97eb00dc26d33c23bf8bf473c0a98472&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a074860e7f25b8dfbcccbabb53c645d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20af4762343b8357c2c72473211f2918&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329563</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bolus Wizard Feature">
  <data key="d0">Bolus Wizard Feature</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Bolus Wizard Feature is a calculation tool built into Medtronic insulin pumps and the MiniMed Mobile App that assists users in determining and delivering insulin bolus doses while operating in Manual mode. The feature draws on the user’s personalized settings—including carbohydrate‑to‑insulin ratios, insulin sensitivity factors (ISF), target blood‑glucose (BG) ranges, and active insulin time—to compute an estimated bolus amount.

The calculation incorporates the current BG reading, the number of carbohydrates the user plans to consume, and any correction required to bring BG toward the target range. It also accounts for active (remaining) insulin from prior doses, subtracting its effect from the total bolus recommendation. Users can enter carb counts and view suggested correction doses, and the interface guides them through confirming or adjusting the recommended insulin amount before delivery.

In addition to dose computation, the Bolus Wizard Feature provides a dedicated interface for configuring the underlying parameters such as carb ratios and insulin sensitivity settings, allowing users to tailor the algorithm to their therapy regimen. Whether accessed directly on the pump or through the companion mobile application, the feature streamlines the process of calculating and administering bolus insulin, helping users achieve more precise glycemic control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d68acc5f59d78c14cf4d2e4d34edf5e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf54a88e051fe74fd94b773f8b5d98da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4faffc449b4b8ea09acbae135d21baa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27b3ea1063acf8e0a407a89daea0dc32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a01dc8dc15b92e2b0b570753b0f57632&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-542e3b31a3f3a9496f26d05d1255498a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97eb00dc26d33c23bf8bf473c0a98472&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2af59ac9cf813cb07dac53f30250d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dd74224daea51112742135154e46244&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20af4762343b8357c2c72473211f2918&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c5a5c97986d9b31b155b0c8f0cac1c5</data>
