<node id="CareLink Software">
  <data key="d0">CareLink Software</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">CareLink Software is a computer application and data‑management platform associated with Medtronic’s MiniMed insulin pump systems. It enables users to upload device‑generated information—such as therapy and system data—from the pump itself, the MiniMed Mobile app, and the MiniMed 780G system via the Blue Adapter or directly through the Mobile app. By serving as the receiving endpoint for these uploads, CareLink Software facilitates remote monitoring and management of insulin therapy.

In addition to data collection, the platform supports pairing with the pump for ongoing data management, generates alerts and messages to inform users and clinicians of important events, and provides a central artifact through which users can view, analyze, and export their diabetes‑related information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4a75df3ab63706f501e8d3134e74a64b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcdc240f555b6c71532ea6d04e0c5798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb80f00ba2dab32852874cb384b38de3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92417ae942a11c591feb2ee9b5fadd7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a764dcbdd73fd1c50fa72a7cd60b6e19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7827239a998e7ac7379613d9e5f81ae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dd74224daea51112742135154e46244</data>
