<node id="Daily History Screen">
  <data key="d0">Daily History Screen</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Daily History Screen displays the actual bolus units delivered and the intended bolus amount for review.&lt;SEP&gt;The Daily History screen displays a record of insulin deliveries and other pump events.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily History screen lists pump actions performed on a selected day, showing the most recent action first.&lt;SEP&gt;A screen that displays recent bolus amounts and timestamps.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily History Screen is the pump display that shows recent bolus amounts and delivery times.&lt;SEP&gt;Daily History Screen displays daily insulin delivery data, including bolus amounts during alarms.&lt;SEP&gt;The screen on the pump that displays the recorded amount of insulin delivered, including bolus history.</data>
