<node id="Fill Cannula">
  <data key="d0">Fill Cannula</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The procedure of inserting insulin into the cannula for delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Fill Cannula is the action of loading insulin into the cannula to prime the infusion line.&lt;SEP&gt;Fill cannula is the tubing component used to fill the reservoir with insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;A component used to deliver insulin via an infusion set, referenced in the manual index.</data>
