<node id="High SG Alert">
  <data key="d0">High SG Alert</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">High SG alert is a fixed alert that activates when SG is at or above 250 mg/dL for three hours.&lt;SEP&gt;High SG alert notifies when sensor glucose exceeds 250 mg/dL for more than three hours.&lt;SEP&gt;An alert related to high sensor glucose values.&lt;SEP&gt;High SG Alert is an alarm indicating sensor glucose exceeds the high limit.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db8e2f5011e0e0fe7dc11273e2f345b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1196548781bdac364853fdfd2074ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd751b869edcd6c88d9e467cfb2cb0fd</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329573</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="High SG Settings">
  <data key="d0">High SG Settings</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">High SG settings are programmable parameters that adjust insulin delivery when sensor glucose readings are high.&lt;SEP&gt;High SG settings are a group of alert configurations that respond to high sensor glucose values.&lt;SEP&gt;Configuration options for high sensor glucose thresholds.&lt;SEP&gt;High SG Settings is a concept configuring alerts for high sensor glucose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db8e2f5011e0e0fe7dc11273e2f345b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1196548781bdac364853fdfd2074ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b2af59ac9cf813cb07dac53f30250d0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329573</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="High Snooze">
  <data key="d0">High Snooze</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A feature that sets a delay (5 minutes to 3 hours) before a high alert can repeat if the high condition remains.&lt;SEP&gt;A snooze feature for high glucose alerts.&lt;SEP&gt;High Snooze is a concept allowing temporary silencing of high SG alerts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db8e2f5011e0e0fe7dc11273e2f345b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ceebe6fbf743053d7b55523365689e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366</data>
