<node id="Pump Settings">
  <data key="d0">Pump Settings</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pump settings are configurable parameters that determine how the pump delivers insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Configurable parameters of the insulin pump that can be cleared, triggering the Startup Wizard.&lt;SEP&gt;Pump Settings are the configuration values that control how the pump operates.&lt;SEP&gt;Pump Settings are the current configuration values of the insulin pump, such as basal rates and bolus amounts.&lt;SEP&gt;Configuration options for the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Pump Settings is a concept for configurable pump parameters.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db8e2f5011e0e0fe7dc11273e2f345b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0267d2986a48c4c31790b6f183277dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27b3ea1063acf8e0a407a89daea0dc32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bfe428f5a1381000cf6932b37aa2239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f94cd06ab0d1bcc7a9349bc40ea3eb22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec</data>
