  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Low Management Mode controls suspend‑before‑low and suspend‑on‑low safety features.&lt;SEP&gt;A mode that manages low‑glucose events, referenced in the Summary screen.&lt;SEP&gt;A mode for managing low glucose situations.&lt;SEP&gt;Low Management Mode adjusts pump behavior to better handle low glucose situations.</data>
