  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Low SG denotes a condition where sensor glucose values are below the preset low limit.&lt;SEP&gt;Low SG refers to a sensor glucose reading that is at or below the predefined low threshold.&lt;SEP&gt;A low sensor glucose condition referenced by several alerts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db8e2f5011e0e0fe7dc11273e2f345b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d8fcf807f0beb090b2f3d68cc7c168</data>
