<node id="Manual Bolus">
  <data key="d0">Manual Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Manual Bolus is a bolus delivery mode that requires a blood glucose meter reading for setup.&lt;SEP&gt;Manual Bolus is a feature to manually enter and deliver a dose of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;A bolus dose administered manually by the user.&lt;SEP&gt;Manual Bolus is a method for delivering bolus manually.&lt;SEP&gt;Manual Bolus is a user‑initiated bolus entry performed without algorithmic assistance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db8e2f5011e0e0fe7dc11273e2f345b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6025fa711665988fad0f789b9eb901a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9639df6feeacb49b96ddc51763dec77d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c</data>
