  <data key="d5">1786329580</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Easy Bolus Feature">
  <data key="d0">Easy Bolus Feature</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Easy Bolus Feature is a pump function that may cause a missed notification leading to delivery of too much or too little insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Easy Bolus Feature enables delivery of a normal bolus using a single button press while the pump is in Sleep mode.&lt;SEP&gt;Easy Bolus Feature is a method for delivering insulin bolus that simplifies activation and calculation steps.&lt;SEP&gt;A simplified bolus delivery option.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db8e2f5011e0e0fe7dc11273e2f345b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-542e3b31a3f3a9496f26d05d1255498a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a074860e7f25b8dfbcccbabb53c645d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b907eb92deb747df3fb3b37fb9974142</data>
