<node id="Message">
  <data key="d0">Message</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A message is textual information displayed in the MiniMed Mobile app regarding pump status or alerts.&lt;SEP&gt;Message is a notification showing the pump status or prompting a decision, displayed with a blue icon and sometimes a yellow icon.&lt;SEP&gt;Message is a notification that may require user response.&lt;SEP&gt;Message is a text prompt shown on the pump that provides information or instructions to the user.&lt;SEP&gt;Generic textual notifications displayed to the user.&lt;SEP&gt;Message is a content element delivering information to the user.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db8e2f5011e0e0fe7dc11273e2f345b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14031c05fdb4152e391234af47d0cfe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e9f02579c179c758cc6393322299d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcea1ff62aae96936f552880e96faa69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d8fcf807f0beb090b2f3d68cc7c168</data>
