  <data key="d5">1786329581</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Max Basal Rate">
  <data key="d0">Max Basal Rate</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Max Basal Rate is the maximum allowable basal insulin rate that limits temporary basal settings.&lt;SEP&gt;A setting that defines the maximum basal insulin delivery rate per hour, adjustable in Manual mode.&lt;SEP&gt;Max Basal Rate is a setting that defines the highest basal insulin infusion rate.&lt;SEP&gt;Max Basal Rate is the maximum amount of basal insulin that can be programmed by the user per hour in Manual mode.&lt;SEP&gt;The defined maximum basal insulin delivery rate.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db8e2f5011e0e0fe7dc11273e2f345b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6025fa711665988fad0f789b9eb901a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27b3ea1063acf8e0a407a89daea0dc32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b907eb92deb747df3fb3b37fb9974142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8e9d04ca4b641b5d8d5ef85044f4566</data>
