  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reservoir User Guide">
  <data key="d0">Reservoir User Guide</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The reservoir user guide provides instructions and duration of use for the insulin reservoir.&lt;SEP&gt;A user guide that provides instructions for handling and filling the reservoir.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0267d2986a48c4c31790b6f183277dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-691a5ee6c6fdbea7a2ef1c835f0e66ae</data>
