  <data key="d5">1786329594</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Time and Date">
  <data key="d0">Time and Date</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Time and date are settings that must be correct on the pump before insulin use.&lt;SEP&gt;Settings that control the pump’s internal clock, affecting insulin delivery and history accuracy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0267d2986a48c4c31790b6f183277dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4d222786e6ed163a90874659266c72a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329594</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Suspend All Delivery Feature">
  <data key="d0">Suspend All Delivery Feature</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Suspend All Delivery feature stops both basal and bolus insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0267d2986a48c4c31790b6f183277dc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329594</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Calculated Bolus">
  <data key="d0">Calculated Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Calculated bolus is the insulin dose computed by the pump based on entered data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0267d2986a48c4c31790b6f183277dc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329594</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bolus Amount">
  <data key="d0">Bolus Amount</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bolus amount is the quantity of insulin being delivered during a bolus.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Amount is the total units of insulin to be administered in a bolus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0267d2986a48c4c31790b6f183277dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a074860e7f25b8dfbcccbabb53c645d7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329595</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Delivery History">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Delivery History</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin delivery history is a record of all insulin doses delivered by the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Recorded information about past insulin deliveries used by SmartGuard to assess basal delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0267d2986a48c4c31790b6f183277dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b8de1434b9d9f57cd225b5d3e0d7f3b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329595</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MiniMed Reservoir">
  <data key="d0">MiniMed Reservoir</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">MiniMed reservoirs are consumable cartridges designed specifically for the MiniMed™ 780G system.&lt;SEP&gt;A reservoir compatible with the MiniMed 780G insulin pump, used to hold insulin before delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;MiniMed Reservoir is a compatible insulin reservoir used with the MiniMed 780G insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0267d2986a48c4c31790b6f183277dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-691a5ee6c6fdbea7a2ef1c835f0e66ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36ace822cd4873b8fd2adcfef0a7f9fd</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329595</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MiniMed Infusion Set">
  <data key="d0">MiniMed Infusion Set</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An infusion set designed for use with the MiniMed pump, including tubing that connects the reservoir to the body.&lt;SEP&gt;MiniMed Infusion Set is a compatible infusion set used with the MiniMed 780G insulin pump to deliver insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0267d2986a48c4c31790b6f183277dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-691a5ee6c6fdbea7a2ef1c835f0e66ae</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329595</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Medtronic Infusion Set">
  <data key="d0">Medtronic Infusion Set</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An infusion set designed for use with Medtronic pumps, mentioned as an alternative component.&lt;SEP&gt;Medtronic Infusion Set is a compatible infusion set alternative for the MiniMed 780G insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0267d2986a48c4c31790b6f183277dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-691a5ee6c6fdbea7a2ef1c835f0e66ae</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329595</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="AA Lithium Battery">
  <data key="d0">AA Lithium Battery</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">AA lithium batteries are power sources that may be kept in the emergency kit.&lt;SEP&gt;AA lithium battery is a type of spare battery recommended to keep in an emergency kit for the pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28515a0aca492eeee478cd9947226498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36ace822cd4873b8fd2adcfef0a7f9fd</data>
