  <data key="d0">Sensor Warm Up</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensor warm up is the period after sensor activation during which the pump displays a countdown message before readings begin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-177e9aca0bf1c1724474ea529826bece</data>
