<node id="Sensor Pairing Alert">
  <data key="d0">Sensor Pairing Alert</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensor failed to pair with pump alert is a warning message displayed on the pump when pairing is unsuccessful.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensor Pairing Alert warns that an existing sensor is already paired with the pump, preventing a new sensor from being paired.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-177e9aca0bf1c1724474ea529826bece&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d8fcf807f0beb090b2f3d68cc7c168</data>
