  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An alert informing the user that active insulin has been cleared, affecting Bolus Wizard calculations.&lt;SEP&gt;Active Insulin cleared alert is a notification indicating that the active insulin level has been cleared to zero.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb80f00ba2dab32852874cb384b38de3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65</data>
