  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The interface screen where the user enters the current time, format, and date after starting the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Time &amp; Date Screen is the pump interface used to reset the current time and date after a power loss.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb80f00ba2dab32852874cb384b38de3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bfe428f5a1381000cf6932b37aa2239</data>
