<node id="Auto Suspend">
  <data key="d0">Auto Suspend</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A safety feature that stops insulin delivery and triggers an alarm when a button is not pressed within a set time.&lt;SEP&gt;Auto Suspend is a feature that automatically stops insulin delivery after a period without button presses.&lt;SEP&gt;Auto suspend is a feature that suspends insulin delivery and triggers an alarm if no buttons are pressed for a specified period.&lt;SEP&gt;Auto Suspend is a feature that automatically halts insulin delivery when low glucose readings are detected.&lt;SEP&gt;Auto Suspend is a feature that automatically suspends insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Auto Suspend is a feature that automatically stops insulin delivery when glucose falls below a low threshold.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-27b3ea1063acf8e0a407a89daea0dc32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c5a5c97986d9b31b155b0c8f0cac1c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f94cd06ab0d1bcc7a9349bc40ea3eb22</data>
