<node id="Sensor Glucose Values">
  <data key="d0">Sensor Glucose Values</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensor glucose (SG) values are continuous glucose measurements used by SmartGuard to modulate insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose readings captured by the sensor component of the CGM system.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensor Glucose Values are glucose readings received from the continuous glucose monitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensor glucose values are measurements from continuous glucose monitors that can be discrepant from actual glucose values when interfered with by certain substances.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-27b3ea1063acf8e0a407a89daea0dc32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36ace822cd4873b8fd2adcfef0a7f9fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8e9d04ca4b641b5d8d5ef85044f4566&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05cc642337c2a615c9b40de9336aec18</data>
