<node id="Temp Basal">
  <data key="d0">Temp Basal</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Temp Basal is a temporary basal insulin rate that can be set for specific periods such as exercise and is cancelled before activating SmartGuard.&lt;SEP&gt;Temp Basal is a temporary basal insulin delivery that can be canceled at any time, after which the scheduled basal pattern automatically resumes.&lt;SEP&gt;Temp Basal is a concept for temporary basal insulin delivery.</data>
