  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Basal Patterns Screen is the display on the insulin pump that lists configured basal patterns and their 24‑hour insulin totals.&lt;SEP&gt;The Basal Patterns screen displays available basal patterns and indicates the active pattern.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal Patterns Screen is an artifact displaying basal pattern options.</data>
