  <data key="d0">Begin</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Begin is the button that starts the alert silence period after setting a duration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd751b869edcd6c88d9e467cfb2cb0fd</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329643</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Suspend on Low">
  <data key="d0">Suspend on Low</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Suspend on low is a feature that suspends insulin delivery when the sensor glucose (SG) reading reaches or falls below the low limit.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329643</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Transmitter Battery">
  <data key="d0">Transmitter Battery</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Transmitter battery powers the communication module of the pump system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329643</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Active Insulin Reminder Alert">
  <data key="d0">Active Insulin Reminder Alert</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Active Insulin reminder alert is a notification prompting the user to check or address active insulin levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329643</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Active Insulin Reset To Zero">
  <data key="d0">Active Insulin Reset To Zero</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Active Insulin reset to zero describes the action of setting the active insulin value back to zero in the pump interface.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329643</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Battery Failed">
  <data key="d0">Battery Failed</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Battery failed is an alert indicating that the pump’s battery is no longer providing power.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329643</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Battery Not Compatible">
  <data key="d0">Battery Not Compatible</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Battery not compatible is an alert indicating that the inserted battery does not meet the pump’s specifications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329643</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Power Error Detected">
  <data key="d0">Power Error Detected</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Power error detected is an alert indicating an abnormal power condition within the pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329643</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="High SG">
  <data key="d0">High SG</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">High SG refers to a sensor glucose reading that exceeds the predefined high threshold.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329643</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Alert Silence">
  <data key="d0">Alert Silence</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Alert silence is a feature that temporarily mutes audible alerts, often used within SmartGuard.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329644</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Basal Delivery Resumed Alarm">
  <data key="d0">Basal Delivery Resumed Alarm</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Basal delivery resumed alarm is a notification confirming that basal delivery has successfully restarted.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329644</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bolus Stopped">
  <data key="d0">Bolus Stopped</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bolus stopped is an alert indicating that a programmed bolus delivery was interrupted.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329644</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Delivery Limit Exceeded">
  <data key="d0">Delivery Limit Exceeded</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Delivery limit exceeded is an alert generated when insulin delivery surpasses a preset safety limit.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329644</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insert Battery">
  <data key="d0">Insert Battery</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insert battery is a prompt indicating that a new battery should be placed into the pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329644</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pump Restarted">
  <data key="d0">Pump Restarted</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pump restarted is a status indicating that the pump has powered on again after a shutdown or error.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd8af150d14c8fd9fd3b20e486220f65</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329644</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Basal Delivery Resumed Alert">
  <data key="d0">Basal Delivery Resumed Alert</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Basal Delivery Resumed Alert is the notification displayed when basal insulin delivery resumes after a suspend period.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d3b794ead59ea83de139af0358a0e7b3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329644</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Under-Delivery">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Under-Delivery</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Under-Delivery is the situation where insulin delivery is reduced or stopped, increasing risk of metabolic complications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d3b794ead59ea83de139af0358a0e7b3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329644</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Minimum Suspension Duration">
  <data key="d0">Minimum Suspension Duration</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Minimum Suspension Duration is the shortest time (30 minutes) that insulin suspension can last.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d3b794ead59ea83de139af0358a0e7b3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329645</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Maximum Suspension Duration">
  <data key="d0">Maximum Suspension Duration</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Maximum Suspension Duration is the longest time (two hours) that insulin suspension can last.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d3b794ead59ea83de139af0358a0e7b3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329645</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Suspend Before Low Alert">
  <data key="d0">Suspend Before Low Alert</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Suspend Before Low Alert is the alert generated when the Suspend Before Low Feature suspends insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d3b794ead59ea83de139af0358a0e7b3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329645</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Suspend On Low Alarm">
  <data key="d0">Suspend On Low Alarm</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Suspend On Low Alarm is the alarm triggered when the Suspend On Low Feature suspends insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d3b794ead59ea83de139af0358a0e7b3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329645</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
