  <data key="d0">Update Pump Feature</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Update Pump feature within the MiniMed Mobile app allows remote software updates of the MiniMed 780G pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The Update pump feature allows remote updating of the pump software through the app.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a764dcbdd73fd1c50fa72a7cd60b6e19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7827239a998e7ac7379613d9e5f81ae0</data>
