  <data key="d0">Save</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Save is the action/button that records any changes made to pump settings; if not selected, changes are not saved.&lt;SEP&gt;Save is the action that stores the entered Bolus Wizard settings and completes setup.</data>
