<node id="SmartGuard Target Values">
  <data key="d0">SmartGuard Target Values</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">SmartGuard Target Values are the glucose level options (100 mg/dL, 110 mg/dL, 120 mg/dL) that can be selected to define the desired range for insulin dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard Target Values are glucose thresholds used by SmartGuard to regulate insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ede0f32eb8f8ea1eaab76cc0bc7648fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8741750a7bf86eb5d1fadf82a9c7720e</data>
