  <data key="d0">SmartGuard Will Exit Soon Alert</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An alert warning that SmartGuard will exit because sensor glucose data is unavailable.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard Will Exit Soon Alert warns that SmartGuard will stop monitoring shortly.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b8de1434b9d9f57cd225b5d3e0d7f3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c</data>
