<node id="Sensor Updating">
  <data key="d0">Sensor Updating</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A notification indicating the sensor firmware or data is being updated.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensor Updating is an alert indicating that the sensor is performing continuous quality checks, pausing glucose readings temporarily.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f677e56841fc57bffd8bf5b6cc4a7797&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46d04af5292fae98e3aa651d9cec4512</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329667</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sensor Too Hot">
  <data key="d0">Sensor Too Hot</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A notification indicating the sensor temperature is too high, preventing glucose readings.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensor Too Hot is an alert triggered when the sensor temperature exceeds the maximum safe operating threshold.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f677e56841fc57bffd8bf5b6cc4a7797&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46d04af5292fae98e3aa651d9cec4512</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329667</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sensor Too Cold">
  <data key="d0">Sensor Too Cold</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A notification indicating the sensor temperature is too low, preventing glucose readings.&lt;SEP&gt;Sensor Too Cold is an alert triggered when the sensor temperature falls below the minimum safe operating threshold.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f677e56841fc57bffd8bf5b6cc4a7797&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46d04af5292fae98e3aa651d9cec4512</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786329667</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
