<node id="Diabetes Technology">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes Technology (field) refers to the broad spectrum of digital and device‑based solutions applied to diabetes care, including tools such as continuous glucose monitoring (CGM) systems, blood‑glucose meters (BGM), and other electronic or software platforms that support self‑management. When properly used, these technologies can improve patients’ health outcomes by providing real‑time glucose data, facilitating more precise insulin dosing, and enabling better lifestyle decisions. The field encompasses both hardware (sensors, pumps, wearables) and software (mobile apps, data‑analytics platforms) that together aim to enhance monitoring, treatment adherence, and overall disease management for individuals with diabetes.

Diabetes Technology (journal) is a peer‑reviewed scientific publication dedicated to research on diabetes devices and management. The journal publishes articles that explore advances in diabetes technology, including studies on CGM, interfering substances affecting sensor accuracy, and other innovations in device‑based care. It serves as a reference source for clinicians and researchers seeking evidence‑based information on the development, evaluation, and clinical application of diabetes‑related technologies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7387e81b8141435df1372f5d8b27662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9bc5d11c9f848439320623cad3d3a38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05cc642337c2a615c9b40de9336aec18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fe769b03fc66d4a691f3b7f741b92cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-511f6be03d2ea98970bd4c1b29b3e5c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76eaa3af026fbb91a96f70d3502e809d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9fe6f17fdb504b9177e8ebc48505716&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a19f43c10a7a756e1597ff1a7f53296e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372136</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
