  <data key="d5">1786372182</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MDI">
  <data key="d0">MDI</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Multiple Daily Injections is an insulin regimen used as a comparison to SICI.&lt;SEP&gt;MDI (multiple daily injections) is a traditional insulin delivery method using several daily shots.&lt;SEP&gt;Multiple daily injections, an intensive insulin therapy regimen based on several injections per day.&lt;SEP&gt;Abbreviation for Múltiplas Doses De Insulina, a multiple daily injection insulin regimen.&lt;SEP&gt;Abbreviation for Multiple Daily Injections, the insulin injection therapy regimen.&lt;SEP&gt;MDI (multiple daily injections) is a treatment method involving several insulin injections per day.&lt;SEP&gt;MDI (Multiple Daily Injections) is a conventional insulin delivery method referenced as an alternative to pump therapy for type 2 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7387e81b8141435df1372f5d8b27662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fba8ea0c6bdb8427804ba05f9fe49f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-336a2f2c9b510e23c35be95e2ff7a72a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51c7617f1e335789b870332231de4058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca8620e735c40bfe850134ccea9a7154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cd925790899146eeb8a373879b5feac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-511f6be03d2ea98970bd4c1b29b3e5c8</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335888</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Microvascular Complications">
  <data key="d0">Microvascular Complications</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Microvascular Complications are diabetes‑related damages to small blood vessels. They encompass a group of small‑vessel pathologies that commonly include diabetic retinopathy, nephropathy (often referred to as diabetic kidney disease), and peripheral neuropathy. These conditions arise from chronic exposure to elevated blood glucose levels and are therefore closely linked to measures of glycaemic control such as HbA1c and Time‑in‑Range.

Because microvascular damage reflects the cumulative effect of high glycaemia, the presence or risk of these complications influences clinical decisions about glycaemic targets. Guidelines often cite microvascular complications as a key factor when setting individualized HbA1c goals, with the aim of preventing further progression of retinopathy, kidney disease, and nerve injury. Consequently, monitoring and managing small‑vessel health is a central component of comprehensive diabetes care.&lt;SEP&gt;Complications affecting small blood vessels, which are typically absent in patients with MODY‑GCK.&lt;SEP&gt;Microvascular Complications are small‑vessel complications that can arise in people with Type 2 Diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Microvascular complications are small‑vessel complications that can arise in diabetes, such as retinopathy or nephropathy.&lt;SEP&gt;Microvascular complications are diabetes-related vascular issues, with risk in postpancreatitis diabetes mellitus similar to other diabetes forms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7387e81b8141435df1372f5d8b27662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-277e136948d5572acf031988fd092dce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f716359c14483f9be36a73861d75008&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d83801272f7a0ae0d797d60572fe578&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8393954b021d0ad02018d1a449e0cc93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea6df8d05eb3fdd356a1eaef16a26dd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2cd796639bdb0e10eeda7ef3d9ebbce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74ef8c063d84e34c44021aa138b9b903&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e668c40e3bc21d982ed03a052f0f9339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f99d05e1089d59496d56d86ff40197cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aff91698679a52cd7b07563b7b2627a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba0417a72f50cf7ca66c87a351bd1ff8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-299bcef3259f8ab6bc70544e12616624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c37e26e62468b725533260347fb4e31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e1f69c1d604e82e14a23a29231bd587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-090b8f9281aa75054311d8f275a2c8f8</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/glicemias capilares.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377192</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Macrovascular Complications">
  <data key="d0">Macrovascular Complications</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Macrovascular Complications are large‑vessel complications of diabetes that encompass a range of cardiovascular diseases and events. They involve damage to major blood vessels caused by elevated glycaemia, particularly in type 2 diabetes, and manifest as heart disease, myocardial infarction, stroke, cardiovascular death, and other long‑term cardiovascular outcomes.

These complications are a central focus of diabetes management guidelines; for example, the HbA1c target set out in Recommendation R2 is intended to prevent macrovascular damage. Clinical evidence also indicates that intensive insulin therapy can reduce the incidence of macrovascular complications, highlighting the importance of tight glycaemic control in mitigating large‑vessel disease risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Complications affecting large blood vessels, which are typically absent in patients with MODY‑GCK.&lt;SEP&gt;Macrovascular Complications are large‑vessel complications that can arise in people with Type 2 Diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Macrovascular complications are large‑vessel complications of diabetes, including cardiovascular disease.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7387e81b8141435df1372f5d8b27662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-277e136948d5572acf031988fd092dce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-494fef0b8efc2c44b3b49ebf9d74b7f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d83801272f7a0ae0d797d60572fe578&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f9624abde6cf128707fcc0466a4c9a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2cd796639bdb0e10eeda7ef3d9ebbce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e668c40e3bc21d982ed03a052f0f9339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f99d05e1089d59496d56d86ff40197cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-299bcef3259f8ab6bc70544e12616624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c37e26e62468b725533260347fb4e31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e1f69c1d604e82e14a23a29231bd587</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/sici.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
