  <data key="d0">Guidelines</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Clinical guidelines are documents referenced by organizations such as AACE/ACE, SBD, and NICE to define SICI indications.&lt;SEP&gt;Clinical practice recommendations referenced for SICI use in gestantes and diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Clinical recommendations that preconize AMGC for all insulin‑using diabetes patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6fba8ea0c6bdb8427804ba05f9fe49f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-336a2f2c9b510e23c35be95e2ff7a72a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e26d518805695de3e4f9d41ae1d3e1</data>
