  <data key="d2">International organization that contributed to the consensus statement on insulin pump therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;International Society for Pediatric and Adolescent Diabetes issued 2018 consensus guidelines relevant to CFRD.&lt;SEP&gt;International Society for Pediatric and Adolescent Diabetes is an organization that issued ISPAD clinical practice consensus guidelines in 2014.</data>
