<node id="European Association for the Study of Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">European Association for the Study of Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">European organization that endorsed the consensus statement on insulin pump therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;European Association for the Study of Diabetes is a professional body co‑authoring the automated insulin delivery consensus report.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Association for the Study of Diabetes is a professional organization that co‑authored a consensus report on diabetes digital app technology.&lt;SEP&gt;EASD co-authored a patient‑centered position statement on hyperglycemia management with the ADA.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Association for the Study of Diabetes co-authored consensus reports on hyperglycemia management.&lt;SEP&gt;European Association for the Study of Diabetes co‑authored a consensus report on precision medicine in diabetes.\&lt;SEP&gt;The European Association for the Study of Diabetes is an organization that co-authored a consensus report on the management of type 1 diabetes in adults.</data>
