<node id="Intensive Treatment">
  <data key="d0">Intensive Treatment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Approach of rigorous diabetes management advocated by the American Diabetes Association.&lt;SEP&gt;Intensive treatment refers to rigorous glycemic management aimed at reducing diabetes complications, examined in multiple long-term studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Aggressive diabetes management aimed at tightly controlling blood glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;An aggressive, multifactorial approach to manage multiple risk factors.&lt;SEP&gt;Intensive Treatment is a therapeutic approach that modestly but significantly improved risk factors compared with routine care.</data>
