<node id="Hybrid Closed-Loop Insulin Delivery System">
  <data key="d0">Hybrid Closed-Loop Insulin Delivery System</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Automated insulin delivery method that combines CGM data with an algorithm to adjust pump basal rates.&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid closed-loop insulin delivery system is an advanced device that combines automated insulin dosing with user input, assessed in a randomized trial.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical device that automatically adjusts insulin delivery based on glucose readings for people with type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-16a76447c936e157673f084ffb74520d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f35eed8b49aa0b698012777f6ec96ce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4af6b5c6f1fd844ec61928d1cce6ef9</data>
