  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Rapid‑acting insulin analogs (lispro, aspart, glulisine) are fast‑acting formulations preferred for pump therapy due to early peak and predictable absorption.&lt;SEP&gt;Rapid‑acting insulin analogs are fast‑acting insulin formulations recommended for use in basal‑bolus regimens.&lt;SEP&gt;Rapid‑acting insulin analogs are a class of injectable insulins designed for quick glucose control.&lt;SEP&gt;Rapid‑acting insulin analogs are fast‑acting insulin formulations used in studies comparing insulin pumps with multiple daily injections.</data>
