  <data key="d0">Canada</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Canada is a country where Fiasp has received regulatory approval.&lt;SEP&gt;Canada is the country where the fast‑acting insulin Fiasp was approved and launched.&lt;SEP&gt;Canada is the country in which the insulin research took place.&lt;SEP&gt;Canada is the country referenced in the citation of the Insulin100 website.&lt;SEP&gt;Canada is the country where insulin was discovered and developed.&lt;SEP&gt;The country where the University of Toronto initially secured patent rights for insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Canada is the country containing Toronto, the site of the historic insulin breakthrough.</data>
