  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">SICI is a continuous insulin infusion method used in intensive diabetes therapy, often implemented with an insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;SICI is a continuous insulin infusion system used as a therapeutic method for diabetes management.</data>
