  <data key="d0">Hipoglicemia Assintomática</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Assymptomatic hypoglycemia is a low blood glucose episode without noticeable symptoms.&lt;SEP&gt;Hipoglicemia Assintomática is asymptomatic hypoglycemia, often recurrent and level 3, requiring specific management.&lt;SEP&gt;Asymptomatic hypoglycemia considered when adjusting HbA1c targets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dfa23fc15cc4d520a32488843dbd710b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f645bd7019e94151caaff47d6cbfcaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0cc9dbb0b2eb4685ac17cfe445b7ce7</data>
