<node id="Hybrid Closed-Loop System">
  <data key="d0">Hybrid Closed-Loop System</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A diabetes device that combines continuous glucose monitoring (MCG) with an insulin pump to automatically adjust basal insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Closed-Loop System is a type of AID that requires manual carbohydrate entry for prandial dosing while automating basal adjustments.&lt;SEP&gt;An automated insulin delivery device (e.g., the 670G system) that integrates continuous glucose monitoring with insulin pump therapy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c2d6e4597425d2a83c3efcd9ca07f65c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cd925790899146eeb8a373879b5feac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-664916c2444f157f5d7d9bc41b032d26</data>
