<node id="Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 (DM2)">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 (DM2)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DM2 is a metabolic disorder characterized by insulin resistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 (DM2) is a form of diabetes for which TIR, hypoglycemia, and hyperglycemia targets can be set.</data>
