<node id="Nature Reviews Drug Discovery">
  <data key="d0">Nature Reviews Drug Discovery</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Nature Reviews Drug Discovery is the journal that published the 2007 review article on delivering drugs through the lungs.&lt;SEP&gt;Nature Reviews Drug Discovery is a journal that published an article on delivering drugs through the lungs.&lt;SEP&gt;Nature Reviews Drug Discovery is the journal hosting the article “Inhaling medicines: delivering drugs to the body through the lungs”.&lt;SEP&gt;Nature Reviews Drug Discovery is the journal that published the article “Inhaling medicines: delivering drugs to the body through the lungs”.&lt;SEP&gt;Nature Reviews Drug Discovery is the journal source of the compiled references on inhaled medicines.&lt;SEP&gt;Nature Reviews Drug Discovery is a scientific journal that publishes review articles on drug discovery and development.&lt;SEP&gt;Nature Reviews Drug Discovery is the journal that published the review article on inhaled medicines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-495ecc36cb3ac19034eacfd82aa72475&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-941c5035ce1f85963f1f564bf2bf73fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35bda9f2de2e1c92c69f8cfe36faec5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649c4ac605d59d792f3d5f8952251312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b95d32a33501b281cbbf40dd69ba1e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61a59544bbd02c2c82b13c7808f72c73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e337602a6f677dde49f4899bab5a07c9</data>
