</node>
<node id="Asthma">
  <data key="d0">Asthma</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Asthma is a lung disease for which inhaled drugs have been used therapeutically since the 1950s.&lt;SEP&gt;Asthma is a chronic respiratory disease that contraindicates the use of Afrezza.&lt;SEP&gt;A chronic pulmonary disease mentioned as a target for liposomal drug delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-495ecc36cb3ac19034eacfd82aa72475&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e6371d8083fb20b137912cdaeec1b8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-292ec5ef0e73074be4398f1729c06661</data>
