<node id="Inhaling Medicines: Delivering Drugs to the Body Through the Lungs">
  <data key="d0">Inhaling Medicines: Delivering Drugs to the Body Through the Lungs</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This 2007 review article examines the use of the lungs for systemic drug delivery and recent advances such as inhaled insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;This article discusses the mechanisms and challenges of delivering drugs to the body via the lungs.&lt;SEP&gt;Inhaling Medicines: Delivering Drugs to the Body Through the Lungs is a review article discussing inhaled drug delivery, PEGylation, bioavailability, and airway physiology.&lt;SEP&gt;Inhaling medicines: delivering drugs to the body through the lungs is the article referenced in the text.</data>
