  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pulmonary drug delivery is the delivery of therapeutic agents to the lung via inhalation.&lt;SEP&gt;The overall approach of delivering therapeutics via the lungs, encompassing devices and carriers.</data>
