<node id="Cystic Fibrosis">
  <data key="d0">Cystic Fibrosis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cystic fibrosis is a lung disease in which aerosolized tobramycin efficacy was studied.&lt;SEP&gt;Cystic Fibrosis is a genetic disease cited as a condition where insulin pumps may be used due to insulin deficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Cystic Fibrosis is a genetic disorder affecting the exocrine pancreas and can lead to diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Cystic fibrosis is a genetic disease that can be complicated by CFRD.&lt;SEP&gt;Cystic Fibrosis is a genetic disorder affecting the lungs and other organs.&lt;SEP&gt;Cystic fibrosis is a genetic disorder referenced as an etiology of pancreatic diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Cystic fibrosis is a genetic disease affecting the lungs and other organs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-941c5035ce1f85963f1f564bf2bf73fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cd925790899146eeb8a373879b5feac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-090b8f9281aa75054311d8f275a2c8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72a2488e8176f7676c76504e76dd6c04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cdf6af658e42c2f4f7dca5e4dbdd3db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7b840a0b5327c5e583eb70dd354d1d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0631ff2b95dd459677eaaebe9283a776</data>
