  <data key="d0">J. Pharm. Sci.</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Journal of Pharmaceutical Sciences is a journal that published Tronde et al.’s research on pulmonary absorption rate and bioavailability of drugs in rats.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-61a59544bbd02c2c82b13c7808f72c73</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Inhaling medicines_ delivering drugs to the body through the lungs _ Nature Reviews Drug Discovery.pdf</data>
