  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">American Review of Respiratory Disease is a journal that described Parra et al.’s zonal distribution of alveolar macrophages, type II pneumocytes, and alveolar septal connective tissue gaps in adult human lungs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-61a59544bbd02c2c82b13c7808f72c73</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Inhaling medicines_ delivering drugs to the body through the lungs _ Nature Reviews Drug Discovery.pdf</data>
