  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">American Journal of Physiology – Lung Cellular and Molecular Physiology is a journal that reported Lombry et al.’s findings that alveolar macrophages are a primary barrier to pulmonary absorption of macromolecules.</data>
