  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Glulisina (Apidra) is a rapid‑acting insulin analog used for prandial coverage.&lt;SEP&gt;Glulisina (Apidra) is a rapid‑acting insulin listed under prandial insulins.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd6fa98b7767319460b4a421a719c5c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d86d36b30e6f5b8ff44caade2d2400d</data>
