  <data key="d0">Fast Aspartate (Fiasp)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Fast Aspartate (Fiasp) is an ultra‑rapid insulin analog used for prandial coverage.&lt;SEP&gt;Fast Aspartate (Fiasp) is an ultra‑rapid insulin with onset 2‑5 min, peak 1‑3h, and duration 5h.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd6fa98b7767319460b4a421a719c5c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d86d36b30e6f5b8ff44caade2d2400d</data>
