  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Inalada (Afrezza) is an inhaled ultra‑rapid insulin formulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Inalada (Afrezza) is an inhaled rapid insulin with immediate onset of 10‑20 min and a duration of 12h.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd6fa98b7767319460b4a421a719c5c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d86d36b30e6f5b8ff44caade2d2400d</data>
