</node>
<node id="Insulin Tecnósfera">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Tecnósfera</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An inhalable, ultrarapid‑acting insulin formulation administered before meals that reaches peak concentration earlier than insulin aspart and reduces post‑prandial glucose, hypoglycemia time, and weight gain.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca8620e735c40bfe850134ccea9a7154</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786331393</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sistema De Infusão Subcutânea Contínua De Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Sistema De Infusão Subcutânea Contínua De Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A continuous subcutaneous insulin infusion system, considered gold‑standard for intensive therapy and recommended when multiple daily injections cannot achieve adequate glycemic control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca8620e735c40bfe850134ccea9a7154</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786331393</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Capillary Glucose Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">Capillary Glucose Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Traditional finger‑stick glucose measurement used as a comparator to continuous glucose monitoring in studies of insulin delivery methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca8620e735c40bfe850134ccea9a7154</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786331393</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="International Society For Pediatric And Adolescent Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">International Society For Pediatric And Adolescent Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A professional organization that recommends continuous insulin infusion as the primary therapy for small children with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;International Society for Pediatric and Adolescent Diabetes is an organization referenced for hypoglycemia management in children.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization that, together with JDRF, recommends identifying patients with multiple autoantibodies for type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca8620e735c40bfe850134ccea9a7154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee7ecd9171c82c15f635a8a9b605621c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-343246c2eef6e8430b581340d6cd4762</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Post‑prandial Glucose">
  <data key="d0">Post‑prandial Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Blood glucose levels measured after meals, which were reduced by insulin Tecnósfera at 30 minutes, 1 hour, and 2 hours in comparative studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca8620e735c40bfe850134ccea9a7154</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786331393</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dose Total Diária De Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Dose Total Diária De Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The total daily insulin dose, which varies with age, weight, time since diagnosis and pubertal stage, and is divided into basal and bolus components.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca8620e735c40bfe850134ccea9a7154</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786331394</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cough">
  <data key="d0">Cough</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An adverse effect reported by one third of patients using inhalable insulin Tecnósfera, which resolved after discontinuation of the therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Cough is a respiratory symptom that can occur as a side effect of inhaling Afrezza powder.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca8620e735c40bfe850134ccea9a7154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8644d98286c4a296063176435b45d589</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/edelman-et-al-2026-dosing-afrezza-it-s-not-that-complicated.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786333267</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Closed‑Loop Hybrid System">
  <data key="d0">Closed‑Loop Hybrid System</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A hybrid closed‑loop insulin pump configuration mentioned as not being used in the referenced continuous infusion study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca8620e735c40bfe850134ccea9a7154</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786331394</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Long‑Acting Insulin Analogues">
  <data key="d0">Long‑Acting Insulin Analogues</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Long‑Acting Insulin Analogues refer to insulin glargina U100 and detemir, which provide prolonged glucose‑lowering action with reduced variability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-65cd86aee374fd1ea91bb4fd5ebee2a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786331395</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ultra‑Long‑Acting Insulin Analogues">
  <data key="d0">Ultra‑Long‑Acting Insulin Analogues</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ultra‑Long‑Acting Insulin Analogues include insulin glargina U300 and degludeca, offering extended duration of action and lower hypoglycemia risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-65cd86aee374fd1ea91bb4fd5ebee2a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786331395</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pediatric Type 1 Diabetes Patients">
  <data key="d0">Pediatric Type 1 Diabetes Patients</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Children and adolescents aged 5 to 16 years with type 1 diabetes represent a pediatric population studied for insulin‑therapy outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-65cd86aee374fd1ea91bb4fd5ebee2a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786331395</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="EDITION 4 Study">
  <data key="d0">EDITION 4 Study</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The EDITION 4 Study is a six‑month, open‑label, randomized clinical trial comparing daily insulin glargina U300 with glargina U100 in type 1 diabetes patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-65cd86aee374fd1ea91bb4fd5ebee2a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786331396</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="BEGIN Basal‑Bolus Type 1 Study">
  <data key="d0">BEGIN Basal‑Bolus Type 1 Study</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The BEGIN Basal‑Bolus Type 1 Study is a 52‑week, multicenter, open‑label, treat‑to‑target trial comparing degludeca with glargina U100 in type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-65cd86aee374fd1ea91bb4fd5ebee2a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Insulinoterapia – Diretriz da Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes – Ed. 2024.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786331396</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SWITCH 1 Study">
  <data key="d0">SWITCH 1 Study</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The SWITCH 1 Study is a clinical trial evaluating degludeca versus glargina U100 regarding overall, nocturnal, and severe hypoglycemia rates.</data>
