<node id="Evidence Class IIb Level A">
  <data key="d0">Evidence Class IIb Level A</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Evidence Class IIb Level A denotes a higher level of evidence supporting ultra‑long‑acting insulin analogues for basal insulinization in high‑risk patients.</data>
