<node id="COMISAIR Study">
  <data key="d0">COMISAIR Study</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">COMISAIR is a study reporting that glycaemic outcomes in adults with T1D are impacted more by continuous glucose monitoring than by insulin delivery method over three years of follow‑up.&lt;SEP&gt;The COMISAIR Study is a three‑year follow‑up investigation of glycemic outcomes in adults with type 1 diabetes, comparing continuous glucose monitoring with insulin delivery methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b50a9fb21c77773aec36a9b8e9f5e1d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9416e8076c17175db0dbb12c3393566</data>
