<node id="Nephropathy">
  <data key="d0">Nephropathy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Nephropathy is a kidney complication of type 1 diabetes evaluated as an outcome of intensive therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Nephropathy is a microvascular complication of diabetes whose progression risk increases as TIR decreases.&lt;SEP&gt;Kidney disease resulting from chronic hyperglycaemia in diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;A diabetes complication affecting the kidneys.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e7e6ca9bf63e843b814736c0409c70fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94150b57cc35a773b7c36f33f237f8a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e668c40e3bc21d982ed03a052f0f9339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9eb02ab1ab7d834858bf60a8b402e6ea</data>
