  <data key="d2">Diabetes Technology and Therapeutics is a scientific journal cited for a study on postprandial glycemic control in type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Technology and Therapeutics is the journal that featured an article on Technosphere insulin technology.&lt;SEP&gt;A journal focusing on technology and therapeutic advances in diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Technology and Therapeutics is a journal that published studies on skin reactions and safety of continuous glucose monitoring devices.&lt;SEP&gt;A peer‑reviewed journal publishing research on glucose monitoring and insulin delivery technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Technology and Therapeutics is a peer‑reviewed journal that published several articles on insulin pumps, V‑Go, and digital diabetes technologies.</data>
