<node id="Glucose Variability">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Variability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose variability refers to fluctuations in blood glucose levels, evaluated as lower with insulin detemir.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose Variability is a metric reported as 45.5 % for the test patient.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose variability is associated with an increased risk for hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Fluctuations in blood glucose levels measured in diabetes management.</data>
