  <data key="d0">Dr. Starr</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Dr. Starr was a colleague whom Banting informed about laboratory difficulties and infection problems.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. Starr is a physician who secured the use of the surgical research operating room for F. G Banting’s experiments.</data>
