<node id="Isletin">
  <data key="d0">Isletin</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Isletin was the name given by Banting and Best to their pancreatic extract that showed anti‑diabetic properties.&lt;SEP&gt;Isletin is an insulin extract administered to Dog #92 during the experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Isletin is the name given to the pancreatic extract used in the initial insulin injections on the dog Marjorie.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eff48c1408719e81f1f423f76dfd19e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-172719b5694ed1fb8003b6874395d641&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0932e9c21a330869629b3fa70d2e1f5e</data>
