  <data key="d0">University of Toronto Archives</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">University of Toronto Archives is the repository that holds the accession record of Banting and Best’s laboratory.&lt;SEP&gt;University of Toronto Archives contain documents about Dr. John Gerald Fitzgerald and Connaught Laboratories.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eff48c1408719e81f1f423f76dfd19e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ba3c49b467b6d37cd2aab29bf4a3119</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332066</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="London, Ontario">
  <data key="d0">London, Ontario</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">London, Ontario is the city where Frederick G. Banting awoke on 31 October 1920 with his initial insulin idea.&lt;SEP&gt;London, Ontario is the city to which Banting planned to travel to settle personal affairs.&lt;SEP&gt;London, Ontario is the city where Sir Frederick Banting had his flash of insight on 31 October 1920.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eff48c1408719e81f1f423f76dfd19e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ba3c49b467b6d37cd2aab29bf4a3119&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01bb90c243340c22c0d25864008eb9d5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332066</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Toronto">
  <data key="d0">Toronto</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Toronto is a major Canadian city that served as the central hub for the pioneering insulin research conducted in the early 1920s. The University of Toronto, located in Toronto, provided the academic setting and laboratory facilities where Dr. Frederick Banting arrived to begin his investigations into insulin. Within the same city, the Toronto General Hospital housed the clinical environment necessary for testing and administering the new treatment.

In Toronto, Banting collaborated with fellow researchers, most notably meeting Professor John J.R. Macleod at the university. The combined efforts of the university’s insulin research groups and the hospital’s medical staff led to the early experiments that culminated in the first successful insulin injection. Consequently, Toronto is recognized as the place where the foundational work on insulin was performed, linking the city’s academic and medical institutions to a breakthrough that transformed the treatment of diabetes worldwide.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eff48c1408719e81f1f423f76dfd19e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-247d0735bf59962683d382203243d395&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9043f44e67d9ed02b4864043d3cbb59a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c2889fe850f241cf3ebb528da2adbb1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01bb90c243340c22c0d25864008eb9d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad5d126f417014eb5c7a07a85db48d1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47acdaf58d4f121a3948976c07c3d03c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0932e9c21a330869629b3fa70d2e1f5e</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Understanding insulin - International Diabetes Federation.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332447</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Experiments on 11 August 1921">
  <data key="d0">Experiments on 11 August 1921</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">On 11 August 1921 Banting and Best removed pancreases of two dogs, gave Isletin to Dog #92, and used Dog #409 as a control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eff48c1408719e81f1f423f76dfd19e5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Experiments on 17 August 1921">
  <data key="d0">Experiments on 17 August 1921</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">On 17 August 1921 Banting and Best removed a whole pancreas from a dog and prepared an extract, then injected Dog #92 with it.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eff48c1408719e81f1f423f76dfd19e5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Secretin Injection Experiment on 20 August 1921">
  <data key="d0">Secretin Injection Experiment on 20 August 1921</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">On 20 August 1921 Banting and Best injected secretin-stimulated extract into Dog #92 after a four‑hour pancreatic stimulation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eff48c1408719e81f1f423f76dfd19e5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cat Pancreas Extract Experiment on 22 August 1921">
  <data key="d0">Cat Pancreas Extract Experiment on 22 August 1921</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">On 22 August 1921 Banting and Best prepared an extract from a cat pancreas using secretin stimulation and administered it to Dog #92, causing shock.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eff48c1408719e81f1f423f76dfd19e5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dog #92 Death on 31 August 1921">
  <data key="d0">Dog #92 Death on 31 August 1921</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">On 31 August 1921 Dog #92 died after lingering for nine days following the experiments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eff48c1408719e81f1f423f76dfd19e5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Macleod Letter Arrival on 23 September 1921">
  <data key="d0">Macleod Letter Arrival on 23 September 1921</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">On 23 September 1921 Macleod’s letter arrived, praising progress but urging caution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eff48c1408719e81f1f423f76dfd19e5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
