  <data key="d2">Insulin100 is an online resource documenting the historical timeline of insulin discovery, cited in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin100: The Discovery and Development – Defining Moments Canada is an online resource cited for the historical timeline of insulin research.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin100 is an online historical resource documenting the discovery and development of insulin, cited multiple times in the source text.</data>
