<node id="Pancreatic Juice">
  <data key="d0">Pancreatic Juice</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pancreatic juice is the digestive fluid whose incubation with the extract in alkaline conditions removed the extract’s effect.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatic Juice is the digestive secretion whose production was halted during secretin stimulation.</data>
