  <data key="d0">Laboratory</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The laboratory is the research space where Banting sought better operating facilities and assistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratory is the research space where the experiments on dogs were conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratory is the setting where blood analyses are performed and laboratory‑based values are obtained.</data>
