<node id="Dog #406">
  <data key="d0">Dog #406</data>
  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">Dog #406 was a laboratory dog used in the 1 August 1921 insulin experiment; it entered a coma, recovered after receiving the extract, but later fell back into a coma and died.&lt;SEP&gt;Dog #406 is an experimental canine that was in a coma and received pancreatic extract on 1 August 1921.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-172719b5694ed1fb8003b6874395d641&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c2889fe850f241cf3ebb528da2adbb1</data>
