</node>
<node id="Dog #408">
  <data key="d0">Dog #408</data>
  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">Dog #408 was a laboratory dog that received an injection of the pancreatic extract on 4 August 1921, remained in good condition for a time, and later died of an infection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-172719b5694ed1fb8003b6874395d641</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
