  <data key="d0">Insulin100</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin100 is an online resource documenting the timeline of insulin’s discovery and development in Canada.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin100 is a digital timeline documenting the discovery and development of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin100: The Discovery and Development – Defining Moments Canada is a website that provides a timeline and citations about insulin’s discovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin100 is a virtual exhibit that explores the discovery and development of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin100 is an online resource providing timelines, micro‑histories, and citations about insulin’s discovery and early clinical use.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin100 is the title of the online timeline and article series documenting insulin’s discovery and development.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin100 is a digital content project documenting the history of insulin discovery and development.</data>
