  <data key="d0">1 August 1921 Experiment with Dog #406</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">On 1 August 1921, Dog #406 was given the extract, resulting in a temporary drop in blood sugar before the dog later died.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-172719b5694ed1fb8003b6874395d641</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
