  <data key="d0">4 August 1921 Injection of Dog #408</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">On 4 August 1921, Dog #408 received an injection of the extract, which lowered its blood sugar and kept it in good condition for a period.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-172719b5694ed1fb8003b6874395d641</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
