  <data key="d0">U of T Board of Governors</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Board of Governors of the University of Toronto negotiated patent rights and a collaboration agreement with Eli Lilly.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9043f44e67d9ed02b4864043d3cbb59a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
