</node>
<node id="Indianapolis">
  <data key="d0">Indianapolis</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Indianapolis is the city in Indiana, USA, where Eli Lilly &amp; Co is headquartered.&lt;SEP&gt;Indianapolis was the city associated with Eli Lilly’s group that pooled knowledge with the Toronto team.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9043f44e67d9ed02b4864043d3cbb59a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad5d126f417014eb5c7a07a85db48d1d</data>
