  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Hans Christian Hagedorn is a scientist who co‑established the Nordisk Insulin Laboratory, acted as its director, and later founded Novo Nordisk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8c80fa00c2f059f9425a4ef62c162b1c</data>
