  <data key="d0">Nordisk Insulin Foundation</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Nordisk Insulin Foundation is a charitable foundation created in December 1926 to fund scientific and clinical studies in physiology, endocrinology, and metabolism.</data>
