  <data key="d2">Dr. Christopher Rutty is listed as the author associated with a Connaught Research University of Toronto webpage about the history of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Christopher Rutty is a researcher who contributed to the Sanofi Pasteur Canada Archives documenting the history of insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-01bb90c243340c22c0d25864008eb9d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53f6d8d7aad59b28e557f5971d0d828</data>
