  <data key="d0">John J. R. Macleod</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Dr. John J. R. Macleod was the head of physiology at the University of Toronto who met with Frederick G. Banting in November 1920 and agreed to support his research.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-01bb90c243340c22c0d25864008eb9d5</data>
