  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The National Film Board of Canada produced the short film “The Quest” (1958) that dramatizes the initial meeting between Banting and Macleod.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-01bb90c243340c22c0d25864008eb9d5</data>
