  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">On June 28 1922, the exclusive Insulin Production Agreement between Eli Lilly and the University of Toronto formally came into effect.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17a38cd3b50722f2d9ae2a618121bb61</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf</data>
