  <data key="d0">August 15, 1922 – Elizabeth Hughes Arrival and Treatment Initiation</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">On August 15 1922, Elizabeth Hughes arrived in Toronto with her mother Antoinette and immediately began insulin therapy under Frederick Banting.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17a38cd3b50722f2d9ae2a618121bb61</data>
