  <data key="d0">October 1922 – Elsie Needham Insulin Treatment</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">In October 1922, 11‑year‑old Elsie Needham received insulin at the Hospital for Sick Children, resulting in a near‑resurrection from diabetic coma.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17a38cd3b50722f2d9ae2a618121bb61</data>
