<node id="International Diabetes Federation">
  <data key="d0">International Diabetes Federation</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">International Diabetes Federation (IDF) is a global, non‑governmental organization dedicated to diabetes education, research, and advocacy. It produces a wide range of educational resources for patients, health professionals, and the public, including specific content such as the “Understanding Insulin” module, and it serves as a central hub for disseminating up‑to‑date information on diabetes prevention and care.

In addition to education, the IDF develops and publishes clinical guidelines and recommendations that address diabetes management across diverse populations. Its guidance covers general diabetes care, with particular emphasis on type 2 diabetes in primary‑care settings, and includes a dedicated global guideline for managing older adults with type 2 diabetes. The federation also issues worldwide recommendations for diabetes diagnosis, providing standardized criteria to harmonize practice internationally.

The IDF regularly convenes expert committees to review and update diagnostic methodologies. One such committee reassessed screening and diagnostic approaches and recommended the preferential use of the 1‑hour oral glucose tolerance test (TTGO‑1h) for identifying type 2 diabetes. The organization’s position statements on diagnosis reflect these expert insights and aim to inform clinicians, policymakers, and health systems about the most effective and evidence‑based practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Global organization that published the 10th edition of the IDF Diabetes Atlas in 2021.&lt;SEP&gt;An international organization that publishes the IDF Diabetes Atlas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0932e9c21a330869629b3fa70d2e1f5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06425d1f80d868bd58871b6a6e740102&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4c458a11c8c36c5c212c3aa69b026c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-679002669c87907578534904694e17dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6db2125b1b94840ea29100039a6fef20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a92f811a7d2d835dc4b730c9bbf08cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80893468bbc3744e2e535806ea31e346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2faebf8275a86cd8d9995c769b0926a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea6df8d05eb3fdd356a1eaef16a26dd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5ec01ed3c32ac663f3dc6cfa6fa09a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f1215318cea8c61dc12042476611f9f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Understanding insulin - International Diabetes Federation.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/ref.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Glicemia_SBD.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377386</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
