<node id="Intensive Therapy">
  <data key="d0">Intensive Therapy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intensive therapy attempts to replicate the body’s normal pattern of insulin secretion using basal and bolus insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Intensive therapy is an insulin regimen that mimics normal insulin secretion using both basal and bolus insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0932e9c21a330869629b3fa70d2e1f5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06425d1f80d868bd58871b6a6e740102</data>
