  <data key="d0">Sliding Scale Therapy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sliding scale therapy adjusts pre‑meal or nighttime insulin doses progressively based on predefined blood glucose ranges.&lt;SEP&gt;Sliding scale therapy adjusts insulin doses before meals or at night based on predefined blood glucose ranges.</data>
