<node id="INHALE‑3 Study">
  <data key="d0">INHALE‑3 Study</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">INHALE‑3 Study is a randomized trial comparing inhaled insulin plus basal insulin with usual care in adults with Type 1 Diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Randomized comparison of postprandial glucose excursion using inhaled insulin versus rapid‑acting analogue insulin in adults with type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-161a201d846100f42e643139469a1e6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0e51dec97ab970bbc2f21878a8735ed</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/edelman-et-al-2026-dosing-afrezza-it-s-not-that-complicated.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786333236</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="INHALE‑1 Study">
  <data key="d0">INHALE‑1 Study</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">INHALE‑1 Study is a multi‑center randomized trial of inhaled Technosphere Insulin in children with Type 1 Diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-161a201d846100f42e643139469a1e6c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332834</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Automated Artificial Pancreas">
  <data key="d0">Automated Artificial Pancreas</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Automated Artificial Pancreas is a device that uses Technosphere inhaled insulin to mimic first‑phase insulin secretion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-161a201d846100f42e643139469a1e6c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332834</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hybrid Closed Loop Treatment">
  <data key="d0">Hybrid Closed Loop Treatment</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hybrid Closed Loop (HCL) Treatment is an insulin delivery approach evaluated for glucose dynamics with Afrezza.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-161a201d846100f42e643139469a1e6c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332834</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Postprandial Period">
  <data key="d0">Postprandial Period</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Postprandial Period refers to the time after meals during which inhaled Technosphere Insulin safety and efficacy were assessed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-161a201d846100f42e643139469a1e6c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332834</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="90‑Day Randomized Controlled Trial of Inhaled Insulin vs Automated Insulin Delivery">
  <data key="d0">90‑Day Randomized Controlled Trial of Inhaled Insulin vs Automated Insulin Delivery</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">This 90‑day trial examined replacing or supplementing automated insulin delivery with inhaled Technosphere Insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-161a201d846100f42e643139469a1e6c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332834</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
