  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A 2020 open‑label, randomized three‑way crossover trial investigating the efficacy and safety of inhaled insulin using a t:slim pump with the Diabetes Assistant hybrid closed‑loop platform.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e76c949a607724dd052d9fc4c7127a18</data>
