  <data key="d0">High‑dose Inhaled Insulin (TI H)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A higher dosage of inhaled insulin tested in the Galderisi Study and shown to reduce early postprandial glucose excursions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e76c949a607724dd052d9fc4c7127a18</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
