  <data key="d0">Subcutaneous RAA Insulin Formulations</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Subcutaneous RAA insulin formulations are traditional insulin products with delayed glucose‑lowering action.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2767372b4b5395439f542016058306a4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
