<node id="Standardized Meal Challenges">
  <data key="d0">Standardized Meal Challenges</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Standardized meal challenges are clinical tests used to assess glucose control in AID users.&lt;SEP&gt;Standardized Meal Challenges are controlled feeding protocols used to assess postprandial glucose responses in clinical studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2767372b4b5395439f542016058306a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
