  <data key="d0">AID Manufacturers</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">AID manufacturers are companies that develop Automated Insulin Delivery systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2767372b4b5395439f542016058306a4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332852</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Inhaled Insulin Manufacturers">
  <data key="d0">Inhaled Insulin Manufacturers</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Inhaled insulin manufacturers produce inhaled insulin products such as TI.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2767372b4b5395439f542016058306a4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332852</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Regulatory Agencies">
  <data key="d0">Regulatory Agencies</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Regulatory agencies are bodies that oversee compliance with FDA requirements for diabetes technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Authorities that approve immunomodulatory medications for diabetes treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulatory Agencies are governmental or independent bodies that approve and oversee the use of medical medications, including immunomodulatory drugs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2767372b4b5395439f542016058306a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-343246c2eef6e8430b581340d6cd4762&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea6df8d05eb3fdd356a1eaef16a26dd5</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372006</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Exogenous Insulin Doses">
  <data key="d0">Exogenous Insulin Doses</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Exogenous insulin doses refer to insulin administered from external sources and input by users into algorithms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2767372b4b5395439f542016058306a4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332852</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fan et al.">
  <data key="d0">Fan et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Fan et al. authored a systematic review and meta‑analysis reporting that AID systems significantly improved time‑in‑range and reduced time‑below‑range.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332852</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Akturk et al.">
  <data key="d0">Akturk et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Akturk et al. investigated the use of AID systems in individuals with Type 1 Diabetes and insulin‑treated Type 2 Diabetes using registration trials and real‑life data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332852</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Gera et al.">
  <data key="d0">Gera et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Gera et al. conducted a review of real‑world evidence on AID systems across diverse patient groups.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332852</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Time‑in‑Range (TIR)">
  <data key="d0">Time‑in‑Range (TIR)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Time‑in‑Range is a glucose metric (70–180 mg/dL) that was reported to improve with AID system use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332852</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Time‑below‑Range (TBR)">
  <data key="d0">Time‑below‑Range (TBR)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Time‑below‑Range is a glucose metric that was reported to decrease with AID system use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332852</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glycated Hemoglobin (HbA1c)">
  <data key="d0">Glycated Hemoglobin (HbA1c)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glycated hemoglobin is a measure of long‑term glucose control that was reduced in T1D subjects using AID systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332852</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Technosphere Insulin (TI)">
  <data key="d0">Technosphere Insulin (TI)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">TI is an inhaled powdered insulin formulation composed of recombinant human insulin adsorbed onto Technosphere microparticles.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332853</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Recombinant Human Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Recombinant Human Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Recombinant human insulin is the protein adsorbed onto Technosphere microparticles in the TI formulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Recombinant human insulin is a genetically engineered form of human insulin incorporated into the TI formulation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbb54288f56e407604ea361f58e58233</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/edelman-et-al-2026-dosing-afrezza-it-s-not-that-complicated.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786333261</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Technosphere Microparticles">
  <data key="d0">Technosphere Microparticles</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Technosphere microparticles are carrier particles (≈2.0–2.5 µm) that deliver TI deep into the lungs.&lt;SEP&gt;Technosphere microparticles are carrier particles in TI that enable pulmonary delivery of insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbb54288f56e407604ea361f58e58233</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/edelman-et-al-2026-dosing-afrezza-it-s-not-that-complicated.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786333261</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fumaryl Diketopiperazine (FDKP)">
  <data key="d0">Fumaryl Diketopiperazine (FDKP)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">FDKP is an inert excipient that crystallizes to form Technosphere microparticles.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332853</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Rapid‑Acting Analog (RAA) Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Rapid‑Acting Analog (RAA) Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">RAA insulin is a rapid‑acting insulin formulation used as a comparator to TI in absorption studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332853</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ultra‑Rapid‑Acting Analog (URAA) Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Ultra‑Rapid‑Acting Analog (URAA) Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">URAA insulin is an ultra‑rapid‑acting insulin class referenced as part of AID system insulin regimens.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332853</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="INHALE‑3 Randomized Controlled Trial">
  <data key="d0">INHALE‑3 Randomized Controlled Trial</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">INHALE‑3 is a randomized controlled trial that evaluated the initial conversion dosing of TI in adults.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332853</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="INHALE‑1 Randomized Controlled Trial">
  <data key="d0">INHALE‑1 Randomized Controlled Trial</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">INHALE‑1 is a randomized controlled trial that evaluated the initial conversion dosing of TI in children.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332853</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Zisser et al.">
  <data key="d0">Zisser et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Zisser et al. performed an early study assessing the clinical efficacy of adding a fixed pre‑prandial TI dose to a fully automated closed‑loop artificial pancreas system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332854</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Closed‑Loop Artificial Pancreas System">
  <data key="d0">Closed‑Loop Artificial Pancreas System</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A fully automated closed‑loop artificial pancreas system is an AID technology evaluated in combination with TI for postprandial glucose control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332854</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hyperinsulinemic–Euglycemic Glucose Clamp Study">
  <data key="d0">Hyperinsulinemic–Euglycemic Glucose Clamp Study</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A glucose clamp study measured the median time to maximum plasma concentration of TI versus insulin lispro.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332854</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Postprandial Glucose (PPG)">
  <data key="d0">Postprandial Glucose (PPG)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">PPG refers to glucose levels after meals, which TI aims to control rapidly while minimizing hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332854</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Meal Carbohydrate Intake">
  <data key="d0">Meal Carbohydrate Intake</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Meal carbohydrate intake is identified as the key factor influencing daytime glucose control in AID system performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332854</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="US Prescribing Information (USPI)">
  <data key="d0">US Prescribing Information (USPI)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The USPI updated in January 2026 provides the conversion dosing algorithm for TI based on RAA dose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332854</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Subcutaneous insulin">
  <data key="d0">Subcutaneous insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Subcutaneous insulin is a delivery method for insulin referenced as having delayed glucose‑lowering action.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332854</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Postprandial hyperglycemia">
  <data key="d0">Postprandial hyperglycemia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Postprandial hyperglycemia is elevated blood glucose after meals that subcutaneous insulin often fails to manage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332854</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Overnight glycemic management">
  <data key="d0">Overnight glycemic management</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Overnight glycemic management refers to blood‑glucose control during the night, an area where AID systems excel.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332855</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Daytime glucose control">
  <data key="d0">Daytime glucose control</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Daytime glucose control denotes blood‑glucose regulation during daylight hours, identified as more challenging for AID systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332855</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin infusion site malfunction">
  <data key="d0">Insulin infusion site malfunction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin infusion site malfunction is a condition that can delay timely correction of hyperglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332855</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Registration trials">
  <data key="d0">Registration trials</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Registration trials are formal clinical studies referenced as part of Akturk et al.’s evaluation of AID systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332855</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Real‑life data">
  <data key="d0">Real‑life data</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Real‑life data are observational datasets used by Akturk et al. to assess AID system performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332855</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin‑based treatments">
  <data key="d0">Insulin‑based treatments</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin‑based treatments are conventional insulin therapies used as comparators to AID systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332855</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Afrezza cartridge">
  <data key="d0">Afrezza cartridge</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Afrezza cartridge is the disposable component of the Afrezza inhaled insulin delivery system that holds the powdered insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
