  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pre‑prandial TI dose">
  <data key="d0">Pre‑prandial TI dose</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A pre‑prandial TI dose is a fixed amount of Technosphere Insulin administered before a meal to improve postprandial glucose control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4daf1d7e9da44e316a5b4dd21bc2dee</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/cengiz-beck-2026-use-of-inhaled-insulin-with-automated-insulin-delivery-systems.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786332856</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
