  <data key="d0">Closed‑loop Insulin Therapy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Closed‑loop insulin therapy is a method that automatically adjusts insulin delivery, investigated for type 2 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d30bfc1840eec64224c3568470e6c539</data>
