  <data key="d0">Diabetes Medicine</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes Medicine is the journal that published the study showing reduced hypoglycaemia with inhaled technosphere insulin versus insulin aspart in 2020.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical journal that publishes clinical diabetes research, cited for the text‑message reminder study.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Medicine is a journal publishing clinical diabetes research, including studies on the STAND programme.</data>
