<node id="Long-Term Adverse Lung Effects">
  <data key="d0">Long-Term Adverse Lung Effects</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Long‑term adverse lung effects are potential risks that Afrezza is reported to lack.</data>
