  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">DIAMOND Study Group performed a randomized clinical trial assessing the effect of continuous glucose monitoring on glycemic control in adults with type 1 diabetes using insulin injections.&lt;SEP&gt;The collaborative research group that conducted the DIAMOND trial comparing continuous glucose monitoring with usual care in type 2 diabetes patients receiving multiple daily insulin injections.&lt;SEP&gt;The DIAMOND Study Group conducted a randomized trial comparing continuous glucose monitoring with usual care in type 2 diabetes patients on multiple daily insulin injections.</data>
