  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Isobornyl Acrylate is a chemical sensitizer that can cause allergic skin reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Isobornyl acrylate is a chemical component of some glucose sensors that can trigger severe allergic contact dermatitis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-91a114d8b89cacee37b56501f349ce85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4b76ae88b212b3a0a4d05c250e05e0c</data>
