  <data key="d2">Eversense is an implanted continuous glucose monitoring system offered as an alternative for patients allergic to isobornyl acrylate.&lt;SEP&gt;Eversense is an implantable long‑term glucose sensor system by Senseonics that includes a cylindrical sensor, a transmitter, and a smartphone application.&lt;SEP&gt;Eversense is a commercial classic SMCG device listed among currently available sensors.</data>
