  <data key="d2">The PANTHER Program (pantherprogram.org) offers a website that helps health care professionals and people with diabetes select appropriate diabetes devices.&lt;SEP&gt;A program providing an online resource to help health care professionals and people with diabetes select appropriate devices.</data>
