</node>
<node id="Infusion Sets">
  <data key="d0">Infusion Sets</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Infusion sets are components of insulin pumps that can become dislodged or occluded, leading to ketosis and diabetic ketoacidosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
