  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetic Ketoacidosis (DKA)">
  <data key="d0">Diabetic Ketoacidosis (DKA)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DKA is a severe complication of diabetes that may arise from infusion set failure in insulin pump therapy and can be reduced by pump use.&lt;SEP&gt;A severe metabolic complication that can present in people with type 2 diabetes, especially among ethnic and racial minorities.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetic Ketoacidosis (DKA) is a severe complication of diabetes characterized by high blood glucose and ketone production.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7b840a0b5327c5e583eb70dd354d1d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba38023866c2db7437e618a60033f21f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377379</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pump Site Infection">
  <data key="d0">Pump Site Infection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pump site infection is a complication that can occur at the infusion site of an insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335855</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mood Disorders">
  <data key="d0">Mood Disorders</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Mood disorders, including anxiety and depression, are reasons some individuals discontinue insulin pump therapy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335855</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Anxiety">
  <data key="d0">Anxiety</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Anxiety is a mood disorder cited as a factor for pump therapy attrition.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335856</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Depression">
  <data key="d0">Depression</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Depression is a mood disorder mentioned as a cause for discontinuing insulin pump therapy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335857</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Youth">
  <data key="d0">Youth</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Youth are young individuals, often diagnosed with type 1 diabetes, who may benefit from early CGM initiation.&lt;SEP&gt;Youth refers to younger individuals with diabetes for whom insulin pump safety has been established.&lt;SEP&gt;Individuals in the younger age group who may use diabetes management technologies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b355007bba178588f3928b6c8620a78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c93787ffd2c022283fc0663decb1a184</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335857</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Randomized Controlled Trials (RCTs)">
  <data key="d0">Randomized Controlled Trials (RCTs)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Randomized Controlled Trials (RCTs) are clinical studies that have evaluated the efficacy of rtCGM and isCGM on outcomes such as A1C and hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;RCTs are research studies that have compared insulin pumps with MDI, showing modest A1C improvements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fe1eff7b58582dec4c8ae7578e20e66</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335859</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Observational Studies">
  <data key="d0">Observational Studies</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Observational studies provide evidence on glycemic outcomes of insulin pump therapy in real‑world settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335859</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Registry Data">
  <data key="d0">Registry Data</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Registry data are collected datasets that support findings on insulin pump effectiveness.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335860</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Peripheral Neuropathy">
  <data key="d0">Peripheral Neuropathy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Peripheral neuropathy is a nerve complication of diabetes that may be reduced by insulin pump use in young patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Nerve damage commonly occurring in diabetes, leading to sensory deficits.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-664916c2444f157f5d7d9bc41b032d26</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372140</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Quality‑of‑Life Measures">
  <data key="d0">Quality‑of‑Life Measures</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Quality‑of‑life measures assess patient satisfaction and well‑being, shown to improve with insulin pump therapy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335866</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="C‑Peptide Levels">
  <data key="d0">C‑Peptide Levels</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">C‑peptide levels are laboratory measurements of endogenous insulin production mentioned as not predictive of insulin pump therapy success.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335866</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Wearability">
  <data key="d0">Wearability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Wearability refers to how comfortable or convenient an insulin pump is to wear, mentioned as a factor influencing pump therapy attrition.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335869</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pump Therapy Discontinuation">
  <data key="d0">Pump Therapy Discontinuation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pump therapy discontinuation describes the cessation of insulin pump use, with various identified causes such as cost, wearability, and mood disorders.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335870</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Temporary Basal Rates">
  <data key="d0">Temporary Basal Rates</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Temporary basal rates are adjustable insulin delivery settings on pumps, listed as examples of advanced pump settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335870</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Extended/Square/Dual Wave Bolus">
  <data key="d0">Extended/Square/Dual Wave Bolus</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Extended, square, and dual wave bolus are specialized insulin delivery patterns for pumps, noted as advanced pump settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335870</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Treatment Satisfaction">
  <data key="d0">Treatment Satisfaction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Treatment satisfaction is a quality‑of‑life measure that improves with insulin pump therapy compared to multiple daily injections.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b3b81193a603a098b1ff9f6f0f665fec</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335870</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Consumer Guide Diabetes Website">
  <data key="d0">Consumer Guide Diabetes Website</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Consumer Guide Diabetes website (consumerguide.diabetes.org) is an online resource that helps health care professionals and people with diabetes choose devices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b355007bba178588f3928b6c8620a78</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335871</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Device Manufacturers">
  <data key="d0">Device Manufacturers</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Device manufacturers are companies that produce diabetes management devices and can assist users with difficulties.&lt;SEP&gt;Device manufacturers are companies that produce glucose monitoring devices and provide usage recommendations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b355007bba178588f3928b6c8620a78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9bc5d11c9f848439320623cad3d3a38</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335871</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Education And Training">
  <data key="d0">Education And Training</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Education and training encompass the instruction, tutorials, videos, and written material needed for optimal diabetes device use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b355007bba178588f3928b6c8620a78</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335871</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Online Tutorials">
  <data key="d0">Online Tutorials</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Online tutorials are digital resources that provide education and training for diabetes device users.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b355007bba178588f3928b6c8620a78</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335871</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Training Videos">
  <data key="d0">Training Videos</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Training videos are visual resources that support education and training for diabetes device users.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b355007bba178588f3928b6c8620a78</data>
