  <data key="d0">Automated Insulin Delivery System</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Devices that adjust insulin delivery rates based on sensor glucose values to manage diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Automated Insulin Delivery System (AID) is a closed‑loop technology that adjusts insulin delivery based on sensor glucose data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9cd925790899146eeb8a373879b5feac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c93787ffd2c022283fc0663decb1a184</data>
