</node>
<node id="Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A set of computational rules used by bolus calculators to recommend insulin doses.&lt;SEP&gt;Algorithm is the computational method used by AID systems to calculate insulin dosing from glucose sensor data.&lt;SEP&gt;A computational procedure used within DIY closed‑loop systems to automate insulin delivery decisions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9cd925790899146eeb8a373879b5feac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c93787ffd2c022283fc0663decb1a184&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5227749196a4c9226dba64a500d84b3a</data>
