<node id="A1C Levels">
  <data key="d0">A1C Levels</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Measurements of glycosylated hemoglobin used to assess diabetes control, mentioned in coverage criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;A1C Levels are a laboratory measure of average blood glucose over several months, used to assess diabetes control.&lt;SEP&gt;A measure of average blood glucose over time, used as an outcome indicator in diabetes trials.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9cd925790899146eeb8a373879b5feac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c5ae163a494feafedb71ed2205c02f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76eaa3af026fbb91a96f70d3502e809d</data>
