</node>
<node id="People with Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">People with Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">People with diabetes are individuals who manage glucose levels through monitoring, nutrition, activity, and medication.&lt;SEP&gt;Individuals living with diabetes who use technology for self‑management.&lt;SEP&gt;People with Diabetes are individuals living with type 1, type 2, or other forms of diabetes who may consider insulin pump therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Individuals diagnosed with diabetes who may use insulin pumps and continuous glucose monitoring systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9cd925790899146eeb8a373879b5feac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c5ae163a494feafedb71ed2205c02f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9bc5d11c9f848439320623cad3d3a38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fe769b03fc66d4a691f3b7f741b92cb</data>
