</node>
<node id="DKA">
  <data key="d0">DKA</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DKA (Diabetic Ketoacidosis) is a severe complication of diabetes whose risk is mentioned as being reduced by insulin pump therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetic Ketoacidosis (DKA) is a severe complication of diabetes that screening aims to prevent.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetic ketoacidosis (DKA) is a serious complication that seldom occurs spontaneously in type 2 diabetes but may arise with stress or certain drugs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9cd925790899146eeb8a373879b5feac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a430bf53157529ccb22e67171fb28e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a111d4b40ec241cf54126f594a80308</data>
