  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A long‑acting insulin whose delivery method (pen device versus vial/syringe) influences glycemic control and patient preferences.&lt;SEP&gt;Glargine insulin is the long‑acting insulin evaluated in a pen‑versus‑vial delivery study.</data>
