  <data key="d2">Traditional containers and syringes used for insulin administration, serving as a comparator for pen devices.&lt;SEP&gt;Vial/syringe represents the traditional insulin delivery method used as a comparator in many investigations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5ed3ce00d7a52cdffe7b550ffe0dd568&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-651d85a13edd23f654d52f95c75d4e32</data>
