  <data key="d0">Pre‑ and Postprandial Blood Glucose Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Pre‑ and postprandial blood glucose monitoring is a conventional method of checking glucose levels before and after meals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-00f6c2252dc945e977b3a2b2f495ffe0</data>
