</node>
<node id="Professional Continuous Glucose Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">Professional Continuous Glucose Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Professional Continuous Glucose Monitoring is a CGM approach where devices are owned and applied in a clinical setting for a discrete period.&lt;SEP&gt;Professional continuous glucose monitoring refers to devices used by healthcare professionals for intermittent or short‑term CGM assessments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-00f6c2252dc945e977b3a2b2f495ffe0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fe1eff7b58582dec4c8ae7578e20e66</data>
