<node id="Monitoramento Contínuo de Glicose (SMCG)">
  <data key="d0">Monitoramento Contínuo de Glicose (SMCG)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Monitoramento Contínuo de Glicose (SMCG) is a continuous glucose monitoring system that provides real-time glucose data and alerts for hypo/hyperglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-97acd5016384ec4abfe4d43c6a9cad08</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/monitoramento contínuo de glicose.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Holter de Glicose">
  <data key="d0">Holter de Glicose</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Holter de Glicose denotes a type of glucose monitoring device that records glucose levels over time, similar to a cardiac holter.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-97acd5016384ec4abfe4d43c6a9cad08</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/monitoramento contínuo de glicose.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sensor Intersticial de Glicose">
  <data key="d0">Sensor Intersticial de Glicose</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensor Intersticial de Glicose is a subcutaneously inserted sensor that measures interstitial glucose levels via an enzymatic reaction.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-97acd5016384ec4abfe4d43c6a9cad08</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/monitoramento contínuo de glicose.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Transmissor">
  <data key="d0">Transmissor</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Transmissor is the device that receives glucose data from the sensor and forwards it to external displays.&lt;SEP&gt;Device connected to the glucose sensor that transmits data wirelessly or via cable.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-97acd5016384ec4abfe4d43c6a9cad08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e26d518805695de3e4f9d41ae1d3e1</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/monitoramento contínuo de glicose.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/glicemias capilares.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338534</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SMCG Medtronic MiniMed">
  <data key="d0">SMCG Medtronic MiniMed</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">SMCG Medtronic MiniMed is an early continuous glucose monitoring device whose data were transferred to a computer for analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-97acd5016384ec4abfe4d43c6a9cad08</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/monitoramento contínuo de glicose.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Enzima Glicose Oxidase">
  <data key="d0">Enzima Glicose Oxidase</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Enzima Glicose Oxidase is an enzyme that catalyzes the conversion of glucose into an electrical signal in glucose sensors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-97acd5016384ec4abfe4d43c6a9cad08</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/monitoramento contínuo de glicose.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="False Low Glucose Reading">
  <data key="d0">False Low Glucose Reading</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A false low glucose reading is an incorrectly low glucose value produced under high oxygen tension with glucose oxidase monitors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-00f6c2252dc945e977b3a2b2f495ffe0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="False High Glucose Reading">
  <data key="d0">False High Glucose Reading</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A false high glucose reading is an incorrectly high glucose value produced under low oxygen tension with glucose oxidase monitors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-00f6c2252dc945e977b3a2b2f495ffe0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Interfering Substances">
  <data key="d0">Interfering Substances</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Interfering Substances are medications, foods, or environmental factors that can affect the accuracy of CGM readings.&lt;SEP&gt;Interfering substances are physiologic or pharmacologic agents that affect the accuracy of glucose meter readings.&lt;SEP&gt;Interfering substances are medications or compounds that cause sensor glucose readings to differ from actual glucose levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-00f6c2252dc945e977b3a2b2f495ffe0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05cc642337c2a615c9b40de9336aec18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fe1eff7b58582dec4c8ae7578e20e66</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Peritoneal Dialysis">
  <data key="d0">Peritoneal Dialysis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Peritoneal dialysis is a renal replacement therapy that utilizes icodextrin, which can interfere with glucose dehydrogenase monitors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-00f6c2252dc945e977b3a2b2f495ffe0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glicemia Intersticial">
  <data key="d0">Glicemia Intersticial</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glicemia Intersticial refers to glucose levels in the interstitial fluid measured by continuous glucose monitoring sensors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-97acd5016384ec4abfe4d43c6a9cad08</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/monitoramento contínuo de glicose.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786335925</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
