  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Guardian Real-Time is a continuous glucose monitoring device from Medtronic that connects a sensor to a Minilink transmitter, sending interstitial glucose values every five minutes to a real‑time monitor with trend arrows.</data>
