  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Endocrine Society is one of the joint authors of the guidance titled “Five things physicians and patients should question.”&lt;SEP&gt;The Endocrine Society issues clinical practice guidelines on endocrine therapies, including insulin infusion and glucose monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;The Endocrine Society issued a clinical practice guideline for treating diabetes in older adults.&lt;SEP&gt;The Endocrine Society contributed to a consensus report on outcome measures beyond HbA1c.&lt;SEP&gt;The Endocrine Society is a professional organization that co‑authored a 2013 workgroup report on hypoglycaemia and diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Endocrine Society co‑authored a scientific statement on staging presymptomatic type 1 diabetes.\</data>
