  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Blood glucose monitors are devices used to measure glucose levels, recommended for additional use when sensor values are unreliable.&lt;SEP&gt;BGM is a tool used to assess therapy and detect incipient hypoglycemia in diabetes management.</data>
