  <data key="d0">Intermittently Scanned Continuous Glucose Monitoring (isCGM)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intermittently Scanned Continuous Glucose Monitoring (isCGM) is a CGM method that requires the user to scan the sensor to visualize glucose values.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0fe1eff7b58582dec4c8ae7578e20e66</data>
