<node id="ADVANCE Collaborative Group">
  <data key="d0">ADVANCE Collaborative Group</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">ADVANCE Collaborative Group is a research consortium that conducted an intensive blood glucose control study assessing vascular outcomes in type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;ADVANCE Collaborative Group is the group that conducted the ADVANCE Trial on diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;International research consortium that performed the ADVANCE trial on intensive blood‑glucose control.&lt;SEP&gt;The ADVANCE Collaborative Group studied severe hypoglycaemia and its association with vascular events and mortality.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f4c458a11c8c36c5c212c3aa69b026c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6db2125b1b94840ea29100039a6fef20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e668c40e3bc21d982ed03a052f0f9339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acba683ee0809d1c3f6e35c228f485ac</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/ref.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372134</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ACCORD Trial">
  <data key="d0">ACCORD Trial</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">ACCORD trial is a clinical study investigating intensive glycemic control and cardiovascular event prevention.&lt;SEP&gt;ACCORD trial is a clinical study halted early because intensive glycemic control was associated with higher mortality (1.41% vs 1.14% per year).&lt;SEP&gt;The ACCORD trial was a clinical study that examined cognitive impairment and its association with level 3 hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;The ACCORD trial is a large randomized study of cardiovascular outcomes in type 2 diabetes that also examined cognitive function and severe hypoglycaemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f4c458a11c8c36c5c212c3aa69b026c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acba683ee0809d1c3f6e35c228f485ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38ab5af7e42588297df4330ffb2c046b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/ref.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372086</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="VA Diabetes Trials">
  <data key="d0">VA Diabetes Trials</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">VA Diabetes Trials are clinical studies examining intensive glycemic control in diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f4c458a11c8c36c5c212c3aa69b026c5</data>
