  <data key="d0">Action to Control Cardiovascular Risk in Diabetes Study Group</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Action to Control Cardiovascular Risk in Diabetes Study Group is a research group referenced in a table of glycemic targets.&lt;SEP&gt;The study group authored multiple papers on intensive glucose lowering in type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Research group that performed the ACCORD, ADVANCE, and VA diabetes trials.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f4c458a11c8c36c5c212c3aa69b026c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6db2125b1b94840ea29100039a6fef20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e668c40e3bc21d982ed03a052f0f9339</data>
