<node id="Intensive Glucose Control">
  <data key="d0">Intensive Glucose Control</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Intensive Glucose Control is a concept describing aggressive management of blood glucose levels to reduce complications.&lt;SEP&gt;Intensive glucose control is a treatment strategy aiming for lower HbA1c levels (e.g., &lt;6.5 %) evaluated in several clinical trials.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f4c458a11c8c36c5c212c3aa69b026c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f9624abde6cf128707fcc0466a4c9a7</data>
