<node id="Dextrostix">
  <data key="d0">Dextrostix</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The first commercial disposable strip for capillary glucose measurement, introduced in 1965 and now obsolete.&lt;SEP&gt;Dextrostix is the first capillary glucose test introduced in 1964, using oxidase/peroxidase reagents on a semipermeable membrane.&lt;SEP&gt;Dextrostix was the first capillary glucose test, which overestimated glycemic values compared to basal glucose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e5570f88766511a4a62cbe9a2dff0bdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d8f17f3f250a37a1effaaa88cc8b382&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f716359c14483f9be36a73861d75008</data>
