<node id="Hematócrito">
  <data key="d0">Hematócrito</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The proportion of red blood cells in blood; values above 45 % or below 35 % can alter glucose test accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Hematócrito is a laboratory value that can be elevated above 45% or low below 35% as indicated in the guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b2ef71fb1a347df36dbb8ea8f4856bcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fe1b07f3c84733fcbfca023fbfd70e6</data>
