  <data key="d0">Manual do Fabricante</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The manufacturer's manual that provides instructions for reading and operating the glucometer.&lt;SEP&gt;Manual do fabricante is the instruction booklet that provides usage guidelines, symbol meanings, and error‑message explanations for the glucose meter.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b2ef71fb1a347df36dbb8ea8f4856bcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fe1b07f3c84733fcbfca023fbfd70e6</data>
