  <data key="d0">Frasco de Amaciante</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Frasco de amaciante is an example of a household bottle that is not recommended for disposing of sharps due to fragility.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b2ef71fb1a347df36dbb8ea8f4856bcb</data>
