<node id="Dados de Glicemia">
  <data key="d0">Dados de Glicemia</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Dados de glicemia are the recorded blood glucose values, timestamps, insulin doses, meals, and exercise information captured by patients.</data>
