  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Classification and Diagnosis of Diabetes is a reference document cited from the American Diabetes Association outlining diabetes standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Classification and Diagnosis of Diabetes is a section in Diabetes Care Volume 46, Supplement 1, January 2023 providing guidelines for diabetes classification.</data>
