<node id="A1C Assay">
  <data key="d0">A1C Assay</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A1C assay is a laboratory method that can be translated into estimated average glucose values.&lt;SEP&gt;A1C assay is a laboratory test whose results can be converted into estimated average glucose values.&lt;SEP&gt;A laboratory test measuring glycated hemoglobin, whose results can be influenced by hemoglobin variants and other conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;A1C assay is a laboratory test discussed in the International Expert Committee report for diagnosing diabetes.\</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-679002669c87907578534904694e17dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2cd796639bdb0e10eeda7ef3d9ebbce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d01033177672e6c36e0a368db88e586d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a15ed0aa8749d4f76e8d725e8752873</data>
