<node id="Regra Dos 15">
  <data key="d0">Regra Dos 15</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Regra Dos 15 is a treatment rule for hypoglycemia involving ingestion of 15 g fast‑acting carbohydrate, waiting 15 minutes, and rechecking glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;Regra dos 15 is a rule that considers classification, signs, and symptoms for managing hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee7ecd9171c82c15f635a8a9b605621c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f645bd7019e94151caaff47d6cbfcaf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338244</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hipoglicemia Nível 1">
  <data key="d0">Hipoglicemia Nível 1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hipoglicemia nível 1 is clinically important regardless of symptoms and marks the point to initiate corrective action to prevent more severe hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Hipoglicemia nível 1 denotes mild hypoglycemia treated with 15 g of rapid‑acting carbohydrates to raise glucose by 30–40 mg/dL within 15 minutes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee7ecd9171c82c15f635a8a9b605621c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e484a5a1df875be2e1525c8c64e2007</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338244</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hipoglicemia Nível 2">
  <data key="d0">Hipoglicemia Nível 2</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hipoglicemia nível 2 is defined by blood glucose concentration below 54 mg/dL, triggering neuroglycopenic symptoms and requiring immediate intervention.&lt;SEP&gt;Hipoglicemia nível 2 denotes moderate hypoglycemia treated with 30 g of rapid‑acting carbohydrates following the same time interval.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee7ecd9171c82c15f635a8a9b605621c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e484a5a1df875be2e1525c8c64e2007</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338245</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hipoglicemia Nível 3">
  <data key="d0">Hipoglicemia Nível 3</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hipoglicemia Nível 3 is severe hypoglycemia (level 3) episodes, many of which occur during sleep.&lt;SEP&gt;Hipoglicemia nível 3 is a severe event characterized by altered mental or physical functioning that necessitates assistance from another person for recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Hipoglicemia nível 3 denotes severe hypoglycemia requiring rapid carbohydrate intake, positioning, possible glucagon administration, and emergency services.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee7ecd9171c82c15f635a8a9b605621c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e484a5a1df875be2e1525c8c64e2007&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f645bd7019e94151caaff47d6cbfcaf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338245</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Teste De Glicose Capilar">
  <data key="d0">Teste De Glicose Capilar</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Teste De Glicose Capilar is a capillary glucose test used to confirm hypoglycemia when symptoms are present.&lt;SEP&gt;Teste de glicose capilar is a finger‑stick glucose test used to confirm hypoglycemia and monitor treatment response.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee7ecd9171c82c15f635a8a9b605621c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f645bd7019e94151caaff47d6cbfcaf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338245</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Serviço De Emergência">
  <data key="d0">Serviço De Emergência</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Serviço de emergência is the emergency medical service to which patients are referred in severe hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee7ecd9171c82c15f635a8a9b605621c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338245</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Carboidratos De Rápida Absorção">
  <data key="d0">Carboidratos De Rápida Absorção</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Carboidratos De Rápida Absorção are fast‑absorbing carbohydrate sources such as gummy candies, sugar, honey, and instant glucose used to treat hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Carboidratos de rápida absorção are fast‑acting carbohydrate sources used to quickly increase blood glucose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee7ecd9171c82c15f635a8a9b605621c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f645bd7019e94151caaff47d6cbfcaf</data>
