</node>
<node id="Minimising Hypoglycemia In The Real Word: The Challenge Of Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Minimising Hypoglycemia In The Real Word: The Challenge Of Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This article examines strategies to reduce hypoglycemia risk in real‑world insulin therapy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ee7ecd9171c82c15f635a8a9b605621c</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338250</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Oxitetraciclina">
  <data key="d0">Oxitetraciclina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An antibiotic that, when used with insulin, increases insulin’s hypoglycemic action.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338250</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sais De Potássio">
  <data key="d0">Sais De Potássio</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Potassium salts that, when used with insulin, increase insulin’s hypoglycemic action.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338250</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Prolonged Fasting">
  <data key="d0">Prolonged Fasting</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Extended periods without food, such as before exams or surgery, that can lead to hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338251</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Restrictive Carbohydrate Diet">
  <data key="d0">Restrictive Carbohydrate Diet</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A diet low in carbohydrates or intermittent fasting that can contribute to hypoglycemic episodes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338251</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="High Intensity Physical Exercise">
  <data key="d0">High Intensity Physical Exercise</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Vigorous exercise performed without considering current glycemia or food intake, increasing hypoglycemia risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338251</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Exhaustive Physical Activity">
  <data key="d0">Exhaustive Physical Activity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Intense physical activity that can cause hypoglycemia if glucose levels are not monitored.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338251</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Excess Insulin">
  <data key="d0">Excess Insulin</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Over‑dosage of insulin, either by error or technique, that directly causes hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338252</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Medication Interaction">
  <data key="d0">Medication Interaction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Interactions between insulin and other drugs that enhance insulin’s hypoglycemic effect.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338252</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hypoglycemia Level 1">
  <data key="d0">Hypoglycemia Level 1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The first classification of hypoglycemia defined by glucose values between 70 mg/dL and 54 mg/dL.&lt;SEP&gt;Hypoglycemia Level 1 is defined as glucose &lt; 70 mg/dL and is recommended to be less than 4% of monitoring time.&lt;SEP&gt;Hypoglycemia episode with glucose below 70 mg/dL as defined in the guideline.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d83801272f7a0ae0d797d60572fe578&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5c8fa42a8437c5708b04fb4ad1272cf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370023</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Celiac Disease">
  <data key="d0">Celiac Disease</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An autoimmune disorder listed as a comorbidity that can influence glycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoimmune intestinal disorder associated with Type 1 Diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2752a78fbaafd94ca566ff099a4ba551</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377343</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Addison Disease">
  <data key="d0">Addison Disease</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A chronic adrenal insufficiency listed as a comorbidity that can influence glycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoimmune adrenal insufficiency associated with Type 1 Diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2752a78fbaafd94ca566ff099a4ba551</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377343</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hypothyroidism">
  <data key="d0">Hypothyroidism</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A thyroid disorder listed as a comorbidity that can influence glycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338252</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intramuscular Insulin Administration">
  <data key="d0">Intramuscular Insulin Administration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Injection of insulin into muscle tissue, a factor that can affect glucose absorption.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338254</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Prolonged Sleep">
  <data key="d0">Prolonged Sleep</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Extended sleep periods that can predispose to hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338254</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Premenstrual Period">
  <data key="d0">Premenstrual Period</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A hormonal phase that can influence glucose metabolism and hypoglycemia risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338254</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Low/Moderate Intensity Physical Exercise">
  <data key="d0">Low/Moderate Intensity Physical Exercise</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Physical exercise of low or moderate intensity performed without considering current glycemia or food intake, increasing hypoglycemia risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338255</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Low Frequency of Glucose Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">Low Frequency of Glucose Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Infrequent measurement of blood glucose levels, identified as a behavioral factor influencing hypoglycemia risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338255</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Emotional Problems">
  <data key="d0">Emotional Problems</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Emotional issues identified as a behavioral factor affecting glucose management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338255</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sweating Related to Climate">
  <data key="d0">Sweating Related to Climate</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Sweating caused by hot ambient temperature, which can mask or delay detection of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338255</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Partial Meal Acceptance">
  <data key="d0">Partial Meal Acceptance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Partial consumption of a meal, identified as a factor contributing to hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338256</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Behavioral Factors">
  <data key="d0">Behavioral Factors</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">General behavioral influences such as beliefs, personal choices, and low glucose monitoring frequency affecting hypoglycemia risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338256</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Excessive Weight Loss">
  <data key="d0">Excessive Weight Loss</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Significant loss of body weight without adjusting medication doses, noted as a condition influencing glycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd2bfbe7cac15c6f6dc444a35691ae83</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338256</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Monitorização Contínua de Glicose (CGM)">
  <data key="d0">Monitorização Contínua de Glicose (CGM)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Monitorização Contínua de Glicose (CGM) is a device that continuously records glucose levels to determine time spent in target, hyperglycemia, and hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0e484a5a1df875be2e1525c8c64e2007</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338256</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lactantes com Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Lactantes com Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Lactantes com diabetes are breastfeeding persons with diabetes who have a higher risk of hypoglycemia and require intensified glucose monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0e484a5a1df875be2e1525c8c64e2007</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338257</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Memória">
  <data key="d0">Memória</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Memória refers to the cognitive process of consolidating information, which may be impacted by nighttime hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0e484a5a1df875be2e1525c8c64e2007</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338258</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sinais de Alerta Precoce">
  <data key="d0">Sinais de Alerta Precoce</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Sinais de alerta precoce are early warning signs of hypoglycemia that should be recognized promptly.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0e484a5a1df875be2e1525c8c64e2007</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338258</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Treinamento">
  <data key="d0">Treinamento</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Treinamento is the educational process directed at children, parents, teachers, and support networks to identify and treat early hypoglycemia signs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0e484a5a1df875be2e1525c8c64e2007</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Orientacoes_Hipoglicemia_SBD_transcricao.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786338258</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pais">
