  <data key="d0">Sensor Lifespan</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensor lifespan is the duration a glucose sensor remains functional, influenced by the stability of its enzyme component.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7ac99b8588a8c480f44a5519509f7713</data>
