  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Leitura">
  <data key="d0">Leitura</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A glucose measurement reading obtained from the test strip, which can be higher than 500 mg/dL.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1136d6aac4c2e881387a4db1a0f4a3a3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786368431</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="500 Mg/Dl">
  <data key="d0">500 Mg/Dl</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A specific glucose concentration value used as a threshold in the instructions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1136d6aac4c2e881387a4db1a0f4a3a3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786368432</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glicose Sanguínea">
  <data key="d0">Glicose Sanguínea</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The concentration of glucose in the blood, which is measured to assess hypoglycemia or hyperglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1136d6aac4c2e881387a4db1a0f4a3a3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786368433</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Limites De Medição">
  <data key="d0">Limites De Medição</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The measurement boundaries of the glucose meter beyond which it displays LO or HI.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1136d6aac4c2e881387a4db1a0f4a3a3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786368433</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Metas no Tratamento do Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Metas no Tratamento do Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Metas no tratamento do diabetes are treatment goals aimed at controlling blood glucose to avoid organ damage and other complications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-12999315830b302d973dd1908eab1e12</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786368434</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tempo no Alvo (TIR – Time in Range)">
  <data key="d0">Tempo no Alvo (TIR – Time in Range)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Tempo no alvo (TIR) indicates the percentage of time glucose stays within the ideal 70‑180 mg/dL range; the ideal is at least 70% of the time.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-12999315830b302d973dd1908eab1e12</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786368436</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Crianças e Adolescentes com Diabetes Tipo 1">
  <data key="d0">Crianças e Adolescentes com Diabetes Tipo 1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Crianças e adolescentes com diabetes tipo 1 are a patient group with specific HbA1c and glucose targets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-12999315830b302d973dd1908eab1e12</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786368436</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Adultos com Diabetes Tipo 1 ou 2">
  <data key="d0">Adultos com Diabetes Tipo 1 ou 2</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Adultos com diabetes tipo 1 ou 2 are a patient group with standard HbA1c and glucose targets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-12999315830b302d973dd1908eab1e12</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786368437</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glicemia Pós-Refeição">
  <data key="d0">Glicemia Pós-Refeição</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glicemia pós-refeição is the post‑meal blood glucose level, with target limits set in treatment goals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-12999315830b302d973dd1908eab1e12</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786368439</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tempo com Glicose &lt; 70 mg/dL">
  <data key="d0">Tempo com Glicose &lt; 70 mg/dL</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Tempo com glicose &lt; 70 mg/dL is the percentage of time glucose levels are below 70 mg/dL, indicating risk of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-12999315830b302d973dd1908eab1e12</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786368439</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tempo com Glicose &lt; 54 mg/dL">
  <data key="d0">Tempo com Glicose &lt; 54 mg/dL</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Tempo com glicose &lt; 54 mg/dL is the percentage of time glucose levels are below 54 mg/dL, indicating risk of severe hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-12999315830b302d973dd1908eab1e12</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786368440</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Flexibilidade da Meta HbA1c">
  <data key="d0">Flexibilidade da Meta HbA1c</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Flexibilidade da meta HbA1c refers to the adjustment of HbA1c targets in certain clinical situations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-12999315830b302d973dd1908eab1e12</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1786368441</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="HbA1c 7% ≈ Glicemia Média 154 mg/dL">
  <data key="d0">HbA1c 7% ≈ Glicemia Média 154 mg/dL</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">This data point shows that an HbA1c value of 7% corresponds approximately to an average glucose level of 154 mg/dL.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-12999315830b302d973dd1908eab1e12</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Documento sem título.docx</data>
