  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="T Hipog">
  <data key="d0">T Hipog</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">T Hipog denotes “Tempo em hipoglicemia,” the percentage of time a patient spends in hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370017</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="TIR">
  <data key="d0">TIR</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">TIR (Time in Range) represents the proportion of glucose readings that fall within a predefined target range.&lt;SEP&gt;TIR (Time in Range) is an abbreviation for the percentage of time glucose values stay within target ranges.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b275f50028ef32e322bf8643e0342810</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372156</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Idoso">
  <data key="d0">Idoso</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Idoso refers to elderly patients for whom specific glycemic goals are defined.&lt;SEP&gt;Idoso refers to the elderly population whose clinical status is categorized in Tabela 2.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d35e6caf612b4c4984ade9315ebc7431</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370017</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Saudável">
  <data key="d0">Saudável</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Saudável is a category in Tabela 2 indicating a healthy elderly individual with few chronic comorbidities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370017</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Comprometido">
  <data key="d0">Comprometido</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Comprometido is a category in Tabela 2 indicating an elderly individual with mild to moderate functional or cognitive compromise.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370017</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
