  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insuficiência renal crônica classe III ou pior">
  <data key="d0">Insuficiência renal crônica classe III ou pior</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insuficiência renal crônica classe III ou pior is listed as a chronic comorbidity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370020</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Metas baseadas em CGM para DM1, DM2 e Idosos">
  <data key="d0">Metas baseadas em CGM para DM1, DM2 e Idosos</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Metas baseadas em CGM para DM1, DM2 e Idosos are glucose‑control targets derived from continuous glucose monitoring for type 1 diabetes, type 2 diabetes, and elderly patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370020</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="R1 recommendation">
  <data key="d0">R1 recommendation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">R1 recommendation advises a HbA1c target below 7% for all individuals with diabetes to prevent microvascular complications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370020</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="UKPDS">
  <data key="d0">UKPDS</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">UKPDS (United Kingdom Prospective Diabetes Study) was a clinical study demonstrating similar HbA1c benefits in type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;UKPDS (United Kingdom Prospective Diabetes Study) is a long‑term trial of type 2 diabetes patients referenced in a 10‑year subanalysis of treatment effects.&lt;SEP&gt;The United Kingdom Prospective Diabetes Study (UKPDS) examined intensive glycemic control in newly diagnosed type 2 diabetes and observed a 16% reduction in cardiovascular events, though the result was not statistically significant.&lt;SEP&gt;UKPDS is a landmark study that demonstrated metabolic memory in diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f9624abde6cf128707fcc0466a4c9a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f99d05e1089d59496d56d86ff40197cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aff91698679a52cd7b07563b7b2627a3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372143</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Complicações microvasculares">
  <data key="d0">Complicações microvasculares</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Complicações microvasculares refer to retinal, renal and neuropathic complications of diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370021</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Preterax and Diamicron">
  <data key="d0">Preterax and Diamicron</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Preterax and Diamicron are modified‑release medications mentioned in the context of diabetes treatment evaluation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="R1 Recommendation">
  <data key="d0">R1 Recommendation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">R1 Recommendation advises a HbA1c target below 7% for all individuals with diabetes to prevent microvascular complications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ADVANCE">
  <data key="d0">ADVANCE</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Large clinical trial that reported higher prevalence of severe hypoglycemia with intensive glycemic control.&lt;SEP&gt;ADVANCE (Action in Diabetes and Vascular Disease: Preterax and Diamicron modified release controlled evaluation) is a randomized clinical trial of 11,140 type 2 diabetes patients comparing intensive versus conventional glucose control.&lt;SEP&gt;ADVANCE is a clinical trial (Action in Diabetes and Vascular) that evaluated diabetes and vascular outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;The ADVANCE trial was a clinical study of intensive glycemic control in type 2 diabetes that reported no significant reduction in cardiovascular disease outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f9624abde6cf128707fcc0466a4c9a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0cc9dbb0b2eb4685ac17cfe445b7ce7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f99d05e1089d59496d56d86ff40197cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372142</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Action in Diabetes and Vascular">
  <data key="d0">Action in Diabetes and Vascular</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Action in Diabetes and Vascular is the full name of the ADVANCE study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Grupo Convencional">
  <data key="d0">Grupo Convencional</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Grupo Convencional refers to the conventional treatment arm that received diet alone.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Comorbidades crônicas">
  <data key="d0">Comorbidades crônicas</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Comorbidades crônicas is the set of chronic diseases considered in the elderly classification.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="HbA1c Normal Range">
  <data key="d0">HbA1c Normal Range</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">HbA1c Normal Range specifies that normal HbA1c values are below 5.7% for non‑pregnant adults.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glicemia de Jejum Normal Range">
  <data key="d0">Glicemia de Jejum Normal Range</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glicemia de Jejum Normal Range indicates fasting glucose values between 70 and 99 mg/dL for non‑pregnant adults.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9dee0a79e4583f41e757f9a20f56f397</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Type 1 Diabetes (DM1)">
  <data key="d0">Type 1 Diabetes (DM1)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Type 1 Diabetes (DM1) is a form of diabetes discussed throughout the recommendations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6d83801272f7a0ae0d797d60572fe578</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370023</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hypoglycemia Level 2">
  <data key="d0">Hypoglycemia Level 2</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hypoglycemia Level 2 is defined as glucose &lt; 54 mg/dL and is recommended to be less than 1% of monitoring time.&lt;SEP&gt;Severe hypoglycemia episode with glucose below 54 mg/dL as defined in the guideline.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6d83801272f7a0ae0d797d60572fe578&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5c8fa42a8437c5708b04fb4ad1272cf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370023</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Coefficient of Variation (CV)">
  <data key="d0">Coefficient of Variation (CV)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Coefficient of Variation (CV) is a metric of glucose variability calculated as standard deviation divided by mean, recommended to be below 36%.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6d83801272f7a0ae0d797d60572fe578</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370023</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="International Consensus on Continuous Glucose Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">International Consensus on Continuous Glucose Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The International Consensus on Continuous Glucose Monitoring established the 36% CV cutoff for hypoglycemia risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6d83801272f7a0ae0d797d60572fe578</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370023</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Monnier">
  <data key="d0">Monnier</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Monnier is the lead author of the study that linked high CV (&gt;36%) with increased hypoglycemia episodes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6d83801272f7a0ae0d797d60572fe578</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370025</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Metanalysis">
  <data key="d0">Metanalysis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The metanalysis combined 18 studies linking HbA1c with CGM and capillary glucose results in 1,137 and 1,440 individuals respectively.&lt;SEP&gt;Metanalysis is a statistical method used by Shields et al. to evaluate diagnostic accuracy of clinical predictors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6d83801272f7a0ae0d797d60572fe578&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372993</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ACCORD">
  <data key="d0">ACCORD</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Large clinical trial that reported increased mortality with intensive glycemic control.&lt;SEP&gt;ACCORD (Action to Control Cardiovascular Risk in Diabetes) is a randomized clinical trial of 10,251 type 2 diabetes patients evaluating intensive versus conventional glucose control.&lt;SEP&gt;The ACCORD trial was a clinical study of intensive glycemic control in long‑standing type 2 diabetes that reported concerning mortality findings and no significant reduction in cardiovascular disease outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4f9624abde6cf128707fcc0466a4c9a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0cc9dbb0b2eb4685ac17cfe445b7ce7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f99d05e1089d59496d56d86ff40197cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74ef8c063d84e34c44021aa138b9b903</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372142</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="VADT">
  <data key="d0">VADT</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Large clinical trial referenced regarding hypoglycemia prevalence.&lt;SEP&gt;VADT (Veterans Affair Diabetes Trial) is a randomized clinical trial of 1,791 type 2 diabetes patients assessing intensive versus conventional glucose control.&lt;SEP&gt;VADT is a diabetes clinical trial reported in a 2009 New England Journal of Medicine article.&lt;SEP&gt;The VADT trial was a clinical study of intensive glycemic control in type 2 diabetes that reported no significant reduction in cardiovascular disease outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4f9624abde6cf128707fcc0466a4c9a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0cc9dbb0b2eb4685ac17cfe445b7ce7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6db2125b1b94840ea29100039a6fef20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f99d05e1089d59496d56d86ff40197cc</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372142</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DCCT/EDIC">
  <data key="d0">DCCT/EDIC</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">DCCT/EDIC (Diabetes Control and Complications Trial / Epidemiology of Diabetes Interventions and Complications) is a study of intensive glucose control in type 1 diabetes showing reductions in cardiovascular events.&lt;SEP&gt;DCCT/EDIC is a long‑term study that demonstrated metabolic memory in diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;The DCCT/EDIC study involved adolescents and younger adults with type 1 diabetes and evaluated the link between level 3 hypoglycemia and cognitive decline.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4f9624abde6cf128707fcc0466a4c9a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aff91698679a52cd7b07563b7b2627a3</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372087</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Microvascular Events">
  <data key="d0">Microvascular Events</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Microvascular events are diabetes complications such as nephropathy and retinopathy defined in the text.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4f9624abde6cf128707fcc0466a4c9a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370027</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cardiovascular Disease (DCV)">
  <data key="d0">Cardiovascular Disease (DCV)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cardiovascular disease (DCV) is a major outcome measured in the ADVANCE, ACCORD and VADT trials.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4f9624abde6cf128707fcc0466a4c9a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370027</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Myocardial Infarction (Non‑fatal)">
  <data key="d0">Myocardial Infarction (Non‑fatal)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Non‑fatal myocardial infarction (IAM) is a cardiovascular endpoint discussed in relation to intensive glucose control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4f9624abde6cf128707fcc0466a4c9a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786370027</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stroke (AVC)">
  <data key="d0">Stroke (AVC)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Stroke (AVC) is a cerebrovascular event mentioned as a cardiovascular outcome in the studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4f9624abde6cf128707fcc0466a4c9a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
