  <data key="d0">HbA1c Target &lt; 7.5 %</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">HbA1c target of less than 7.5 % is suggested for children and adolescents with type 1 diabetes when asymptomatic hypoglycemia occurs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4f9624abde6cf128707fcc0466a4c9a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
