  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The “Metas no tratamento do diabetes” guideline summarizes evidence‑based HbA1c targets for diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Metas no tratamento do diabetes is the official guideline document released by the Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes in 2023.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4f9624abde6cf128707fcc0466a4c9a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29ea6999715cd3886bd7d4abc2a653b0</data>
