<node id="National Glycohemoglobin Standardization Program">
  <data key="d0">National Glycohemoglobin Standardization Program</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">NGSP certifies laboratory methods for HbA1c and defines the normal HbA1c range (&lt; 5.7%).&lt;SEP&gt;NGSP is a program that certifies the standardization of HbA1c measurement methods.&lt;SEP&gt;National Glycohemoglobin Standardization Program is an organization that provides standardization for A1C testing.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Glycohemoglobin Standardization Program certifies and standardizes hemoglobin A1c assays in the United States.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d35e6caf612b4c4984ade9315ebc7431&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2faebf8275a86cd8d9995c769b0926a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9fe6f17fdb504b9177e8ebc48505716&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44888abd4ca8a1953f751ed6c41922e6</data>
