  <data key="d0">Hemácia</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Hemácia (red blood cell) has a lifespan of 3–4 months and is the carrier of hemoglobin that undergoes glycation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d35e6caf612b4c4984ade9315ebc7431</data>
