</node>
<node id="Anemias">
  <data key="d0">Anemias</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Anemias are conditions that can alter red blood cell turnover and cause discrepancies between HbA1c and average glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;Anemias are blood disorders that can lead to inaccurate HbA1c readings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d35e6caf612b4c4984ade9315ebc7431&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ad6eb7138be249f01b479174a34076</data>
