<node id="High and Low Hemoglobin Glycation Phenotypes in Type 1 Diabetes: A Challenge for Interpretation of Glycemic Control">
  <data key="d0">High and Low Hemoglobin Glycation Phenotypes in Type 1 Diabetes: A Challenge for Interpretation of Glycemic Control</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A 2002 article in Journal of Diabetes Complications discussing differing hemoglobin glycation phenotypes and their impact on interpreting glycemic control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29ea6999715cd3886bd7d4abc2a653b0</data>
