<node id="ADAG Study">
  <data key="d0">ADAG Study</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A1C‑Derived Average Glucose study involving 237 DM1 patients and 147 DM2 patients, correlating HbA1c with estimated average glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;International A1C-Derived Average Glucose study that assessed correlation between A1C and frequent BGM/CGM in adults.&lt;SEP&gt;The ADAG study involved 470 participants with type 1 and type 2 diabetes to analyze glucose range adequacy.&lt;SEP&gt;The ADAG study demonstrated that higher glycemic targets corresponded to A1C goals, influencing ADA guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ad23b9b7ef0802d02c046415e54e3fcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-066ba9218f6293a2f3dc5459d69239cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc39a0c02d5f1bd08d5cb71bacc69a24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36ddeaa53bc38bee375d7ac6d71485d4</data>
