  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The ADVANCE Trial is a large diabetes study summarized in a 2009 publication.&lt;SEP&gt;ADVANCE trial is a clinical study mentioned with a glycemic target of 6.5% A1C (48 mmol/mol) and evaluated intensive glycemic control outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;The ADVANCE trial reported an association between level 3 hypoglycemia and mortality.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6db2125b1b94840ea29100039a6fef20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38ab5af7e42588297df4330ffb2c046b</data>
