  <data key="d2">The French DESIR Study is a longitudinal cohort investigating diabetes‑related outcomes, including retinopathy.&lt;SEP&gt;French DESIR Study is a longitudinal research project that evaluated predictors of diabetic retinopathy over ten years.</data>
