  <data key="d2">Emerging Risk Factors Collaboration conducted a large prospective study linking fasting glucose levels to coronary disease risk.&lt;SEP&gt;The Emerging Risk Factors Collaboration is a research consortium that conducted a meta‑analysis on diabetes, fasting blood glucose, and vascular disease risk.&lt;SEP&gt;International collaboration analysing cardiometabolic multimorbidity and mortality risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8393954b021d0ad02018d1a449e0cc93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e551f4b7f03919afc1d663b3b2a2efa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e668c40e3bc21d982ed03a052f0f9339</data>
