<node id="Diabet Med">
  <data key="d0">Diabet Med</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabet Med is a peer‑reviewed medical journal dedicated to publishing research on diabetes.  It covers both basic and clinical aspects of the disease, providing articles that address laboratory investigations such as C‑peptide measurement, routine clinic assessments, and broader scientific studies.  

The journal serves as a venue for a variety of notable investigations, including the GLADIS study, the MIDD study, and a 2022 article focused on the diagnosis of type 1 diabetes.  Its content is frequently cited in reference lists of related scholarly works, reflecting its role as an influential source within the diabetes research community.  

By concentrating on diabetes research and clinical practice, Diabet Med aims to advance understanding and improve management of the condition for clinicians, researchers, and healthcare professionals worldwide.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabet Med is a scientific journal that publishes studies on diabetes and metabolic disorders.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8393954b021d0ad02018d1a449e0cc93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddc3658b93eb925d28d625c4e2ce652f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-034c9e1f42f0eec15fed18c25580b0eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-664916c2444f157f5d7d9bc41b032d26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-703ccc96df3edd610232f0cca4bf7afa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c23c0554362bde8c591c91d4a0185a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4adabacd09697393ca15fc999724c51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc432bf15c11ef31f7aff87b534b5eaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27380916f7cd2065a9c21259b0aa7868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ab98b1c07f7bbaa3ad28fb83167f489</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377398</data>
