<node id="Doença Hepática Esteatótica Metabólica (DHEM)">
  <data key="d0">Doença Hepática Esteatótica Metabólica (DHEM)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DHEM is a metabolic fatty liver disease for which the Sociedade Brasileira de Diabetes recommends screening.&lt;SEP&gt;Metabolic steatotic liver disease (DHEM) is a hepatic condition linked to diabetes mellitus type 2 and can progress to severe liver disease such as steatohepatitis, fibrosis, cirrhosis, and hepatocarcinoma.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e7b4535dbb2554b84c7a2e024c4b82c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c92d117f7109ea1ce6995f23bc680ce3</data>
