</node>
<node id="Diabetes Mellitus Tipo 2 (DM2)">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Mellitus Tipo 2 (DM2)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Type 2 diabetes mellitus is a chronic metabolic disorder discussed throughout the guideline, associated with various risk factors and complications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e7b4535dbb2554b84c7a2e024c4b82c4</data>
