<node id="Islet Autoantibodies">
  <data key="d0">Islet Autoantibodies</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Islet autoantibodies are biological markers examined in multiple studies as predictors of type 1 diabetes development.&lt;SEP&gt;Specific autoantibodies targeting pancreatic islets that serve as near‑certain predictors of diabetes onset.&lt;SEP&gt;Specific autoantibodies measured in relatives to predict future Type 1 Diabetes development.&lt;SEP&gt;Islet autoantibodies refer to confirmed autoantibodies against islet antigens, indicating risk for clinical diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoantibodies targeting pancreatic islet antigens, used as biomarkers in screening and risk assessment for type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc0d4df5f59432ca990767b120f983a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6601fea85bfbb9f20040c70b7e21695d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2752a78fbaafd94ca566ff099a4ba551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c122c1c6d7dd36110b6ddba2c074d122&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba38023866c2db7437e618a60033f21f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377320</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Teplizumab">
  <data key="d0">Teplizumab</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Immunomodulatory medication approved by the FDA to delay progression to DM1 Phase 3 in individuals aged 8 years or older.&lt;SEP&gt;Teplizumab is an anti‑CD3 monoclonal antibody investigated for its effect in relatives at risk for type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;An anti‑CD3 antibody investigated for preventing or treating type 1 diabetes in at‑risk individuals and for improving beta cell function.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc0d4df5f59432ca990767b120f983a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cf24d486949a568d61c1de206cd3e14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c122c1c6d7dd36110b6ddba2c074d122</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377357</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="TEDDY">
  <data key="d0">TEDDY</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">TEDDY (The Environmental Determinants of Diabetes in the Young) is a longitudinal study on early childhood diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;TEDDY (The Environmental Determinants of Diabetes in the Young) is a study cohort referenced in the paper on predictors of progression from islet autoantibodies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc0d4df5f59432ca990767b120f983a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddc3658b93eb925d28d625c4e2ce652f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786371988</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Autoantibody Risk Score">
  <data key="d0">Autoantibody Risk Score</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Autoantibody risk score is a quantitative tool described for assessing type 1 diabetes risk in relatives.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc0d4df5f59432ca990767b120f983a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786371988</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pre‑Stage 3 Type 1 Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Pre‑Stage 3 Type 1 Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pre‑Stage 3 type 1 diabetes denotes a pre‑clinical phase identified by islet autoantibody positivity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc0d4df5f59432ca990767b120f983a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786371988</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Islet Autoantibodies and Risk of Progression to Diabetes in Children">
  <data key="d0">Islet Autoantibodies and Risk of Progression to Diabetes in Children</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">“Islet Autoantibodies and Risk of Progression to Diabetes in Children” is a journal article cited from JAMA discussing autoantibody risk in pediatric populations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc0d4df5f59432ca990767b120f983a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
