  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Predictors of Progression from the Appearance of Islet Autoantibodies to Early Childhood Diabetes: The Environmental Determinants of Diabetes in the Young (TEDDY)">
  <data key="d0">Predictors of Progression from the Appearance of Islet Autoantibodies to Early Childhood Diabetes: The Environmental Determinants of Diabetes in the Young (TEDDY)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This paper investigates factors influencing progression from islet autoantibody appearance to early childhood type 1 diabetes, referencing the TEDDY study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc0d4df5f59432ca990767b120f983a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786371989</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="The Prediction of Type Diabetes by Multiple Autoantibody Levels and Their Incorporation into an Autoantibody Risk Score in Relatives of Type 1 Diabetic Patients">
  <data key="d0">The Prediction of Type Diabetes by Multiple Autoantibody Levels and Their Incorporation into an Autoantibody Risk Score in Relatives of Type 1 Diabetic Patients</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This article evaluates how multiple autoantibody levels and an autoantibody risk score predict type 1 diabetes in relatives.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc0d4df5f59432ca990767b120f983a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786371989</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="An Anti‑CD3 Antibody, Teplizumab, in Relatives at Risk for Type 1 Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">An Anti‑CD3 Antibody, Teplizumab, in Relatives at Risk for Type 1 Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This study assesses the therapeutic potential of the anti‑CD3 antibody teplizumab in individuals at risk for type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc0d4df5f59432ca990767b120f983a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
