<node id="Markedly Reduced Rate of Diabetic Ketoacidosis at Onset of Type 1 Diabetes in Relatives Screened for Islet Autoantibodies">
  <data key="d0">Markedly Reduced Rate of Diabetic Ketoacidosis at Onset of Type 1 Diabetes in Relatives Screened for Islet Autoantibodies</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This paper reports a significant decline in diabetic ketoacidosis incidence at disease onset among screened relatives.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc0d4df5f59432ca990767b120f983a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786371989</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetic Ketoacidosis at Diagnosis of Type 1 Diabetes Predicts Poor Long‑Term Glycemic Control">
  <data key="d0">Diabetic Ketoacidosis at Diagnosis of Type 1 Diabetes Predicts Poor Long‑Term Glycemic Control</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This article links the presence of diabetic ketoacidosis at diagnosis with adverse long‑term glycemic outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc0d4df5f59432ca990767b120f983a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786371990</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Screening for Type 1 Diabetes in the General Population: A Status Report and Perspective">
  <data key="d0">Screening for Type 1 Diabetes in the General Population: A Status Report and Perspective</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This report provides an overview of population‑wide screening efforts for type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc0d4df5f59432ca990767b120f983a7</data>
