  <data key="d5">1786371990</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Consensus Guidance for Monitoring Individuals with Islet Autoantibody‑Positive Pre‑Stage 3 Type 1 Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Consensus Guidance for Monitoring Individuals with Islet Autoantibody‑Positive Pre‑Stage 3 Type 1 Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This guideline offers recommendations for monitoring individuals identified as pre‑stage 3 type 1 diabetes based on islet autoantibody positivity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc0d4df5f59432ca990767b120f983a7</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786371990</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="RISC Study">
  <data key="d0">RISC Study</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">RISC Study examined metabolic profiles of individuals with normal GJ and TTGO-2h but elevated TTGO-1h.&lt;SEP&gt;The “Relationship between Insulin Sensitivity and Cardiovascular risk” cohort study that provided cross‑sectional data on insulin resistance, β‑cell function, and glucose tolerance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-23ad6eb7138be249f01b479174a34076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec7e786a85b1b6e6cc75bcfc9189fd27</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786371990</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FINDRISC">
  <data key="d0">FINDRISC</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Finnish Diabetes Risk Score questionnaire used to stratify individuals’ risk of developing Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus.&lt;SEP&gt;FINDRISC is a risk scoring method used to identify individuals at high risk for diabetes and guide TTGO‑1h testing.&lt;SEP&gt;The Finnish Diabetes Risk Score employed to stratify individuals’ risk of developing type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;FINDRISC is a risk score used to stratify individuals; low/moderate scores suggest a three‑year screening interval, while high scores suggest a twelve‑month interval.&lt;SEP&gt;FINDRISC is a risk‑score questionnaire assessing the likelihood of developing type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;FINDRISC is the Finnish Diabetes Risk Score, a tool for estimating the risk of developing type 2 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-23ad6eb7138be249f01b479174a34076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a05276c5db43e3a1e9f987056012750f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-078f5907e86c2158587c79b26b0cd683&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e428438c632682ef93541430ec497ed5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c92d117f7109ea1ce6995f23bc680ce3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c6dca13b685243e63fb6f24f7cb301d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786371990</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hemoglobin Variants">
  <data key="d0">Hemoglobin Variants</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hemoglobin Variants are genetic alterations of hemoglobin that can cause discordant HbA1c results.&lt;SEP&gt;Genetic variations in hemoglobin that must be considered when A1C does not correlate with CGM or BGM.&lt;SEP&gt;Hemoglobin variants are genetic differences in hemoglobin that may interfere with A1C assay accuracy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-23ad6eb7138be249f01b479174a34076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-066ba9218f6293a2f3dc5459d69239cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44888abd4ca8a1953f751ed6c41922e6</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377220</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Gestação e Puerpério">
  <data key="d0">Gestação e Puerpério</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Gestação e Puerpério (pregnancy and postpartum) are physiological states that may affect HbA1c measurements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-23ad6eb7138be249f01b479174a34076</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786371991</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Transfusões Sanguíneas">
  <data key="d0">Transfusões Sanguíneas</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Transfusões Sanguíneas (blood transfusions) are clinical events that may cause HbA1c incongruence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-23ad6eb7138be249f01b479174a34076</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786371991</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Uso de Drogas Antirretrovirais">
  <data key="d0">Uso de Drogas Antirretrovirais</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Uso de Drogas Antirretrovirais (use of antiretroviral drugs) can interfere with HbA1c determination.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-23ad6eb7138be249f01b479174a34076</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786371991</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insuficiência Renal Crônica">
  <data key="d0">Insuficiência Renal Crônica</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insuficiência Renal Crônica (chronic renal insufficiency) is a condition that may distort HbA1c values.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-23ad6eb7138be249f01b479174a34076</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786371991</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Uso de Eritropoetina Recombinante">
  <data key="d0">Uso de Eritropoetina Recombinante</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Uso de Eritropoetina Recombinante (use of recombinant erythropoietin) can affect HbA1c results.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-23ad6eb7138be249f01b479174a34076</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Diagnóstico de diabetes mellitus.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786371992</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intolerância à Glicose">
  <data key="d0">Intolerância à Glicose</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Intolerância à Glicose denotes impaired glucose tolerance identified by TTGO-2h.</data>
