<node id="Global Variation in Diabetes Diagnosis and Prevalence">
  <data key="d0">Global Variation in Diabetes Diagnosis and Prevalence</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Global Variation in Diabetes Diagnosis and Prevalence is a 2023 research article reporting worldwide differences in diabetes diagnosis based on fasting glucose and HbA1c.</data>
