  <data key="d0">Two-Hour Plasma Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Two‑hour plasma glucose is the glucose concentration measured two hours after a glucose load, employed in diabetes diagnostic criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;Two-Hour Plasma Glucose is the blood glucose concentration measured two hours after an oral glucose load.</data>
