  <data key="d0">Pedersen-Bjergaard Score</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Pedersen‑Bjergaard score is a tool for assessing impaired hypoglycemia awareness.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372085</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Level 3 Hypoglycemia">
  <data key="d0">Level 3 Hypoglycemia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Level 3 hypoglycemia is a severe episode requiring immediate assistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Level 3 hypoglycemia is defined as severe hypoglycemia that may lead to loss of consciousness, seizure, coma, or death.&lt;SEP&gt;Level 3 Hypoglycemia is a severe classification of low blood glucose.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36ddeaa53bc38bee375d7ac6d71485d4</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372085</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Nonpregnant Adults With Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Nonpregnant Adults With Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Nonpregnant adults with diabetes are the population for which the glycemic recommendations in Table 6.3 apply.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372085</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Preprandial Capillary Plasma Glucose">
  <data key="d0">Preprandial Capillary Plasma Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Preprandial capillary plasma glucose target range is 80–130 mg/dL (4.4–7.2 mmol/L).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372086</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Postprandial Capillary Plasma Glucose">
  <data key="d0">Postprandial Capillary Plasma Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Postprandial capillary plasma glucose target is less than 180 mg/dL (10.0 mmol/L).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372086</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="African American Individuals">
  <data key="d0">African American Individuals</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">African American individuals are a population group described as having higher A1C values than non‑Hispanic White individuals at comparable mean glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;African American individuals have a substantially increased risk of level 3 hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;People of African American descent discussed in relation to hemoglobin variants, A1C levels, and other biomarkers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba0417a72f50cf7ca66c87a351bd1ff8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d01033177672e6c36e0a368db88e586d</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377310</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Use">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Use</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin use is identified as a risk factor for level 3 hypoglycemia in older adults with type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Use is the administration of insulin, mentioned as a factor to balance with carbohydrate intake and physical activity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372087</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Albuminuria">
  <data key="d0">Albuminuria</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Albuminuria is a risk factor associated with level 3 hypoglycemia in older adults with type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Presence of albumin in urine, indicating kidney damage often associated with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Albuminuria is a kidney complication that can be reduced by improved time in range.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2cd796639bdb0e10eeda7ef3d9ebbce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-664916c2444f157f5d7d9bc41b032d26</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372087</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Young Children With Type 1 Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Young Children With Type 1 Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Young children with type 1 diabetes are particularly vulnerable to hypoglycemia due to reduced symptom recognition.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372087</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Rapid-Acting Glucose">
  <data key="d0">Rapid-Acting Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Rapid‑acting glucose is a treatment used to reverse hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372088</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bedtime Snack">
  <data key="d0">Bedtime Snack</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A bedtime snack is a nutrition intervention used to prevent overnight hypoglycemia when specifically needed.&lt;SEP&gt;A bedtime snack may be used to prevent overnight hypoglycemia when specifically needed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc39a0c02d5f1bd08d5cb71bacc69a24</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372088</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
