  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes Care Volume 46, Supplement 1 (January 2023) is the source publication for the glycemic recommendations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b</data>
