  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dementia">
  <data key="d0">Dementia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dementia is a neurocognitive disorder that was found to have greater risk among older adults with a history of level 3 hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Dementia is a neurodegenerative condition linked to hypoglycaemic episodes in older patients with type 2 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acba683ee0809d1c3f6e35c228f485ac</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372089</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cognitive Impairment">
  <data key="d0">Cognitive Impairment</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cognitive impairment at baseline was significantly associated with subsequent episodes of level 3 hypoglycemia in the ACCORD trial.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372089</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cognitive Decline">
  <data key="d0">Cognitive Decline</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cognitive decline showed no association with frequency of level 3 hypoglycemia in the DCCT/EDIC study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372089</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glycemic Target">
  <data key="d0">Glycemic Target</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glycemic target refers to the recommended blood glucose range (e.g., 80–130 mg/dL) for diabetes management.&lt;SEP&gt;Glycemic target refers to individualized blood glucose goals for patients with diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc39a0c02d5f1bd08d5cb71bacc69a24</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372090</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Shakiness">
  <data key="d0">Shakiness</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Shakiness is a symptom commonly experienced during hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372090</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Irritability">
  <data key="d0">Irritability</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Irritability is a symptom that may occur during hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372090</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tachycardia">
  <data key="d0">Tachycardia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Tachycardia is an increased heart rate that can be a sign of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Nutrition Intervention">
  <data key="d0">Nutrition Intervention</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Nutrition intervention includes strategies such as bedtime snacks to prevent hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Nutrition intervention refers to dietary strategies, such as snacks, employed to prevent or treat hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc39a0c02d5f1bd08d5cb71bacc69a24</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Physical Activity Management">
  <data key="d0">Physical Activity Management</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Physical activity management is a component of diabetes care aimed at reducing hypoglycemia risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Physical activity management involves adjusting exercise to help maintain glycemic control in diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc39a0c02d5f1bd08d5cb71bacc69a24</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Medication Adjustment">
  <data key="d0">Medication Adjustment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Medication adjustment involves titrating glucose‑lowering drugs to meet glycemic targets while avoiding overtreatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Medication adjustment entails modifying drug regimens to achieve individualized glycemic targets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc39a0c02d5f1bd08d5cb71bacc69a24</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Claims Data">
  <data key="d0">Claims Data</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Claims data are healthcare utilization records used to estimate rates of level 3 hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hospitalization">
  <data key="d0">Hospitalization</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Hospitalization refers to admission to the hospital, which is more likely for individuals with diabetes when infection or dehydration occurs.&lt;SEP&gt;Hospitalization denotes admission to a hospital, often recorded in claims data for severe hypoglycemia episodes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2cd796639bdb0e10eeda7ef3d9ebbce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Emergency Department Visit">
  <data key="d0">Emergency Department Visit</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Emergency department visit refers to an urgent care encounter documented in claims data for hypoglycemia events.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372092</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ambulance Use">
  <data key="d0">Ambulance Use</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Ambulance use is emergency transport recorded in claims data for severe hypoglycemia cases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc59aba81df88fe020f6e1d93d9e403b</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372092</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Blood Glucose Awareness Training Program">
  <data key="d0">Blood Glucose Awareness Training Program</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Blood Glucose Awareness Training Program is a formal training program developed to increase awareness of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372092</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dose Adjusted for Normal Eating (DAFNE)">
  <data key="d0">Dose Adjusted for Normal Eating (DAFNE)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Dose Adjusted for Normal Eating (DAFNE) is a formal training program developed to increase awareness of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372092</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DAFNE-Plus">
  <data key="d0">DAFNE-Plus</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">DAFNE-Plus is an extended formal training program developed to increase awareness of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
