  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hypoglycemia-Associated Autonomic Failure">
  <data key="d0">Hypoglycemia-Associated Autonomic Failure</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hypoglycemia-Associated Autonomic Failure is a syndrome characterized by deficient counterregulatory hormone release and diminished autonomic response, both risk factors for hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;A condition describing autonomic failure linked to hypoglycemia in diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8df31d65b128b9d70b82bb8af257332</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372093</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sensor-Augmented CGM">
  <data key="d0">Sensor-Augmented CGM</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensor-Augmented CGM is a technology that provides alarm‑based prevention of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372093</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CGM-Assisted Pump Therapy">
  <data key="d0">CGM-Assisted Pump Therapy</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">CGM-Assisted Pump Therapy is a technology that provides alarm‑based prevention of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372093</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Real-Time CGM">
  <data key="d0">Real-Time CGM</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Real-Time CGM is a continuous glucose monitoring device used in studies that have shown reduction in hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372093</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CGM Technology">
  <data key="d0">CGM Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">CGM Technology refers to the suite of continuous glucose monitoring methods and devices discussed for hypoglycemia prevention and A1C improvement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372094</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Nonketotic Hyperglycemic Hyperosmolar State">
  <data key="d0">Nonketotic Hyperglycemic Hyperosmolar State</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Nonketotic Hyperglycemic Hyperosmolar State is a severe hyperglycemic emergency that can be precipitated by stressful events.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372095</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intercurrent Illness">
  <data key="d0">Intercurrent Illness</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Intercurrent Illness refers to acute health conditions that affect diabetes management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372095</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stressful Events">
  <data key="d0">Stressful Events</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Stressful Events such as illness, trauma, or surgery may worsen glycemic control and trigger severe complications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372096</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes Care Team">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Care Team</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The diabetes care team is a multidisciplinary group that should interact with patients whose treatment plan requires temporary adjustment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Diabetes Care Team is the group of healthcare professionals who manage diabetes treatment adjustments.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes care team is a group of healthcare professionals recommended to work with patients to manage hypoglycemic unawareness.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Care Team is a group of health professionals that assists patients in managing diabetes and hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2cd796639bdb0e10eeda7ef3d9ebbce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0645201ac55eff389c44997aecbb6ce7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-208cda7ee40e8d266fadd1eadff49e03</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/hipoglicemia.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372321</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intense Physical Activity">
  <data key="d0">Intense Physical Activity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Intense Physical Activity is vigorous exercise identified as a trigger for hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372097</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sleep">
  <data key="d0">Sleep</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Sleep is a physiological state during which hypoglycemia may occur.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372097</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Counterregulation">
  <data key="d0">Counterregulation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Counterregulation refers to the body's hormonal response that opposes hypoglycemia, mentioned as improving with avoidance of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372097</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Treatment Plan">
  <data key="d0">Treatment Plan</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Treatment Plan is the individualized diabetes management plan that may be adjusted in response to hyperglycemia or hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Treatment plan refers to the therapeutic regimen that may require temporary adjustment during marked hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Treatment Plan is a structured approach to managing hypoglycemia and glucose targets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2cd796639bdb0e10eeda7ef3d9ebbce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-208cda7ee40e8d266fadd1eadff49e03</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/hipoglicemia.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372327</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Dosing">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Dosing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Dosing is a strategy for adjusting insulin amounts, noted as improving A1C with minimal hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372099</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Urine Ketone Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">Urine Ketone Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Urine Ketone Monitoring is the practice of testing urine for ketones, required for ketosis‑prone patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372099</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Blood Ketone Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">Blood Ketone Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Blood Ketone Monitoring is the practice of testing blood for ketones, required for ketosis‑prone patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372099</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fluid Intake">
  <data key="d0">Fluid Intake</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Fluid Intake refers to the consumption of adequate fluids, emphasized as necessary for individuals with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Fluid intake denotes the amount of fluids a patient with diabetes should consume to maintain adequate hydration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2cd796639bdb0e10eeda7ef3d9ebbce</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372099</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Caloric Intake">
  <data key="d0">Caloric Intake</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Caloric Intake refers to the consumption of calories, emphasized as necessary for individuals with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Caloric intake refers to the amount of calories a patient with diabetes should consume as part of nutritional management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-345ad64f464691cc28341ccd246032db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2cd796639bdb0e10eeda7ef3d9ebbce</data>
