<node id="Point-of-Care A1C Testing">
  <data key="d0">Point-of-Care A1C Testing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A point-of-care testing approach for measuring A1C levels, mentioned as a way to enable timely treatment changes during patient encounters.&lt;SEP&gt;Point‑of‑care A1C testing provides rapid A1C results using FDA‑approved devices in CLIA‑certified laboratories.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-066ba9218f6293a2f3dc5459d69239cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cc61bc2e95346d553972b4371912e7f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
