<node id="A1C Test">
  <data key="d0">A1C Test</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">An indirect laboratory measure of average glycemia, described as having variability and limitations.&lt;SEP&gt;A1C test is a diagnostic assay that may underestimate glycemia in people with HIV.&lt;SEP&gt;A1C test measures average blood glucose and is debated for pediatric use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-066ba9218f6293a2f3dc5459d69239cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55e58732610596ce9a8f3145d34f75a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0631ff2b95dd459677eaaebe9283a776</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
