<node id="Glucose-6-Phosphate Dehydrogenase Deficiency">
  <data key="d0">Glucose-6-Phosphate Dehydrogenase Deficiency</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A deficiency affecting red blood cell turnover that may cause A1C result discrepancies.&lt;SEP&gt;G6PD deficiency is a condition that may affect A1C reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;A deficiency that increases red blood cell turnover and impacts A1C interpretation.</data>
