  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A section of the referenced guideline discussing medication options that minimize hypoglycemia risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Section 9 describes pharmacologic strategies for glycemic management, including the use of SGLT2 inhibitors and GLP‑1 receptor agonists.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-74ef8c063d84e34c44021aa138b9b903&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38ab5af7e42588297df4330ffb2c046b</data>
