<node id="Figure 6.1">
  <data key="d0">Figure 6.1</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Figure 6.1 displays key points included in a standard ambulatory glucose profile (AGP) report.&lt;SEP&gt;A figure referenced in the guideline illustrating recommended glycemic target ranges.</data>
