  <data key="d0">Section 14</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Section 14 is the part of the document that discusses glycemic goals for children and adolescents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b275f50028ef32e322bf8643e0342810</data>
