  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Blood glucose levels are measurements of glucose concentration in the bloodstream.&lt;SEP&gt;Elevated measurements that signal acute presentation of Type 1 Diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood glucose levels are a clinical measurement that can improve with high‑dose sulfonylureas in K ATP‑related neonatal diabetes.</data>
