  <data key="d0">Flash Glucose‑Sensing Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Flash glucose‑sensing technology is a device that captures glucose data intermittently, serving as an alternative to traditional blood glucose meters.</data>
