<node id="Hypoglycemia (Low Blood Glucose)">
  <data key="d0">Hypoglycemia (Low Blood Glucose)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hypoglycemia, also referred to as low blood glucose, is a medical condition characterized by abnormally low glucose levels in the blood.</data>
