<node id="A1C Level">
  <data key="d0">A1C Level</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A1C Level is a laboratory measurement reflecting average blood glucose over several months.&lt;SEP&gt;A measurement of glycated hemoglobin used to predict future diabetes risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-208cda7ee40e8d266fadd1eadff49e03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5ec01ed3c32ac663f3dc6cfa6fa09a3</data>
