<node id="BMJ Open">
  <data key="d0">BMJ Open</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">BMJ Open is a peer‑reviewed medical journal cited in the references.&lt;SEP&gt;BMJ Open is a peer‑reviewed medical journal that published a study on multivariable clinical diagnostic models for type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;BMJ Open is a peer‑reviewed medical journal that published the 2019 article on multivariable clinical diagnostic models.&lt;SEP&gt;BMJ Open is an open‑access medical journal that published the diagnostic model study for type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;BMJ Open published a study on multivariable clinical diagnostic models for type 1 diabetes requiring rapid insulin therapy.\&lt;SEP&gt;An open-access medical journal that published a study on glycosylated haemoglobin for gestational diabetes screening.&lt;SEP&gt;BMJ Open is a peer‑reviewed medical journal that published a 2016 article (e011059) on gestational diabetes mellitus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5c23c0554362bde8c591c91d4a0185a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1ee3f56f3180d8544dbba6a542c9d68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4adabacd09697393ca15fc999724c51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27380916f7cd2065a9c21259b0aa7868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a15ed0aa8749d4f76e8d725e8752873&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-037075addb77da4a5a1721a95ee298c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fedb8cdc485be3c8e38133ddb9ea67cf</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377416</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multivariable Clinical Diagnostic Models">
  <data key="d0">Multivariable Clinical Diagnostic Models</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Multivariable Clinical Diagnostic Models are statistical models developed to identify adults aged 18‑50 with type 1 diabetes requiring rapid insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Multivariable Clinical Diagnostic Models are statistical models designed to identify type 1 diabetes requiring rapid insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Multivariable clinical diagnostic models are statistical tools to identify type 1 diabetes requiring rapid insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Multivariable Clinical Diagnostic Models are diagnostic models described in a BMJ Open study to identify type 1 diabetes requiring rapid insulin therapy.\</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5c23c0554362bde8c591c91d4a0185a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1ee3f56f3180d8544dbba6a542c9d68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27380916f7cd2065a9c21259b0aa7868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a15ed0aa8749d4f76e8d725e8752873</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ZnT8 Autoantibodies">
  <data key="d0">ZnT8 Autoantibodies</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">ZnT8 Autoantibodies are autoantibodies targeting the zinc transporter 8, screened as biomarkers for autoimmune diabetes in a large French cohort.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5c23c0554362bde8c591c91d4a0185a0</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
