  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Latent Autoimmune Diabetes in Adults (LADA) is a form of autoimmune diabetes that manifests in adulthood.&lt;SEP&gt;A form of autoimmune diabetes that manifests in adulthood, also known as LADA.</data>
