<node id="Shields et al.">
  <data key="d0">Shields et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Shields et al. performed a meta‑analysis evaluating clinical predictors for differentiating DM1 and DM2.&lt;SEP&gt;Researchers who developed the MODY Probability Calculator using clinical‑laboratory data of patients diagnosed before 30 years.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-299bcef3259f8ab6bc70544e12616624</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372990</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ke et al.">
  <data key="d0">Ke et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Ke et al. conducted a population study of DM2 patients in Hong Kong.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372990</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Carr et al.">
  <data key="d0">Carr et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Carr et al. are researchers who corroborated the utility of Peptídeo C Randômico in a clinical case‑control study.&lt;SEP&gt;Carr et al. developed a clinical model combining age, BMI and autoantibodies for detecting DM1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-858cd6ea7fba353827f5ab95be1157ae</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372991</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lynam et al.">
  <data key="d0">Lynam et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Lynam et al. demonstrated that adding biomarkers improves classification of DM1 versus DM2.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372991</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Peptide C">
  <data key="d0">Peptide C</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Peptide C dosage assists in correctly classifying ambiguous diabetes cases.&lt;SEP&gt;Peptide C is a biomarker measured to aid diabetes diagnosis in ketoacidosis cases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4adabacd09697393ca15fc999724c51</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372991</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Anti-GAD">
  <data key="d0">Anti-GAD</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Anti-GAD is an antibody test used as a biomarker for distinguishing type 1 and type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Anti‑GAD is an auto‑antibody biomarker that enhances discrimination between DM1 and DM2.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-858cd6ea7fba353827f5ab95be1157ae</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372991</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Anti IA-2">
  <data key="d0">Anti IA-2</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Anti IA-2 is an antibody test employed to improve discrimination between type 1 and type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Anti IA‑2 is an auto‑antibody biomarker that enhances discrimination between DM1 and DM2.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-858cd6ea7fba353827f5ab95be1157ae</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372991</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Biomarkers">
  <data key="d0">Biomarkers</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Biomarkers such as auto‑antibodies, anti‑GAD, anti‑IA‑2 and peptide C improve diabetes classification.&lt;SEP&gt;Biomarkers are biological indicators used in screening for monogenic diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-355eedbe74750d3739f7257279494c9a</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377230</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Acantosis Nigricans">
  <data key="d0">Acantosis Nigricans</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Acantosis nigricans is a skin manifestation that may prompt differential diagnosis of diabetes in children and adolescents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372992</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mild Dysglycemia">
  <data key="d0">Mild Dysglycemia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Mild dysglycemia is a subtle glucose abnormality that may require differential diagnosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372992</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hong Kong">
  <data key="d0">Hong Kong</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Hong Kong is the city where Ke et al. conducted a large DM2 population study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372992</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Clinical Model">
  <data key="d0">Clinical Model</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Clinical model refers to the predictive algorithm combining age, BMI and autoantibodies for DM1 detection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372993</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulin Receptor Antibodies">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Receptor Antibodies</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin Receptor Antibodies are auto‑immune markers mentioned in the context of diabetes diagnosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372993</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Age at Diagnosis">
  <data key="d0">Age at Diagnosis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Age at Diagnosis refers to the patient’s age when diabetes is first identified and is used as a predictor for diabetes type.&lt;SEP&gt;Patient age when diabetes is first diagnosed; thresholds under 30 years for LADA and under 25 years for MODY are used in clinical criteria.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-299bcef3259f8ab6bc70544e12616624</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372994</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Time to Initiation of Insulin Therapy">
  <data key="d0">Time to Initiation of Insulin Therapy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Time to Initiation of Insulin Therapy denotes the interval between diabetes diagnosis and the start of insulin treatment, serving as a classification factor.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372994</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Genetic Risk Score for DM1">
  <data key="d0">Genetic Risk Score for DM1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Genetic Risk Score for DM1 is a calculated score based on genetic markers that estimates the risk of developing Diabetes Mellitus Type 1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372994</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Genetic Tests">
  <data key="d0">Genetic Tests</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Genetic Tests are laboratory analyses used to detect genetic variants associated with diabetes subtypes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372994</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes Classification">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Classification</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes Classification is the systematic process of assigning a diabetes case to a specific type based on clinical and laboratory criteria.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-429fba9c3900b6d0b0c3ccfb38323e54</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372994</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Peptídeo C">
  <data key="d0">Peptídeo C</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Peptídeo C is a biomarker measured in ng/ml or pmol/L, used for diagnosing and differentiating types of diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Peptídeo C is a measurement taken two weeks after resolution of ketoacidosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Peptídeo C is a biomarker measured in blood; low random levels (&lt;0.6 ng/ml) after five years of diabetes suggest classification as Diabetes Tipo 1B.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e6267110f4ae5f4df4c49c0653a09b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed325288512881a80fa42dba504c4bff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fee32f1fb0c848b0799071a86119b142</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372995</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Monogenic Diabetes">
  <data key="d0">Monogenic Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Monogenic Diabetes refers to a genetically single‑gene form of diabetes reclassified from DM1 in some cases.&lt;SEP&gt;Monogenic diabetes refers to diabetes caused by single‑gene defects, representing a small fraction (&lt;5%) of diabetes cases.&lt;SEP&gt;Monogenic diabetes encompasses rare diabetes forms caused by single‑gene mutations, including MODY and neonatal diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Monogenic Diabetes is a rare genetic form of diabetes that may complicate pregnancy.&lt;SEP&gt;Monogenic Diabetes is a type of diabetes caused by single-gene mutations, examined across several studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e6267110f4ae5f4df4c49c0653a09b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-355eedbe74750d3739f7257279494c9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e1f69c1d604e82e14a23a29231bd587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bdb8ef335f3531317a3a5bd7de3a561&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83d72fbc44fe0c28f27702c0d4f2c140</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377232</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insulinotherapy">
  <data key="d0">Insulinotherapy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulinotherapy is the initiation of insulin treatment recommended immediately upon suspicion of DM1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e6267110f4ae5f4df4c49c0653a09b2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372995</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Latent Autoimmune Diabetes In Adults">
  <data key="d0">Latent Autoimmune Diabetes In Adults</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Latent Autoimmune Diabetes In Adults (LADA) is a slowly progressive autoimmune diabetes in adults, exhibiting features of both DM1 and DM2.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e6267110f4ae5f4df4c49c0653a09b2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372996</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Organização Mundial Da Saúde">
  <data key="d0">Organização Mundial Da Saúde</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Organização Mundial Da Saúde is the World Health Organization that provides recommendations on diabetes classifications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e6267110f4ae5f4df4c49c0653a09b2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372996</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Anti‑GAD Antibody">
  <data key="d0">Anti‑GAD Antibody</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Anti‑GAD Antibody is an autoantibody commonly used to diagnose LADA.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e6267110f4ae5f4df4c49c0653a09b2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372996</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Índice De Massa Corporal">
  <data key="d0">Índice De Massa Corporal</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Índice De Massa Corporal is the body mass index used as a clinical predictor in diabetes differentiation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e6267110f4ae5f4df4c49c0653a09b2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372997</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="HDL">
  <data key="d0">HDL</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">HDL is high‑density lipoprotein cholesterol measured in diagnostic criteria for diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;High‑density lipoprotein cholesterol; levels above 46 mg/dl are included in the LADA criteria.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e6267110f4ae5f4df4c49c0653a09b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-299bcef3259f8ab6bc70544e12616624</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372997</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="UnitSLab.com C‑Peptide Conversion Tool">
  <data key="d0">UnitSLab.com C‑Peptide Conversion Tool</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">UnitSLab.com C‑Peptide Conversion Tool is an online converter that translates Peptídeo C units between ng/ml and pmol/L.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e6267110f4ae5f4df4c49c0653a09b2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372997</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hipoglicemias">
  <data key="d0">Hipoglicemias</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hipoglicemias are episodes of low blood glucose that should be absent when measuring Peptídeo C.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e6267110f4ae5f4df4c49c0653a09b2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372998</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Glicosúria">
  <data key="d0">Glicosúria</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Glicosúria is the presence of glucose in urine, used as a diagnostic criterion for adolescent DM2.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e6267110f4ae5f4df4c49c0653a09b2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372998</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Afrodescendentes">
  <data key="d0">Afrodescendentes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Afrodescendentes denotes individuals of African descent, highlighted as a demographic factor in adolescent DM2 risk.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e6267110f4ae5f4df4c49c0653a09b2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372999</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Adolescentes">
  <data key="d0">Adolescentes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Adolescentes refers to the teenage age group, in which DM2 diagnosis criteria are discussed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e6267110f4ae5f4df4c49c0653a09b2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372999</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Idade De Diagnóstico &gt; 30 Anos">
  <data key="d0">Idade De Diagnóstico &gt; 30 Anos</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Idade De Diagnóstico &gt; 30 Anos is the criterion that LADA diagnosis typically requires age at onset greater than 30 years.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e6267110f4ae5f4df4c49c0653a09b2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786372999</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Idade De Diagnóstico &lt; 30 Anos">
  <data key="d0">Idade De Diagnóstico &lt; 30 Anos</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Idade De Diagnóstico &lt; 30 Anos is an alternative criterion suggested by some authors for LADA diagnosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e6267110f4ae5f4df4c49c0653a09b2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786373000</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Idade De Diagnóstico &lt; 50 Anos">
  <data key="d0">Idade De Diagnóstico &lt; 50 Anos</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Idade De Diagnóstico &lt; 50 Anos is a criterion proposed by Fourlanos et al. for suspecting LADA.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e6267110f4ae5f4df4c49c0653a09b2</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786373000</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Anti-ZnT8">
  <data key="d0">Anti-ZnT8</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Anti-ZnT8 is an antibody test that contributes to the classification of diabetes types.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-858cd6ea7fba353827f5ab95be1157ae</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786373000</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Anti-Insulina">
  <data key="d0">Anti-Insulina</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Anti-Insulina is an antibody test that is infrequently positive in adult patients with diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-858cd6ea7fba353827f5ab95be1157ae</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786373000</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Peptídeo C Randômico">
  <data key="d0">Peptídeo C Randômico</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Peptídeo C Randômico is a random C‑peptide measurement used to differentiate diabetes subtypes when autoantibody results are negative.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-858cd6ea7fba353827f5ab95be1157ae</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786373001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Diabetes Monogênico">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes Monogênico</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes Monogênico refers to monogenic forms of diabetes caused by single-gene mutations.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Monogênico is a rare form of diabetes caused by a single‑gene mutation, often with early onset and strong family history.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-858cd6ea7fba353827f5ab95be1157ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed325288512881a80fa42dba504c4bff</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786373001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Jones et al.">
  <data key="d0">Jones et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Jones et al. are researchers who proposed a specific cutoff value for Peptídeo C Randômico to distinguish diabetes types.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-858cd6ea7fba353827f5ab95be1157ae</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786373001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fotopoulou et al.">
  <data key="d0">Fotopoulou et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Fotopoulou et al. are researchers who evaluated Peptídeo C Randômico in a large cohort of patients with DM1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-858cd6ea7fba353827f5ab95be1157ae</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786373002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Células ß Pancreáticas">
  <data key="d0">Células ß Pancreáticas</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Células ß Pancreáticas are pancreatic beta cells responsible for producing insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-858cd6ea7fba353827f5ab95be1157ae</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786373002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
