  <data key="d2">Ketosis‑prone diabetes is a form of diabetes characterized by episodes of ketosis, discussed in multiple studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Variant of Type 1 Diabetes with episodic DKA and fluctuating insulin deficiency.</data>
