<node id="Consortium for the Study of Chronic Pancreatitis, Diabetes, and Pancreatic Cancer (CPDPC)">
  <data key="d0">Consortium for the Study of Chronic Pancreatitis, Diabetes, and Pancreatic Cancer (CPDPC)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">CPDPC is a research consortium that investigates type 3c (pancreatogenic) diabetes secondary to chronic pancreatitis and pancreatic cancer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1ee3f56f3180d8544dbba6a542c9d68</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
