<node id="Diabetes of the Exocrine Pancreas">
  <data key="d0">Diabetes of the Exocrine Pancreas</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes of the exocrine pancreas, also known as type 3c diabetes, is examined for incidence, demographics, and clinical features.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes of the Exocrine Pancreas is another term for type 3c diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1ee3f56f3180d8544dbba6a542c9d68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-355eedbe74750d3739f7257279494c9a</data>
