<node id="LADA">
  <data key="d0">LADA</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Autoimmune diabetes in adults over 20 with recent diagnosis, age at diagnosis under 30, serum triglycerides below 98 mg/dl, HDL above 46 mg/dl, and HbA1c greater than 8.6%, for which Fourlanos et al. propose five clinical criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;LADA (Latent Autoimmune Diabetes in Adults) is a subtype of adult‑onset autoimmune diabetes that does not require insulin for at least six months after diagnosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-299bcef3259f8ab6bc70544e12616624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed325288512881a80fa42dba504c4bff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba38023866c2db7437e618a60033f21f</data>
