  <data key="d0">Fourlanos et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Researchers who suggested five criteria to suspect LADA, including age at diagnosis under 50 and personal or family history of autoimmunity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-299bcef3259f8ab6bc70544e12616624</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classificação do diabetes.pdf</data>
