</node>
<node id="World Health Organization">
  <data key="d0">World Health Organization</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The World Health Organization is an international body referenced for diabetes classification.&lt;SEP&gt;The World Health Organization provides guidelines for conducting the oral glucose tolerance test.&lt;SEP&gt;World Health Organization is an international body that suggests BMI thresholds for increased diabetes risk in Asian American individuals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e4adabacd09697393ca15fc999724c51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44888abd4ca8a1953f751ed6c41922e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55e58732610596ce9a8f3145d34f75a7</data>
