  <data key="d0">Medida Da Prega Cutânea</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Medida Da Prega Cutânea is a skin‑fold measurement technique used to quantify and characterize loss of body fat and detect lipodistrofia.</data>
