  <data key="d2">Genetic Testing is a diagnostic method used to identify monogenic forms of diabetes such as neonatal diabetes and MODY.&lt;SEP&gt;Genetic testing is recommended to identify monogenic causes of diabetes, including neonatal diabetes and MODY.&lt;SEP&gt;Genetic Testing is a method employed to detect genetic causes of monogenic diabetes.</data>
