  <data key="d2">Cost‑effectiveness refers to the economic evaluation indicating that diabetes screening may be &lt;$11,000 per quality‑adjusted life year gained.&lt;SEP&gt;Cost-Effectiveness refers to the economic evaluation of MODY genetic testing.</data>
