  <data key="d0">Pancreatogenic Diabetes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pancreatogenic Diabetes is a synonym for type 3c diabetes linked to pancreatic cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A form of diabetes associated with disease of the exocrine pancreas, such as chronic pancreatitis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-355eedbe74750d3739f7257279494c9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f1215318cea8c61dc12042476611f9f</data>
