  <data key="d0">Diabetes Prevention Program Research Group</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes Prevention Program Research Group authored a study on reducing incidence of type 2 diabetes with lifestyle intervention or metformin.\&lt;SEP&gt;Research group responsible for the Diabetes Prevention Program study on A1c differences.&lt;SEP&gt;The research group that investigated HbA1c as a predictor of diabetes in a randomized clinical trial.&lt;SEP&gt;The Diabetes Prevention Program Research Group conducted research on diabetes prevention.&lt;SEP&gt;Research consortium conducting long‑term studies on diabetes prevention interventions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-525031caa389d084bc170433212cdca8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5ec01ed3c32ac663f3dc6cfa6fa09a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ab98b1c07f7bbaa3ad28fb83167f489&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a15ed0aa8749d4f76e8d725e8752873&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84032013252fd71963ed381e09a3116d</data>
