  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The International Association of Diabetes and Pregnancy Study Groups (IADPSG) develops the IADPSG diagnostic criteria for Gestational Diabetes Mellitus.&lt;SEP&gt;Professional body that defines criteria for glucose tolerance testing in pregnancy.&lt;SEP&gt;The International Association of Diabetes and Pregnancy Study Groups (IADPSG) develops consensus diagnostic criteria for gestational diabetes.</data>
