  <data key="d0">Autosomal Dominant Inheritance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Autosomal dominant inheritance describes a pattern where a single mutated allele can cause disease, seen in many monogenic diabetes forms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0bdb8ef335f3531317a3a5bd7de3a561</data>
