  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Type 1 Diabetes Stage 1">
  <data key="d0">Type 1 Diabetes Stage 1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Stage 1 of type 1 diabetes is characterized by autoimmunity, normoglycemia, presymptomatic status, and diagnostic criteria of multiple islet autoantibodies with no IGT or IFG.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cc61bc2e95346d553972b4371912e7f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377380</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Type 1 Diabetes Stage 2">
  <data key="d0">Type 1 Diabetes Stage 2</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Stage 2 of type 1 diabetes is characterized by autoimmunity, dysglycemia, presymptomatic status, and diagnostic criteria of islet autoantibodies together with IFG and/or IGT.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cc61bc2e95346d553972b4371912e7f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377380</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Type 1 Diabetes Stage 3">
  <data key="d0">Type 1 Diabetes Stage 3</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Stage 3 of type 1 diabetes is characterized by autoimmunity, overt hyperglycemia, symptomatic status, and diagnostic criteria of diabetes by standard criteria, specific FPG, 2‑hour PG, and A1C ranges.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cc61bc2e95346d553972b4371912e7f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377380</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Overt Hyperglycemia">
  <data key="d0">Overt Hyperglycemia</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Overt Hyperglycemia denotes clearly elevated glucose levels defining Stage 3 of type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cc61bc2e95346d553972b4371912e7f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377381</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Presymptomatic">
  <data key="d0">Presymptomatic</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Presymptomatic describes the absence of clinical symptoms in Stages 1 and 2 of type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cc61bc2e95346d553972b4371912e7f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377381</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Symptomatic">
  <data key="d0">Symptomatic</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Symptomatic describes the presence of clinical diabetes symptoms in Stage 3 of type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cc61bc2e95346d553972b4371912e7f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377381</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multiple Islet Autoantibodies">
  <data key="d0">Multiple Islet Autoantibodies</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Multiple islet autoantibodies are immune markers used to diagnose early stages of type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cc61bc2e95346d553972b4371912e7f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377381</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="2-Hour Plasma Glucose (2-Hour PG)">
  <data key="d0">2-Hour Plasma Glucose (2-Hour PG)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">2‑Hour Plasma Glucose (2‑Hour PG) is a post‑load glucose measurement used for diabetes diagnosis, with specific thresholds in Stage 3.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cc61bc2e95346d553972b4371912e7f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377381</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="National Glycohemoglobin Standardization Program (NGSP)">
  <data key="d0">National Glycohemoglobin Standardization Program (NGSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The NGSP certifies A1C testing methods to ensure standardization to the DCCT reference assay.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cc61bc2e95346d553972b4371912e7f</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786377381</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
