  <data key="d0">Precision Medicine Consensus Report</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Precision Medicine Consensus Report is a document produced by the American Diabetes Association and European Association for the Study of Diabetes, published in Diabetes Care.\</data>
