<node id="Glutamic Acid Decarboxylase Autoantibody Assay">
  <data key="d0">Glutamic Acid Decarboxylase Autoantibody Assay</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Glutamic acid decarboxylase autoantibody assay is an electro‑chemiluminescence method detecting autoantibodies to identify latent autoimmune diabetes in adults.\</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3a15ed0aa8749d4f76e8d725e8752873</data>
  <data key="d4">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
