  <data key="d0">Classification of Diabetes Mellitus</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Classification of Diabetes Mellitus refers to the system created by the National Diabetes Data Group for categorizing diabetes and glucose intolerance.</data>
