<edge source="Paciente" target="Seringa">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Paciente uses a Seringa to aspirate the correct insulin dose and remove air bubbles.&lt;SEP&gt;The paciente uses a seringa to inject insulin.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration,handling,injection,usage</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed051c0c90a644e72ac31d765d73a6f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786298852</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
