<edge source="Paciente" target="Médico">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Paciente should follow the orientations of the Médico and report any adverse symptoms.&lt;SEP&gt;The paciente should inform the médico immediately if a severe allergic reaction occurs.&lt;SEP&gt;The paciente should inform the médico about any skin changes observed after injection.&lt;SEP&gt;The physician prescribes Humalog Mix 50 KwikPen dosing for the patient.&lt;SEP&gt;The patient seeks medical assistance from a doctor when severe hypoglycemia or ketoacidosis occurs.&lt;SEP&gt;The doctor determines the insulin dose according to the patient’s needs.</data>
  <data key="d9">care,consultation,consults,dosage,emergency,inform,monitoring,prescription</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-54575ceb6b15fc8abcc2afcec7b36792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c032d0271c85fd24982516368a62b1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aca0b919135813e1d5b772face36989d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-929e31613caadc967412041c8c2155b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb0cd81f0439cbb74e3c0ff54236c45d</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/TRESIBA _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786319777</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
