<edge source="Insulina" target="Músculo">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Injecting insulin into muscle tissue can cause hypoglycemia, therefore subcutaneous placement is required.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina promotes rapid intracellular transport of glucose and amino acids in muscle, stimulates anabolism and inhibits protein catabolism.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration risk,hypoglycemia,metabolic effect,muscle glucose transport</data>
