<edge source="Insulina" target="Luz Solar Direta">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Direct sunlight exposure can degrade insulin, so it must be avoided during transport.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina must not be exposed to direct sunlight during transport.</data>
