<edge source="Insulina" target="Rodízio dos Pontos de Aplicação">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Rotating injection sites is a decisive factor for safe and effective insulin therapy, preventing lipo‑hipertrofia and glycemic variability.</data>
