</edge>
<edge source="Insulina" target="Lipo‑hipertrofia">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Repeated insulin injections at the same point increase the risk of lipo‑hipertrofia, so the site is avoided for 14 days.&lt;SEP&gt;Repeated insulin injections in the same subcutaneous area are associated with development of lipo‑hipertrofia.</data>
