<edge source="Insulina" target="Hiperglucemia">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insufficient insulin infusion can lead to hiperglucemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin prevents episodes of hyperglycemia by lowering blood glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;Insufficient insulin leads to high blood glucose, resulting in hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Hyperglycemia occurs when there is too much glucose and not enough insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin lowers blood glucose, counteracting hyperglycemia.</data>
