<edge source="NPH" target="Lantus®">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Lantus® was not inferior to NPH in preventing progression of diabetic retinopathy.&lt;SEP&gt;Lantus® was associated with a lower incidence of nocturnal hypoglycemia compared with NPH.&lt;SEP&gt;Lantus® and NPH were the two insulin treatments compared in Estudo J.&lt;SEP&gt;Lantus® demonstrated non‑inferiority to NPH in diabetic retinopathy progression.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical trial,comparison,efficacy,efficacy comparison,hypoglycemia,non‑inferiority,safety</data>
