<edge source="Caneta de Insulina" target="Manual de Instruções do Fabricante">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The manufacturer’s instruction manual provides guidance for the correct use of the insulin pen.</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance,proper use</data>
