<edge source="Diabetes" target="A1C">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A1C is used by health professionals to determine the chronicity of hyperglycemia in diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Higher A1C percentages correlate with elevated five‑year incidence of diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">assessment,chronicity,risk association</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-6601fea85bfbb9f20040c70b7e21695d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca8741dfdb9ff0f12f049953db6cb9c0</data>
