<edge source="Hipoglicemia" target="Atividade Física">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Physical activity accelerates insulin absorption, increasing the risk of hypoglycemia if insulin is injected in the leg.&lt;SEP&gt;Increased or prolonged physical activity can raise the risk of hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Elevated or prolonged physical activity can increase the risk of hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Physical activity increases glucose utilization, raising the risk of hypoglycemia during or after exercise.</data>
