<edge source="Hipoglicemia" target="Glucagon">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Glucagon, Hipoglicemia is a therapeutic relation describing the use of glucagon injection to rapidly increase blood glucose levels in individuals who are experiencing severe hypoglycemia. The medication is administered either intramuscularly or subcutaneously, and it is typically given by trained personnel because the condition may involve loss of consciousness or an inability to ingest oral glucose.

In cases of severe hypoglycemia—often defined by neuroglycopenic symptoms, unconsciousness, or failure of oral carbohydrate intake—glucagon is injected to quickly elevate circulating glucose, thereby restoring normal mental status and preventing further complications. The route of administration (intramuscular or subcutaneous) and the injectable form are emphasized across clinical guidelines, reflecting standard emergency practice for this metabolic emergency.&lt;SEP&gt;Severe hypoglycemia such as coma or seizures can be treated with intramuscular or subcutaneous glucagon.&lt;SEP&gt;Severe hypoglycemia may require an injection of glucagon.</data>
  <data key="d9">emergency,emergency medication,injection,intervention,rescue medication,severe,treatment</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-c032d0271c85fd24982516368a62b1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-072d97721eef045503ec1dce0363b58e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aca0b919135813e1d5b772face36989d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e7689ca0fc736d9eae94256f73fed52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-922791f49d1bf928fe4f02ddd336927b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f2714936869e55e840f5294caefeaee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-786395f3716fb61a79fd183c63e1a9d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7ca732691e1cbcafd65e378b8d80144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6419fb3ef4249d6c7e8d8a45d82efe80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbe87fd92ad66dcb02b25b669d829f6c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/TRESIBA _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786319790</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
