  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Incidence of hypoglycemia after intravenous Lantus® is similar to that after insulin human.&lt;SEP&gt;Clinical data for Lantus® list hypoglycemia as the most frequent adverse reaction.&lt;SEP&gt;Lantus® was associated with reports of hipoglicemia in the adverse‑reaction table.</data>
  <data key="d9">adverse reaction,hypoglycemia,symptom similarity</data>
