  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">APIDRA SOLOSTAR may cause severe hypoglycemia, potentially before the patient is aware.&lt;SEP&gt;Hypoglycemia is a frequent adverse reaction observed with APIDRA SOLOSTAR therapy.</data>
