<edge source="Hipoglicemia" target="APIDRA">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Rates of Hipoglicemia were comparable between APIDRA and insulin regular regimens, indicating similar safety.&lt;SEP&gt;A dose of 0.5 UI/kg per day of APIDRA was associated with severe hypoglycemia in rabbits.&lt;SEP&gt;The incidence of hypoglycemia requiring third‑party assistance was equivalent between the APIDRA and insulin humana regular groups.</data>
