<edge source="Hipoglicemia" target="Glicose Intravenosa Concentrada">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Severe hypoglycemia may also be treated with concentrated intravenous glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;Glicose intravenosa concentrada is used intravenously to manage severe hipoglicemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">severe,treatment</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-04b345bc26ec7f5d7c9db8c6004a50a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e7689ca0fc736d9eae94256f73fed52</data>
