</edge>
<edge source="Hipoglicemia" target="Betabloqueadores">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Betabloqueadores can mask the clinical signs of hypoglycemia, delaying recognition.&lt;SEP&gt;Beta blockers may mask the symptoms of hypoglycemia and delay recovery.&lt;SEP&gt;Beta‑blockers may mask the symptoms of hypoglycemia and delay its recovery.</data>
  <data key="d9">interaction,masking,symptom,symptom masking</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4615ca664e7ff898d8c5929cbc79e7d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6101c469482b48e341b4095a54907fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba6b31518be6fff1db8b68a28e82f200</data>
