</edge>
<edge source="Hipoglicemia" target="Ajuste da Dose de Insulina">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Modifying insulin dosage in response to activity or diet changes can cause hypoglycemia if dosage is excessive.</data>
