<edge source="Hipoglicemia" target="Regra Dos 15">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Rule of 15 treats hypoglycemia by ingesting 15 g fast‑acting carbohydrate, waiting 15 minutes, and rechecking glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;Regra dos 15 guides the classification and management of hypoglycemia based on signs and symptoms.</data>
