<edge source="Insulin" target="Refrigerator">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin should be stored in a refrigerator to preserve its potency and effectiveness.  The medication must be kept at a controlled temperature between 2 °C and 8 °C, and it should remain in a closed container or its original packaging while in the refrigerator.  Both unopened insulin vials and opened pens can be placed in the unit, but it is advisable to keep them in a dedicated space—commonly the middle compartment or the lower internal part of the refrigerator—to minimize temperature fluctuations and protect them from accidental exposure.  Maintaining these conditions helps ensure that insulin retains its therapeutic efficacy throughout its intended shelf life.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin should be kept closed in a refrigerator at temperatures between 2 °C and 8 °C.</data>
  <data key="d9">containment,storage,temperature,temperature control</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4654b5e9fa02cf051c2d5ebc846c5d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03a1de93a53fbcb513268c123e2c5a16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc6a26a5d2c41087b58a0f7f71ad21cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8336dc27990f6189c99863d64435c6c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e94cedc7134adbb256c931b851235c53</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Armazenamento e transporte.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786330504</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
