<edge source="Insulin" target="Needle">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin is administered to the patient using a needle.&lt;SEP&gt;The needle is used to inject insulin into the skin.&lt;SEP&gt;Needle is used to deliver insulin into the body during injection.&lt;SEP&gt;The needle is the instrument used to inject insulin into the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Needle serves as the conduit through which insulin is expelled from the SoloStar into the patient’s tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;The needle attached to the SoloStar is used to deliver insulin into the skin.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration,conduit,delivery,injection,instrument,tool</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35a8ffab5eb63600b93fb2c67160b5ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03a1de93a53fbcb513268c123e2c5a16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffe095bda1b787c5b5ae2d61a2f74c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9835d6684db67541402527b3182b6c5</data>
