</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The relation (Insulin, Insulin Pump) denotes that an insulin pump is a medical device used to deliver the medication insulin to a patient. By providing continuous, programmable subcutaneous infusion, the pump can replace most manual insulin injections and administer insulin according to individualized basal settings as part of diabetes therapy. This delivery is intended to regulate blood glucose levels, offering a steady supply of insulin that mimics the body’s natural secretion patterns.

Insulin pumps deliver insulin directly into the body, typically through a small catheter placed under the skin, and can be programmed to release insulin at specific rates throughout the day. The device therefore administers insulin subcutaneously according to the user‑defined schedule, ensuring that the medication reaches the patient in a controlled and therapeutic manner.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump delivers insulin to the body continuously or in bolus doses.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump delivers insulin to the user for glucose control.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration,delivers,delivery,hormone,infusion,insulin delivery,medication,medication delivery,replacement,therapy</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-022aabbd0c94aa681dcd00c49d072b46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa6e3b40416ce7934111298208db5346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd31a315488bb0669257b83dd88b9809&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fe81d733c2a429da0726794b55350b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b9f6a4a440ccb40e47c326ca6dd9346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beee0553403f566be565a996251cac46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36de8c99d97d234e12244c240c45f156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2474d83c9e01bbd20c6e68744a2dad5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8e89a2540c525a104b0a1a5513347a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d24fce6aa8866fb4a11514ae0e4d675&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4faffc449b4b8ea09acbae135d21baa6</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329913</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
