</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Subcutaneous Injection">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin is administered via subcutaneous injection as the recommended route.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin is commonly administered via subcutaneous injection into fatty tissue beneath the skin.&lt;SEP&gt;Subcutaneous injection is the recommended method for delivering insulin into the body.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration,administration method,route,technique,therapy</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-26c5ab6d7b3b32c5f6aca2b58489782a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5de4e99a192602fe98c8b7e8e270a49c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786301883</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Intramuscular Injection">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Improper insulin injection can result in intramuscular delivery, which is undesirable.&lt;SEP&gt;Intramuscular injection delivers insulin into muscle, causing rapid absorption and possible severe hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration,contraindication,risk,route</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-26c5ab6d7b3b32c5f6aca2b58489782a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786299850</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Intradermal Injection">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Intradermal injection of insulin places the drug in the superficial skin layer, resulting in slower action.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration,route</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786299850</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Endovenous Injection">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Endovenous injection of insulin is used only in emergency settings under medical supervision.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration,emergency</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786299851</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Exercise">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Exercise can increase insulin absorption speed, raising the risk of hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">effect,speed</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786299852</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Heat">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">External heat accelerates insulin action, potentially leading to low blood sugar.</data>
  <data key="d9">effect,speed</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786299853</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Fever">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Fever raises body temperature, which can speed up insulin absorption.</data>
  <data key="d9">effect,speed</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786299853</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Warm Compress">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Applying a warm compress to the injection area hastens insulin uptake.</data>
  <data key="d9">effect,speed</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786299854</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Cold Compress">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Cold compresses slow down insulin absorption, increasing blood glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Applying a cold compress, cold bath, or dehydration can cause insulin to act more slowly and increase blood sugar.</data>
  <data key="d9">effect,pharmacokinetics,slowdown,speed</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786300295</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Dehydration">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Dehydration can slow insulin action, leading to higher blood sugar.&lt;SEP&gt;Dehydration can cause insulin to act more slowly and raise blood sugar.</data>
  <data key="d9">effect,pharmacokinetics,slowdown,speed</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84c3145631d64a0c7b9ea21dfb9c8275</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786300297</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Freezing">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">If insulin freezes, it becomes ineffective and must be discarded.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin must never be frozen; if it freezes it must be discarded.</data>
  <data key="d9">avoidance,damage,disposal,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8336dc27990f6189c99863d64435c6c6</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Armazenamento e transporte.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786302110</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="i-Port Device">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The i-Port device enables multiple insulin injections without inserting a new needle each day.</data>
  <data key="d9">delivery tool</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786299857</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Hand Luggage">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin should be carried in hand luggage to avoid temperature extremes during travel.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin should be carried in hand luggage during travel and not placed in checked baggage.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin must be carried in hand luggage and never placed in checked luggage.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin should always be transported in hand luggage during travel.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin should be carried in hand luggage, not in checked baggage.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin must always be carried in hand luggage during travel.</data>
  <data key="d9">carry-on,guideline,safety,transport,travel,travel requirement,travel safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1d9f7234865211afc5d8343294b276d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-525086e26636af026c417773a8f11a92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03a1de93a53fbcb513268c123e2c5a16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b1b73e9b7285819a4ba5caa6fdfa785&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8336dc27990f6189c99863d64435c6c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d795dc393eb02c6418957ee1678504f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/Armazenamento e transporte.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Armazenamento e Transporte/transporte e conservação Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-20201.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786302755</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Syringe">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Syringes are used to inject insulin when precise small doses are required.&lt;SEP&gt;Syringes are the devices used to administer insulin injections.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin is drawn into a syringe for injection.&lt;SEP&gt;Syringe injects insulin during administration.&lt;SEP&gt;Using a syringe graduated in milliliters for insulin can lead to dosing errors and hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Syringes are the primary devices used to administer insulin doses.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration,containment,delivery,device,error risk,incompatibility,injection,medication,tool</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-191286ebd759321d40620f77c84ef5a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebdb9452013f0e340884677832714553&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4654b5e9fa02cf051c2d5ebc846c5d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03a1de93a53fbcb513268c123e2c5a16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b1b73e9b7285819a4ba5caa6fdfa785&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5b4c60b3de8c56d9ab869d868345fb7</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786301876</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Insulin Pen">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin pen is a device used to apply insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin can be administered using an insulin pen.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin pen administers insulin doses to the patient.&lt;SEP&gt;An insulin pen is used to administer insulin subcutaneously.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pen is used as a device to administer insulin subcutaneously.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pen is a device used to inject insulin conveniently multiple times a day.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin pens are devices that enable accurate and less painful insulin dosing.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration,application,delivery,delivery device,device,injection,tool</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-191286ebd759321d40620f77c84ef5a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03a1de93a53fbcb513268c123e2c5a16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8768fa32f88d682aa4ddf677297047e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5de4e99a192602fe98c8b7e8e270a49c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7e6ef38db0b62d161b13473af47d738&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06425d1f80d868bd58871b6a6e740102</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Insulinas CANETAS.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Documento sem título.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Understanding insulin - International Diabetes Federation.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786332470</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Vial">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Vial holds insulin to be drawn into a syringe for injection.&lt;SEP&gt;The vial stores insulin until it is drawn into a syringe or pen.</data>
  <data key="d9">containment,source,storage</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-191286ebd759321d40620f77c84ef5a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786299860</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Dose">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Dose refers to the prescribed amount of insulin for an individual.&lt;SEP&gt;The dose specifies the amount of insulin drawn into the syringe or pen for injection.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration,amount,prescription,quantity</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-191286ebd759321d40620f77c84ef5a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a0a3f492aa5ef7771b2246547cb5f02</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786299862</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Diabetes Mellitus">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Diabetes mellitus involves an inability to produce or use insulin properly.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin is a primary therapy for diabetes mellitus types 1, 2, and gestational.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Mellitus involves insufficient production or improper use of Insulin.</data>
  <data key="d9">dysfunction,pathophysiology,therapy,treatment</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b91b40e47c97be1b62c0f3d271cd4efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d10a1f849386df540104c79e33a7b242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22078404beeceb5adc3e688d239c585e</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/GLICEMIAS CAPILARES/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786336977</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Discovery of Insulin">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The 1921 discovery of insulin led to the availability of insulin as a therapeutic agent.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin was discovered during the 1921 Discovery of Insulin event.</data>
  <data key="d9">discovered in,origin</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b91b40e47c97be1b62c0f3d271cd4efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-457b20f4d8d08ee6b3ed08a225c773de</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786299866</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Glucose">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin lowers blood glucose levels by facilitating cellular uptake.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin facilitates the entry of glucose into cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin enables glucose to enter cells for energy.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin facilitates the uptake and utilization of glucose by cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin lowers blood glucose by moving it from the bloodstream into cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin lowers Glucose by facilitating cellular uptake.</data>
  <data key="d9">facilitation,hormone action,lowers,metabolism,reduction,regulation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b91b40e47c97be1b62c0f3d271cd4efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65c6beab51324e055f4a39b388e2eefe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36de8c99d97d234e12244c240c45f156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f4d152d83c514f926b18413e065c2fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9b29e7a7839d7ff2b29e72fb4912618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b867cec4c5eed3b10e431cbd4078dee</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786324232</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
