</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Type 1 Diabetes">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Type 1 Diabetes is characterized by an autoimmune deficiency of insulin production.&lt;SEP&gt;Patients with type 1 diabetes require continuous insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin provides a treatment that transformed outcomes for Type 1 Diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;People with type 1 diabetes always require insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin is a primary treatment for type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoimmune destruction of beta‑cells in Type 1 Diabetes leads to loss of insulin production, making patients dependent on exogenous insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin is the primary treatment for type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">condition,cure,deficiency,dependence,essential,insulin deficiency,therapy,treatment</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b6828aacfba0c2a6ae59c439a4e4b161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffb10c00517fa772be2ca9a42f497edf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ba3c49b467b6d37cd2aab29bf4a3119&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0932e9c21a330869629b3fa70d2e1f5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-511f6be03d2ea98970bd4c1b29b3e5c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2752a78fbaafd94ca566ff099a4ba551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bdb8ef335f3531317a3a5bd7de3a561</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/The Discovery and Development.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Understanding insulin - International Diabetes Federation.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/blood glucose monitoring.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786377588</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
