<edge source="Insulin" target="Patient">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Patients use insulin to manage blood glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;After removal from the refrigerator, insulin should sit for 15–30 minutes before the patient applies it to avoid pain or irritation.&lt;SEP&gt;Patient may use insulin multiple times per day.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration,comfort,medication,treatment,usage,waiting period</data>
