<edge source="Insulin" target="Subcutaneous Fold">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin injection requires a subcutaneous fold to achieve correct subcutaneous placement of the dose.&lt;SEP&gt;Performing the subcutaneous fold helps ensure insulin is delivered into subcutaneous tissue rather than muscle.</data>
  <data key="d9">injection aid,requirement,technique</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-35a8ffab5eb63600b93fb2c67160b5ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae9010ed1abd5a5160b82713c862d22f</data>
