</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Lipohyperplasia">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Lipohyperplasia (lumps) interferes with insulin absorption, making glucose control harder.</data>
  <data key="d9">absorption reduction,impairment</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-35a8ffab5eb63600b93fb2c67160b5ef</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786299907</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Lipodystrophy">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Lipodystrophy areas should be avoided when injecting insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Lipodystrophy develops in skin where insulin is repeatedly injected.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin injections can cause lipodystrophy, an alteration of subcutaneous fat at the injection site.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin injections can lead to lipodystrophy (lipohypertrophy or lipoatrophy) at the injection site.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin injections may cause lipodystrophy at the injection site.&lt;SEP&gt;Lipodystrophy may appear in the subcutaneous tissue after repeated insulin injections.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin injection sites may develop lipodystrophy, altering fat tissue.</data>
  <data key="d9">adverse effect,condition,contraindication,injection site,side effect,site avoidance,site reaction,subcutaneous change,tissue,tissue change,tissue reaction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-35a8ffab5eb63600b93fb2c67160b5ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-525086e26636af026c417773a8f11a92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d59c9bf7f429a82cbfd7083e36ff8f9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e50c145614f04be2319a31b74b80411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8934881ec5ab7cfeb836126b3f0e8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c68e2c07786710dd5250c6610f52b14d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06425d1f80d868bd58871b6a6e740102</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Tipos de insulinas/Understanding insulin - International Diabetes Federation.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786332476</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Redness or Inflammation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Inflamed skin is unsuitable for insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d9">contraindication,site avoidance</data>
