<edge source="Insulin" target="Diabetes Type 2">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">In diabetes type 2 the body cannot use insulin properly.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin is part of the natural treatment for diabetes type 2, not a punishment.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin constitutes a natural part of the therapeutic regimen for diabetes type 2.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin is a primary medication used to manage diabetes type 2.&lt;SEP&gt;In type 2 diabetes the body uses insulin poorly; insulin may be required when oral drugs are insufficient.&lt;SEP&gt;Diabetes Type 2 involves Insulin Resistance, reducing Insulin effectiveness.</data>
