<edge source="Insulin" target="Pancreas">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin is a hormone that is naturally produced by the pancreas.  

The pancreas generates and secretes insulin into the bloodstream, where the hormone functions to regulate blood‑glucose levels and overall glucose metabolism. By lowering circulating glucose, insulin helps maintain metabolic homeostasis throughout the body.</data>
  <data key="d9">biology,hormone,hormone production,production,regulation,secretion,source,synthesis</data>
