<edge source="Insulin" target="Blood Glucose">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin helps maintain blood glucose levels within target values.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin reduces blood glucose levels by facilitating its uptake into cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Insufficient insulin leads to an increase in blood glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin regulates blood glucose levels by allowing glucose to enter cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin lowers blood glucose levels by facilitating glucose entry into cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin regulates Blood Glucose levels by facilitating cellular uptake.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood Glucose concentration is regulated by Insulin.</data>
