<edge source="Insulin" target="Alcohol">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Alcohol is applied to the skin before insulin injection to clean the site.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcohol consumption can alter a person’s insulin requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcohol can lower insulin needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcohol can both potentiate and weaken insulin’s glucose‑lowering effect.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcohol can intensify or reduce insulin’s hypoglycemic effect.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcohol can intensify or reduce the hypoglycemic effect of insulin.</data>
