</edge>
<edge source="Insulin" target="Antibodies">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin therapy can stimulate the formation of antibodies in patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Administration of insulin can cause the formation of antibodies.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin administration can lead to the formation of antibodies, indicating an immunogenic adverse effect.</data>
  <data key="d9">adverse effect,adverse reaction,immune response,immunogenicity</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d59c9bf7f429a82cbfd7083e36ff8f9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da80e99fd3e43cb7d3b260aca23fe56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d194d06ef99b3f8aa6b6542b7e93e762</data>
