<edge source="Needle" target="Needle Protector">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A needle protector covers the needle after use to prevent accidental needle sticks.&lt;SEP&gt;Needle Protector covers the Needle after removal to prevent accidental injury.&lt;SEP&gt;The needle protector shields the needle during preparation and until injection.&lt;SEP&gt;The needle protector is rotated to loosen and then remove the needle.</data>
