<edge source="Needle" target="Insulin Pen">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">An insulin pen requires a needle to deliver insulin subcutaneously.&lt;SEP&gt;The needle is inserted into the insulin pen to enable injection.&lt;SEP&gt;An insulin pen uses a needle to deliver subcutaneous injections of insulin.</data>
