</edge>
<edge source="Needle" target="Subcutaneous Fold">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A subcutaneous fold is performed before inserting the needle to ensure proper placement.&lt;SEP&gt;Subcutaneous fold is performed before needle insertion to ensure insulin is delivered into fatty tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;A subcutaneous fold is created before inserting the needle to ensure proper placement.</data>
  <data key="d9">preparation,procedure,technique</data>
