<edge source="Needle" target="Skin">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The needle is inserted into the skin at the appropriate angle (90° with short needles, 45° in some cases).&lt;SEP&gt;The needle is inserted into the skin to deliver insulin during an injection.&lt;SEP&gt;The needle is inserted into the skin to deliver insulin subcutaneously.&lt;SEP&gt;The needle is inserted into the skin to deliver insulin.</data>
