  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Needle" target="Patient">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Patients are instructed to discard the needle after every application of NovoRapid® FlexPen®.&lt;SEP&gt;The patient inserts the needle into the skin to deliver the insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Patient uses the needle attached to SoloStar to inject insulin into the skin.&lt;SEP&gt;Patient removes the needle from the SoloStar after each injection to prevent injury.&lt;SEP&gt;Patient discards the used needle safely according to medical guidance.</data>
