<edge source="Needle" target="SoloStar">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Needle is the detachable component that connects to the SoloStar insulin pen for delivering medication.&lt;SEP&gt;A sterile needle must be affixed to the SoloStar pen before each injection.&lt;SEP&gt;The SoloStar insulin pen has a needle attached for injection, which must be removed after each use.</data>
  <data key="d9">attachment,component,device component,part-of,requirement</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ffe095bda1b787c5b5ae2d61a2f74c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9835d6684db67541402527b3182b6c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79f891b1d7c0c6ca0eab9dbcc76c902d</data>
