  <data key="d12">1786315673</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Needle" target="External Cap">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">External Cap is used to unscrew and safely detach the needle from the SoloStar pen.&lt;SEP&gt;The needle is covered by an external cap that must be removed after injection.&lt;SEP&gt;After use, the needle is placed into the external cap without touching the cap surface.&lt;SEP&gt;The external cap is pressed and unscrewed to release the used needle for safe disposal.&lt;SEP&gt;The external cap covers the needle when it is not in use to prevent contamination and accidental injury.</data>
  <data key="d9">cover,covering,disposal,handling,protection,removal,safety,storage,tool</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ffe095bda1b787c5b5ae2d61a2f74c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0710d91bd443ae1af3fd98049f4ad42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb8954aaa1e1230598596ce6f5df249&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c24a2af0d0291fc4f4730256c420e93</data>
