  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Internal Cap should not be reattached to the needle to prevent accidental injury.&lt;SEP&gt;The needle is also covered by an internal cap that must be discarded after use.</data>
  <data key="d9">cover,protection,restriction,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ffe095bda1b787c5b5ae2d61a2f74c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0710d91bd443ae1af3fd98049f4ad42</data>
