<edge source="Needle" target="Caregiver">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Caregivers must handle used needles cautiously to avoid puncture injuries and cross‑infection.&lt;SEP&gt;The caregiver removes and disposes of the needle after each injection to reduce risk of contamination and infection.</data>
