  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin detemir was compared to NPH insulin in multiple studies assessing efficacy and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin detemir is distributed more slowly to peripheral tissues compared with NPH insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;The study reported similar efficacy and global safety profiles between insulin detemir and NPH insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin detemir shows less patient‑to‑patient variability than NPH insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Detemir was compared with NPH Insulin in randomized studies.</data>
