<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Bolus">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pump may administer a bolus extra dose at meals or when blood sugar rises.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump can administer a bolus of insulin for meals, high glucose, or hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump delivers bolus insulin doses.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump can be programmed to administer precise bolus doses of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump administers the calculated bolus dose when the user confirms delivery through SmartGuard.</data>
