<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Type 1 Diabetes">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin pumps are commonly used by individuals with Type 1 Diabetes to deliver continuous insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin pumps are recommended for individuals with type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin pumps may be considered for children and adolescents with type 1 diabetes as a preferred mode of insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d9">device,recommendation,target condition,therapy</data>
