<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Hyperglycemia">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Malfunction of the insulin pump can quickly cause hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Incorrect basal settings in the insulin pump can cause hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Prolonged disconnection of the insulin pump can lead to hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Improper use of the insulin pump could result in Hyperglycemia.</data>
