<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Reservoir">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">An insulin pump contains a reservoir that stores insulin for infusion.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump contains a reservoir that holds the insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump utilizes reservoirs to hold insulin for delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;The reservoir stores insulin within the pump and is removed when insulin flow is blocked.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Pump contains the Reservoir that holds insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;The reservoir stores insulin within the insulin pump.</data>
