<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Basal Insulin">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">An insulin pump can substitute basal insulin when the pancreas is unable to produce it.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin pump supplies basal insulin continuously.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump supplies basal insulin in small amounts continuously over 24 hours.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump provides basal insulin continuously, which resumes automatically after suspension.&lt;SEP&gt;Basal insulin is continuously delivered by the insulin pump to meet insulin needs between meals and during sleep.</data>
  <data key="d9">background insulin,basal insulin,continuous delivery,delivery,dosage,replacement,therapy</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b7715667f5fca178f0988984e932ecfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5913d17c337be62cd526d46fbdcd9a6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b867cec4c5eed3b10e431cbd4078dee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d24fce6aa8866fb4a11514ae0e4d675&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c5a5c97986d9b31b155b0c8f0cac1c5</data>
