<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Bolus Insulin">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">An insulin pump can also deliver bolus insulin in place of pancreatic secretion.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin pump provides bolus insulin for rapid glucose control.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus insulin is used to cover an expected rise in blood glucose from carbohydrates or to lower a high blood glucose reading.</data>
  <data key="d9">bolus delivery,delivery,dosage,replacement,therapy</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b7715667f5fca178f0988984e932ecfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b867cec4c5eed3b10e431cbd4078dee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c5a5c97986d9b31b155b0c8f0cac1c5</data>
