<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Bolus Wizard™">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pump includes the Bolus Wizard™ feature for calculating correction doses.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Wizard™ is a software function embedded in the insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d9">component,contains,device,software</data>
