</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Infusion Set">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The infusion set is the part of the insulin pump system that delivers insulin to the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump system incorporates an infusion set to deliver insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;The Insulin Pump is connected to the body via the Infusion Set.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump connects to the body via an infusion set.&lt;SEP&gt;The infusion set delivers insulin from the pump to the body; leaks are not notified by the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The infusion set delivers insulin from the pump and may be removed during insulin flow blockage.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin Pump delivers insulin through the Infusion Set.</data>
  <data key="d9">compatibility,component,connects,delivery,includes,insulin delivery,uses</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-e91ce385a4956221ce891caa7456655a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5913d17c337be62cd526d46fbdcd9a6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ce776458e256df9d6070a419cab7449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6025fa711665988fad0f789b9eb901a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71de01baf40871c616eaa39cb8189f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db5749bec4af1c3ea068b257c4376aaf</data>
