<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="SmartGuard™">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">SmartGuard™ can automatically suspend the insulin pump infusion when low glucose is anticipated.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard™ automatically suspends insulin delivery from the insulin pump when glucose approaches the low‑glucose limit.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard™ automatically suspends and resumes insulin delivery from the insulin pump based on glucose forecasts.</data>
  <data key="d9">automated control,automation,interruption,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-6ab7cedc48ea8fdd199a2c12c99416a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36de8c99d97d234e12244c240c45f156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2474d83c9e01bbd20c6e68744a2dad5</data>
