<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Basal Rate">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The basal rate setting determines the background insulin delivery by the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump delivers basal insulin through the basal rate to maintain background glucose control.&lt;SEP&gt;When needed, the pump provides a fixed basal insulin rate for up to four hours while remaining in the SmartGuard feature.&lt;SEP&gt;The basal rate is a programmable insulin delivery setting on the pump that must be confirmed after storage.</data>
  <data key="d9">basal,control,delivery,programming,settings parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-36de8c99d97d234e12244c240c45f156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff2787d1cec4a771ee14b7d5d97324a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05241912c4f8f5e79ae75071a1c7c604&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb80f00ba2dab32852874cb384b38de3</data>
