<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="24‑Hour Assistance Line">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The 24‑Hour Assistance Line offers help if the insulin pump is exposed to hazardous conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Users can contact the 24‑hour assistance line for help when the insulin pump malfunctions.</data>
