  <data key="d12">1786325798</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="ADA">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The American Diabetes Association advises users to contact them via a dedicated phone number for pump‑related issues.</data>
  <data key="d9">contact,support</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-138cbaf5a43762d4c5b77a07ab51cbd4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786325799</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Airport Emergency Card">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Travelers are advised to print and carry an airport emergency card that identifies the insulin pump and diabetes condition.</data>
  <data key="d9">carry,notification</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-138cbaf5a43762d4c5b77a07ab51cbd4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786325801</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="TSA">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The TSA advises that insulin should not be placed in checked baggage because of temperature risk.</data>
  <data key="d9">baggage,regulation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-138cbaf5a43762d4c5b77a07ab51cbd4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786325802</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Instinct Sensor">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Instinct Sensor is automatically unpaired from the Insulin Pump when a new sensor is started.&lt;SEP&gt;Instinct Sensor pairs wirelessly with the Insulin Pump via the MiniMed Mobile App.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump can pair with an Instinct Sensor, which is started via the MiniMed Mobile App.</data>
  <data key="d9">activation,automatic,pairing,sensor,unpairing,wireless communication</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ab510c8377992bab31045a97eb95893a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71de01baf40871c616eaa39cb8189f43</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329736</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Simplera Sync Sensor">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Simplera Sync Sensor pairs with the Insulin Pump using a wireless connection established through the MiniMed Mobile App.&lt;SEP&gt;Simplera Sync Sensor is automatically unpaired from the Insulin Pump when a new sensor is initiated.</data>
  <data key="d9">automatic,pairing,unpairing,wireless communication</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ab510c8377992bab31045a97eb95893a</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329736</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Guardian 4 Sensor">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Guardian 4 Sensor operates with the Insulin Pump for glucose monitoring and follows similar insertion and removal procedures.</data>
  <data key="d9">compatibility,operation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ab510c8377992bab31045a97eb95893a</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329737</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Magnetic Fields">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Strong magnetic fields can cause the insulin pump to malfunction, leading to possible hypoglycemia or hyperglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">interference,safety risk</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329840</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Radiation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Exposure to radiation such as x‑ray or CT scans can damage pump components that regulate insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d9">damage,safety risk</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329840</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="MRI Equipment">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">If the insulin pump is exposed to MRI equipment, it may malfunction or be damaged.</data>
  <data key="d9">exposure hazard,malfunction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329841</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="X‑Ray Equipment">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Scanning the insulin pump with an x‑ray machine can damage components that regulate insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d9">damage,exposure hazard</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329842</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="CT Scan Equipment">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The pump must be removed before entering a room with CT scan equipment to prevent malfunction.</data>
  <data key="d9">exposure hazard,malfunction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329843</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Magnet">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Direct contact with a magnet, such as a magnetic clasp, may interfere with the pump motor and cause malfunction.</data>
  <data key="d9">interference,motor damage</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329844</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Electrostatic Discharge">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Very high levels of electrostatic discharge can reset the pump’s software and trigger an alarm.</data>
  <data key="d9">alarm,reset</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329845</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Extreme Temperature">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Exposure to temperatures above 122 °F or below -4 °F can damage the insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d9">damage,operational limit</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329846</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Waterproof Capability">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pump is waterproof up to 8 feet (2.4 m) for 30 minutes when the reservoir and tubing are properly inserted.</data>
  <data key="d9">protection,submersion</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329846</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Blood Glucose Meter">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Blood glucose values from the meter are entered into the pump for calibration or system performance checks.</data>
  <data key="d9">calibration,data input</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329847</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="24-Hour Technical Support">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">24‑Hour Technical Support is contacted for help when the pump malfunctions or is exposed to magnetic fields.&lt;SEP&gt;When a critical pump error occurs, users are instructed to contact 24‑Hour Technical Support.&lt;SEP&gt;Users are instructed to contact 24-Hour Technical Support for help with pump alarms and pairing issues.&lt;SEP&gt;The 24‑Hour Technical Support is contacted for assistance with the insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d9">assistance,contact,support,technical assistance,troubleshooting</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b53b69acbef0e172ea7719cc15bf3ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14031c05fdb4152e391234af47d0cfe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71de01baf40871c616eaa39cb8189f43</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329848</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Users Manual">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The User’s Manual contains the most current safety warnings for the insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance,warnings</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329849</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Medical Emergency Card">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Medical Emergency Card provides critical information about pump use on an airplane and airport security.</data>
  <data key="d9">safety,travel information</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329849</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Pump Reservoir">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The pump reservoir holds insulin and must be properly inserted for proper operation.</data>
  <data key="d9">component,insulin storage</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329850</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Pump Tubing">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Pump tubing connects the reservoir to the infusion set and is required for waterproof capability.</data>
  <data key="d9">component,fluid delivery</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329851</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Skin Care Products">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Skin care products such as lotion or sunscreen can damage the insulin pump if they contact it.</data>
  <data key="d9">chemical exposure,damage risk</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329853</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Full-Body Scanner">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pump must be removed before passing through a full-body scanner to avoid damage.</data>
  <data key="d9">removal,safety requirement</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-379a204614747df98c1296e2f76c264f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329854</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="BG Reading">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Home screen shows BG reading, which is obtained via the insulin pump’s glucose meter interface.</data>
  <data key="d9">data source</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4faffc449b4b8ea09acbae135d21baa6</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329911</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Active Insulin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Active insulin displayed on the Home screen represents bolus insulin currently acting, delivered by the insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d9">insulin delivery</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4faffc449b4b8ea09acbae135d21baa6</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329912</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Pump System">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pump is the central component of the overall pump system.</data>
  <data key="d9">system component</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4faffc449b4b8ea09acbae135d21baa6</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329914</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Basal X">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pump executes Basal X, delivering a defined amount of insulin each day.</data>
  <data key="d9">basal delivery,insulin</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-6b53b69acbef0e172ea7719cc15bf3ad</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329927</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Very High Basal Setting">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pump may deliver significantly more insulin than needed when a very high basal setting is active.</data>
  <data key="d9">high basal,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-6b53b69acbef0e172ea7719cc15bf3ad</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329928</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="Suspend Before Low">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pump suspends insulin delivery via the Suspend Before Low feature when sensor glucose falls below the low limit.</data>
  <data key="d9">insulin suspension,low glucose</data>
