<edge source="Insulin Pump" target="SmartGuard Feature">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">When active, the SmartGuard feature enables the pump to calculate and deliver insulin automatically.&lt;SEP&gt;The SmartGuard feature of the insulin pump should not be used for a period after a manual insulin injection.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump runs the SmartGuard safety feature.</data>
