  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Karen initiates a bolus of insulin for lunch using the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Karen stops the ongoing bolus after receiving a phone call.&lt;SEP&gt;Karen initiates a manual bolus of insulin for her lunch.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration,dosing,insulin delivery,interruption,pause</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5863810bebfd1be64b8af80afcd57e11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-785aac5c827baebbe0c372f8c4550f23</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
