  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bolus" target="Bolus Wizard">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Bolus Wizard is a feature that calculates and delivers the appropriate bolus insulin dose for the user. It determines the amount of insulin to be administered by processing user‑entered inputs such as carbohydrate intake, current blood glucose level, and personal insulin‑to‑carbohydrate ratios. The system then provides a menu choice allowing the user to select and confirm the calculated bolus, guiding them through the final delivery of the insulin. In all descriptions, Bolus Wizard is consistently portrayed as an assistive tool that computes the correct bolus amount and facilitates its administration.</data>
  <data key="d9">assistance,calculate,calculation,dosage,dose,enables,guidance,insulin,insulin administration,menu option,wizard</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5863810bebfd1be64b8af80afcd57e11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84bb2bb0df91a594c6936b2fe97e4220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27a9a11fec63f11922c3e40119833245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-995e322b08a5c6d446f5fd68e5c3fe5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0dcb28a160ed0e11da58b075919575&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-785aac5c827baebbe0c372f8c4550f23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a111edb31d6739acf013ce812b952366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f94cd06ab0d1bcc7a9349bc40ea3eb22</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786330058</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bolus" target="Parar Bolus">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Selecting the Parar Bolus command halts the ongoing insulin bolus.&lt;SEP&gt;The stop bolus method interrupts an ongoing bolus.&lt;SEP&gt;Parar Bolus is selected to interrupt an ongoing bolus infusion.</data>
  <data key="d9">control,interruption,stop</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5863810bebfd1be64b8af80afcd57e11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f6eb3be969569b166fc1e5f7e7567f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1a77062463b62317e84265a3b2b6d4a</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786325662</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bolus" target="Hipoglucemia">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">An insulin bolus that is too large or improperly timed can cause hipoglucemia.&lt;SEP&gt;An improperly timed bolus can lead to hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">low blood sugar,risk,timing</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5863810bebfd1be64b8af80afcd57e11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cbaec668e54aa5cf462a7bd08d7813c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
