</edge>
<edge source="Bolus" target="Hiperglucemia">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">An insulin bolus that is too small or interrupted can lead to hiperglucemia.&lt;SEP&gt;A bolus delivered too early may cause subsequent hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;A bolus is administered to correct episodes of high glucose (hiperglucemia).</data>
