<edge source="Bolus" target="Ratio I/R">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin‑to‑carbohydrate ratio determines the amount of bolus insulin needed for a given carbohydrate intake.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin‑to‑carbohydrate ratio (Ratio I/R) is used to calculate appropriate bolus doses.</data>
