</edge>
<edge source="Bolus" target="FSI">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin sensitivity factor guides the size of correction bolus when glucose is high.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin sensitivity factor (FSI) determines how much one unit of insulin will lower glucose, informing bolus adjustments.</data>
