  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pump administers bolus doses to manage glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump administers bolus doses of insulin according to programmed settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Bomba De Insulina delivers bolus doses of insulin as part of therapy.</data>
