  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The “Change Sensor” message instructs the user to remove the current sensor and start a new one.&lt;SEP&gt;Change Sensor action involves inserting a new Sensor to replace a faulty one.</data>
  <data key="d9">instruction,procedure,replace</data>
