<edge source="Sensor" target="Change Sensor Alert">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The “Change sensor alert” prompts the user to replace a sensor that is not securely connected.&lt;SEP&gt;Change Sensor Alert advises discarding the current sensor and inserting a new one.&lt;SEP&gt;Change Sensor Alert prompts replacement of the Sensor.</data>
  <data key="d9">alert,replace,replacement instruction,sensor change</data>
