<edge source="Sensor" target="Pump">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Sensor is paired to the Pump to provide continuous glucose monitoring data.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump works with a CGM sensor to obtain continuous glucose data.&lt;SEP&gt;Pump pairs with a sensor, allowing only one sensor to be paired at a time.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump attempts to locate and pair with the sensor; failures generate alerts.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump integrates a sensor for continuous glucose monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Pump receives glucose readings from the sensor to inform insulin delivery decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sensor pairs with the Pump to transmit glucose data for insulin delivery decisions.</data>
  <data key="d9">data,data acquisition,data exchange,detection,error,hardware,hardware integration,integrates,interface,monitoring,pairing</data>
