<edge source="Sensor" target="SmartGuard Feature">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">SmartGuard requires accurate sensor measurements to calculate insulin dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;The sensor must complete its warm‑up within four hours of the last SG reading to remain in the SmartGuard Feature.&lt;SEP&gt;The suspend‑before‑low feature is unavailable when the SmartGuard feature is enabled on the sensor.&lt;SEP&gt;The glucose sensor supplies data used by the SmartGuard feature.</data>
  <data key="d9">data feed,feature limitation,measurement,requirement,safety,sensor,warm‑up</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d4d222786e6ed163a90874659266c72a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b8de1434b9d9f57cd225b5d3e0d7f3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8741750a7bf86eb5d1fadf82a9c7720e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46d04af5292fae98e3aa651d9cec4512</data>
