<edge source="Glucose" target="Hypoglycemia">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Severe hypoglycemia can be treated with concentrated glucose given intravenously.&lt;SEP&gt;Mild hypoglycemia can be treated with oral glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose is administered orally or intravenously to treat mild and severe hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Mild hypoglycemic episodes are treated with oral glucose.</data>
