<edge source="Continuous Glucose Monitoring" target="COMISAIR Study">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">COMISAIR reported that continuous glucose monitoring had a greater impact on glycaemic outcomes than insulin delivery method.&lt;SEP&gt;The COMISAIR Study found that glycemic outcomes are more affected by continuous glucose monitoring than by insulin delivery method.</data>
