<edge source="Técnica de Aplicação de Insulina" target="Quadro 1">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The technique’s steps for preparing a single insulin type are shown in Quadro 1.</data>
  <data key="d9">documented in,steps</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-fed051c0c90a644e72ac31d765d73a6f</data>
