</edge>
<edge source="Técnica de Aplicação de Insulina" target="Quadro 2">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The technique’s steps for preparing two insulin types are shown in Quadro 2.</data>
  <data key="d9">documented in,steps</data>
