<edge source="Técnica de Aplicação de Insulina" target="Borracha do Frasco de Insulina">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The technique specifies aseptic cleaning of the Borracha do Frasco de Insulina with alcohol.</data>
  <data key="d9">asepsis,preparation</data>
