  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Injection sites are divided into small quadrants to keep injections at least 1 cm apart.</data>
  <data key="d9">site segmentation,spacing</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-da4ea6b1580793801f801a34c92f1905</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786301883</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Local de Aplicação" target="Tecido Subcutâneo">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Each injection location corresponds to an area of subcutaneous tissue.</data>
  <data key="d9">injection site,tissue</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-da4ea6b1580793801f801a34c92f1905</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786301883</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Local de Aplicação" target="Rodízio dos Pontos de Aplicação">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The rotation scheme determines which local de aplicação (injection sites) are used for each injection.</data>
  <data key="d9">rotation,site selection</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-da4ea6b1580793801f801a34c92f1905</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786301885</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Prega Subcutânea" target="Agulha de 4 mm">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The prega subcutânea should be performed when using an agulha de 4 mm in children ≤ 6 years old.</data>
  <data key="d9">technique application</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b64741e11a7d852f462b1269fabfbe43</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Cópia de Técnicas de aplicação de insulina.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786298867</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Prega Subcutânea" target="Dedos (Polegar E Indicador)">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The thumb and index finger are the fingers used to create the subcutaneous pinch before insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d9">instrument,technique</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-e490a7e963a20e2221a8097b50073543</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786300310</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Prega Subcutânea" target="Manual Prático Preparo e Aplicação de Insulina Sem Mistério">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The manual provides the procedure for performing the subcutaneous fold technique.</data>
  <data key="d9">instruction source</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2df359ca3783191b2159f8d3f6ea6c52</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786301088</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Prega Subcutânea" target="Abdômen">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The subcutaneous fold technique is performed on the abdomen to create a pocket for insulin injection.</data>
  <data key="d9">injection site,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2df359ca3783191b2159f8d3f6ea6c52</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786301089</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Prega Subcutânea" target="Gestantes 1º e 2º Trimester">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The subcutaneous fold technique may be used on the abdomen of pregnant people in the first or second trimester.</data>
  <data key="d9">permitted,pregnancy stage</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2df359ca3783191b2159f8d3f6ea6c52</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786301090</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Prega Subcutânea" target="Gestantes 3º Trimester">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Abdominal subcutaneous injection is not recommended for pregnant individuals in the third trimester.</data>
  <data key="d9">pregnancy stage,restriction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2df359ca3783191b2159f8d3f6ea6c52</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/insulinas em seringa.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786301090</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Prega Subcutânea" target="Tecido Subcutâneo">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The subcutaneous fold technique is performed to create space within the subcutaneous tissue for needle insertion.</data>
  <data key="d9">technique,tissue utilization</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-da4ea6b1580793801f801a34c92f1905</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Aplicação de insulina/uso da insulina - Diretrizes-Sociedade-Brasileira-de-Diabetes-2019-2020.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786301882</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Botão Injetor" target="FlexPen®">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The FlexPen® has an injector button that, when pressed, delivers the selected insulin dose.</data>
  <data key="d9">activation,component</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-46f4c578332d81d4fc1ca84bcbc26bd6</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786317684</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Botão Injetor" target="Dose">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Pressing the injector button fully releases the selected insulin dose.</data>
  <data key="d9">activation,delivery</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-46f4c578332d81d4fc1ca84bcbc26bd6</data>
