<edge source="Subcutaneous Injection" target="Abdomen">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">When injected subcutaneously in the abdomen, insulin is absorbed the fastest.&lt;SEP&gt;The abdomen is a permissible site for subcutaneous injection of BASAGLAR.&lt;SEP&gt;Subcutaneous injection of BASAGLAR KWIKPEN can be performed in the abdomen.&lt;SEP&gt;Subcutaneous Injection of APIDRA may be performed in the Abdomen.</data>
