<edge source="HbA1c" target="Lantus®">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Lantus® treatment also led to a reduction in HbA1c values.&lt;SEP&gt;Lantus® reduced mean HbA1c to 6.96% in Study J.&lt;SEP&gt;During treatment, the Lantus® group maintained HbA1c values between 5.9 % and 6.4 %.&lt;SEP&gt;Lantus® lowered mean HbA1c to 6.96% in the trial.&lt;SEP&gt;Lantus® achieved a mean HbA1c reduction comparable to BASAGLAR KWIKPEN in the DM2 study.&lt;SEP&gt;During treatment, HbA1c values with Lantus® ranged from 5.9 % to 6.4 %.</data>
  <data key="d9">biomarker outcome,efficacy,glucose control,glycemic control,outcome,reduction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-89eaf7a8bcccf1ef8657b22ee03b5dd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afc9722167670b0bfeef0b43f4b0df79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a72472938feb27131681a1591081e8c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b916f29e047f8579110cf5da3fd73847&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d648fb4d9a20040dd617a7ca164c9f10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce5998d1ff6a67e2e549405b16f744f</data>
