<edge source="HbA1c" target="Levemir®">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Levemir® was not inferior to Insulin NPH in reducing HbA1c at gestational week 36.&lt;SEP&gt;Adding Levemir® to Liraglutida lowered HbA1c from 7.6% to 7.1% after 52 weeks.&lt;SEP&gt;Levemir® produced HbA1c values comparable to those obtained with NPH.</data>
  <data key="d9">biomarker,comparative efficacy,efficacy,non‑inferiority,reduction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-68b98187c6ab15468f1c0d8f5e7f9f6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42ddf181cf4422a3b24643a2252d99b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3059be019782459a72891cea5e0434ea</data>
