  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">For most individuals with DM1, rapid‑acting insulin analogues are recommended in basal‑bolus regimens to reduce hypoglycemia risk.</data>
  <data key="d9">recommendation,risk reduction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-95c81e7ab8160456d9a63a9e0868205b</data>
