<edge source="Lipodystrophy" target="Lipoatrofia">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Lipoatrofia is a rarer subtype of lipodystrophy characterized by loss of fatty tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;Lipodystrophy may manifest as lipoatrofia, a loss of fat at injection sites.</data>
  <data key="d9">definition,subtype,tissue loss</data>
