<edge source="Lipodystrophy" target="Hyperglycemia">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Repeated insulin injections into areas with lipodystrophy were reported to cause hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Repeated insulin injections in areas with lipodystrophy have been reported to cause hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Repeated insulin injections in areas with lipodystrophy have been reported to result in hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Repeated injections in areas with lipodystrophy have been reported to cause hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Lipodystrophy‑related injection sites can lead to hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Repeated insulin injections causing lipodystrophy can lead to hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Lipodystrophy at injection sites can cause hyperglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">association,causal,cause,complication,hyperglycemia,injection site complication,metabolic effect</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-22df77f7bf817d736d90608e62a11d84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ca13e396b094f0c2f482892f220f538&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2416b3e5e8ebc96cdb451a794fc78e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1245bd9ff75c998b49dab861cc4cebf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-779af610d7298ce98490962cd90b4e76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e622f0079074cd1916470223d22aa66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ac99e7359716e2cecc2ec93159218b6</data>
