<edge source="Bomba De Insulina" target="MEDTRONIC MINIMED MANUAL DEL USUARIO">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The manual provides guidance on insulin‑pump therapy.</data>
  <data key="d9">content</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1fa7ad1de214645f0e643708dc1efab8</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786324279</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba De Insulina" target="SAP">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Bomba De Insulina is a component of the SAP therapy concept.&lt;SEP&gt;SAP combines an insulin pump with sensor data.&lt;SEP&gt;SAP comprises an insulin pump that delivers basal and correction insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;SAP refers to a sensor‑augmented pump mode used with the insulin pump.</data>
  <data key="d9">combines,component,hardware,insulin pump,mode</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-1fa7ad1de214645f0e643708dc1efab8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4d039b786601ed8a06d8adad50938&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da325dc5071cd02bfe55ffc2f9b79aa5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eaa74c3ef8165f52ddf18e17a240a9d</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786324280</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba De Insulina" target="Insulina De Acción Rápida">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Bomba De Insulina supplies small amounts of rapid‑acting insulin every few minutes to meet basal insulin needs.</data>
  <data key="d9">delivery,supply</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-34da912924aa29d035c8cd1c3f4f6ae3</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786324305</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba De Insulina" target="Equipo De Infusión">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The infusion set (Equipo De Infusión) is the part of the pump that delivers insulin to the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The infusion set is a component that connects to the insulin pump for insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump uses an infusion set to deliver insulin to the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump works together with the infusion set equipment to deliver insulin.</data>
  <data key="d9">component,connection,delivery,device,infusion,pump</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-34da912924aa29d035c8cd1c3f4f6ae3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0a4d039b786601ed8a06d8adad50938&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ed0e4c13d1643a77d1d74092a8cda5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fb90cfe4a3993c8a19c8fd291cc4d67</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786324308</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba De Insulina" target="Terapia Con Bomba De Insulina">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Use of the insulin pump constitutes the therapeutic approach known as Terapia Con Bomba De Insulina.&lt;SEP&gt;The therapy method employs an insulin pump to deliver insulin.</data>
  <data key="d9">enables,method,uses</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-34da912924aa29d035c8cd1c3f4f6ae3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da325dc5071cd02bfe55ffc2f9b79aa5</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786324308</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba De Insulina" target="Hipoglucemia">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Studies indicate that pump therapy provides better glucose control with fewer hypoglycemia episodes compared with injections.</data>
  <data key="d9">risk reduction,study</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-34da912924aa29d035c8cd1c3f4f6ae3</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786324309</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba De Insulina" target="Hiperglucemia">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Pump therapy also reduces unexpected hyperglycemia episodes relative to long‑acting insulin injections.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump can deliver correction boluses to lower elevated blood glucose.</data>
  <data key="d9">insulin delivery,risk reduction,study,treatment</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-34da912924aa29d035c8cd1c3f4f6ae3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ed0e4c13d1643a77d1d74092a8cda5a</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786324311</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba De Insulina" target="Páncreas">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The pump delivers insulin in a manner that closely imitates the natural secretion pattern of the pancreas.</data>
  <data key="d9">function,mimicry</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-34da912924aa29d035c8cd1c3f4f6ae3</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786324312</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba De Insulina" target="Insulina Bolus">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Bomba De Insulina can deliver insulin in bolus doses to manage carbohydrate intake.</data>
  <data key="d9">bolus,delivery</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-34da912924aa29d035c8cd1c3f4f6ae3</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
