  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba De Insulina" target="Índice Basal Temporal">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The pump includes a temporal basal index function that can be configured for temporary insulin adjustments.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump enables temporary basal rate adjustments for activity periods.</data>
  <data key="d9">basal control,configuration,feature,function</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-34da912924aa29d035c8cd1c3f4f6ae3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cbaec668e54aa5cf462a7bd08d7813c</data>
