  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">MiniMed™ is the specific insulin pump model that implements the Bomba de Insulina device.&lt;SEP&gt;MiniMed™ is a specific insulin‑pump model that functions as a Bomba De Insulina.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump is represented by the MiniMed™ model.</data>
