<edge source="Subcutaneous Fold" target="Children Under 6 Years">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Subcutaneous fold is recommended for children under six years even with short needles.&lt;SEP&gt;Children under six are advised to use the subcutaneous fold even when using short needles.</data>
  <data key="d9">necessity,recommendation,recommended technique</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-35a8ffab5eb63600b93fb2c67160b5ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473</data>
