</edge>
<edge source="Subcutaneous Fold" target="Adolescents">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Adolescents may require a subcutaneous fold due to low subcutaneous fat.&lt;SEP&gt;Adolescents with low subcutaneous fat should apply the subcutaneous fold before injection.</data>
  <data key="d9">necessity,recommendation,recommended technique</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-35a8ffab5eb63600b93fb2c67160b5ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473</data>
