</edge>
<edge source="Subcutaneous Fold" target="Pregnant Women">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Pregnant women should consider using a subcutaneous fold for safe insulin injection.&lt;SEP&gt;Pregnant women are advised to use the subcutaneous fold for safety during insulin injection.&lt;SEP&gt;In pregnant women, the subcutaneous fold should be used regardless of needle length, preferably with a 4 mm needle.</data>
  <data key="d9">pregnancy,recommendation,recommended technique,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-35a8ffab5eb63600b93fb2c67160b5ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-708e3c514f667dc9979cfa8df875e473&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74b3171b97fd80965359afadc0af9312</data>
