<edge source="Hypoglycemia" target="Alcohol">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Alcohol consumption can induce hypoglycemia in patients using insulin such as BASAGLAR.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcohol consumption can cause hypoglycemia in patients using BASAGLAR KWIKPEN.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcohol consumption may cause hypoglycemia in insulin users.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcohol consumption may induce hypoglycemia in users of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcohol influences the hypoglycemic effect of insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Excessive alcohol consumption can precipitate hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Alcohol inhibits hepatic glucose release, causing a gradual decline in blood glucose that may lead to hypoglycemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">adverse effect,cause,consumption effect,effect modulation,glucose reduction,inhibition,interaction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-3db0edd23b6b502ccbbf62bfd601ce68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d96761d60c65f05f1530bc19b144cf1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ce520f0fe7dc4a6c79f92a25dfaff19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd94288932ad6675a1de2b46b3fd9128&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cedd8e88a8d35eade68ce02222b9e276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e622f0079074cd1916470223d22aa66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab7cedc48ea8fdd199a2c12c99416a0</data>
