<edge source="Hypoglycemia" target="Neuroglicopenia">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Severe hypoglycemia can cause neuroglicopenia, a neurological deficit due to low glucose.&lt;SEP&gt;Low glucose levels during hypoglycemia lead to neuroglycopenic symptoms.</data>
