<edge source="Hypoglycemia" target="Elderly Patients">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hypoglycemia may be difficult to recognize in elderly patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Elderly patients may find it difficult to recognize hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;In elderly patients hypoglycemia caused by APIDRA SOLOSTAR can be difficult to recognize.</data>
