  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Severe hypoglycemia is a more extreme form of hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Severe hypoglycemia is a serious form of hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Severe hypoglycemia is an extreme form of hypoglycemia.</data>
