<edge source="Hypoglycemia" target="APIDRA">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">APIDRA can cause severe hypoglycemia, potentially leading to loss of consciousness.&lt;SEP&gt;APIDRA can cause hypoglycemia, especially when the dose is too high.&lt;SEP&gt;APIDRA treatment was associated with low hypoglycemia event rates (0.02 events/month/patient) in the study.</data>
  <data key="d9">adverse effect,adverse events,adverse reaction,risk,safety</data>
