<edge source="Hypoglycemia" target="Fiasp®">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Because of its distinct time‑action profile, Fiasp® can cause hypoglycemia earlier after injection compared with other prandial insulins.&lt;SEP&gt;Fiasp® injections in skin areas with reactions can lead to delayed insulin absorption and increase the risk of hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Hypoglycemia is the most frequently reported adverse reaction during Fiasp® treatment.</data>
  <data key="d9">adverse effect,adverse reaction,frequency,injection site,risk,timing</data>
