<edge source="Hypoglycemia" target="Levemir®">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Excessive Levemir® dose, missed meals, or unplanned exercise can cause hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Hypoglycemia is the most frequently reported adverse reaction to Levemir®, occurring when insulin dose exceeds need.</data>
  <data key="d9">adverse effect,adverse reaction,frequency,overdose</data>
