</edge>
<edge source="Hypoglycemia" target="Human Insulin">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Human insulin can cause hypoglycemia as a frequent adverse reaction.&lt;SEP&gt;Human insulin administration may cause hypoglycemia as a frequent adverse reaction.</data>
