<edge source="Hypoglycemia" target="Intensive Glycemic Control">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Intensive glycemic control increases the risk of hypoglycemia, especially in type 1 diabetes and polypharmacy contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;Intensive glycemic control increases the risk of hypoglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Intensive glycemic control was associated with a significantly higher likelihood of severe hypoglycemia in trial participants.</data>
