<edge source="Hyperglycemia" target="Insulin Injection into Nodule">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Injecting insulin directly into a lipohypertrophic nodule reduces its effectiveness and can raise post‑meal blood sugar.</data>
