<edge source="Hyperglycemia" target="Localized Cutaneous Amyloidosis">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Repeated insulin injections in areas with localized cutaneous amyloidosis have been reported to cause hyperglycemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Repeated insulin injections into amyloid‑affected skin areas have been associated with hyperglycemia.</data>
