</edge>
<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes" target="Monogenic Polyglandular Autoimmune Syndromes">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">These syndromes, including IPEX and AIRE‑related forms, are genetically associated with Type 1 Diabetes.</data>
