  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hypertension enhances the risk of developing type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Hypertension is commonly associated with type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Hypertension is identified as a risk factor for incident Type 2 Diabetes.</data>
