<edge source="Type 2 Diabetes" target="Obesity">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Obesity is linked to a higher probability of developing type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Obesity increases the risk of developing type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;The ongoing epidemic of obesity has led to an increase in Type 2 Diabetes among people of reproductive age.</data>
  <data key="d9">metabolic,prevalence,risk factor</data>
