  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Gestational diabetes mellitus is a risk factor for developing type 2 diabetes later.&lt;SEP&gt;Gestational diabetes mellitus confers a markedly increased risk for later development of type 2 diabetes in the mother after delivery.</data>
