<edge source="Cetonas" target="Plan De Emergencia Para CAD">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A positive ketone test triggers the CAD emergency plan provided by the medical team.&lt;SEP&gt;The emergency plan for CAD includes testing for ketones when appropriate.</data>
  <data key="d9">emergency,protocol,testing</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-817893fc39ccf7551d476cefaf7f32ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fb90cfe4a3993c8a19c8fd291cc4d67</data>
