<edge source="Glucose Sensor" target="Continuous Glucose Monitoring (CGM)">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">CGM technology relies on a subcutaneous glucose sensor to capture interstitial glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;CGM employs a glucose sensor to measure interstitial glucose continuously.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous Glucose Monitoring employs a glucose sensor positioned in interstitial tissue.&lt;SEP&gt;The glucose sensor is a hardware component required for Continuous Glucose Monitoring to function.</data>
  <data key="d9">component,device,employs,method,technology</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b6828aacfba0c2a6ae59c439a4e4b161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cceea4f7036977c7ddcbe81f76f8aa1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94150b57cc35a773b7c36f33f237f8a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d83801272f7a0ae0d797d60572fe578</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/DOC Completo.docx&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/cgm.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786370141</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Glucose Sensor" target="Interstitial Fluid">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The glucose sensor measures glucose concentration directly in the interstitial fluid beneath the skin.&lt;SEP&gt;The sensor measures glucose in the interstitial fluid.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose Sensor measures glucose levels in the Interstitial Fluid.&lt;SEP&gt;The glucose sensor measures glucose concentration in the interstitial fluid between cells.&lt;SEP&gt;The glucose sensor measures glucose concentration in the interstitial fluid beneath the skin.</data>
  <data key="d9">location,measurement,measures in,physiology</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b6828aacfba0c2a6ae59c439a4e4b161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cceea4f7036977c7ddcbe81f76f8aa1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6025fa711665988fad0f789b9eb901a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08c7f7bb0209cabd75e27f9c8556c214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-545c19428427ece2c838e352e759e388</data>
