<edge source="Patient" target="Doctor">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The (Doctor, Patient) relationship encompasses a bidirectional flow of medical information and guidance centered on diabetes management. Doctors are responsible for providing patients with detailed instructions on insulin therapy, including Humalog dosing, glucose monitoring, dose adjustments, and strategies for preventing and treating hypoglycemia. They also advise patients on the frequency of blood‑glucose checks, how to modify insulin pump settings, and the appropriate use of continuous glucose monitoring sensors.

Patients, in turn, are expected to communicate any adverse reactions to Humalog, report suspected episodes of hypoglycemia or hyperglycemia, and disclose any intercurrent illnesses or conditions that could affect their diabetes control. They should also seek the doctor’s counsel before undertaking activities that might impact their regimen, such as traveling across time zones, and discuss any desired treatment adjustments or sensor‑related concerns. This collaborative exchange ensures that therapeutic decisions are continuously tailored to the patient’s evolving health status.</data>
  <data key="d9">advice,communication,comorbidities,consultation,consults,guidance,instruction,medical advice,monitoring,reporting</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-e89f1dbae629e925f06732cebf41df16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3daabbd42055dc30154f5f97c85fb7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffb10c00517fa772be2ca9a42f497edf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd396c45bc09fb646d156b4e69d328e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2f8a0d67f7320d6157b61dbbf428a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f18f20af642d4a480c16e7a6780bb6</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/Bula Humalog.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/LANTUS _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/CGM/Documento sem título.docx</data>
  <data key="d12">1786333923</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
