<edge source="Abdômen" target="Gestante">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">During the first two trimesters, a pregnant person may safely inject insulin into the abdomen.&lt;SEP&gt;During the third trimester, a pregnant person should not inject insulin into the abdomen.</data>
  <data key="d9">contraindicated,first two trimesters,permitted,third trimester</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-e490a7e963a20e2221a8097b50073543</data>
