<edge source="Injection Site Rotation" target="Injection Site Reactions">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Rotating the injection site continuously reduces the risk of local reactions such as pain, redness, and edema.&lt;SEP&gt;Rotating injection sites helps reduce or prevent injection site reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Rotating injection sites continuously helps reduce or prevent injection‑site reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Continuous rotation of injection sites helps reduce injection site reactions.</data>
