</edge>
<edge source="Injection Site Rotation" target="Cutaneous Amyloidosis">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Rotating injection sites lowers the chance of cutaneous amyloidosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Rotating injection sites continuously reduces the risk of cutaneous amyloidosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Injecting in varied locations reduces the chance of cutaneous amyloidosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Injection‑site rotation helps prevent cutaneous amyloidosis.</data>
  <data key="d9">prevention,preventive practice,skin health,technique,tissue health,tissue reaction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-6d0f18c80f8de2dee960a03599d12052&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14772c7de5db762c492a75a1c744dae6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a6f9e10c0d4af5fff0338eb861f9c86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acaa1440ae268669e1894588bb9e37c2</data>
