<edge source="Humulin R" target="Human Insulin">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Humulin R contains human insulin produced by recombinant technology.&lt;SEP&gt;Humulin R is a solution that provides human insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Humulin R is classified as a formulation of human insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;No studies have examined the effects of mixing Humulin R with human insulin from other manufacturers.</data>
