<edge source="Lantus" target="Insulin Glargina">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Lantus refers to the insulin glargine formulation mentioned in the medication leaflet.&lt;SEP&gt;Lantus contains insulin glargina as its active ingredient.&lt;SEP&gt;Lantus is the brand name of insulin glargina, a long‑acting recombinant human insulin analogue.</data>
