<edge source="Apidra" target="Insulina Humana Regular">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Both Apidra and Insulina Humana Regular produce equivalent hypoglycemic effects when given intravenously.&lt;SEP&gt;Apidra exhibits a more rapid onset of action compared with Insulina Humana Regular.&lt;SEP&gt;Apidra’s duration of activity is shorter than that of Insulina Humana Regular.</data>
  <data key="d9">duration,equipotent,hypoglycemic potency,onset speed,pharmacodynamics</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f46c503a378e6c69618036a038672417</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786315534</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Apidra" target="Estudo Clínico">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The clinical study evaluated Apidra against Insulina Humana Regular in Diabetes Tipo 1 patients.</data>
  <data key="d9">clinical comparison,evaluation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f46c503a378e6c69618036a038672417</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786315534</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Apidra" target="Figura 1">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Figura 1 shows the six‑hour hypoglycemic effect of Apidra under different meal timing conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 1 depicts the six‑hour hypoglycemic effect of Apidra administered before or after a meal compared with regular insulin.</data>
  <data key="d9">effect,efficacy,illustration,visualization</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f46c503a378e6c69618036a038672417&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b65ee62ad12239ddc729c50a1aef854c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786315535</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Apidra" target="Apidra Pré-Refeição">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Apidra Pré‑Refeição is a specific pre‑meal dosing schedule of Apidra.</data>
  <data key="d9">dosing regimen</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f46c503a378e6c69618036a038672417</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf</data>
