  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Asparagine at position A21 of human insulin is replaced in insulin glargine.&lt;SEP&gt;In Insulina Glargina, the asparagine originally at position A21 in Insulina Humana is replaced.</data>
  <data key="d9">replacement,substitution</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-02780a8bc1d372cc47e0ccf2eaab1a99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a279eef99c9c70338c74ffc7b4e260e</data>
