<edge source="Insulina Glargina" target="Insuficiência Hepática">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin glargina dose may need adjustment in patients with hepatic insufficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Severe hepatic insufficiency can lower the insulin needs for patients using Insulina Glargina.&lt;SEP&gt;Hepatic insufficiency can decrease insulin glargina needs due to reduced gluconeogenesis and insulin metabolism.</data>
  <data key="d9">dose adjustment,dose requirement,hepatic insufficiency,metabolism,reduces requirement,reduction</data>
