<edge source="Insulina Glargina" target="Camundongos">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulina Glargina was administered intravenously and subcutaneously to camundongos to assess acute toxicity.&lt;SEP&gt;Repeated subcutaneous doses of insulin glargina were given to camundongos to evaluate chronic toxicity.&lt;SEP&gt;Two‑year carcinogenicity studies of insulin glargina in camundongos showed no increased cancer risk.</data>
  <data key="d9">acute toxicity,carcinogenicity,chronic toxicity,testing</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d99841fd6d1e1fbf23f184e202bc760e</data>
