<edge source="Insulina Glargina" target="Coelhos">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Local tolerance studies in rabbits showed no adverse risk from subcutaneous, intramuscular, intravenous or paravenous insulin glargina administration.&lt;SEP&gt;Immunogenicity studies in coelhos indicated insulin glargina has similar or lower immune response than human insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;In rabbit studies, insulin glargina caused maternal hypoglycemic shock and intra‑uterine deaths.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina Glargina was not embryotoxic nor teratogenic in rabbit embryotoxicity studies.</data>
