<edge source="Infusion Set" target="Tubing">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Tubing is the component that forms part of the infusion set connecting the reservoir to the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The infusion set includes tubing that carries insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Tubing links the infusion set to the cannula.&lt;SEP&gt;Tubing is part of the infusion set that transports medication.&lt;SEP&gt;Infusion Set includes Tubing that connects to the Reservoir.</data>
