<edge source="Infusion Set" target="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pump delivers insulin through the infusion set.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump’s delivery system includes an infusion set.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump connects to an infusion set to deliver insulin into the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Infusion Set is attached to the MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump to deliver insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump connects to an infusion set for insulin delivery to the body.</data>
  <data key="d9">component,connect,connection,delivery,delivery system,insulin delivery</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-83bb94d08bdb958eff25f76c9a6ac18a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0267d2986a48c4c31790b6f183277dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a01dc8dc15b92e2b0b570753b0f57632&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a764dcbdd73fd1c50fa72a7cd60b6e19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcea1ff62aae96936f552880e96faa69</data>
