  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The infusion set user guide provides the recommended duration of use for the infusion set.&lt;SEP&gt;The infusion set user guide offers step‑by‑step directions for inserting and managing the infusion set.&lt;SEP&gt;The infusion set user guide is referenced for instructions on disconnecting and reconnecting the infusion set.</data>
