<edge source="Insulin Lispro" target="Human Insulin">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin lispro is an analog of human insulin, sharing molecular structure with specific amino‑acid inversions.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin lispro is absorbed more rapidly than human insulin after subcutaneous injection.&lt;SEP&gt;The volume of distribution of insulin lispro is identical to that of human insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin lispro was compared with human insulin, which showed similar safety regarding carcinogenesis and mutagenesis.</data>
  <data key="d9">absorption,analog,comparison,distribution,equivalent,faster,safety,similarity</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-bf25fca295be60e28b7c7d3103f722fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2416b3e5e8ebc96cdb451a794fc78e3</data>
