<edge source="Insulina Humana Regular" target="Insulina Glulisina">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulina Glulisina shows absorption roughly twice as fast and a peak concentration about twice that of Insulina Humana Regular.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina Glulisina reaches a maximum concentration of about 82 µUI/mL, roughly double that of Insulina Humana Regular.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina Glulisina is absorbed approximately twice as fast as Insulina Humana Regular.</data>
  <data key="d9">Cmax,absorption,absorption rate,pharmacokinetics</data>
