<edge source="Insulin Aspart (Novorapid®)" target="Preclinical Safety Data">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Preclinical studies revealed no special danger for humans from insulin aspart based on repeated‑dose toxicity, genotoxicity, and reproductive toxicity tests.</data>
