</edge>
<edge source="Insulin Aspart (Novorapid®)" target="IGF-1 Receptor">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin aspart exhibits similar dissociation from the IGF‑1 receptor as observed with human insulin in laboratory assays.</data>
