<edge source="Sistema VigiMed" target="Anvisa">
  <data key="d7">10.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Anvisa – Sistema VigiMed  

Sistema VigiMed is the adverse‑event reporting platform that is operated and provided by Brazil’s national health regulator, the Agência Nacional de Vigilância Sanitária (Anvisa). Under the authority of Anvisa, the system serves as the official mechanism for health professionals, patients, and other stakeholders to submit notifications of adverse events related to medicines, health products, and related treatments.  

The platform is publicly accessible through the Anvisa website, allowing users to report adverse events directly via the agency’s portal. By facilitating these notifications, Sistema VigiMed supports Anvisa’s pharmacovigilance activities, enabling the regulator to monitor safety signals, conduct risk assessments, and take appropriate regulatory actions to protect public health.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration,governance,method,operation,oversight,portal,provides,regulation,regulator,regulatory,reporting,reporting system</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f9e5c50e8a808c537075377966ae2ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-072d97721eef045503ec1dce0363b58e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef35bd45e4ba8d20f4e9181011ccfcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aca0b919135813e1d5b772face36989d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e7689ca0fc736d9eae94256f73fed52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-922791f49d1bf928fe4f02ddd336927b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d01ed6a801b11c1b53f4668059c1f9cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f2714936869e55e840f5294caefeaee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-786395f3716fb61a79fd183c63e1a9d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7ca732691e1cbcafd65e378b8d80144</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/NOVORAPID _ BulasMed.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_1778357531609.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786318592</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
