<edge source="Tiazolidinediones" target="Congestive Heart Failure">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Use of tiazolidinediones together with insulin, including NovoRapid®, has been reported to cause congestive heart failure.&lt;SEP&gt;Use of tiazolidinediones together with insulin has been reported to cause congestive heart failure.&lt;SEP&gt;Use of tiazolidinediones together with insulin has been associated with cases of congestive heart failure.&lt;SEP&gt;Combination of tiazolidinediones with insulin has been associated with cases of congestive heart failure.</data>
