<edge source="Lantus®" target="BASAGLAR">
  <data key="d7">6.0</data>
  <data key="d8">BASAGLAR and Lantus® showed similar reductions in HbA1c over 24 weeks.&lt;SEP&gt;BASAGLAR demonstrated non‑inferior HbA1c reduction compared with Lantus® in the trial.&lt;SEP&gt;Clinical studies indicate Lantus® and BASAGLAR have equal potency when given at the same dose.&lt;SEP&gt;BASAGLAR and Lantus® demonstrated similar pharmacokinetic profiles and a biodisponibilidade ratio close to 1 (AUC 0‑24 within 0.8‑1.25).&lt;SEP&gt;BASAGLAR was directly compared with Lantus® in phase 3 clinical studies to assess safety and adverse reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Clinical studies found no significant differences between BASAGLAR and Lantus® in the occurrence of local or systemic allergic reactions and in antibody production levels.</data>
  <data key="d9">HbA1c,allergic reactions,antibody production,biodisponibilidade,clinical comparison,comparative efficacy,comparison,efficacy,equipotent,non‑inferiority,pharmacokinetic equivalence</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-afc9722167670b0bfeef0b43f4b0df79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22df77f7bf817d736d90608e62a11d84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c078e8c2861146fb455f1dc3d4af2456&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c580ebfc111aa29796af1a6f15941c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f14ce019f10c2a88765380143498ba5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a279eef99c9c70338c74ffc7b4e260e</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Basaglar.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786310065</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
