<edge source="Lantus®" target="BASAGLAR KWIKPEN">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">BASAGLAR KWIKPEN was developed as a biosimilar product comparable to Lantus®.&lt;SEP&gt;BASAGLAR KWIKPEN was compared with Lantus® as the active comparator in the clinical trial.&lt;SEP&gt;BASAGLAR KWIKPEN was compared with Lantus® as the active comparator in the DM2 trial.&lt;SEP&gt;BASAGLAR KWIKPEN demonstrated pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic profiles similar to those of Lantus®.&lt;SEP&gt;Conversion from Lantus® to BASAGLAR KWIKPEN is performed on a 1:1 unit basis, maintaining the same dose.&lt;SEP&gt;BASAGLAR KWIKPEN was directly compared with Lantus® in clinical studies of insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Phase 3 clinical studies comparing BASAGLAR KWIKPEN and Lantus® found similar frequencies and severities of adverse reactions.</data>
