</edge>
<edge source="Retinopatia Diabética" target="Levemir®">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A sudden drop in glucose after starting Levemir® can temporarily worsen diabetic retinopathy, while sustained control lowers long‑term progression risk.</data>
  <data key="d9">adverse reaction,temporal</data>
