<edge source="Hipoglicemia Noturna" target="Toujeo 300 U/mL">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Toujeo 300 U/mL demonstrated a lower rate of nocturnal hypoglycemia compared with Insulina Glargina 100 U/mL.</data>
  <data key="d9">efficacy,risk reduction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-78f859befb6230d94e8af9144794e0d9</data>
