  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Continuous glucose monitoring is an ally in preventing nocturnal hypoglycemia due to its easy reading and trend arrows.</data>
  <data key="d9">monitoring,prevention</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-6f645bd7019e94151caaff47d6cbfcaf</data>
