<edge source="Insulin Glargine" target="Toujeo 300 U/mL">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Toujeo 300 U/mL contains insulin glargine equivalent to 300 units of human insulin per milliliter.&lt;SEP&gt;After subcutaneous injection, Toujeo forms a precipitate that continuously releases small amounts of insulin glargine.&lt;SEP&gt;Toujeo 300 U/mL includes insulin glargine as its active pharmaceutical ingredient.&lt;SEP&gt;Toujeo 300 U/mL is a formulation of insulin glargine.</data>
  <data key="d9">composition,equivalence,formulation,formulation behavior,sustained release</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-afc28422755c2c44f931bab7b6a2b477&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93623071acdcd0ba060c8826ab5a2a81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78b302b74d715df9c3b9e9db38fa4c64</data>
