<edge source="Insulina Humana" target="Carcinogênese">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Human insulin has been mentioned as potentially associated with carcinogenic effects in animal studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulina humana did not cause carcinogenic effects in studies.</data>
  <data key="d9">carcinogenesis,non-carcinogenic,potential risk,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-a247846b9ec5d44d0bcbe6c5f15599f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbe87fd92ad66dcb02b25b669d829f6c</data>
