<edge source="Insulin Humana Regular" target="Insulin Glulisina">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin glulisina reaches its maximum concentration at 55 minutes, whereas regular human insulin reaches it at 82 minutes.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin glulisina is absorbed approximately twice as fast as regular human insulin after subcutaneous injection.&lt;SEP&gt;The peak concentration (Cmax) of insulin glulisina is about two times higher than that of regular human insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;The mean residence time of insulin glulisina (98 min) is shorter than that of regular human insulin (161 min).</data>
  <data key="d9">Cmax,Tmax,absorption,concentration,pharmacokinetics,rate,residence time,timing</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b65ee62ad12239ddc729c50a1aef854c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_apidra.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786315539</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
