<edge source="Insulin Humana Regular" target="APIDRA">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">APIDRA administered pre‑meal was compared with Insulin Humana Regular given 30–45 minutes before meals.&lt;SEP&gt;APIDRA administered post‑meal was compared with Insulin Humana Regular given before meals.&lt;SEP&gt;APIDRA is eliminated more rapidly subcutaneously than insulin regular, with half‑lives of 42 min versus 86 min.&lt;SEP&gt;APIDRA and insulin regular display similar distribution and elimination profiles following intravenous dosing.&lt;SEP&gt;Mammary tumor rates in rats receiving APIDRA were reported as similar to those observed with regular human insulin.</data>
  <data key="d9">comparison,faster elimination,pharmacokinetic similarity,post‑meal,pre‑meal,subcutaneous,tumor incidence</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-29710f08f3e10bba4a464e8b4da1917c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee2684edaea64aa597fd29c3bbda611d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50719bcc88f4515ec825b9d5a7aba107</data>
