<edge source="Intensive Insulin Therapy" target="Diabetes Control and Complications Trial">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The DCCT demonstrated that intensive insulin therapy reduces microvascular complications compared with conventional therapy.</data>
