<edge source="Toujeo 300/mL" target="Fasting Plasma Glucose">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Toujeo 300/mL produced a similar reduction in fasting plasma glucose as Insulina Glargina 100 U/mL.</data>
