<edge source="Toujeo 300 U/mL" target="Insulina Glargina 100 U/mL">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Toujeo 300 U/mL was directly compared to Insulina Glargina 100 U/mL in the clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;Switching from Insulina Glargina 100 U/mL to Toujeo may require a 10‑18% higher Toujeo dose to reach target glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Switching from Toujeo 300 U/mL to Insulina Glargina 100 U/mL may allow a ~20% dose reduction to lower hypoglycaemia risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Toujeo 300 U/mL and Insulina Glargina 100 U/mL are not bioequivalent and are not directly interchangeable.</data>
  <data key="d9">10‑18%,comparison,dose increase,dose reduction,interchangeability,non‑bioequivalent,treatment,~20%</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-78f859befb6230d94e8af9144794e0d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56fb3d61e8c32af5d6b8be06cc54f904</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_Toujeo.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786313808</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
