<edge source="Toujeo (Insulin Glargine)" target="Global Cancer Incidence">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Treatment with Toujeo did not produce a statistically significant difference in global cancer incidence compared with standard therapy.</data>
