  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">In patients aged ≥65 years, efficacy and safety of Toujeo 300 U/mL were comparable to those of insulin glargine 100 U/mL.</data>
  <data key="d9">efficacy,subgroup analysis</data>
