<edge source="Coelhos" target="APIDRA">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">At 1.5 UI/kg per day, APIDRA caused skeletal defects, increased post‑implantation loss, and mortality in rabbits.&lt;SEP&gt;APIDRA was administered subcutaneously to pregnant rabbits throughout gestation at up to 1.5 UI/kg per day.&lt;SEP&gt;APIDRA did not produce embryofetal toxic effects in rabbits at low doses.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration,adverse effects,safety,study,teratogenicity,toxicity</data>
