</edge>
<edge source="APIDRA SOLOSTAR" target="Betablockers">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Betablockers can both potentiate and weaken the hypoglycemic effect of APIDRA SOLOSTAR.</data>
  <data key="d9">bidirectional effect,interaction</data>
