</edge>
<edge source="A1C" target="HbS Variant">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Heterozygosity for the HbS variant lowers A1C by approximately 0.3 percentage points compared with individuals without the trait.</data>
  <data key="d9">genetic effect,reduction</data>
