<edge source="Continuous Subcutaneous Insulin Infusion (CSII)" target="Fiasp®">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Fiasp® was administered to participants through the CSII system.&lt;SEP&gt;The time to reach 50 % of Cmax during CSII is 35 minutes shorter when using Fiasp® compared with NovoRapid®.&lt;SEP&gt;In a CSII setting, the onset of insulin exposure is 26 minutes shorter with Fiasp® than with NovoRapid®.</data>
