<edge source="Fiasp®" target="FlexTouch®">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">FlexTouch® is a pre‑filled injection system designed to deliver Fiasp® insulin aspart.&lt;SEP&gt;Fiasp® is marketed alongside the FlexTouch® pen device in the professional labeling.&lt;SEP&gt;FlexTouch® is a pen device used for delivering Fiasp®.&lt;SEP&gt;Fiasp® is available in a FlexTouch® pen delivery device.&lt;SEP&gt;FlexTouch® is used as a pen device to deliver Fiasp® insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;FlexTouch® pen is designed for delivering Fiasp® insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Fiasp® is administered using the FlexTouch® insulin delivery system.</data>
  <data key="d9">administration device,compatibility,delivery,delivery device,delivery system,device,formulation,product family</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2f4f01a72f35d6db3ff333e64f8400ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f85d0ab4cfadc905544cb9e30752dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb9ea85b9ad8cd6940ae41a3ab5d1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88b97cde53943160602b20f634ba5c1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d10a1f849386df540104c79e33a7b242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09d60e0b850d87c77dd67ca2d709912c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8c7e36686d077dcb6239405f60ea031</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786316204</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Fiasp®" target="Penfill®">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Fiasp® and Penfill® are linked through a dedicated insulin‑delivery system in which Penfill® functions as the companion cartridge and accessory for administering Fiasp® insulin aspart. Penfill® is described as a refill cartridge device that integrates with the Fiasp® pen, serving as the primary mechanism to load, fill, and dispense the insulin. It is marketed as a disposable, refill‑type cartridge that can be inserted into compatible Fiasp® pens, effectively forming part of the overall delivery system for the medication.

The Penfill® unit is also characterized as a pen‑needle accessory, providing a ready‑to‑use format for delivering Fiasp® insulin. It operates as a refill accessory noted in Fiasp® documentation, allowing users to replenish the pen with a sealed cartridge that contains the insulin dose. In practice, Penfill® enables both the filling of the pen and the actual injection of Fiasp® insulin, representing an alternative delivery format and a convenient, single‑use cartridge solution within the Fiasp® insulin therapy regimen.</data>
  <data key="d9">accessory,administration device,cartridge,delivery,delivery device,delivery system,device,filling,formulation,medication packaging,product family,refill cartridge,refill device,refill system</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2f4f01a72f35d6db3ff333e64f8400ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f85d0ab4cfadc905544cb9e30752dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb9ea85b9ad8cd6940ae41a3ab5d1fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14772c7de5db762c492a75a1c744dae6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff211ed5ca723fa2074871af58a4eb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88b97cde53943160602b20f634ba5c1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d10a1f849386df540104c79e33a7b242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a7ca48868f79f7be782198d67ffefd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09d60e0b850d87c77dd67ca2d709912c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8c7e36686d077dcb6239405f60ea031&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fdc648ec086061141581e27adde6fc4</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_fiasp.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786316231</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
