  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Levemir®" target="GLP-1 Receptor Agonist">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">When added to Levemir®, a GLP-1 receptor agonist requires a 20% reduction in Levemir® dose.&lt;SEP&gt;Levemir® can be combined with GLP-1 receptor agonists for type 2 diabetes treatment.</data>
  <data key="d9">combination therapy,dose reduction,interaction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-56fc1d5df1b34d9120c3cf8a760c40f9</data>
