<edge source="Insuficiência Cardíaca Congestiva" target="Tiazolidinedionas">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Using tiazolidinedionas together with insulin has been reported to increase the risk of insuficiência cardíaca congestiva.&lt;SEP&gt;Tiazolidinedionas should be discontinued if symptoms of insuficiência cardíaca congestiva worsen.&lt;SEP&gt;Using tiazolidinedionas together with insulin has been reported to increase the risk of congestive heart failure.&lt;SEP&gt;Use of tiazolidinedionas, especially with insulin, has been reported to cause congestive heart failure.&lt;SEP&gt;When combined with insulinas, tiazolidinedionas have been linked to cases of congestive heart failure.</data>
  <data key="d9">adverse effect,cardiovascular risk,cause,combination therapy,discontinuation recommendation,drug interaction,risk</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-9bcc4202330d45ebfca8f79c3d4998b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6101c469482b48e341b4095a54907fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0851222a21a012cffce7a16710847208&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba6b31518be6fff1db8b68a28e82f200</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_levemir.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular novonordiks.pdf</data>
