<edge source="Insulina Humana Biossintética" target="Insulina Bovina">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">When administered before night, IHB yielded higher pre‑dinner glucose (11.6 mmol/L) than bovine insulin (10.0 mmol/L).&lt;SEP&gt;Both treatments resulted in equal average glucose concentration, modified M index, and total daily insulin need.&lt;SEP&gt;Fasting glucose was greater with IHB (14.2 mmol/L) than with bovine insulin (12.8 mmol/L).</data>
  <data key="d9">equivalence,fasting glucose,glucose concentration,higher,insulin dose,pre‑dinner glucose</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d29256dbc41e0c81e974f018d373c72d</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786319786</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulina Humana Biossintética" target="Insulina Suína">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">IHB produced slightly higher average glucose (9.7 vs 9.0 mmol/L) and higher modified M index (79.6 vs 65.0) than porcine insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Fasting glucose was greater with IHB (12.1 mmol/L) than with porcine insulin (9.6 mmol/L).</data>
  <data key="d9">fasting glucose,glucose concentration,higher,higher; modified M index</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d29256dbc41e0c81e974f018d373c72d</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786319787</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulina Humana Biossintética" target="Hipoglicêmicos Episódios">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The IHB group experienced fewer hypoglycemic episodes than the animal‑insulin groups.</data>
  <data key="d9">hypoglycemia,reduced frequency</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d29256dbc41e0c81e974f018d373c72d</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786319787</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Insulina Humana Biossintética" target="Diferenças Na Farmacocinética Da IHB">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Pharmacokinetic differences of IHB are proposed to underlie the observed glucose response variations.</data>
  <data key="d9">glucose response,pharmacokinetics</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-d29256dbc41e0c81e974f018d373c72d</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/Bulas/bula_regular.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786319788</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
