</edge>
<edge source="Hipoglucemia" target="Bolus Wizard">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Improper use of Bolus Wizard may cause excessive insulin delivery leading to hipoglucemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Wizard may suggest administering more insulin than needed, potentially causing Hipoglucemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">low blood sugar,overdosage,risk</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-8aa63853b30ac5d214c8cd80df90e517&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5863810bebfd1be64b8af80afcd57e11</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786322894</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hipoglucemia" target="Bomba">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">If the Bomba delivers excessive Insulina, it may cause Hipoglucemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">risk,side effect</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-8aa63853b30ac5d214c8cd80df90e517</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786322895</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hipoglucemia" target="Parar Bolus">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Interrupting a bolus may result in insufficient insulin, potentially causing hipoglucemia.</data>
  <data key="d9">low blood sugar,risk</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5863810bebfd1be64b8af80afcd57e11</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786322935</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hipoglucemia" target="Autoapagado">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Autoapagado is intended to protect users who may not respond to hypoglycemia by halting insulin delivery after a period of inactivity.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoapagado provides protection against Hipoglucemia by stopping insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d9">hypoglycemia protection,protection,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5a3c673db465ff57a023abf1cd26053&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc1b97c88d050500f2b90b8837bd34bd</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786325721</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hipoglucemia" target="Glucagón">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Glucagón is administered to treat severe Hipoglucemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucagón is administered to treat hypoglycemia when the patient cannot eat or drink.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucagon prevents episodes of hypoglycemia by raising blood glucose.</data>
  <data key="d9">emergency,prevention,regulation,treatment,treats</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-644dc086af7b196cc5bc332524608d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-310d06ee583c6aa24af77816642d0ba7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a717b5a81dbba0bd3cf2aae23dc0e309</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/41d0f4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786324247</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hipoglucemia" target="Regla 15‑15">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
