  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A basal pattern is composed of one or more basal rate indices.&lt;SEP&gt;A basal pattern is composed of basal indices.&lt;SEP&gt;An index basal is a component of the overall basal pattern.&lt;SEP&gt;The basal pattern defines the values of the Índice Basal that can be edited on the pump.&lt;SEP&gt;A basal pattern is composed of multiple basal indices that define insulin rates for specific time segments.</data>
