<edge source="Bomba" target="Pantalla Bolus Detenido">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pump shows the Bolus Detenido screen to indicate delivered insulin before interruption.</data>
  <data key="d9">display,screen</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5863810bebfd1be64b8af80afcd57e11</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786322933</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Bolus Manual">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The manual bolus procedure is performed via the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Bolus Manual is a function available in the Bomba for delivering manual bolus doses.</data>
  <data key="d9">device,feature,function,method</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-5863810bebfd1be64b8af80afcd57e11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdb2f497ff0665f2860089645ba9450</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786325672</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Lisa">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Lisa uses the insulin pump to deliver insulin and access its functions.&lt;SEP&gt;Lisa learned the basic functions of the Bomba before exploring additional functions.&lt;SEP&gt;Lisa uses the Bomba to manage insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;Lisa uses the insulin pump (Bomba) to manage insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d9">interaction,learning,operation,training,usage</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-84bb2bb0df91a594c6936b2fe97e4220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdb2f497ff0665f2860089645ba9450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cf7c487c5bd4a61120add295be9d518</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786325666</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="SmartGuard">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pump includes the SmartGuard option for automatic insulin management.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard is a feature integrated into the Bomba.</data>
  <data key="d9">component,feature,inclusion</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-84bb2bb0df91a594c6936b2fe97e4220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdb2f497ff0665f2860089645ba9450</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786325667</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Tubo">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pump includes tubing that connects the reservoir to the infusion site.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump connects to an infusion tube that delivers insulin.</data>
  <data key="d9">component,delivery,infusion line</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-84bb2bb0df91a594c6936b2fe97e4220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786322940</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Suspender Infusión">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Suspender Infusión stops all insulin infusion from the pump.</data>
  <data key="d9">infusion,stops</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-84bb2bb0df91a594c6936b2fe97e4220</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786322945</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Modo Manual">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Modo Manual allows manual control of the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Modo Manual switches the Bomba to manual insulin delivery mode.</data>
  <data key="d9">control,method,mode</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-84bb2bb0df91a594c6936b2fe97e4220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdb2f497ff0665f2860089645ba9450</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786325708</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Autoapagado">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Autoapagado is a feature that automatically shuts off the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoapagado is a built‑in safety feature of the insulin pump that stops infusion and sounds an alarm when inactivity exceeds the configured time.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoapagado automatically powers off the Bomba after inactivity.</data>
  <data key="d9">control,feature,power,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-84bb2bb0df91a594c6936b2fe97e4220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5a3c673db465ff57a023abf1cd26053&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdb2f497ff0665f2860089645ba9450</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786325680</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Patrones Basales">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Patrones Basales option is accessed on the pump to review and select basal patterns.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump stores multiple basal patterns for insulin delivery schedules.&lt;SEP&gt;Patrones Basales are programmed into the pump to control insulin delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Patrones Basales are saved basal schedules stored in the Bomba.</data>
  <data key="d9">basal,basal pattern,basal patterns,configuration,delivery,feature,stores</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5a3c673db465ff57a023abf1cd26053&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdb2f497ff0665f2860089645ba9450&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e303ffa37ca96974ad7399e052659bb</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786325676</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Valor Basal Máx.">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Valor Basal Máx. is a configurable parameter on the pump that defines the maximum basal insulin rate per hour.</data>
  <data key="d9">basal rate,parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5a3c673db465ff57a023abf1cd26053</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786322950</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Valor Bolus Máx.">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Valor Bolus Máx. is a configurable parameter on the pump that defines the maximum insulin amount for a single bolus.</data>
  <data key="d9">bolus limit,parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5a3c673db465ff57a023abf1cd26053</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786322951</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="GS">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Nightly GS measurements are taken and the pump is checked in relation to those glucose readings.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump receives the GS glucose reading entered by the user.&lt;SEP&gt;GS readings can be entered and displayed by the Bomba.</data>
  <data key="d9">data,data entry,glucose measurement,monitoring,sensor</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5a3c673db465ff57a023abf1cd26053&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-644dc086af7b196cc5bc332524608d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fdb2f497ff0665f2860089645ba9450</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786325682</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Infusión de Insulina">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pump delivers continuous insulin infusion.</data>
  <data key="d9">delivery,function</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5a3c673db465ff57a023abf1cd26053</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786322952</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Alarma">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The pump can generate an alarm as part of its safety functions.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump generates alarms when insulin delivery is prevented, such as blocked infusion.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump generates an alarm when insulin delivery is blocked and immediate action is required.</data>
  <data key="d9">alert generation,critical,critical notification,device,function,notification</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f5a3c673db465ff57a023abf1cd26053&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-220ba7466dbb8a2a07b8e4b09b215d39</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786325785</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Alerta">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The pump signals an alerta with a red light when an issue such as low reservoir or battery occurs.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump generates alerts to inform the user of conditions such as low reservoir or low battery.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump generates an alert to warn the user of a condition that may need attention.</data>
  <data key="d9">alert,device,notification,warning</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-644dc086af7b196cc5bc332524608d5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-220ba7466dbb8a2a07b8e4b09b215d39</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786325784</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Infusión Bloqueada">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Blocked Infusion alarm indicates the pump cannot deliver insulin through the tube or cannula.</data>
  <data key="d9">alarm,delivery failure</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786322965</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Pantalla">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The pump displays notifications on its screen for alerts and alarms.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump includes a screen (Pantalla) for user interaction.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump includes a screen (pantalla) that shows icons and options.</data>
  <data key="d9">component,display,displays,has,interface,notification</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb7c582936fb68746bd1911895df40c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e303ffa37ca96974ad7399e052659bb</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/887d88.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786325548</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Cánula">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The pump uses a cannula as part of the infusion set to deliver insulin subcutaneously.</data>
  <data key="d9">component,infusion set</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786322968</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Opciones De Audio">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The pump provides audio options to configure sound notifications.</data>
  <data key="d9">audio settings,configuration</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786322969</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Audio">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The pump emits audio tones or vibrations as part of alerts and alarms.&lt;SEP&gt;Audio can be enabled on the pump, possibly together with vibration.</data>
  <data key="d9">emits,notification,option</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ca7afb2078bd96edf087859a2c89920c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e303ffa37ca96974ad7399e052659bb</data>
