  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Modo de Inactivación">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The pump enters inactivity mode after the background light turns off to conserve battery.&lt;SEP&gt;Inactivity mode locks the pump, requiring user action to regain access.</data>
  <data key="d9">inactivity,lock,power management,security</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-9b74c4d587eaa1f27358b25bcf758f1f</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/231037.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786322979</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Botón Resaltado">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Pressing the highlighted button unlocks the pump and confirms that the user is reading the screen.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump (Bomba) has a highlighted button (Botón Resaltado) used for unlocking.&lt;SEP&gt;Pressing the highlighted button (Botón Resaltado) unlocks the pump (Bomba).</data>
  <data key="d9">control,has,unlock,user interaction</data>
