</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Patrón Basal">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The pump follows a basal pattern to determine insulin delivery rates.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump stores and follows basal patterns to determine insulin delivery over time.</data>
