</edge>
<edge source="Bomba" target="Lynn">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The pump supplies basal insulin automatically to Lynn.&lt;SEP&gt;Lynn uses the pump to receive automatic basal insulin instead of manual injections.</data>
