</edge>
<edge source="Glucose Reading (GS)" target="Corrective Bolus Dose">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">When glucose exceeds 250 mg/dL and ketones are negative, a corrective bolus dose is calculated and administered.</data>
