<edge source="Pump" target="AA Battery">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The pump requires a new AA battery to operate.&lt;SEP&gt;Pump operates on the AA battery when its internal power source cannot charge.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump is powered by an AA Battery that can be replaced when low.</data>
