</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Emergency Message">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Pump displays an Emergency Message when an alert is not cleared after suspension.&lt;SEP&gt;If a suspend alarm is not cleared within two hours, the Pump displays an Emergency Message.</data>
