  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Stuck Button Alarm">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The pump detects a button pressed for more than three minutes and generates a stuck button alarm.&lt;SEP&gt;Pump issues a Stuck Button Alarm when a button is unresponsive.</data>
  <data key="d9">alert,detection</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-6a9714e3b2aaad60242e3827215230bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329810</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="24-Hour Technical Support">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Users are instructed to contact 24-Hour Technical Support for pump-related issues.&lt;SEP&gt;The organization provides assistance for pump-related issues such as recurring alarms or errors.</data>
  <data key="d9">assistance,support,troubleshooting</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-6a9714e3b2aaad60242e3827215230bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28515a0aca492eeee478cd9947226498</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329810</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Simplera Sync Sensor">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Simplera Sync sensor pairs directly with the MiniMed pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The insulin pump pairs with the Simplera Sync sensor to obtain sensor glucose readings.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump can pair with a Simplera Sync sensor to receive glucose data.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump can pair with the Simplera Sync Sensor to receive glucose data.&lt;SEP&gt;Simplera Sync Sensor pairs with the Pump for glucose monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d9">communication,pairing,sensor pairing</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-bf54a88e051fe74fd94b773f8b5d98da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28515a0aca492eeee478cd9947226498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f3d819d6498d4482286628946e37a6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3895d65c9a22c257a4717f300d4086b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23dfd3ae95fca711f8f10fc98ab467c</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329852</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="SmartGuard Feature">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pump includes the SmartGuard Feature to automate insulin delivery based on glucose readings.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump utilizes the SmartGuard feature to automate insulin delivery decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump includes the SmartGuard feature that can suspend insulin delivery.</data>
  <data key="d9">algorithm,automation,feature,feature integration,insulin management,safety</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-bf54a88e051fe74fd94b773f8b5d98da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df77f2ea988e5724effb4c71cc79a65a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b48243f8e773d3c94abc58e2314db2c0</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329854</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Sensor Feature">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Sensor Feature automatically turns on when a sensor is paired to the Pump.&lt;SEP&gt;Turning on the sensor feature enables the pump to communicate with a CGM device.</data>
  <data key="d9">automatic activation,feature activation,pairing,sensor communication</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-bf54a88e051fe74fd94b773f8b5d98da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd751b869edcd6c88d9e467cfb2cb0fd</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329855</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="CGM Device">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The insulin pump establishes a paired connection with the CGM device to receive glucose data.&lt;SEP&gt;Pump communicates with the CGM Device, and this link can be disrupted by signal interference.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump receives the CGM device signal for glucose monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d9">communication,interference,pairing,receives_signal</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-bf54a88e051fe74fd94b773f8b5d98da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87a1bd89a18cb218431ff9359e299ee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a0307c83d7b514ca00334e4c8ca2357</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329856</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Lost Sensor Signal Alert">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The alert appears when the pump cannot communicate with the sensor.&lt;SEP&gt;When the sensor signal is absent for 30 minutes, the pump shows a Lost sensor signal alert.</data>
  <data key="d9">alert,communication loss,signal loss</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-bf54a88e051fe74fd94b773f8b5d98da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28515a0aca492eeee478cd9947226498</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329857</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
