</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Reconnect Sensor">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Pump provides a Reconnect Sensor option to re‑establish communication with an already inserted sensor.&lt;SEP&gt;Pump reconnects a previously used sensor when the user selects Reconnect Sensor.</data>
  <data key="d9">UI,method,reconnection,sensor reconnection</data>
