</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Startup Wizard">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">After a reset, the pump launches the Startup Wizard to guide users through initial configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;The Startup Wizard guides the initial setup of the Pump.</data>
