</edge>
<edge source="Pump" target="Instinct Sensor">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Instinct sensor can be paired and unpaired with the MiniMed pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump can pair with an Instinct sensor for glucose monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump can pair with the Instinct Sensor for glucose monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Instinct Sensor pairs with the Pump to provide continuous glucose data.</data>
  <data key="d9">communication,pairing,sensor pairing</data>
