<edge source="Instinct Sensor" target="MiniMed Mobile App">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The MiniMed Mobile App is the required interface for initiating, starting, and managing the Instinct CGM sensor. Whenever a new Instinct sensor is inserted or a sensor change is performed, the user must launch the MiniMed Mobile App to commence the sensor’s startup sequence; the sensor cannot be paired directly with the insulin pump without the app’s involvement.

In addition to starting the sensor, the MiniMed Mobile App oversees the sensor’s ongoing management and facilitates its pairing with the insulin pump for continuous glucose monitoring. During the startup process the app may present error messages to the user, indicating any issues that arise while the sensor is being activated.</data>
  <data key="d9">app,control,management,pairing,required start,required_for,requirement,sensor start,sensor_initialization,software control,startup</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-95ba6f1fa7d1791230f690255a8ba2df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab510c8377992bab31045a97eb95893a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-177e9aca0bf1c1724474ea529826bece&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a764dcbdd73fd1c50fa72a7cd60b6e19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71de01baf40871c616eaa39cb8189f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3895d65c9a22c257a4717f300d4086b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dd74224daea51112742135154e46244&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36ace822cd4873b8fd2adcfef0a7f9fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c030749e7f9a2ae77cb8993d7250cffe</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329714</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
