  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Instinct Sensor" target="MiniMed 780G System">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The MiniMed 780G system can be used with the Instinct sensor for continuous glucose monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;MiniMed 780G system can be used with the Instinct sensor.</data>
  <data key="d9">compatibility,compatible,integration,uses</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-8cceea4f7036977c7ddcbe81f76f8aa1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1196548781bdac364853fdfd2074ec</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329778</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Instinct Sensor" target="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The pump can connect to the Instinct integrated CGM.&lt;SEP&gt;The Instinct sensor communicates with the MiniMed 780G insulin pump through a wireless connection.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed 780G insulin pump can be paired with the Instinct sensor for continuous glucose monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;MiniMed 780G insulin pump is compatible with Instinct sensor.</data>
  <data key="d9">communication,compatibility,compatible,compatible with,hardware,monitoring,pairing</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-caf5071e54a797f595d8cac8e4653918&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-177e9aca0bf1c1724474ea529826bece&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e9f02579c179c758cc6393322299d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da4119d4fc266b13dd11e47dd6f506ca</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/INSULINOTERAPIA/SICI (bomba de insulina)/MiniMed-780G-system-user-guide.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786329839</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Instinct Sensor" target="Unpairing">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Unpairing removes the Instinct Sensor from the pump.</data>
  <data key="d9">disconnects</data>
