<edge source="MiniMed Mobile App" target="Simplera Sync Sensor">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Simplera Sync sensor is an optional accessory that is compatible with the MiniMed Mobile app and the MiniMed 780G system.&lt;SEP&gt;MiniMed Mobile App facilitates the pairing process for Simplera Sync Sensor with the Insulin Pump.</data>
  <data key="d9">compatibility,management,optional accessory,pairing</data>
