  <data key="d12">1786329743</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="MiniMed Mobile App" target="MiniMed 780G Insulin Pump">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The app provides a secondary display for the insulin pump.&lt;SEP&gt;The app wirelessly updates the pump’s software.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed Mobile app updates the insulin pump’s software and manages its settings.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed Mobile app can be paired with the insulin pump (one mobile device at a time) and provides a secondary display of pump data.&lt;SEP&gt;The MiniMed Mobile app is used to pair the mobile device with the insulin pump before starting a new sensor.</data>
  <data key="d9">data display,display,management,pairing,secondary,setup,software update,wireless</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4a75df3ab63706f501e8d3134e74a64b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-caf5071e54a797f595d8cac8e4653918&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-177e9aca0bf1c1724474ea529826bece&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a764dcbdd73fd1c50fa72a7cd60b6e19</data>
