<edge source="Blood Glucose Meter Reading" target="SmartGuard Min Delivery Alert">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">When the minimum delivery time limit is reached, the alert appears and requests the user to enter a blood glucose meter reading.</data>
  <data key="d9">alert,prompt</data>
