  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Blood Glucose Meter Reading" target="SmartGuard Max Delivery Alert">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">After basal insulin has been delivered at its maximum limit for 7 hours, the max delivery alert appears, advising entry of a BG reading.</data>
