<edge source="SmartGuard Feature" target="Auto Correction Bolus">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">SmartGuard Feature determines limits and delivers Auto Correction Boluses.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard delivers auto correction boluses based on glucose data.&lt;SEP&gt;Auto correction boluses may be administered when the SmartGuard Feature is enabled.</data>
