  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="SmartGuard Feature" target="Auto Basal">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Auto Basal is a component of the SmartGuard feature.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard triggers the Auto Basal method to calculate and deliver basal insulin continuously based on SG readings.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard manages the transition to Auto Basal mode after a valid BG reading.</data>
  <data key="d9">automated basal,component,controls,insulin delivery,transition</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4a75df3ab63706f501e8d3134e74a64b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b8de1434b9d9f57cd225b5d3e0d7f3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8741750a7bf86eb5d1fadf82a9c7720e</data>
