  <data key="d12">1786329823</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="SmartGuard Feature" target="Auto Correction">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Auto Correction is a component of the SmartGuard feature.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard should be used with Auto Correction On when using the system with the Simplera Sync sensor.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard automatically delivers correction boluses via Auto Correction.&lt;SEP&gt;SmartGuard activates the Auto Correction method to deliver correction boluses automatically when glucose is out of range.</data>
  <data key="d9">automated correction,bolus delivery,combined use,component,optimization,performs</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4a75df3ab63706f501e8d3134e74a64b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ede0f32eb8f8ea1eaab76cc0bc7648fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36ace822cd4873b8fd2adcfef0a7f9fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8741750a7bf86eb5d1fadf82a9c7720e</data>
