  <data key="d8">Long‑term follow‑up revealed enduring effects of early intensive control on microvascular disease.</data>
  <data key="d9">outcome,reduction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-74ef8c063d84e34c44021aa138b9b903</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786372267</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Microvascular Complications" target="Kumamoto Study">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Results indicated a marked reduction in retinopathy, neuropathy, and kidney disease with intensive control.</data>
  <data key="d9">outcome,reduction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-74ef8c063d84e34c44021aa138b9b903</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786372267</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Microvascular Complications" target="Veterans Affairs Diabetes Trial (VADT)">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">VADT assessed the effect of intensive control on microvascular disease, observing limited benefit.</data>
  <data key="d9">assessment,outcome</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-74ef8c063d84e34c44021aa138b9b903</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786372268</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Microvascular Complications" target="Action to Control Cardiovascular Risk in Diabetes (ACCORD)">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">ACCORD found that lower A1C levels were linked to reduced onset or progression of some microvascular complications.</data>
  <data key="d9">outcome,reduction</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-74ef8c063d84e34c44021aa138b9b903</data>
