  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">SICI use is primarily linked to improvement in macro‑ and microvascular complications.</data>
  <data key="d9">improvement,therapy</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-dfa23fc15cc4d520a32488843dbd710b</data>
