  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Insulin Tecnósfera reaches peak concentration 12‑15 minutes after inhalation, earlier than the 45‑60 minute peak of insulin Aspart rapid‑acting.&lt;SEP&gt;Both ultrarapid insulins may be administered immediately before meals.</data>
