<edge source="Afrezza" target="Conversion Ratio">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Afrezza’s labeling has caused confusion about the appropriate conversion ratio between its units and rapid‑acting insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;Afrezza dosing follows a 2:1 conversion ratio compared with subcutaneous insulin.</data>
