  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Automated Insulin Delivery systems rely on subcutaneous rapid‑acting insulin analogs (RAA) for insulin dosing.</data>
  <data key="d9">component,reliance</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-3c9d162accf67a3761df6b1c9113e193</data>
