</edge>
<edge source="Automated Insulin Delivery (AID) Systems" target="Subcutaneous RAA Insulin">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">AID systems are built around subcutaneous RAA insulin formulations, creating constraints for inhaled insulin integration.</data>
  <data key="d9">dependency,formulation</data>
