  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The 75‑g oral glucose tolerance test is used to diagnose gestational diabetes mellitus postpartum.&lt;SEP&gt;The 75‑g Oral Glucose Tolerance Test is used to diagnose Gestational Diabetes Mellitus according to standard criteria.</data>
