<edge source="Gestational Diabetes Mellitus" target="Prediabetes">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Individuals with a history of gestational diabetes mellitus have an increased risk of developing prediabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Women diagnosed with Gestational Diabetes Mellitus have a 3.4‑fold higher risk of later developing prediabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Individuals diagnosed with gestational diabetes mellitus should receive lifelong screening for prediabetes.</data>
