  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">IADPSG criteria are employed to diagnose Gestational Diabetes Mellitus based on pregnancy outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;The IADPSG criteria are used to diagnose gestational diabetes mellitus.</data>
