  <data key="d8">The VADT trial found no significant reduction in cardiovascular disease outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d9">no benefit,outcome</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-f99d05e1089d59496d56d86ff40197cc</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/metas cuidado do diabetes.pdf</data>
