<edge source="HbA1c Target &lt; 7.0 %" target="Metas no tratamento do diabetes">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The guideline recommends an HbA1c target below 7.0 % for all individuals with diabetes to prevent macrovascular complications.</data>
  <data key="d9">glycemic goal,recommendation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4f9624abde6cf128707fcc0466a4c9a7</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786370144</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="HbA1c Target &lt; 6.5 %" target="Metas no tratamento do diabetes">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The guideline states that a lower HbA1c target of &lt;6.5 % may be appropriate for type 1 diabetes patients when hypoglycemia risk is low.</data>
  <data key="d9">glycemic goal,recommendation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4f9624abde6cf128707fcc0466a4c9a7</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786370145</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="HbA1c Target &lt; 7.5 %" target="Metas no tratamento do diabetes">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">For children and adolescents with type 1 diabetes the guideline suggests a higher HbA1c target of &lt;7.5 % if asymptomatic hypoglycemia is present.</data>
  <data key="d9">glycemic goal,recommendation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-4f9624abde6cf128707fcc0466a4c9a7</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Metas glicêmicas/Metas no tratamento.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786370145</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
