  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Hidrocortisona doses &gt; 50 mg/day are linked to increased risk of glucocorticoid‑induced diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d9">dose‑dependent,risk</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-e7b4535dbb2554b84c7a2e024c4b82c4</data>
