<edge source="209 mg/dL" target="200 mg/dL">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A TTGO‑1h value ≥ 209 mg/dL is considered equivalent to a TTGO‑2h value ≥ 200 mg/dL for diagnosing Diabetes Mellitus.</data>
