<edge source="DM1 Phase 3" target="Autoantibodies">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Detection of two or more autoantibodies is associated with a 69.5% risk of DM1 Phase 3 in ten years and 84% in fifteen years.&lt;SEP&gt;Detection of a single autoantibody is associated with a 14.5% risk of DM1 Phase 3 in ten years.</data>
