</edge>
<edge source="Three-Year Screening Interval" target="False-Positive Tests">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A three‑year interval is intended to reduce the number of false‑positive screening results.</data>
  <data key="d9">false positives,screening frequency</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-55e58732610596ce9a8f3145d34f75a7</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786377641</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Three-Year Screening Interval" target="False-Negative Tests">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The three‑year interval may also influence the occurrence of false‑negative tests.</data>
  <data key="d9">false negatives,screening frequency</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-55e58732610596ce9a8f3145d34f75a7</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786377641</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="False-Positive Tests" target="Testing Interval">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">A 3‑year testing interval reduces the number of false‑positive tests requiring confirmatory testing.</data>
  <data key="d9">reduction,screening</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-0631ff2b95dd459677eaaebe9283a776</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786377764</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="False-Negative Tests" target="Testing Interval">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The interval allows individuals with false‑negative tests to be retested before complications develop.</data>
  <data key="d9">retesting,screening</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-0631ff2b95dd459677eaaebe9283a776</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786377764</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Testing Interval" target="High-Risk Individuals">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">High‑risk individuals, especially with weight gain, may benefit from shorter testing intervals.</data>
  <data key="d9">frequency,risk</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-0631ff2b95dd459677eaaebe9283a776</data>
  <data key="d11">data/raw/MONITORIZAÇÃO GLICÊMICA/METAS GLICÊMICAS/Diagnostico e Classificação/Classification and Diagnosis of.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1786377766</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Testing Interval" target="Three‑Year Interval">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The three‑year interval is the suggested testing interval to balance false‑positive reduction and timely retesting.</data>
  <data key="d9">specification</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-0631ff2b95dd459677eaaebe9283a776</data>
