<edge source="One-Step Screening Strategy" target="U.S. Preventive Services Task Force (USPSTF)">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">USPSTF’s 2021 systematic review concluded that one‑step screening identifies more GDM cases than two‑step screening.</data>
  <data key="d9">comparison,systematic review</data>
