</edge>
<edge source="Two-Step Screening Strategy" target="U.S. Preventive Services Task Force (USPSTF)">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">USPSTF’s review noted no health outcome improvement with the one‑step versus two‑step approach.</data>
  <data key="d9">comparison,systematic review</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-49c21dd27a63d44c5d80b53aa7e1f48d</data>
